export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"takeoffcraft","name":"TakeoffCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.9","summary":"Funda ubude ngamamitha, amasentimitha noma amamilimitha, izindawo ze-metric ngamamitha esikwele nendawo yodonga, izikali ezisethiwe ngaphambili ka-1:75 no-1:150, amayunithi wesisindo nezinga lokushisa, i-Arc enezindlela eziyishumi, namakhesa aphilayo, ukulandela nohlu lwabantu.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["okusha","yini emisha","amanothi okukhishwa","changelog","0.9","bonisa ubude njenge","amamitha","amasentimitha","amamilimitha","metric","landela okujwayelekile","amayunithi","amayunithi okubonisa","m2","amamitha esikwele","indawo yodonga","izikali ezisethiwe ngaphambili","1:75","1:150","isisindo","amakhilogremu","kg","itoni","ithani","lb","izinga lokushisa","celsius","fahrenheit","arc","izindlela ze-arc","ijika elingu-3","iradiyasi","ephilayo","amakhesa","landela","uhlu lwabantu","ikilasi","amathiphu","isakhiwo","izinguquko","0.8","0.8.1","inguqulo","izici ezintsha","bala konke","isiqondisi","isiqondisi sezimpawu","isethi yonke","inkumbulo yamanani","imisebenzi edlule","umsebenzi wokugcina","izinga lajwayelekile","umhlinzeki","isitoko","isikhathi sokulinda","ukushoda ngemva","uhlu lokuyala","ukushoda","iphaneli yezinkinga","izisizi","izilimi","amadivayisi okufaka","imigqa yebha yamathuluzi","dwg"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"funda-ubude-ngamamitha-amasentimitha-noma-amamilimitha","text":"Funda ubude ngamamitha, amasentimitha noma amamilimitha","level":3},{"id":"izindawo-nezikali-zomsebenzi-we-metric","text":"Izindawo nezikali zomsebenzi we-metric","level":3},{"id":"i-arc-enezindlela-eziyishumi","text":"I-Arc enezindlela eziyishumi","level":3},{"id":"ukusebenza-ndawonye","text":"Ukusebenza ndawonye","level":3},{"id":"kuyo-yonke-i-app","text":"Kuyo yonke i-app","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo-engisho-iqiniso","text":"Imikhawulo engisho iqiniso","level":2},{"id":"kwangaphambili-0-8-kanye-ne-0-8-1","text":"Kwangaphambili: 0.8 kanye ne-0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"okusha-2","text":"Okusha","level":3},{"id":"kulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1","text":"Kulungisiwe ku-0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"akukakufakwa-kulolu-hlobo","text":"Akukakufakwa kulolu hlobo","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshile ku-TakeoffCraft 0.9, uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.8.1. Ukukhishwa okuncane kule app: ubude bungafundeka manje ngamamitha, amasentimitha noma amamilimitha, izindawo nezikali zilandela umsebenzi we-metric ngendlela efanele, futhi i-Arc inezindlela eziyishumi zokudweba. Iseshini ephilayo nayo ikhombisa ukuthi ubani usendaweni nini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"funda-ubude-ngamamitha-amasentimitha-noma-amamilimitha\"\u003EFunda ubude ngamamitha, amasentimitha noma amamilimitha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa ubude njenge.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E unento ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow lengths as\u003C/span\u003E enezinketho ezithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow Global\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeet-inches\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm kanye ne-mm. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow Global\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa iyunithi yobude ye-metric oyiphawulile kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E, futhi isebenzisa amafiti namainshi uma kungekho lutho oluphawulwe. Ishintsha indlela ubude obufundeka ngayo ephepheni, kubha yesimo nasemaphaneleni, kuhlanganise nokuphakama, ukujula, ukuqina namazinga. Inombolo engenalutho etshalwe enkundleni yokuphakama ifundwa ngeyunithi ebonisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubonisa kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinani, izindleko namaphrinti kubalwa kusukela ebudeni obunembile. Ukukhetha kwe-1/16, 1/8 kanye ne-1/4 yeyinci kuvela kumafiti namainshi kuphela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/show-lengths-in-meters\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/show-lengths-in-meters\"\u003EBonisa ubude ngamamitha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi wesisindo.\u003C/strong\u003E Into ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETyped quantity (no drawing)\u003C/span\u003E ingaba ngu-lb, TON, kg noma t, futhi inganikezwa amanani ngeyunithi ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga lokushisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Yonke into inenkundla ekhethwayo ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETemperature\u003C/span\u003E kumhleli wento, ibhalwe ngamadigri C noma F. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow temperatures as\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E inikeza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow Global\u003C/span\u003E, °C noma °F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izindawo-nezikali-zomsebenzi-we-metric\"\u003EIzindawo nezikali zomsebenzi we-metric\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo ngama-m2 kumdwebo.\u003C/strong\u003E Indawo ekalwe ngento ye-metric manje ithi m2 ethegini yomdwebo nasephaneli yamamaki, nakwethebula, esikhundleni se-SF. Umthetho uthi m2 uma into inikezwa amanani nge-metric noma ubude bubonisa m, cm noma mm, kanti SF uma kungenjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yodonga.\u003C/strong\u003E Into yomugqa enobude nayo inobude bayo ibonisa nendawo yodonga (ubude kuphindwe ngobude) ohlwini lwezinto nanjengomugqa wensula ngaphansi kwethebula lezinani ngento.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzikali ezisethiwe ngaphambili 1:75 no-1:150.\u003C/strong\u003E Zisohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, okumanje linezikali ezingu-32. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EIzikali ezisethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"i-arc-enezindlela-eziyishumi\"\u003EI-Arc enezindlela eziyishumi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E isebenza (inkinobho yethuluzi noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kuvela ibhokisi elithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc method\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni leshidi: 3-Point, Start, Center, End, Start, Center, Angle, Start, Center, Length, Start, End, Angle, Start, End, Direction, Start, End, Radius, Center, Start, End, Center, Start, Angle kanye no-Center, Start, Length. Ingalo, ubude, iradiyasi nesiqondiso kungachofozwa noma kubhalwe. Isebenza emigqeni eqondile, ezindaweni nasemigodini ekhethiwe. Amafayela alondolozwe ngaphambi kwe-0.9 avula ngendlela efanayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/draw-arcs-ten-methods\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/draw-arcs-ten-methods\"\u003EDweba amajika ngezindlela eziyishumi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukusebenza-ndawonye\"\u003EUkusebenza ndawonye\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBona amakhesa abanye.\u003C/strong\u003E Kuseshini ephilayo, indlela yokubhekisa yalowo nalowo ibonakala ephepheni negama lakhe nombala wakhe, nebhokisi elinemigqa emincane ezungeze izimaka azikhethile. Abantu abasephepheni elehlukile babhalwa ngegama leshidi labo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/work-live\"\u003ESebenzani ngokuphila nabanye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELandela umuntu, nohlu lwabantu.\u003C/strong\u003E Inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPeople\u003C/span\u003E kuseshini ephilayo idweba uhlu lwabantu ngabanye, ngethuluzi abalisebenzisayo, ishidi abakulo nesikhathi ekhishe ngaso ukuhlelwa kokugcina. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow\u003C/span\u003E ishintsha ukubuka kwakho ukuze ihambisane nokwakhe, futhi umphathi angasebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk everyone to follow me\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/follow-a-teammate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/follow-a-teammate\"\u003ELandela umngane wethimba kuseshini ephilayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuyo-yonke-i-app\"\u003EKuyo yonke i-app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbhalo wesiqondiso kanye neseluleko sokuqala.\u003C/strong\u003E Umbhalo ovela uma uhambisa isikhombi uyithiphu ye-Bootstrap, futhi iseluleko sokuqala singavalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu askrola.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhande lamathebhu ephaneli elingangeni liyaskrola esikhundleni sokusikwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzihloko zamathebhu.\u003C/strong\u003E Ithebhu yesiphequluli ifunda \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;document&gt; - TakeoffCraft | CadCraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu lwesakhiwo kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E luuhlu olwehlisekayo olubonisa isakhiwo osikhethile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUlimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ulimi oluyikhethayo manje lufinyelela amagama aphrintwa yikhasi ngokwalo, njengoKusha, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-Londoloza. Izilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizidrafu zomshini kuze kufundwe umuntu wendabuko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo-engisho-iqiniso\"\u003EImikhawulo engisho iqiniso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubonisa ubude, amayunithi wesisindo nezinga lokushisa kanye nezilungiselelo ezintsha kuhlolwe ngamathesti nasekhasini. Akukahlolwa ngesandla zonke amaphaneli kuzo zonke iziyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwabantu alikaze luhlolwe ngesandla ngekilasi langempela lothisha nabafundi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizidrafu zomshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbafakeli be-Windows abaqinisekiswanga ngekhodi (Ulwazi olwengeziwe, bese Qhuba noma kunjalo). Isithombe sedisiki se-macOS asikaqinisekiswa (chofoza ngenkinobho yesokudla, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwangaphambili-0-8-kanye-ne-0-8-1\"\u003EKwangaphambili: 0.8 kanye ne-0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshile ku-TakeoffCraft 0.8 (kukhishwe ngo-2026-11-01) ne-0.8.1 (2026-11-02), uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.7. Umugqa wezimpawu ungabalwa manje kuso sonke isethi ngasikhathi sinye, umsebenzi omusha ungaqala ngamanani emisebenzi yakho edlule, futhi umsebenzi ungahlolwa ngesitoko somhlinzeki. I-0.8.1 ukulungisa iphutha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okusha-2\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBala konke esethini\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYiboksa isiqondisi kanye.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount everything\u003C/span\u003E ethulini ifunda isiqondisi sezimpawu: hudula ibhokisi ozungeze izimpawu namagama ezibhalwe eduze kwazo. Impawu ngayinye ibhalwa nesithombe negama layo, futhi igama liba yigama lento. Susa ukukhetha kokungakudingi, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount on N sheets\u003C/span\u003E. Ibha ikhombisa ishidi elisesekwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E iyeka ukusebenza, futhi ikhasi lisasebenziseka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWonke amashidi kokusebenza kunye.\u003C/strong\u003E Impawu ngayinye ibalwa kuwo wonke amashidi avulekile. Ishidi elidwetshwe ngesikali esihlukile liseshwa ngalesosikali, futhi izimpawu zitholakala zijikiwe kunoma yiliphi i-engeli eqondile. Izimpawu zesiqondisi ngokwaso azibalwa kuleyoshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola ngaphambi kokungeza noma yini.\u003C/strong\u003E Isamba ngasinye sinesixhumanisi ngeshidi ngalinye (&quot;E-103: 4&quot;) esiya kuleyoshidi. Chofoza ibhokisi kokutholakele ukuze ulisuse, bese uchofoza futhi ukuze ulibuyisele. Izinga lokufana (50% kuya ku-100%) lihlunga kuphela okutholakele; akukho okuphinde kusekwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsinyathelo esisodwa sokubuyisela.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd N marks\u003C/span\u003E yenza into yokubala ngento ngayinye, ngophawu ezindaweni zonke ezitholakele. Igama elisuke liyinto yakho yokubala lisetshenziswa kabusha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela zonke izinto nezimaka. Okwamukelwe nakho kuyengezwa kuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimpawu nganoma yiliphi i-engeli.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESymbols at any angle\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokubala ukuze uthole nezimpawu ezijikiwe ngengalo engeyona eyisikhombisa. Ukusesha kujikisa ngayinye impawu njalo ngama-degree ayi-15, futhi impawu engeyona eyindilinga ingathatha isikhathi esingaphezu kwamaphindwe ayisithupha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYini kanye.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukufanisa izimpawu okuvamile kumashidi akho, akukho imodeli eqeqeshiwe, futhi akukho okushiya ikhompyutha yakho. Kwisethi eyenziwe ngamashidi angu-200 yathatha amasekhondi ayi-9.4 ukusuka kuqala kuya ekugcineni ku-Chrome ekhompyutheni ejwayelekile esheshayo; amaseti wamaplani angempela azoba nzima kakhulu. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-everything\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-everything\"\u003EBala konke esethini\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkumbulo yamanani emisebenzini yakho\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ikhumbula amazinga akho.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma ulondoloza ibalo, into ngayinye enamanani esetshenziswayo ikhunjulwa ngegama nangohlobo: izinga lempahla, izinga lomsebenzi, ukulahleka neyunithi. Imisebenzi eyi-12 yokugcina igcinwa ngegama ngalinye. Igcinwa kulo khompyutha eceleni komtapo wamanani, ingasoze igcinwe ngaphakathi kwefayela lebalo, futhi akukho okuthunyelwa noyiphi indawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQala ibalo elisha kuwo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E ethulini ibonisa, ngento ngayinye, amazinga womsebenzi wokugcina, amazinga ajwayelekile nobubanzi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse last\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse typical\u003C/span\u003E inikeza into eyodwa amanani, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice N unpriced items from memory\u003C/span\u003E igcwalisa zonke izinto ezingenawo amanani okwamanje. Ukusebenzisa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokubuyisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImisebenzi edlule.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn from a past takeoff…\u003C/span\u003E ikhumbula izinto ezinamanani zebalo elilondoloziwe (.json).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBona, shintsha, khohlwa.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything remembered\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa uhlu lwawo wonke amagama; inkinobho yokusula ikhohlwa igama elilodwa, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear all prices\u003C/span\u003E ikhohlwa konke. Vala \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemember my prices when I save a takeoff\u003C/span\u003E ukuze kuyeke. Amanani &quot;ngakunye&quot; awasoze afakwe kuto eqoshwa ngefidi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-memory\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-memory\"\u003EInkumbulo yamanani emisebenzini yakho edlule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko somhlinzeki nezikhathi zokulinda\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola ngohlu lomhlinzeki.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupply\u003C/span\u003E ethulini ithatha uhlu lwesitoko somhlinzeki (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a supplier file…\u003C/span\u003E), i-CSV noma ishidi lezibalo, bese ihlola okudingekayo ibalo, kanye nokulahleka, ngakho. Kugcinwa kuze kube yimafayela amahlanu. Akukho okuthunyelwa futhi akukho okucela umhlinzeki: wena uletha ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkushoyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinto ezinganele zivela kuqala: &quot;Short by 120 EA&quot; ihunyushwa ibe &quot;Ishoda ngo-120 EA&quot;, &quot;Isikhathi sokulinda izinsuku ezi-21&quot;, &quot;Ioda ilindile&quot;, &quot;Iyunithi ihlukile&quot;, &quot;Akukho inani lesitoko&quot; noma &quot;Kukhona esitokweni&quot;. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELongest wait wanted (days)\u003C/span\u003E iqala ku-14.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lokuyala.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrder list (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E ilanda izinto ezishoda ngenani elishodayo, umhlinzeki kanye nesikhathi sokulinda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanani angena emtapweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma ifayela linamanani, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices into the Library\u003C/span\u003E isetha izinga lempahla ye-Library ngayinye enegama neyunithi efanayo. Phinda unikeze amanani kusuka emtapweni ukuze uwafake ebalweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEphaneli yezinkinga.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukushoda kuyisexwayiso kanti isikhathi eside kuyisaziso, ngaphansi kwe-&quot;Supplier stock&quot;. Ungamukela okukodwa ngesizathu, futhi isizathu siyagcinwa ebalweni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/supplier-stock\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/supplier-stock\"\u003EHlola isitoko somhlinzeki nezikhathi zokulinda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzisizi ze-AI\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi kubo bonke abathathu.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma izisizi zivunyelwe kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, isizi singafunda isiqondisi (\u003Ccode\u003Elegend_open\u003C/code\u003E), senze ukubala (\u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_start\u003C/code\u003E, bese \u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_status\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_result\u003C/code\u003E) bese siyengeza (\u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_add\u003C/code\u003E, okungabonisa kuqala). Singafunda amanani agciniwe (\u003Ccode\u003Eprices_list\u003C/code\u003E) futhi sinikeze izinto amanani kuwo (\u003Ccode\u003Eprices_apply\u003C/code\u003E, okungabonisa kuqala), futhi singafunda ukuhlolwa kwesitoko somhlinzeki (\u003Ccode\u003Esupply_check\u003C/code\u003E). Ukungeza ifayela lomhlinzeki kuseyisandla sakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003ESebenzisa i-TakeoffCraft nezisizi ze-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuyo yonke i-app\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izilimi ezingama-54 ngokubonke; eziyishumi ziyizintsha (isiLithuania, isiLatvia, isiBosnia, isiMarathi, isiTelugu, isiAlbania, isiAfrikaans, isiFilipino, isiSwahili kanye nesiUzbek). Izilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizidrafu zomshini kuze kufundwe umuntu wendabuko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadivayisi okufaka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E isetha ukuthi i-trackpad, izinkinobho zangasese ze-mouse, ipeni, i-mouse ye-3D, isilawuli segeyimu noma isilawuli se-MIDI senzani, kuyo yonke i-app noma kwesodwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/input-devices\" data-topic=\"basics/input-devices\"\u003ESebenzisa i-trackpad, i-mouse ye-3D noma isilawuli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yebha yamathuluzi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E inikeza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrap\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 row\u003C/span\u003E; amaqembu angangeni askrola ohlangothini. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEphaneli yezinkinga.\u003C/strong\u003E Iphaneli elabelanwa ngezexwayiso nezaziso manje liqukethe ukuhlolwa kwesitoko somhlinzeki okungenhla, eceleni kwezinye izinhlolo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkwengeziwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Okwengeziwe kulandela uhlu lwe-akhawunti yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/addons-basics\" data-topic=\"basics/addons-basics\"\u003EOkwengeziwe nohlu lwe-akhawunti\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma i-AI yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E I-CadCraft Studio iyisikhungo: xhuma isizi sakho kanye kuphela kuzo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili. I-Studio ayinayo i-AI yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1\"\u003EKulungisiwe ku-0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba samakilasi e-DWG.\u003C/strong\u003E Isigaba samakilasi efayeleni le-DWG safundwa njengohlobo olungalungile. Lokhu kulungisiwe ku-TakeoffCraft nakwamanye ama-app amane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-Studio ingashintsha ulimi isasebenza.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngaphambili i-Studio nezinhlobo zayo ezipakishiwe zaziyisiNgisi kuphela. Lokhu akuhlolwanga kuwo wonke amapuleti ohlelo lwedeskthophu; sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akukakufakwa-kulolu-hlobo\"\u003EAkukakufakwa kulolu hlobo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukaqinisekiswa ngekhodi.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Windows ingase isixwayise, futhi ku-Mac uchofoza ngenkinobho yesokudla bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E ngokokuqala. Izakhiwo zesitolo (Microsoft Store, Google Play, App Store) zimisiwe, futhi isakhiwo se-iPad ne-iPhone asizange sakhiwe kabusha ngo-0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibuyekezo ze-Studio.\u003C/strong\u003E Umfakeli we-Windows namaphakheji e-Linux ahlola kanye ngosuku futhi ayabuza kuqala. Ifayela le-zip elihambisekayo liyakutshela kuphela, kanti i-macOS ne-APK azibuyekezi ngokuzenzakalelayo. Ifayela le-.dmg le-macOS ka-0.8 lilandela ukukhishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma i-AI yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuxhuma ngokuchofoza kanye ngaphakathi kwe-Studio, isixhumi esisebenza kusiphequluli, ukhiye wakho we-API ngaphakathi kwe-Studio kanye nephakheji le-MCP elishicilelwe akuthenjiswa kulolu hlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBala konke.\u003C/strong\u003E Idinga izimpawu ezidwetshwe ngendlela efanayo nasesiqondisini, futhi impawu enodonga noma umugqa omude ushayiwe ingase iphuthelwe. Izimpawu ezigoqwe azitholakali, futhi ishidi elingenasikali elidwetshwe ngesinye isilinganiso liseshwa ngesilinganiso sesiqondisi. Hlola okutholakele kushidi lokuqala ngaphambi kokuthembela kokunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitoko somhlinzeki.\u003C/strong\u003E Izibalo zesitoko zisemusha njengefayela oliwengezayo. Ukuhlolwa akukaze kucele umhlinzeki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibha yoku-app ye-Tamil iyachichima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kusohlwini \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E. Ngokukhishwa okwandulela lona, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EOkusha ku-0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lokhu yikho okushintshile ku-TakeoffCraft 0.9, uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.8.1. Ukukhishwa okuncane kule app: ubude bungafundeka manje ngamamitha, amasentimitha noma amamilimitha, izindawo nezikali zilandela umsebenzi we-metric ngendlela efanele, futhi i-Arc inezindlela eziyishumi zokudweba. Iseshini ephilayo nayo ikhombisa ukuthi ubani usendaweni nini. Okusha Funda ubude ngamamitha, amasentimitha noma amamilimitha Bonisa ubude njenge. Settings › TakeoffCraft unento ethi Show lengths as enezinketho ezithi Follow Global, Feet-inches, m, cm kanye ne-mm. Follow Global isebenzisa iyunithi yobude ye-metric oyiphawulile kumenyu Settings › Global › Units, futhi isebenzisa amafiti namainshi uma kungekho lutho oluphawulwe. Ishintsha indlela ubude obufundeka ngayo ephepheni, kubha yesimo nasemaphaneleni, kuhlanganise nokuphakama, ukujula, ukuqina namazinga. Inombolo engenalutho etshalwe enkundleni yokuphakama ifundwa ngeyunithi ebonisiwe. Ukubonisa kuphela. Izinani, izindleko namaphrinti kubalwa kusukela ebudeni obunembile. Ukukhetha kwe-1/16, 1/8 kanye ne-1/4 yeyinci kuvela kumafiti namainshi kuphela. Bona Bonisa ubude ngamamitha. Amayunithi wesisindo. Into ethi Typed quantity (no drawing) ingaba ngu-lb, TON, kg noma t, futhi inganikezwa amanani ngeyunithi ngayinye. Izinga lokushisa. Yonke into inenkundla ekhethwayo ethi Temperature kumhleli wento, ibhalwe ngamadigri C noma F. Show temperatures as kumenyu Settings › TakeoffCraft inikeza Follow Global, °C noma °F. Izindawo nezikali zomsebenzi we-metric Izindawo ngama-m2 kumdwebo. Indawo ekalwe ngento ye-metric manje ithi m2 ethegini yomdwebo nasephaneli yamamaki, nakwethebula, esikhundleni se-SF. Umthetho uthi m2 uma into inikezwa amanani nge-metric noma ubude bubonisa m, cm noma mm, kanti SF uma kungenjalo. Indawo yodonga. Into yomugqa enobude nayo inobude bayo ibonisa nendawo yodonga (ubude kuphindwe ngobude) ohlwini lwezinto nanjengomugqa wensula ngaphansi kwethebula lezinani ngento. Izikali ezisethiwe ngaphambili 1:75 no-1:150. Zisohlwini lwe-Preset eqenjini Scale, okumanje linezikali ezingu-32. Bona Izikali ezisethiwe ngaphambili. I-Arc enezindlela eziyishumi Uma Arc isebenza (inkinobho yethuluzi noma R), kuvela ibhokisi elithi Arc method ebhareni leshidi: 3-Point, Start, Center, End, Start, Center, Angle, Start, Center, Length, Start, End, Angle, Start, End, Direction, Start, End, Radius, Center, Start, End, Center, Start, Angle kanye no-Center, Start, Length. Ingalo, ubude, iradiyasi nesiqondiso kungachofozwa noma kubhalwe. Isebenza emigqeni eqondile, ezindaweni nasemigodini ekhethiwe. Amafayela alondolozwe ngaphambi kwe-0.9 avula ngendlela efanayo. Bona Dweba amajika ngezindlela eziyishumi. Ukusebenza ndawonye Bona amakhesa abanye. Kuseshini ephilayo, indlela yokubhekisa yalowo nalowo ibonakala ephepheni negama lakhe nombala wakhe, nebhokisi elinemigqa emincane ezungeze izimaka azikhethile. Abantu abasephepheni elehlukile babhalwa ngegama leshidi labo. Bona Sebenzani ngokuphila nabanye. Landela umuntu, nohlu lwabantu. Inkinobho ethi People kuseshini ephilayo idweba uhlu lwabantu ngabanye, ngethuluzi abalisebenzisayo, ishidi abakulo nesikhathi ekhishe ngaso ukuhlelwa kokugcina. Follow ishintsha ukubuka kwakho ukuze ihambisane nokwakhe, futhi umphathi angasebenzisa Ask everyone to follow me. Bona Landela umngane wethimba kuseshini ephilayo. Kuyo yonke i-app Umbhalo wesiqondiso kanye neseluleko sokuqala. Umbhalo ovela uma uhambisa isikhombi uyithiphu ye-Bootstrap, futhi iseluleko sokuqala singavalwa. Amathebhu askrola. Ibhande lamathebhu ephaneli elingangeni liyaskrola esikhundleni sokusikwa. Izihloko zamathebhu. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ifunda \u003Cdocument\u003E - TakeoffCraft | CadCraft. Isakhiwo. Uhlu lwesakhiwo kumenyu Settings luuhlu olwehlisekayo olubonisa isakhiwo osikhethile. Ulimi. Ulimi oluyikhethayo manje lufinyelela amagama aphrintwa yikhasi ngokwalo, njengoKusha, Open kanye ne-Londoloza. Izilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizidrafu zomshini kuze kufundwe umuntu wendabuko. Imikhawulo engisho iqiniso Ukubonisa ubude, amayunithi wesisindo nezinga lokushisa kanye nezilungiselelo ezintsha kuhlolwe ngamathesti nasekhasini. Akukahlolwa ngesandla zonke amaphaneli kuzo zonke iziyunithi. Uhlu lwabantu alikaze luhlolwe ngesandla ngekilasi langempela lothisha nabafundi. Izilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizidrafu zomshini. Abafakeli be-Windows abaqinisekiswanga ngekhodi (Ulwazi olwengeziwe, bese Qhuba noma kunjalo). Isithombe sedisiki se-macOS asikaqinisekiswa (chofoza ngenkinobho yesokudla, bese Open). Kwangaphambili: 0.8 kanye ne-0.8.1 Lokhu yikho okushintshile ku-TakeoffCraft 0.8 (kukhishwe ngo-2026-11-01) ne-0.8.1 (2026-11-02), uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.7. Umugqa wezimpawu ungabalwa manje kuso sonke isethi ngasikhathi sinye, umsebenzi omusha ungaqala ngamanani emisebenzi yakho edlule, futhi umsebenzi ungahlolwa ngesitoko somhlinzeki. I-0.8.1 ukulungisa iphutha. Okusha Bala konke esethini Yiboksa isiqondisi kanye. Count everything ethulini ifunda isiqondisi sezimpawu: hudula ibhokisi ozungeze izimpawu namagama ezibhalwe eduze kwazo. Impawu ngayinye ibhalwa nesithombe negama layo, futhi igama liba yigama lento. Susa ukukhetha kokungakudingi, bese ukhetha Count on N sheets. Ibha ikhombisa ishidi elisesekwa, Cancel iyeka ukusebenza, futhi ikhasi lisasebenziseka. Wonke amashidi kokusebenza kunye. Impawu ngayinye ibalwa kuwo wonke amashidi avulekile. Ishidi elidwetshwe ngesikali esihlukile liseshwa ngalesosikali, futhi izimpawu zitholakala zijikiwe kunoma yiliphi i-engeli eqondile. Izimpawu zesiqondisi ngokwaso azibalwa kuleyoshidi. Hlola ngaphambi kokungeza noma yini. Isamba ngasinye sinesixhumanisi ngeshidi ngalinye (\"E-103: 4\") esiya kuleyoshidi. Chofoza ibhokisi kokutholakele ukuze ulisuse, bese uchofoza futhi ukuze ulibuyisele. Izinga lokufana (50% kuya ku-100%) lihlunga kuphela okutholakele; akukho okuphinde kusekwe. Isinyathelo esisodwa sokubuyisela. Add N marks yenza into yokubala ngento ngayinye, ngophawu ezindaweni zonke ezitholakele. Igama elisuke liyinto yakho yokubala lisetshenziswa kabusha. Ctrl+Z ibuyisela zonke izinto nezimaka. Okwamukelwe nakho kuyengezwa kuthi Learned. Izimpawu nganoma yiliphi i-engeli. Khetha Symbols at any angle ngaphambi kokubala ukuze uthole nezimpawu ezijikiwe ngengalo engeyona eyisikhombisa. Ukusesha kujikisa ngayinye impawu njalo ngama-degree ayi-15, futhi impawu engeyona eyindilinga ingathatha isikhathi esingaphezu kwamaphindwe ayisithupha. Yini kanye. Ukufanisa izimpawu okuvamile kumashidi akho, akukho imodeli eqeqeshiwe, futhi akukho okushiya ikhompyutha yakho. Kwisethi eyenziwe ngamashidi angu-200 yathatha amasekhondi ayi-9.4 ukusuka kuqala kuya ekugcineni ku-Chrome ekhompyutheni ejwayelekile esheshayo; amaseti wamaplani angempela azoba nzima kakhulu. Bona Bala konke esethini. Inkumbulo yamanani emisebenzini yakho I-TakeoffCraft ikhumbula amazinga akho. Uma ulondoloza ibalo, into ngayinye enamanani esetshenziswayo ikhunjulwa ngegama nangohlobo: izinga lempahla, izinga lomsebenzi, ukulahleka neyunithi. Imisebenzi eyi-12 yokugcina igcinwa ngegama ngalinye. Igcinwa kulo khompyutha eceleni komtapo wamanani, ingasoze igcinwe ngaphakathi kwefayela lebalo, futhi akukho okuthunyelwa noyiphi indawo. Qala ibalo elisha kuwo. Prices ethulini ibonisa, ngento ngayinye, amazinga womsebenzi wokugcina, amazinga ajwayelekile nobubanzi. Use last noma Use typical inikeza into eyodwa amanani, futhi Price N unpriced items from memory igcwalisa zonke izinto ezingenawo amanani okwamanje. Ukusebenzisa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokubuyisela. Imisebenzi edlule. Learn from a past takeoff… ikhumbula izinto ezinamanani zebalo elilondoloziwe (.json). Bona, shintsha, khohlwa. Everything remembered ibonisa uhlu lwawo wonke amagama; inkinobho yokusula ikhohlwa igama elilodwa, futhi Clear all prices ikhohlwa konke. Vala Remember my prices when I save a takeoff ukuze kuyeke. Amanani \"ngakunye\" awasoze afakwe kuto eqoshwa ngefidi. Bona Inkumbulo yamanani emisebenzini yakho edlule. Isitoko somhlinzeki nezikhathi zokulinda Hlola ngohlu lomhlinzeki. Supply ethulini ithatha uhlu lwesitoko somhlinzeki (Add a supplier file…), i-CSV noma ishidi lezibalo, bese ihlola okudingekayo ibalo, kanye nokulahleka, ngakho. Kugcinwa kuze kube yimafayela amahlanu. Akukho okuthunyelwa futhi akukho okucela umhlinzeki: wena uletha ifayela. Okushoyo. Izinto ezinganele zivela kuqala: \"Short by 120 EA\" ihunyushwa ibe \"Ishoda ngo-120 EA\", \"Isikhathi sokulinda izinsuku ezi-21\", \"Ioda ilindile\", \"Iyunithi ihlukile\", \"Akukho inani lesitoko\" noma \"Kukhona esitokweni\". Longest wait wanted (days) iqala ku-14. Uhlu lokuyala. Order list (CSV) ilanda izinto ezishoda ngenani elishodayo, umhlinzeki kanye nesikhathi sokulinda. Amanani angena emtapweni. Uma ifayela linamanani, Prices into the Library isetha izinga lempahla ye-Library ngayinye enegama neyunithi efanayo. Phinda unikeze amanani kusuka emtapweni ukuze uwafake ebalweni. Ephaneli yezinkinga. Ukushoda kuyisexwayiso kanti isikhathi eside kuyisaziso, ngaphansi kwe-\"Supplier stock\". Ungamukela okukodwa ngesizathu, futhi isizathu siyagcinwa ebalweni. Bona Hlola isitoko somhlinzeki nezikhathi zokulinda. Izisizi ze-AI Amathuluzi kubo bonke abathathu. Uma izisizi zivunyelwe kumenyu Settings, isizi singafunda isiqondisi (legend_open), senze ukubala (legend_count_start, bese legend_count_status kanye ne-legend_count_result) bese siyengeza (legend_count_add, okungabonisa kuqala). Singafunda amanani agciniwe (prices_list) futhi sinikeze izinto amanani kuwo (prices_apply, okungabonisa kuqala), futhi singafunda ukuhlolwa kwesitoko somhlinzeki (supply_check). Ukungeza ifayela lomhlinzeki kuseyisandla sakho. Bona Sebenzisa i-TakeoffCraft nezisizi ze-AI. Kuyo yonke i-app Izilimi. Izilimi ezingama-54 ngokubonke; eziyishumi ziyizintsha (isiLithuania, isiLatvia, isiBosnia, isiMarathi, isiTelugu, isiAlbania, isiAfrikaans, isiFilipino, isiSwahili kanye nesiUzbek). Izilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizidrafu zomshini kuze kufundwe umuntu wendabuko. Amadivayisi okufaka. Settings › Global › Input devices isetha ukuthi i-trackpad, izinkinobho zangasese ze-mouse, ipeni, i-mouse ye-3D, isilawuli segeyimu noma isilawuli se-MIDI senzani, kuyo yonke i-app noma kwesodwa. Bona Sebenzisa i-trackpad, i-mouse ye-3D noma isilawuli. Imigqa yebha yamathuluzi. Settings › General › Toolbar rows inikeza Wrap (okokuqala), 2 rows kanye 1 row; amaqembu angangeni askrola ohlangothini. Bona Hlela amaphaneli. Ephaneli yezinkinga. Iphaneli elabelanwa ngezexwayiso nezaziso manje liqukethe ukuhlolwa kwesitoko somhlinzeki okungenhla, eceleni kwezinye izinhlolo. Okwengeziwe. Okwengeziwe kulandela uhlu lwe-akhawunti yakho. Bona Okwengeziwe nohlu lwe-akhawunti. Xhuma i-AI yakho. I-CadCraft Studio iyisikhungo: xhuma isizi sakho kanye kuphela kuzo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili. I-Studio ayinayo i-AI yayo. Kulungisiwe ku-0.8.1 Isigaba samakilasi e-DWG. Isigaba samakilasi efayeleni le-DWG safundwa njengohlobo olungalungile. Lokhu kulungisiwe ku-TakeoffCraft nakwamanye ama-app amane. I-Studio ingashintsha ulimi isasebenza. Ngaphambili i-Studio nezinhlobo zayo ezipakishiwe zaziyisiNgisi kuphela. Lokhu akuhlolwanga kuwo wonke amapuleti ohlelo lwedeskthophu; sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi. Akukakufakwa kulolu hlobo Akukaqinisekiswa ngekhodi. I-Windows ingase isixwayise, futhi ku-Mac uchofoza ngenkinobho yesokudla bese ukhetha Open ngokokuqala. Izakhiwo zesitolo (Microsoft Store, Google Play, App Store) zimisiwe, futhi isakhiwo se-iPad ne-iPhone asizange sakhiwe kabusha ngo-0.8.1. Izibuyekezo ze-Studio. Umfakeli we-Windows namaphakheji e-Linux ahlola kanye ngosuku futhi ayabuza kuqala. Ifayela le-zip elihambisekayo liyakutshela kuphela, kanti i-macOS ne-APK azibuyekezi ngokuzenzakalelayo. Ifayela le-.dmg le-macOS ka-0.8 lilandela ukukhishwa. Xhuma i-AI yakho. Ukuxhuma ngokuchofoza kanye ngaphakathi kwe-Studio, isixhumi esisebenza kusiphequluli, ukhiye wakho we-API ngaphakathi kwe-Studio kanye nephakheji le-MCP elishicilelwe akuthenjiswa kulolu hlobo. Bala konke. Idinga izimpawu ezidwetshwe ngendlela efanayo nasesiqondisini, futhi impawu enodonga noma umugqa omude ushayiwe ingase iphuthelwe. Izimpawu ezigoqwe azitholakali, futhi ishidi elingenasikali elidwetshwe ngesinye isilinganiso liseshwa ngesilinganiso sesiqondisi. Hlola okutholakele kushidi lokuqala ngaphambi kokuthembela kokunye. Isitoko somhlinzeki. Izibalo zesitoko zisemusha njengefayela oliwengezayo. Ukuhlolwa akukaze kucele umhlinzeki. Izilimi. Ibha yoku-app ye-Tamil iyachichima. Konke okunye kusohlwini Akukakwakhiwa. Ngokukhishwa okwandulela lona, bona Okusha ku-0.7.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.7 (kwangaphambili)","summary":"Imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF ivulwa njengamashidi anesilinganiso sawo, izinani nobude obunembile kusukela komdwebo uqobo, inani lesabelomsebenzi elikhethiwe njengexabiso lephakheji, izimemo zamathenda ezinamanani avalekile, amathuluzi abasizi emidwebweni, nama-USD asuka ku-3D check view.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["okusha 0.7","inguqulo yangaphambili","amanothi okukhishwa","izinguquko","0.7","inguqulo","izici ezintsha","dwg","dxf","umdwebo","izingqimba","isikali somdwebo","bala kusukela komdwebo","ukubala kwe-cad","amabhulokhi","amabhulokhi aguquguqukayo","izindawo","izingqimba","xref","umdwebo oxhunyiwe","linganisa umdwebo","polyline","ukufiphaza","i-pdf emakwe","inani elikhethiwe","sebenzisa ithenda","thumela amathenda","imemo yethenda","amathenda avaliwe","ukuvulwa kwamathenda","ithenda elisemuva","amarekhodi wesabelomsebenzi","csv","umsizi","mcp","usd","usdz","amayunithi","uhlu lwamayunithi","okuhlangene","amaphaneli","izingxoxo","isiPutukezi"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"imidwebo-ye-dwg-ne-dxf","text":"Imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF","level":3},{"id":"izinani-nobude-obunembile-kusuka-emdwebeni","text":"Izinani nobude obunembile kusuka emdwebeni","level":3},{"id":"amathenda","text":"Amathenda","level":3},{"id":"abasizi-be-ai","text":"Abasizi be-AI","level":3},{"id":"usd","text":"USD","level":3},{"id":"kuwo-wonke-ama-app","text":"Kuwo wonke ama-app","level":2},{"id":"akukakwenziwa-kule-nguqulo","text":"Akukakwenziwa kule nguqulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshe ku-TakeoffCraft 0.7, uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.6. Imidwebo manje ivulwa njengoba ibe, ngaphandle kokuyiphrinta kuqala ibe yi-PDF, futhi iphakheji yethenda ingathunyelwa kubasebenzi besabelomsebenzi ibuyele inexabiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"imidwebo-ye-dwg-ne-dxf\"\u003EImidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVula umdwebo njengamashidi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amapulani\u003C/span\u003E kweqembu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma wehlise amafayela) ithatha imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF eduze kwama-PDF. Imodeli namalayisheni ngamunye kuba yimashidi kuhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E, futhi ukubala kungafaka imidwebo namaPDF ndawonye. Ayikho into elayishwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EVula umdwebo we-DWG noma i-DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinganiso sivela emdwebeni.\u003C/strong\u003E Ilayisheni iqala ngesilinganiso sevikhwende yalo elikhulu kakhulu, ibizwe njengepresethi uma kunjalo, njengo-1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;. Imodeli iqala ngamayunithi omdwebo. Umdwebo ongenamayunithi uthi &quot;No scale&quot; size ulinganise. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/span\u003E sekusebenza kuqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing#the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-hash=\"the-scale\"\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingqimba nemidwebo exhunyiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngqimba\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni leshidi ikhombisa noma ifihle izingqimba zomdwebo. Izingqimba ifayela elizicime noma elizimise ziqala zifihliwe futhi azibalwa ngaphandle uma ukhetha. Umdwebo oxhunyiwe (xref) ovulwe eduze komdwebo osingathayo udwetshwa futhi ubalwe lapho uxhunywe khona; uma ungakavulwa, ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi yini engekho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing#layers\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-hash=\"layers\"\u003EIzingqimba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-PDF emakwe isebenza emdwebeni.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E idweba amashidi emakwe omdwebo njenge-PDF kuqala, ngakho ikhophi likhombisa izimaki zakho nencwadi yezimpawu ngaphandle kwesinyathelo sokuphrinta. Idwetshwa ngomnyama noma ngemibala yomdwebo, ngaphandle kwamathebhulu esitayela sokuphrinta. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate#a-marked-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-hash=\"a-marked-pdf\"\u003EI-PDF emakwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izinani-nobude-obunembile-kusuka-emdwebeni\"\u003EIzinani nobude obunembile kusuka emdwebeni\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBala lokho umdwebo okutshela ukuthi kukhona.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala kwe-CAD\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni leshidi ibala ibhulokhi ngegama lalo (kanye namabhulokhi agxiwe, izimo zebhulokhi eziguquguqukayo namakhredi webhulokhi), konke kuhlobo olulodwa esingqimbeni, noma umbhalo noma inani lesici. Ibala lokho ibhodlela leshidi noma umdwebo wonke kanye. Ukungeza izimaki kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa, nokubala futhi kwengeza okusha kuphela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E ihlala kuma-PDF nakuzimpawu ezingesizo amabhulokhi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBala kusukela kumdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa kusukela emigqeni yomdwebo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa umdwebo\u003C/span\u003E uthatha imigqa, ama-arc, ama-polyline, amasongo, izigaba zokufiphaza namasolidi oyawachofozayo noma oyawafaka iwindi njengezimaki zento yomugqa noma yendawo. Ama-arc, ama-bulge nezimbobo zesigaba zifika zinembile; ama-ellipse namacala ahlanganisiwe alinganiswa ngezingxenye ezincane, futhi ibha iyakutshela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003ELinganisa kusukela kumdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amathenda\"\u003EAmathenda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa ithenda lomsebenzisi njengexabiso lephakheji.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E kwithenda. Izinto zephakheji zihlala njengezinani, umugqa \u003Cstrong\u003EChosen bid\u003C/strong\u003E uthwala ixabiso, izinto ithenda elizishiya ngaphandle zihlala ngezindleko zakho, futhi ukuphathwa, inzuzo kanye nebhondi kusebenza kuyo. Ukushintsha amathenda kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa; incwadi yomsebenzi nesifinyezo sethenda siyithwala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-leveling#use-a-bid-as-the-packages-price\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-leveling\" data-hash=\"use-a-bid-as-the-packages-price\"\u003ESebenzisa ithenda njengexabiso lephakheji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThumela ephakheji ukuba kuthathwe amathenda.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela amathenda…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwephakheji ithumela kumsebenzisi ngamunye wesabelomsebenzi ixhumanisi lekhasi elingadingi i-akhawunti: babona isikophu namashidi njenge-PDF, bafake ixabiso kumugqa ngamunye noma babhale ukuthi akufakiwe, bangeza amanothi namafayela amathathu kuya kwangaphezulu, noma banqabe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola amanani\u003C/span\u003E idonsa lokho okubuye kwaleli leveli, iphawulwe \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuthumela kuvulekele kuma-akhawunti aqinisekiswe yi-CadCraft team kuphela ngenkathi ihlolwa (bona ngezansi). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\"\u003EThumela ephakheji ukuba kuthathwe amathenda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKufihliwe kuze kuvulwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Amanani angahlala efihliwe kuze kufike isikhathi sokuvula osisethayo: kuze kufike, akekho obona ixabiso, nawe uqobo. Ekuvulweni wonke ithenda liyabonakala ngasikhathi sinye, futhi ithenda elifike ngemva kwesikhathi lichazwa njengelibhalwe sekwephuzile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations#sealed-bids-and-the-opening\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-hash=\"sealed-bids-and-the-opening\"\u003EAmathenda afihliwe nokuvulwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmarekhodi wesabelomsebenzi.\u003C/strong\u003E I-akhawunti yakho ku-getcadcraft.com igcina oxhumana nabo bayo ngayinye, izinhlobo zomsebenzi, impendulo zokuqinisekisa, nezinsuku zeinshurensi nelayisensi (zifakwa uphawu lapho zidlule noma zisesikhathini esingamasonto angu-30), kanye namathenda abo adlule. Ziyangeniswa nokuphuma njenge-CSV, futhi uyazikhetha uma uthumela ephakheji. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations#on-the-website\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-hash=\"on-the-website\"\u003EKwiwebhusayithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"abasizi-be-ai\"\u003EAbasizi be-AI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbasizi bangangeza ekubalweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma i-\u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe, umsizi wakho ungangeza izinto (\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E) nokulinganisa imigqa, izindawo nezinani eshidini (\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E; ubude nezindawo kuphela eshidini elinesilinganiso), ngokubiza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi omsizi emidwebweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-DWG noma i-DXF evulekile umsizi angabala amashidi awo nokubalwa kwawo, abale ngokunembile, engeze izimaki zokubala, futhi alinganise kusukela ejiyomethri yomdwebo. Ngaphandle kokuvula i-TakeoffCraft, i-CadCraft MCP server ivula umdwebo njengokubala okusha futhi ayilondoloze, futhi i-\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft count\u003C/code\u003E ibala kumugqa womyalo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants#what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-hash=\"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\"\u003EOkungacelwa umsizi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuka kokuhlola kwe-3D njenge-USD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji ye-USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E ku-3D check view ibhala ngayinye yodonga, ukhonkolo, ipuleti, insika yokubala nombhalo njengento yayo, ibizwe ngegama lento nethwele inani layo, ngamamitha. Umsizi nawo angayithumela (\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EThumela ukubuka kokuhlola kwe-3D njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuwo-wonke-ama-app\"\u003EKuwo wonke ama-app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E inohlu olulodwa lobude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, nosayizi abanembile abavela ezichazweni zamayunithi (i-US survey foot iyiyunithi yayo). Vala amayunithi ongawasebenzisi nala awasuka ohlwini; uwenze wangena njengensimbi, futhi umsebenzi omusha uqala kuwo. Ifayela ligcina iyunithi yalo ngokwalo. Ku-TakeoffCraft uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E lwento luyalandela iswishi, into entsha iqala ngobude obunenkanyezi noma indawo, ama-roofing squares (SQ), ama-acre namahektha ayizindawo entsha, futhi ibhokisi lobude lamukela noma iyiphi uphawu lweyunithi, njengo-\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EAmayunithi, izinani ozibhalayo nohlu lwamayunithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakheka okuqinile namaphaneli azicwebe.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E ilwanele okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini zokuthinta nama-foni zigcina izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Iphaneli ngalinye eliseceleni linebha yesihloko elincane: yidonse ukuze uyifake noma uyiyeke ilula, uyilahle ebhareni lephaneli elinye ukuze wabelane ngerafu eyodwa njengamathebhu, uyibophe ukuze ishelele ngasemphethelweni, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisa emphethelweni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EHlela izakhiwo zamaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxoxo ziyahamba.\u003C/strong\u003E Donsa ingxoxo ngebha yayo yesihloko iphume endleleni yomdwebo; ibuyela lapho wayishiya khona. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibeke phakathi futhi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EHambisa ingxoxo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindlela zabasizi be-AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenziwe zomsizi wakho (hlanza umdwebo, phrinta isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, bala ukubala okuphelele, zama inguqulo yengxenye…), ngayinye nethuluzi eliyibizayo nezimvume ezidingekayo, futhi ngayinye iphindwa yizivivinyo zethu. Uhlelo alunayo i-AI. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EIzindlela zabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmalimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanguage\u003C/span\u003E kukhona okusha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E. Yona, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E manje zinawo wonke amagama ama-app, njengamadrafti angakabuyekezwa umuntu wendabuko. Izihloko zosizo zisesiNgisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-CadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E ichaza ukuthi kungani ukuhlola isibuyekezo kuhlulekile (akukho fayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isiginecha esingalungile) esikhundleni sokuthi &quot;Done&quot; nje, futhi ayiphindi ikhadi elisha elivaliwe size kube nenguqulo entsha ekhishiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwenziwa-kule-nguqulo\"\u003EAkukakwenziwa kule nguqulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 ayisayinwanga yikhodi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukusayina, nephakheji yeMicrosoft Store, kwadluliselwa ku-0.8 ngoba ukuqinisekiswa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eduze kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa isifakeli, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore info\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun anyway\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngakwesokudla i-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E. I-CadCraft Studio asikakabi esitolo sama-app, futhi asikakabi bukhona kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwe-engeli nokuthambeka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E lugciniwe, kodwa abukho bhokisi elikufundayo okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimemo zamathenda zicimiwe kwabaningi bama-akhawunti.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngenkathi isici sihlolwa, i-imeyili eya kubaqashi bangaphandle iphuma kuma-akhawunti aqinisekiswe yi-CadCraft team kuphela. Amakhasi ababhidi asebenza kuzo zonke izimemo ezisevele zithunyelwe. Abanye bonke: landa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E, uyithumele nge-imeyili ngokwakho, bese ufaka amathenda ngesandla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi le-CadCraft Studio alikwazi ukuthumela izimemo zamathenda okwamanje: lisho ukuthi usebenzise i-TakeoffCraft kusiphequluli. Ukuvula ukubala okunezicelo ezithunyelwe, ukuhlanganisa nokukhetha ithenda kusebenza ku-Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzengezo, izincwadi zokunikezwa, ishidi lesikophu elisayinwa yi-bidder ngamunye nezikhumbuzo ezizenzakalelayo ngaphambi kokuphela kwesikhathi seinshurensi azakhiwanga. Ithenda elikhethiwe alishintshi ixabiso lendawo ye-alternate.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImidwebo: amathebhulu esitayela sokuphrinta namafayela e-CTB ayingenwa, i-DXF yebhayinari iyenqatshwa (yigcine njenge-DXF ye-ASCII noma i-DWG), imidwebo exhunyiwe itholwa kuphela phakathi kwamafayela avulekile ngegama lefayela, futhi ama-PDF angaphansi, izithombe namathangi e-OLE emdwebeni ayadwetshwa noma abalwa. Izinani nezilinganiso zihlolwe kumidwebo yesampula, hhayi okwamanje emidwebweni esuka emsebenzini wangempela evulwe kuhlelo olwayidala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmsizi ungangeza izinto nezimaki kodwa awukwazi ukuhambisa, ukushintsha noma ukususa izimaki ezikhona ngaphambili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kukuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lokhu yikho okushintshe ku-TakeoffCraft 0.7, uma kuqhathaniswa ne-0.6. Imidwebo manje ivulwa njengoba ibe, ngaphandle kokuyiphrinta kuqala ibe yi-PDF, futhi iphakheji yethenda ingathunyelwa kubasebenzi besabelomsebenzi ibuyele inexabiso. Okusha Imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF Vula umdwebo njengamashidi. Vula amapulani kweqembu le-Ifayela (Ctrl+O, noma wehlise amafayela) ithatha imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF eduze kwama-PDF. Imodeli namalayisheni ngamunye kuba yimashidi kuhlu lwe-Amashidi, futhi ukubala kungafaka imidwebo namaPDF ndawonye. Ayikho into elayishwa. Bona Vula umdwebo we-DWG noma i-DXF. Isilinganiso sivela emdwebeni. Ilayisheni iqala ngesilinganiso sevikhwende yalo elikhulu kakhulu, ibizwe njengepresethi uma kunjalo, njengo-1/2\" = 1'-0\". Imodeli iqala ngamayunithi omdwebo. Umdwebo ongenamayunithi uthi \"No scale\" size ulinganise. Linganisa, Hlola ne-Okusethiwe ngaphambili sekusebenza kuqala. Bona Isilinganiso. Izingqimba nemidwebo exhunyiwe. Ongqimba ebhareni leshidi ikhombisa noma ifihle izingqimba zomdwebo. Izingqimba ifayela elizicime noma elizimise ziqala zifihliwe futhi azibalwa ngaphandle uma ukhetha. Umdwebo oxhunyiwe (xref) ovulwe eduze komdwebo osingathayo udwetshwa futhi ubalwe lapho uxhunywe khona; uma ungakavulwa, ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi yini engekho. Bona Izingqimba. I-PDF emakwe isebenza emdwebeni. Thumela › Marked PDF idweba amashidi emakwe omdwebo njenge-PDF kuqala, ngakho ikhophi likhombisa izimaki zakho nencwadi yezimpawu ngaphandle kwesinyathelo sokuphrinta. Idwetshwa ngomnyama noma ngemibala yomdwebo, ngaphandle kwamathebhulu esitayela sokuphrinta. Bona I-PDF emakwe. Izinani nobude obunembile kusuka emdwebeni Bala lokho umdwebo okutshela ukuthi kukhona. Ukubala kwe-CAD ebhareni leshidi ibala ibhulokhi ngegama lalo (kanye namabhulokhi agxiwe, izimo zebhulokhi eziguquguqukayo namakhredi webhulokhi), konke kuhlobo olulodwa esingqimbeni, noma umbhalo noma inani lesici. Ibala lokho ibhodlela leshidi noma umdwebo wonke kanye. Ukungeza izimaki kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa, nokubala futhi kwengeza okusha kuphela. Auto count ihlala kuma-PDF nakuzimpawu ezingesizo amabhulokhi. Bona Bala kusukela kumdwebo. Linganisa kusukela emigqeni yomdwebo. Linganisa umdwebo uthatha imigqa, ama-arc, ama-polyline, amasongo, izigaba zokufiphaza namasolidi oyawachofozayo noma oyawafaka iwindi njengezimaki zento yomugqa noma yendawo. Ama-arc, ama-bulge nezimbobo zesigaba zifika zinembile; ama-ellipse namacala ahlanganisiwe alinganiswa ngezingxenye ezincane, futhi ibha iyakutshela. Bona Linganisa kusukela kumdwebo. Amathenda Sebenzisa ithenda lomsebenzisi njengexabiso lephakheji. Ku-Thumela › Bid packages and leveling…, khetha Sebenzisa kwithenda. Izinto zephakheji zihlala njengezinani, umugqa Chosen bid uthwala ixabiso, izinto ithenda elizishiya ngaphandle zihlala ngezindleko zakho, futhi ukuphathwa, inzuzo kanye nebhondi kusebenza kuyo. Ukushintsha amathenda kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa; incwadi yomsebenzi nesifinyezo sethenda siyithwala. Bona Sebenzisa ithenda njengexabiso lephakheji. Thumela ephakheji ukuba kuthathwe amathenda. Thumela amathenda… ngaphansi kwephakheji ithumela kumsebenzisi ngamunye wesabelomsebenzi ixhumanisi lekhasi elingadingi i-akhawunti: babona isikophu namashidi njenge-PDF, bafake ixabiso kumugqa ngamunye noma babhale ukuthi akufakiwe, bangeza amanothi namafayela amathathu kuya kwangaphezulu, noma banqabe. Thola amanani idonsa lokho okubuye kwaleli leveli, iphawulwe web. Ukuthumela kuvulekele kuma-akhawunti aqinisekiswe yi-CadCraft team kuphela ngenkathi ihlolwa (bona ngezansi). Bona Thumela ephakheji ukuba kuthathwe amathenda. Kufihliwe kuze kuvulwe. Amanani angahlala efihliwe kuze kufike isikhathi sokuvula osisethayo: kuze kufike, akekho obona ixabiso, nawe uqobo. Ekuvulweni wonke ithenda liyabonakala ngasikhathi sinye, futhi ithenda elifike ngemva kwesikhathi lichazwa njengelibhalwe sekwephuzile. Bona Amathenda afihliwe nokuvulwa. Amarekhodi wesabelomsebenzi. I-akhawunti yakho ku-getcadcraft.com igcina oxhumana nabo bayo ngayinye, izinhlobo zomsebenzi, impendulo zokuqinisekisa, nezinsuku zeinshurensi nelayisensi (zifakwa uphawu lapho zidlule noma zisesikhathini esingamasonto angu-30), kanye namathenda abo adlule. Ziyangeniswa nokuphuma njenge-CSV, futhi uyazikhetha uma uthumela ephakheji. Bona Kwiwebhusayithi. Abasizi be-AI Abasizi bangangeza ekubalweni. Uma i-Edit ithikiwe, umsizi wakho ungangeza izinto (items_add) nokulinganisa imigqa, izindawo nezinani eshidini (marks_add; ubude nezindawo kuphela eshidini elinesilinganiso), ngokubiza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa. Amathuluzi omsizi emidwebweni. Ku-DWG noma i-DXF evulekile umsizi angabala amashidi awo nokubalwa kwawo, abale ngokunembile, engeze izimaki zokubala, futhi alinganise kusukela ejiyomethri yomdwebo. Ngaphandle kokuvula i-TakeoffCraft, i-CadCraft MCP server ivula umdwebo njengokubala okusha futhi ayilondoloze, futhi i-cadcraft count ibala kumugqa womyalo. Bona Okungacelwa umsizi. USD Ukubuka kokuhlola kwe-3D njenge-USD. Iphakheji ye-USD (.usdz) eduze kwe-GLB ku-3D check view ibhala ngayinye yodonga, ukhonkolo, ipuleti, insika yokubala nombhalo njengento yayo, ibizwe ngegama lento nethwele inani layo, ngamamitha. Umsizi nawo angayithumela (usd_export). Bona Thumela ukubuka kokuhlola kwe-3D njenge-USD. Kuwo wonke ama-app Amayunithi. Settings › General › Units inohlu olulodwa lobude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, nosayizi abanembile abavela ezichazweni zamayunithi (i-US survey foot iyiyunithi yayo). Vala amayunithi ongawasebenzisi nala awasuka ohlwini; uwenze wangena njengensimbi, futhi umsebenzi omusha uqala kuwo. Ifayela ligcina iyunithi yalo ngokwalo. Ku-TakeoffCraft uhlu lwe-Unit lwento luyalandela iswishi, into entsha iqala ngobude obunenkanyezi noma indawo, ama-roofing squares (SQ), ama-acre namahektha ayizindawo entsha, futhi ibhokisi lobude lamukela noma iyiphi uphawu lweyunithi, njengo-3 yd. Bona Amayunithi, izinani ozibhalayo nohlu lwamayunithi. Ukwakheka okuqinile namaphaneli azicwebe. Settings › General › Layout density › Compact ilwanele okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini zokuthinta nama-foni zigcina izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Iphaneli ngalinye eliseceleni linebha yesihloko elincane: yidonse ukuze uyifake noma uyiyeke ilula, uyilahle ebhareni lephaneli elinye ukuze wabelane ngerafu eyodwa njengamathebhu, uyibophe ukuze ishelele ngasemphethelweni, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisa emphethelweni. Bona Hlela izakhiwo zamaphaneli. Izingxoxo ziyahamba. Donsa ingxoxo ngebha yayo yesihloko iphume endleleni yomdwebo; ibuyela lapho wayishiya khona. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibeke phakathi futhi. Bona Hambisa ingxoxo. Izindlela zabasizi be-AI. Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenziwe zomsizi wakho (hlanza umdwebo, phrinta isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, bala ukubala okuphelele, zama inguqulo yengxenye…), ngayinye nethuluzi eliyibizayo nezimvume ezidingekayo, futhi ngayinye iphindwa yizivivinyo zethu. Uhlelo alunayo i-AI. Bona Izindlela zabasizi be-AI. Amalimi. Ku-Settings › General › Language kukhona okusha i-Português (Portugal). Yona, i-Português (Brasil), i-Español (México) ne-Bahasa Indonesia manje zinawo wonke amagama ama-app, njengamadrafti angakabuyekezwa umuntu wendabuko. Izihloko zosizo zisesiNgisi. I-CadCraft Studio ichaza ukuthi kungani ukuhlola isibuyekezo kuhlulekile (akukho fayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isiginecha esingalungile) esikhundleni sokuthi \"Done\" nje, futhi ayiphindi ikhadi elisha elivaliwe size kube nenguqulo entsha ekhishiwe. Akukakwenziwa kule nguqulo 0.7 ayisayinwanga yikhodi. Ukusayina, nephakheji yeMicrosoft Store, kwadluliselwa ku-0.8 ngoba ukuqinisekiswa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eduze kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa isifakeli, khetha More info, bese Run anyway. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngakwesokudla i-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha Open. I-CadCraft Studio asikakabi esitolo sama-app, futhi asikakabi bukhona kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone. Uhlu lwe-engeli nokuthambeka ku-Units lugciniwe, kodwa abukho bhokisi elikufundayo okwamanje. Izimemo zamathenda zicimiwe kwabaningi bama-akhawunti. Ngenkathi isici sihlolwa, i-imeyili eya kubaqashi bangaphandle iphuma kuma-akhawunti aqinisekiswe yi-CadCraft team kuphela. Amakhasi ababhidi asebenza kuzo zonke izimemo ezisevele zithunyelwe. Abanye bonke: landa i-Scope CSV, uyithumele nge-imeyili ngokwakho, bese ufaka amathenda ngesandla. Iwindi le-CadCraft Studio alikwazi ukuthumela izimemo zamathenda okwamanje: lisho ukuthi usebenzise i-TakeoffCraft kusiphequluli. Ukuvula ukubala okunezicelo ezithunyelwe, ukuhlanganisa nokukhetha ithenda kusebenza ku-Studio. Izengezo, izincwadi zokunikezwa, ishidi lesikophu elisayinwa yi-bidder ngamunye nezikhumbuzo ezizenzakalelayo ngaphambi kokuphela kwesikhathi seinshurensi azakhiwanga. Ithenda elikhethiwe alishintshi ixabiso lendawo ye-alternate. Imidwebo: amathebhulu esitayela sokuphrinta namafayela e-CTB ayingenwa, i-DXF yebhayinari iyenqatshwa (yigcine njenge-DXF ye-ASCII noma i-DWG), imidwebo exhunyiwe itholwa kuphela phakathi kwamafayela avulekile ngegama lefayela, futhi ama-PDF angaphansi, izithombe namathangi e-OLE emdwebeni ayadwetshwa noma abalwa. Izinani nezilinganiso zihlolwe kumidwebo yesampula, hhayi okwamanje emidwebweni esuka emsebenzini wangempela evulwe kuhlelo olwayidala. Umsizi ungangeza izinto nezimaki kodwa awukwazi ukuhambisa, ukushintsha noma ukususa izimaki ezikhona ngaphambili. Konke okunye kukuthi Akukakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ukuqala nge-TakeoffCraft","summary":"Okwenza i-TakeoffCraft, lapho isebenza khona, nencwadi yakho yokuqala ekalwe futhi yabiwa ngentengo esuka kusethi yamapulani e-PDF.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["qala","ukubala kokuqala","isiqalo esisheshayo","isingeniso","isilinganiso","ukubala amanani","isethi yamapulani","pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"lapho-isebenza-khona","text":"Lapho isebenza khona","level":2},{"id":"ukubala-kokuqala-ngezinyathelo-eziyishumi","text":"Ukubala kokuqala ngezinyathelo eziyishumi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo-okufundwa","text":"Okulandelayo okufundwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ikala amasethi amapulani, ama-PDF namadrowing e-DWG noma e-DXF, iguqule izilinganiso ibe yisilinganiso sezindleko. Uvula amafayela (idrowing ye-DWG noma ye-DXF ibalwa ngqo kusuka kumabhulokhi ayo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EVula idrowing ye-DWG noma ye-DXF\u003C/a\u003E), unikeze ishidi ngalinye isikali (idrowing iletha eyayo), wenze \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinto\u003C/strong\u003E (uhlobo lodonga, umshato wesakhiwo, into yokufakwa), bese uchofoza emashidini ukuze uzikale. Amanani, izindleko nesamba sephrojekthi kuyabuyekezwa njengoba usebenza. Ungathumela isilinganiso njengesipredishithi nekhophi yama-PDF enokubalwa kwakho kudwetshwe kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma usuke wenza ukubala ngezinye izinhlelo, funda kuqala \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EUkuvela kokubala okuvela kwezinye izinhlelo\u003C/a\u003E. Ezinye izinto zisebenza ngendlela ehlukile lapha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-isebenza-khona\"\u003ELapho isebenza khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft isebenza kusiphequluli sakho sewebhu. Vula i-TakeoffCraft isikrini silungele ngokushesha; akukho okudingeka ukufakwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-PDF akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Avulwa yisiphequluli futhi awalayishwa. Ukulondoloza kuyukulanda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsebenza ku-Chrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari zamanje. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EAmasiphequluli nekhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumana ngemva kokuthi usikhethe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yohlelo futhi kutshelwe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza efwini akutholakali okwamanje. Ngedesktop, i-TakeoffCraft iza ku-CadCraft Studio, kanye namanye ama-app ayisikhombisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubala-kokuqala-ngezinyathelo-eziyishumi\"\u003EUkubala kokuqala ngezinyathelo eziyishumi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELolu hambo lukala uhlobo lodonga olulodwa bese luluthengisa. Lithatha imizuzu embalwa kunoma yipulani oyilo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E kweqembu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), khetha i-PDF eyodwa noma ngaphezulu, bese ukhetha Vula. Ungaphinda uwadonse ndawana ekhasini. Amashidi avela ngakwesobunxele, futhi ishidi lokuqala livulwa phakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola isikali esiphrintiwe seshidi ngesihloko sayo esiphethe noma ngaphansi kwesihloko sedrowing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E kweqembu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha leso sikali, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Ibha esezansi kweshidi manje ithi &quot;Isikali 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uchofoza iziphetho ezimbili zesilinganiso esiphrintiwe kudrowing. Ukufunda okusebhodweni yesimo esingezansi ngakwesobunxele kufanele kufane nesilinganiso esiphrintiwe. Uma kungafani, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-panel ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha igama njengo \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E, ushiye uhlobo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ekuqaleni kodonga, bese ngamakhona alo ngamunye. Cofoza kabili, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze ngakwesokudla ukuqeda lo mgqa. Umugqa udwetshwa ngombala wento, futhi ubude bawo buvela eduze kwento.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-item editor ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.85\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003E1.20\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E. Ithebula le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E elisezansi libonisa ubude, impahla nomsebenzi ngokwandisiwe, nethoti le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Isiphequluli sakho silanda ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Liqukatha izinto zakho, izikali namakwe, futhi livula kabusha phezu kwama-PDF afanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ulande isilinganiso njengesipredishithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze umise noma yini oyenzayo ubuyele kwithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlehlisa noma yiluphi oshintsho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo-okufundwa\"\u003EOkulandelayo okufundwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EIsikrini se-TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E siqamba yonke ingxenye yewindi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EQala ukubala futhi uvule isethi yamapulani\u003C/a\u003E ikhuluma ngama-PDF amaningi nohlu lwamashidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EDala izinto zokubala\u003C/a\u003E ichaza izinhlobo, izinyunithi, ukulahleka namazinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EInhlanganisela namafomula\u003C/a\u003E iguqula ukukala okukodwa ibe ama-stud, amashidi webhodi nokunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIkhibhodi nemouse\u003C/a\u003E ibala zonke izinkinobho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-TakeoffCraft ikala amasethi amapulani, ama-PDF namadrowing e-DWG noma e-DXF, iguqule izilinganiso ibe yisilinganiso sezindleko. Uvula amafayela (idrowing ye-DWG noma ye-DXF ibalwa ngqo kusuka kumabhulokhi ayo: bona Vula idrowing ye-DWG noma ye-DXF), unikeze ishidi ngalinye isikali (idrowing iletha eyayo), wenze izinto (uhlobo lodonga, umshato wesakhiwo, into yokufakwa), bese uchofoza emashidini ukuze uzikale. Amanani, izindleko nesamba sephrojekthi kuyabuyekezwa njengoba usebenza. Ungathumela isilinganiso njengesipredishithi nekhophi yama-PDF enokubalwa kwakho kudwetshwe kuwo. Uma usuke wenza ukubala ngezinye izinhlelo, funda kuqala Ukuvela kokubala okuvela kwezinye izinhlelo. Ezinye izinto zisebenza ngendlela ehlukile lapha. Lapho isebenza khona I-TakeoffCraft isebenza kusiphequluli sakho sewebhu. Vula i-TakeoffCraft isikrini silungele ngokushesha; akukho okudingeka ukufakwa. Ama-PDF akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho. Avulwa yisiphequluli futhi awalayishwa. Ukulondoloza kuyukulanda. Isebenza ku-Chrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari zamanje. Bona Amasiphequluli nekhompyutha. Isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumana ngemva kokuthi usikhethe Save for offline ebhareni yohlelo futhi kutshelwe Offline ready. Bona Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukulondoloza efwini akutholakali okwamanje. Ngedesktop, i-TakeoffCraft iza ku-CadCraft Studio, kanye namanye ama-app ayisikhombisa. Ukubala kokuqala ngezinyathelo eziyishumi Lolu hambo lukala uhlobo lodonga olulodwa bese luluthengisa. Lithatha imizuzu embalwa kunoma yipulani oyilo. Khetha Open plans kweqembu le-File ethuluzini (noma cindezela Ctrl+O), khetha i-PDF eyodwa noma ngaphezulu, bese ukhetha Vula. Ungaphinda uwadonse ndawana ekhasini. Amashidi avela ngakwesobunxele, futhi ishidi lokuqala livulwa phakathi. Thola isikali esiphrintiwe seshidi ngesihloko sayo esiphethe noma ngaphansi kwesihloko sedrowing. Vula uhlu lwe-Preset kweqembu le-Scale bese ukhetha leso sikali, isibonelo 1/4\" = 1'-0\". Ibha esezansi kweshidi manje ithi \"Isikali 1/4\" = 1'-0\"\". Khetha Check (noma cindezela D) bese uchofoza iziphetho ezimbili zesilinganiso esiphrintiwe kudrowing. Ukufunda okusebhodweni yesimo esingezansi ngakwesobunxele kufanele kufane nesilinganiso esiphrintiwe. Uma kungafani, bona Setha isikali. Ku-panel ye-Items ngakwesokudla, khetha New item, thayipha igama njengo Interior wall type A, ushiye uhlobo ku-Linear (length), bese ukhetha Add. Khetha Linear ethuluzini (noma cindezela L). Chofoza ekuqaleni kodonga, bese ngamakhona alo ngamunye. Cofoza kabili, cindezela Enter noma uchofoze ngakwesokudla ukuqeda lo mgqa. Umugqa udwetshwa ngombala wento, futhi ubude bawo buvela eduze kwento. Ku-item editor ngaphansi kwe-Items, thayipha 9'-0\" ku-Height, 0.85 ku-Material $/LF no-1.20 ku-Labor $/LF. Ithebula le-Quantities elisezansi libonisa ubude, impahla nomsebenzi ngokwandisiwe, nethoti le-Job total. Khetha Save takeoff (noma cindezela Ctrl+S). Isiphequluli sakho silanda ifayela le-.takeoff.json. Liqukatha izinto zakho, izikali namakwe, futhi livula kabusha phezu kwama-PDF afanayo. Vula imenyu ye-Export ethuluzini bese ukhetha XLSX ukuze ulande isilinganiso njengesipredishithi. Cindezela Esc ukuze umise noma yini oyenzayo ubuyele kwithuluzi le-Select. Ctrl+Z ihlehlisa noma yiluphi oshintsho. Okulandelayo okufundwa Isikrini se-TakeoffCraft siqamba yonke ingxenye yewindi. Qala ukubala futhi uvule isethi yamapulani ikhuluma ngama-PDF amaningi nohlu lwamashidi. Dala izinto zokubala ichaza izinhlobo, izinyunithi, ukulahleka namazinga. Inhlanganisela namafomula iguqula ukukala okukodwa ibe ama-stud, amashidi webhodi nokunye. Ikhibhodi nemouse ibala zonke izinkinobho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Isikrini se-TakeoffCraft","summary":"Ukuhamba esikrinini ngamagama asekrinini - ibha yamathuluzi, amashidi, ishidi, ipanele Izinto, ithebula lamanani nebha yesimo.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["isikrini","isakhiwo","izakhiwo","ibhoni","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ibhokisi lolwazi","ibha yamathuluzi","amapanele","uhlu lwamashidi","ipanele yezinto","amanani","ibha yesimo","ukuhamba","indawo yokusebenzela"],"headings":[{"id":"ibha-yamathuluzi","text":"Ibha yamathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"amashidi-kwesobunxele","text":"Amashidi (kwesobunxele)","level":2},{"id":"ishidi-phakathi","text":"Ishidi (phakathi)","level":2},{"id":"izinto-kwesokudla","text":"Izinto (kwesokudla)","level":2},{"id":"amanani-phansi","text":"Amanani (phansi)","level":2},{"id":"ibha-yesimo-phansi","text":"Ibha yesimo (phansi)","level":2},{"id":"ezinye-izakhiwo","text":"Ezinye izakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"isikrini-esigcwele-nezihloko","text":"Isikrini esigcwele nezihloko","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft igcwalisa iwindi lesiphequluli ngaphansi kwebha yohlelo ye-CadCraft. Kusuka phezulu kuya phansi nakwesokudla kuya kwesobunxele:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIngxenye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYini ekhonzelwe yona\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yohlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhezulu kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lohlelo, inguqulo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E nesiwishi sesihloko se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgaphansi kwebha yohlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke imiyalo, ngamaqembu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmashidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwesobunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke ikhasi lazo zonke ama-PDF avulekile, nesithombe sawo esincane, isikali sawo nenani lamakwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhasi elivulekile. Ukukala kwenziwa lapha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zakho zokubala, izilungiselelo zento ekhethiwe, nophawu olukhethiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanani nezindleko ngento noma ngeshidi, nesamba sephrojekthi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yesimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhansi kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukala okuphilayo, imilayezo, isiphakamiso se-45°, nesikali sokusondeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yamathuluzi\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYima phezu kwanoma iyiphi inkinobho ukuze ubone ukuthi yenzani nokhiye wayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIqembu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E (ukubala okungenalutho), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen PDFs\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (iphrojekthi \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImenyu eyodwa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), nohlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, isiwishi sokuvula/sokuvala), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, isiwishi sokuvula/sokuvala), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi osilisebenzisayo libonakala linxeniwe. Izinkinobho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E zihlala zixineneke uma zivuliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amashidi-kwesobunxele\"\u003EAmashidi (kwesobunxele)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESesha amashidi\u003C/strong\u003E ihlunga uhlu ngegama leshidi, ngegama lefayela noma ngelebula yekhasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIshidi ngalinye linesithombe esincane (sidwetshwa njengoba usuka phansi), igama layo, nalokho okuthi ngesikali sayo noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho sikali\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokudla kwesakhiwo ngasinye kukhombisa amakwe amangaki eshidi linawo. Uma into ikhanyisiwe, ikhombisa amakwe alo mbhalo akulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ishidi ukuze liyivule. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ziya kweshidi elilandelayo nelandulelayo kuhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ukubala kumboza ama-PDF angavulekile, isaziso ngaphansi kohlu siwabiza ngamagama. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ELondoloza bese uvula kabusha ukubala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmagama amashidi avela ku-PDF: ilebula yekhasi njenge-\u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E iba yigama leshidi. Ikhasi elingenalo ilebula libizwa ngegama lefayela nenombolo yekhasi, njengo &quot;Amapulani, ikhasi 3&quot;. Uma kuvulwe ama-PDF amaningi, amashidi anelebula akhombisa negama lefayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ishidi-phakathi\"\u003EIshidi (phakathi)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbha engaphansi kweshidi ikhombisa igama leshidi nesikali salo, noma &quot;Akukho sikali okwamanje: khetha i-preset noma linganisa&quot;. Izinkinobho zayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E (lapho lolo hlelo lunganamukela i-PDF; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EQala ukubala uvule isethi yamapulani\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E (inguqulo endala yeshidi ngaphezu kwalo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003EQhathanisa ishidi elibuyekeziwe\u003C/a\u003E), &quot;(n) ukuhlola&quot; (amakwe akhonjiswe, uma likhona) kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003Eumbono wokuhlola ngo-3D\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphambi kokuvulwa kwanoma yiPDF, phakathi kubonisa umhlahlandlela omfushane wezinyathelo ezinhlanu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkonzo yembewu isondeza endaweni yophoyinta. Hudula ukuze ushelele. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIkhibhodi nemouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho usebenzisa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, ibha enezilawuli zayo ivela phezulu kweshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-kwesokudla\"\u003EIzinto (kwesokudla)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhezulu kukhona uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E: isakhiwo, uhlelo noma isigaba lapho kuzongeniswa khona amakwe amasha (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EIzindawo zezindleko\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E ivula ifomu elincane: igama, uhlobo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E) kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lubonisa umbala wento ngayinye, isithombe sohlobo, igama nenani. Chofoza into ukuze udwebe ngayo nokuqaphela amakwe ayo kuwo wonke amashidi. Chofoza futhi ukuze uyeke ukuqaphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kohlu kukhona \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto: (igama)\u003C/strong\u003E, umhleli wento: igama, uhlobo, umbala, iyunithi, ubude noma ukujula, ukulahleka, amarethi empahla nomsebenzi, izinkulumo ezilinganisiwe, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EDala izinto zokubala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti elikhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E livela uma ukhetha iphoyinti: ukuthi lingeyaphi into, ishidi lalo, izilinganiso zalo, nezinkinobho ezinjenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a cut-out\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E. Uma kukhethwe amakwe amaningi lidlulela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakwe akhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: inani lento ngayinye, nezinkinobho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete marks\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmhleli wento uphela ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate item\u003C/span\u003E: into enenhlanganisela yayo nezindleko, ngaphandle kwamakwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde amakwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanani-phansi\"\u003EAmanani (phansi)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E ibala yonke into nezingxenye zayo zenhlanganisela ngenani, ukulahleka, amarethi nezindleko ezandisiwe. Ungathayipha ukulahleka namarethi ngqo kwithebula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E ibala inani ngalinye lento kuleshidi ngalinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsexwayiso esiqala ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkungaphelele:\u003C/strong\u003E sivela uma kukhona okushiywe ezinhlanganisweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E isendaweni ekwesokudla kwesihloko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho enompini ekwesokudla kakhulu ifihla noma ibonise ithebula ukuze kube nendawo eningi yeshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\"\u003EFunda amanani nesilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yesimo-phansi\"\u003EIbha yesimo (phansi)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKusuka kwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla: ukukala okuphilayo ngesikhathi udwebayo (ubude, indawo, iradiyasi noma umphumela wokuhlola), ibhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E uma uthayipha ubude, imilayezo evela ku-TakeoffCraft, isikhumbuzi esithi &quot;Shift snaps to 45°&quot; (noma &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot; uma lokho kuvulwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/a\u003E), inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E (ukubambelela emigqeni yedrowing, ivulekile uma ikhanyisiwe; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kanye nephesenti lokusondeza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunda ibha yesimo uma okuthile kungenzeki. I-TakeoffCraft icacisa lapho ukuthi ikwenqabile ngani ukuchofoza, isibonelo &quot;Leli shidi alikakabi nesikali&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezinye-izakhiwo\"\u003EEzinye izakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okusenhla kungakhulunywa ngakho kusakhiwo se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E, okuwukuqala. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E inikeza ezimbili ezengeziwe; amathuluzi nokhiye bafanayo kuzo zonke ezintathu, futhi ukukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E futhi kubuyisela yonke into lapho yayikhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-TakeoffCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E phezulu (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, izinkinobho nemouse\u003C/a\u003E), ibha yethuluzi elisebenzayo, nethebhu ngalinye leshidi olivulayo (namamodeli nezakhiwo zedrowing nazo ngamashidi), ngamapresethi esikali ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kweshidi. Ipanele elingakwesobunxele linezakhiwo ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E (into, inothi noma iphoyinti elikhethiwe) ngaphezulu kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff browser\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E (chofoza eyodwa ukuze uyivule ethebhini), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConditions\u003C/span\u003E (chofoza eyodwa ukuze udwebe ngayo) kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E (isamba sento ngayinye nesamba sephrojekthi); izithombe ezincane zingethebhu yayo yesibili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yamathuluzi phezu kweshidi, ibhokisi lolwazi nebhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E, ithuluzi elisebenzayo noma ukukhethwa, nebha yeshidi, ikholomu yamathuluzi okubala ngakwesobunxele, ithebhu ngayo yonke ishidi, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E nokusondeza ngaphansi kweshidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003Eumbono wokuhlola ngo-3D\u003C/a\u003E uvuliwe, amathebhu amashidi nebha engaphansi kweshidi ayasuka; vala umbono we-3D ukuze ulinganise futhi. Efonini kusebenza isakhiwo sefoni njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikrini-esigcwele-nezihloko\"\u003EIsikrini esigcwele nezihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yohlelo, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (i-Control kuzo zonke izinhlelo, nakuMac), ijikeleza phakathi kwejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, nesikrini esigcwele nezibha ezifihliwe. Ngezibha ezifihliwe, hambisa iphoyinta ngaphezulu emaphethelweni ukuze uzibuyisele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E iyisihloko esikhanyayo, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E eyimnyama. Kwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E idrowing iboniswa iphenduliwe (imigqa ekhanyayo ngaphezu kokumnyama) kuskrini kuphela; okuthunyelwayo akusoze kushintshwe.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-TakeoffCraft igcwalisa iwindi lesiphequluli ngaphansi kwebha yohlelo ye-CadCraft. Kusuka phezulu kuya phansi nakwesokudla kuya kwesobunxele: Ingxenye Lapho Yini ekhonzelwe yona Ibha yohlelo Phezulu kakhulu Igama lohlelo, inguqulo, About TakeoffCraft, Help (F1), Save for offline, Settings (Ctrl+,), inkinobho ye-Full screen nesiwishi sesihloko se-Paper / Model. Ibha yamathuluzi Ngaphansi kwebha yohlelo Yonke imiyalo, ngamaqembu: File, Export, Scale, Takeoff, Edit, View. Amashidi Kwesobunxele Yonke ikhasi lazo zonke ama-PDF avulekile, nesithombe sawo esincane, isikali sawo nenani lamakwe. Ishidi Phakathi Ikhasi elivulekile. Ukukala kwenziwa lapha. Izinto Kwesokudla Izinto zakho zokubala, izilungiselelo zento ekhethiwe, nophawu olukhethiwe. Amanani Phansi Amanani nezindleko ngento noma ngeshidi, nesamba sephrojekthi. Ibha yesimo Phansi kakhulu Ukukala okuphilayo, imilayezo, isiphakamiso se-45°, nesikali sokusondeza. Ibha yamathuluzi Yima phezu kwanoma iyiphi inkinobho ukuze ubone ukuthi yenzani nokhiye wayo. Iqembu Izinkinobho File New (ukubala okungenalutho), Open PDFs (Ctrl+O), Open takeoff (iphrojekthi .takeoff.json), Save takeoff (Ctrl+S) Export Imenyu eyodwa: XLSX, CSV, Marked PDF Scale Calibrate (K), Check (D), nohlu lwe-Preset Takeoff Select (V), Linear (L), Area (A), Circle (O), Arc (R, isiwishi sokuvula/sokuvala), Deduct (E, isiwishi sokuvula/sokuvala), Cut-out (X), Count (C), Auto count (S) Edit Undo (Ctrl+Z), Redo (Ctrl+Y), Copy (Ctrl+C), Paste (Ctrl+V), kanye More: Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste in place, Duplicate, Delete, Select all, Select none View Fit page (F), Fit width (W) Ithuluzi osilisebenzisayo libonakala linxeniwe. Izinkinobho ze-Arc ne-Deduct zihlala zixineneke uma zivuliwe. Amashidi (kwesobunxele) Sesha amashidi ihlunga uhlu ngegama leshidi, ngegama lefayela noma ngelebula yekhasi. Ishidi ngalinye linesithombe esincane (sidwetshwa njengoba usuka phansi), igama layo, nalokho okuthi ngesikali sayo noma Akukho sikali. Ngakwesokudla kwesakhiwo ngasinye kukhombisa amakwe amangaki eshidi linawo. Uma into ikhanyisiwe, ikhombisa amakwe alo mbhalo akulo. Chofoza ishidi ukuze liyivule. Page Down no-Page Up ziya kweshidi elilandelayo nelandulelayo kuhlu. Uma ukubala kumboza ama-PDF angavulekile, isaziso ngaphansi kohlu siwabiza ngamagama. Bona Londoloza bese uvula kabusha ukubala. Amagama amashidi avela ku-PDF: ilebula yekhasi njenge-A-101 iba yigama leshidi. Ikhasi elingenalo ilebula libizwa ngegama lefayela nenombolo yekhasi, njengo \"Amapulani, ikhasi 3\". Uma kuvulwe ama-PDF amaningi, amashidi anelebula akhombisa negama lefayela. Ishidi (phakathi) Ibha engaphansi kweshidi ikhombisa igama leshidi nesikali salo, noma \"Akukho sikali okwamanje: khetha i-preset noma linganisa\". Izinkinobho zayo: MarkupCraft (lapho lolo hlelo lunganamukela i-PDF; bona Qala ukubala uvule isethi yamapulani), Compare (inguqulo endala yeshidi ngaphezu kwalo: Qhathanisa ishidi elibuyekeziwe), \"(n) ukuhlola\" (amakwe akhonjiswe, uma likhona) kanye ne-3D (umbono wokuhlola ngo-3D). Ngaphambi kokuvulwa kwanoma yiPDF, phakathi kubonisa umhlahlandlela omfushane wezinyathelo ezinhlanu. Inkonzo yembewu isondeza endaweni yophoyinta. Hudula ukuze ushelele. Bona Ikhibhodi nemouse. Lapho usebenzisa i-Auto count, ibha enezilawuli zayo ivela phezulu kweshidi. Izinto (kwesokudla) Phezulu kukhona uhlu lwe-Bid area: isakhiwo, uhlelo noma isigaba lapho kuzongeniswa khona amakwe amasha (Izindawo zezindleko). New item ivula ifomu elincane: igama, uhlobo (Linear (length), Area noma Count) kanye ne-Add. Uhlu lubonisa umbala wento ngayinye, isithombe sohlobo, igama nenani. Chofoza into ukuze udwebe ngayo nokuqaphela amakwe ayo kuwo wonke amashidi. Chofoza futhi ukuze uyeke ukuqaphela. Ngaphansi kohlu kukhona Izinto: (igama), umhleli wento: igama, uhlobo, umbala, iyunithi, ubude noma ukujula, ukulahleka, amarethi empahla nomsebenzi, izinkulumo ezilinganisiwe, kanye ne-Assembly. Bona Dala izinto zokubala. Iphoyinti elikhethiwe livela uma ukhetha iphoyinti: ukuthi lingeyaphi into, ishidi lalo, izilinganiso zalo, nezinkinobho ezinjenge-Add a cut-out ne-Delete mark. Uma kukhethwe amakwe amaningi lidlulela ku-Amakwe akhethiwe: inani lento ngayinye, nezinkinobho ze-Copy, Duplicate, Cut ne-Delete marks. Umhleli wento uphela ngo-Copy item ne-Duplicate item: into enenhlanganisela yayo nezindleko, ngaphandle kwamakwe. Bona Kopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde amakwe. Amanani (phansi) By item ibala yonke into nezingxenye zayo zenhlanganisela ngenani, ukulahleka, amarethi nezindleko ezandisiwe. Ungathayipha ukulahleka namarethi ngqo kwithebula. By sheet ibala inani ngalinye lento kuleshidi ngalinye. Isexwayiso esiqala ngo-Okungaphelele: sivela uma kukhona okushiywe ezinhlanganisweni. Job total isendaweni ekwesokudla kwesihloko. Inkinobho enompini ekwesokudla kakhulu ifihla noma ibonise ithebula ukuze kube nendawo eningi yeshidi. Bona Funda amanani nesilinganiso. Ibha yesimo (phansi) Kusuka kwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla: ukukala okuphilayo ngesikhathi udwebayo (ubude, indawo, iradiyasi noma umphumela wokuhlola), ibhokisi le-Type uma uthayipha ubude, imilayezo evela ku-TakeoffCraft, isikhumbuzi esithi \"Shift snaps to 45°\" (noma \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\" uma lokho kuvulwe kuthi Izilungiselelo), inkinobho ye-Snap (ukubambelela emigqeni yedrowing, ivulekile uma ikhanyisiwe; F3), kanye nephesenti lokusondeza. Funda ibha yesimo uma okuthile kungenzeki. I-TakeoffCraft icacisa lapho ukuthi ikwenqabile ngani ukuchofoza, isibonelo \"Leli shidi alikakabi nesikali\". Ezinye izakhiwo Konke okusenhla kungakhulunywa ngakho kusakhiwo se-CadCraft classic, okuwukuqala. Settings (Ctrl+,) › Global › Layout inikeza ezimbili ezengeziwe; amathuluzi nokhiye bafanayo kuzo zonke ezintathu, futhi ukukhetha CadCraft classic futhi kubuyisela yonke into lapho yayikhona. Isakhiwo Ku-TakeoffCraft Ribbon and project browser I-Takeoff ribbon phezulu (Imenyu, izinkinobho nemouse), ibha yethuluzi elisebenzayo, nethebhu ngalinye leshidi olivulayo (namamodeli nezakhiwo zedrowing nazo ngamashidi), ngamapresethi esikali ne-Fit page ngaphansi kweshidi. Ipanele elingakwesobunxele linezakhiwo ze-Properties (into, inothi noma iphoyinti elikhethiwe) ngaphezulu kwe-Takeoff browser: Sheets (chofoza eyodwa ukuze uyivule ethebhini), Conditions (chofoza eyodwa ukuze udwebe ngayo) kanye ne-Estimate (isamba sento ngayinye nesamba sephrojekthi); izithombe ezincane zingethebhu yayo yesibili. Toolbox and info box Ibha yamathuluzi phezu kweshidi, ibhokisi lolwazi nebhokisi le-Bid area, ithuluzi elisebenzayo noma ukukhethwa, nebha yeshidi, ikholomu yamathuluzi okubala ngakwesobunxele, ithebhu ngayo yonke ishidi, kanye ne-Snap nokusondeza ngaphansi kweshidi. Uma umbono wokuhlola ngo-3D uvuliwe, amathebhu amashidi nebha engaphansi kweshidi ayasuka; vala umbono we-3D ukuze ulinganise futhi. Efonini kusebenza isakhiwo sefoni njalo. Isikrini esigcwele nezihloko Inkinobho ye-Full screen ebhareni yohlelo, noma Ctrl+Shift+F (i-Control kuzo zonke izinhlelo, nakuMac), ijikeleza phakathi kwejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, nesikrini esigcwele nezibha ezifihliwe. Ngezibha ezifihliwe, hambisa iphoyinta ngaphezulu emaphethelweni ukuze uzibuyisele. I-Paper iyisihloko esikhanyayo, ne-Model eyimnyama. Kwi-Model idrowing iboniswa iphenduliwe (imigqa ekhanyayo ngaphezu kokumnyama) kuskrini kuphela; okuthunyelwayo akusoze kushintshwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"files","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amafayela i-TakeoffCraft evula futhi ilondoloza","summary":"Ama-PDF angenayo, ifayela lephrojekthi yokubala amanani, izipredishithi namapulani e-PDF emakwe aphumayo - okuqukethwe yilelo ngalinye, lapho liya khona, nokushintsha okwenzeka ku-inthanethi, ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi nakuma-browser ahlukene.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["amafayela","amafomethi","pdf","takeoff.json","ifayela lephrojekthi","xlsx","csv","pdf emakwe","landa","londoloza","vula","ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuvulayo","text":"Okuvulayo","level":2},{"id":"okulondolozayo","text":"Okulondolozayo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-okulandelwa-khona","text":"Lapho okulandelwa khona","level":2},{"id":"kungani-iphrojekthi-nama-pdf-kuhlukene","text":"Kungani iphrojekthi nama-PDF kuhlukene","level":2},{"id":"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwayo","text":"Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo","level":2},{"id":"izipredishithi","text":"Izipredishithi","level":2},{"id":"idesktop-nelifu","text":"Idesktop nelifu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuvulayo\"\u003EOkuvulayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF (\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma uyidonse ekhasini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Ikhasi ngalinye liba yishidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphrojekthi yokubala amanani (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, noma uyidonse ekhasini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zakho, izikali namakwe. Ungayidonsa kanye nama-PDF ayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanye amafayela adonselwe ekhasini ayadlulwa, futhi ibha yesimo iwabiza ngamagama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-PDF avikelwe ngephasiwedi\u003C/strong\u003E awavuleki: &quot;(igama) livikelwe ngephasiwedi. Vula ikhophi engavikelwe.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-PDF efanayo kabili\u003C/strong\u003E ivulwa kanye: &quot;(igama) livulekile vele.&quot; I-TakeoffCraft iwazi amafayela ngokuqukethwe kwawo, hhayi ngamagama awo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-PDF askeniwe\u003C/strong\u003E avulwa futhi ahlolwe njengawanoma yiziphi ezinye; i-TakeoffCraft ayidingi umbhalo ongaphakathi kwe-PDF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasethi amakhulu amapulani\u003C/strong\u003E: yonke i-PDF ifundwa iphelele lapho ivulwa (ukuze kuthathwe isigxivizo sayo), ngakho ifayela elikhulu kakhulu lithatha isikhashana. Izithombe ezincane zidwetshwa ngodwa njengoba usuka phansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulondolozayo\"\u003EOkulondolozayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngakunye kuba ukulanda. Akukho okubhalwa emuva kuma-PDF akho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukhethayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUyathola\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukuwo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(igama).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto, izinhlanganisela, amarethi, izikali zamashidi nawo wonke amakwe, ahlobene nePDF ngayinye ngokuqukethwe kwayo. Akukho amakhasi e-PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(igama).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmashidi amane wokusebenza: Isilinganiso (namafomula aphilayo), Ngeshidi, Amakwe, Izikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(igama).csv\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsilinganiso njengamanani avamile, umugqa ngamunye wento nengxenye ngayinye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(igama le-PDF) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi ye-PDF ngayinye evuliwe enamakwe, nokubalwa kwayo kudwetshwe ezikhashini zayo nencwadi yencazelo. Ifayela elilodwa nge-PDF ngayinye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgama litholakala ku-PDF yokuqala oyivule kulokubala. Akukho bhokisi lokuqamba kabusha okwamanje: qamba kabusha ifayela elilandiwe uma ufuna elinye igama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EThumela isilinganiso nePDF emakwe\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EAmakholomu okuthumela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-okulandelwa-khona\"\u003ELapho okulandelwa khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsiphequluli sakho silondoloza ukulanda kuleyo ndawo esilondoloza kuyo konke ukulanda, ngokuvamile kufolda ye-Downloads. Thola kuma-\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eisiphathi-mafayela sakho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E. Uma isiphequluli sakho sisetelwe ukubuza ukuthi ifayela ngalinye lilondolozwe kuphi, siyabuza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E nama-PDF amaningi amakwe ilanda amafayela amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa. I-Chrome ne-Edge zingabuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi sivunyelwe yini ukulanda amafayela amaningi. Khetha Vumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Safari ilondoloza ku-Downloads ngaphandle uma ushintshe indawo yokulanda ku-Izilungiselelo ze-Safari, ngaphansi kwe-Okujwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kungani-iphrojekthi-nama-pdf-kuhlukene\"\u003EKungani iphrojekthi nama-PDF kuhlukene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E liqukatha ukubalwa kwakho kuphela. Lithola ama-PDF alo futhi ngokuqukethwe kwawo (isigxivizo sawo ngamunye), ngakho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqamba kabusha noma ukuhambisa i-PDF akukhathalekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PDF eshintshiwe noma elondolozwe kabusha yinye uhlelo ibalwa njengefayela elihlukile, noma ngabe linegama elifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakwe ku-PDF ezingavulwanga aqhubeka ebalwa ezinhlanganisweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ELondoloza bese uvula kabusha ukubala amanani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwayo\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-PDF akho nokubalwa kwakho akusoze kushiye ikhompyutha yakho, ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo. Ukuxhumana kubaluleka kuphela ekulayisheni i-TakeoffCraft ngokwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze usebenze ngaphandle kokuxhumana, londoloza uhlelo kuqala, uma usuxhunyiwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yohlelo phezulu. Inkinobho iyabala, &quot;Iyalondoloza 12 kwangu-40&quot;, ngesikhathi isonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza i-TakeoffCraft kugcina uhlelo, lesi siqondiso, isifundi se-PDF, umbhali we-PDF osetshenziswa ngu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E nesisebenzi se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E esisesiphequluluni sakho, cishe ngo-6 MB. Uma kuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, konke kuyasebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi: ukuvula ama-PDF, ukukala, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E kanye no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho ithi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukalondolozwa kulesi siphequluli. Yikhethe ukuze ulondoloze.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyalondoloza (n) kwangu-(m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyalondoloza manje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlondoloziwe. Yikhethe ukuze wenze \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the offline copy\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECould not save\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanye amafayela awalandwanga. Hlola ukuxhumana kwakho bese uyikhetha futhi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline not available\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELo window wesiphequluli awukwazi ukugcina ikhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi (amawindow angasese namanye amakhompyutha alawulwayo ayivimbela).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwengeziwe, kuhlanganise nokuthi ikhophi elondoliziwe ihlala isikhathi esingakanani kwisiphequluli ngasinye: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwusaxhunyiwe. Uma ibha yohlelo ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, konke kuyasebenza. Uma kungabonisi, izingxenye ze-TakeoffCraft ezingakalayishwa kuleli thebhu (umbhali we-PDF we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E, isisebenzi se-auto count) azikwazi ukulayisha manje, futhi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E imisa ngo-&quot;Akukwazanga ukubhala i-PDF emakwe&quot;. Ukubala kwakho kuphephile noma kunjalo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E akudingi kuxhumana. Ungaphindi uvule kabusha ithebhu kuze usuxhunyiwe futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsuxhunyiwe. Ngaphambi kokuvakasha esizeni noma ukundiza, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E beseulinda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izipredishithi\"\u003EIzipredishithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-XLSX ligcina namafomula aphilayo, ngakho uhlelo lwezipredishithi lubala kabusha isilinganiso lapho livula ifayela, futhi lilungisa uma ushintsha izinga noma ukulahleka lapho. Incwadi ihlolwe ku-LibreOffice Calc, eyabala futhi yaphinda yabala onke amasamba ngesenti elifanayo. Ayikaze ivulwe ku-Excel okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-CSV linamanani avamile nebhayithi yomakhi (byte order mark), ngakho izinhlelo zezipredishithi zifunda izinhlamvu ezifana no-m² ngendlela efanele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"idesktop-nelifu\"\u003EIdesktop nelifu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKusukela ku-0.5, uhlelo lwedesktop yi-CadCraft Studio: i-TakeoffCraft namanye ama-app ayisikhombisa ku-install eyodwa. Akukho i-installer ehlukile ye-TakeoffCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza kwelifu akutholakali okwamanje. Gcina amafayela wakho \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ndawonye nama-PDF omsebenzi, futhi wenze ikhophi yawo njengefayela lanoma yiluphi olunye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho aya khona\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuvulayo Ifayela Indlela Amanothi PDF (.pdf) Open plans, Ctrl+O, noma uyidonse ekhasini Eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Ikhasi ngalinye liba yishidi. Iphrojekthi yokubala amanani (.takeoff.json) Open takeoff, noma uyidonse ekhasini Izinto zakho, izikali namakwe. Ungayidonsa kanye nama-PDF ayo. Amanye amafayela adonselwe ekhasini ayadlulwa, futhi ibha yesimo iwabiza ngamagama. Ama-PDF avikelwe ngephasiwedi awavuleki: \"(igama) livikelwe ngephasiwedi. Vula ikhophi engavikelwe.\" I-PDF efanayo kabili ivulwa kanye: \"(igama) livulekile vele.\" I-TakeoffCraft iwazi amafayela ngokuqukethwe kwawo, hhayi ngamagama awo. Ama-PDF askeniwe avulwa futhi ahlolwe njengawanoma yiziphi ezinye; i-TakeoffCraft ayidingi umbhalo ongaphakathi kwe-PDF. Amasethi amakhulu amapulani: yonke i-PDF ifundwa iphelele lapho ivulwa (ukuze kuthathwe isigxivizo sayo), ngakho ifayela elikhulu kakhulu lithatha isikhashana. Izithombe ezincane zidwetshwa ngodwa njengoba usuka phansi. Okulondolozayo Ukulondoloza ngakunye kuba ukulanda. Akukho okubhalwa emuva kuma-PDF akho. Okukhethayo Uyathola Okukuwo Save takeoff (igama).takeoff.json Izinto, izinhlanganisela, amarethi, izikali zamashidi nawo wonke amakwe, ahlobene nePDF ngayinye ngokuqukethwe kwayo. Akukho amakhasi e-PDF. XLSX (igama).xlsx Amashidi amane wokusebenza: Isilinganiso (namafomula aphilayo), Ngeshidi, Amakwe, Izikali. CSV (igama).csv Isilinganiso njengamanani avamile, umugqa ngamunye wento nengxenye ngayinye. Marked PDF (igama le-PDF) (takeoff).pdf Ikhophi ye-PDF ngayinye evuliwe enamakwe, nokubalwa kwayo kudwetshwe ezikhashini zayo nencwadi yencazelo. Ifayela elilodwa nge-PDF ngayinye. Igama litholakala ku-PDF yokuqala oyivule kulokubala. Akukho bhokisi lokuqamba kabusha okwamanje: qamba kabusha ifayela elilandiwe uma ufuna elinye igama. Bona Thumela isilinganiso nePDF emakwe kanye Amakholomu okuthumela. Lapho okulandelwa khona Isiphequluli sakho silondoloza ukulanda kuleyo ndawo esilondoloza kuyo konke ukulanda, ngokuvamile kufolda ye-Downloads. Thola kuma-Finder / File Explorer / isiphathi-mafayela sakho. Uma isiphequluli sakho sisetelwe ukubuza ukuthi ifayela ngalinye lilondolozwe kuphi, siyabuza. Marked PDF nama-PDF amaningi amakwe ilanda amafayela amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa. I-Chrome ne-Edge zingabuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi sivunyelwe yini ukulanda amafayela amaningi. Khetha Vumela. I-Safari ilondoloza ku-Downloads ngaphandle uma ushintshe indawo yokulanda ku-Izilungiselelo ze-Safari, ngaphansi kwe-Okujwayelekile. Kungani iphrojekthi nama-PDF kuhlukene Ifayela le-.takeoff.json liqukatha ukubalwa kwakho kuphela. Lithola ama-PDF alo futhi ngokuqukethwe kwawo (isigxivizo sawo ngamunye), ngakho: Ukuqamba kabusha noma ukuhambisa i-PDF akukhathalekile. I-PDF eshintshiwe noma elondolozwe kabusha yinye uhlelo ibalwa njengefayela elihlukile, noma ngabe linegama elifanayo. Amakwe ku-PDF ezingavulwanga aqhubeka ebalwa ezinhlanganisweni. Bona Londoloza bese uvula kabusha ukubala amanani. Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo Ama-PDF akho nokubalwa kwakho akusoze kushiye ikhompyutha yakho, ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwayo. Ukuxhumana kubaluleka kuphela ekulayisheni i-TakeoffCraft ngokwayo. Ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kokuxhumana, londoloza uhlelo kuqala, uma usuxhunyiwe: Khetha Save for offline ebhareni yohlelo phezulu. Inkinobho iyabala, \"Iyalondoloza 12 kwangu-40\", ngesikhathi isonga. Linda Offline ready. Ukulondoloza i-TakeoffCraft kugcina uhlelo, lesi siqondiso, isifundi se-PDF, umbhali we-PDF osetshenziswa ngu-Marked PDF nesisebenzi se-Auto count esisesiphequluluni sakho, cishe ngo-6 MB. Uma kuthi Offline ready, konke kuyasebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi: ukuvula ama-PDF, ukukala, Auto count, Save takeoff, XLSX, CSV kanye no-Marked PDF. Inkinobho ithi Okusho Save for offline Akukalondolozwa kulesi siphequluli. Yikhethe ukuze ulondoloze. Iyalondoloza (n) kwangu-(m) Iyalondoloza manje. Offline ready Ilondoloziwe. Yikhethe ukuze wenze Save again (get the newest version) noma Remove the offline copy. Could not save Amanye amafayela awalandwanga. Hlola ukuxhumana kwakho bese uyikhetha futhi. Offline not available Lo window wesiphequluli awukwazi ukugcina ikhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi (amawindow angasese namanye amakhompyutha alawulwayo ayivimbela). Okwengeziwe, kuhlanganise nokuthi ikhophi elondoliziwe ihlala isikhathi esingakanani kwisiphequluli ngasinye: Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Awusaxhunyiwe. Uma ibha yohlelo ibonisa Offline ready, konke kuyasebenza. Uma kungabonisi, izingxenye ze-TakeoffCraft ezingakalayishwa kuleli thebhu (umbhali we-PDF we-Marked PDF, isisebenzi se-auto count) azikwazi ukulayisha manje, futhi i-Marked PDF imisa ngo-\"Akukwazanga ukubhala i-PDF emakwe\". Ukubala kwakho kuphephile noma kunjalo: Save takeoff, XLSX no-CSV akudingi kuxhumana. Ungaphindi uvule kabusha ithebhu kuze usuxhunyiwe futhi. Usuxhunyiwe. Ngaphambi kokuvakasha esizeni noma ukundiza, khetha Save for offline beseulinda Offline ready. Izipredishithi Ifayela le-XLSX ligcina namafomula aphilayo, ngakho uhlelo lwezipredishithi lubala kabusha isilinganiso lapho livula ifayela, futhi lilungisa uma ushintsha izinga noma ukulahleka lapho. Incwadi ihlolwe ku-LibreOffice Calc, eyabala futhi yaphinda yabala onke amasamba ngesenti elifanayo. Ayikaze ivulwe ku-Excel okwamanje. Ifayela le-CSV linamanani avamile nebhayithi yomakhi (byte order mark), ngakho izinhlelo zezipredishithi zifunda izinhlamvu ezifana no-m² ngendlela efanele. Idesktop nelifu Kusukela ku-0.5, uhlelo lwedesktop yi-CadCraft Studio: i-TakeoffCraft namanye ama-app ayisikhombisa ku-install eyodwa. Akukho i-installer ehlukile ye-TakeoffCraft. Ukulondoloza kwelifu akutholakali okwamanje. Gcina amafayela wakho .takeoff.json ndawonye nama-PDF omsebenzi, futhi wenze ikhophi yawo njengefayela lanoma yiluphi olunye. Bona Lapho amafayela akho aya khona.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-plan-set","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qala ukubala futhi vula isethi yamapulani","summary":"Vula i-PDF eyodwa noma eziningi njengesethi yamapulani, uthole indlela ezungeze amashidi, uhambe phakathi kwawo.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["vula","isethi yamapulani","ama-pdf amaningi","amafayela amaningi","amashidi","imidwebo","amalebula amakhasi","uhlu lwamashidi","zula","wisa","ukudluliswa","vula kolunye uhlelo","amamaki"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-ama-pdf","text":"Vula ama-PDF","level":2},{"id":"imidwebo-ecaleni-kwama-pdf","text":"Imidwebo ecaleni kwama-PDF","level":2},{"id":"i-pdf-edluliselwe-kolunye-uhlelo","text":"I-PDF edluliselwe kolunye uhlelo","level":2},{"id":"thola-ishidi","text":"Thola ishidi","level":2},{"id":"ukuqanjwa-kwamashidi","text":"Ukuqanjwa kwamashidi","level":2},{"id":"hamba-ezungeze-ishidi","text":"Hamba ezungeze ishidi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsethi yamapulani ivame ukuba yi-PDF eziningi: ezakhiwo, ezesakhiwo, ezomshini. I-TakeoffCraft izivula ndawonye njengohlu olulodwa lwamashidi, futhi ukubala okulodwa kungafaka zonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ama-pdf\"\u003EVula ama-PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amapulani\u003C/span\u003E kweqembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. (Ezinye izitayela zemenyu zibiza ngokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ama-PDF…\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-dayalogi yefayela, khetha yonke i-PDF yesethi. Bamba \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003ECommand\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ukhethe eziningi, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ukhethe uhla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha Vula. Umlayezo othi &quot;Ivula (igama)…&quot; ubonakala lapho ifayela ngalinye lifundwa. Bese wonke amakhasi avela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E, nekhasi lokuqala le-PDF entsha yokuqala livulwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngawuhudula ufake ama-PDF esuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eyour file manager\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E bese uwawisa noma kuphi kwi-TakeoffCraft. Uhlaka oluthi &quot;Drop PDFs, DWG or DXF drawings, or a .takeoff.json&quot; luvela ngenkathi uhudula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wengeze ama-PDF amanye kamuva, yenza okufanayo futhi. Ama-PDF asevele evulekile ayadlulwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikrini sokuqala siphinde sibonise ama-PDF nokubala okuvulwe kamuva, kumabhrawuza avumela ikhasi ukuvula ifayela futhi (i-Chrome ne-Edge). Chofoza eyodwa ukuyivula; ibhrawuza lingacela imvume kuqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EAmafayela akho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkulayishwa lutho. Ibhrawuza lifunda ama-PDF kukhompyutha yakho, futhi ayanyamalala ku-TakeoffCraft uma uvala ithebhu noma ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntsha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imidwebo-ecaleni-kwama-pdf\"\u003EImidwebo ecaleni kwama-PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amapulani\u003C/span\u003E ithatha futhi imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, yodwa noma nama-PDF: isikhala semodeli nezakhiwo zomdwebo ngamunye ziba ngamashidi ohlwini olulodwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EVula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF\u003C/a\u003E, bese \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBala kumdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-pdf-edluliselwe-kolunye-uhlelo\"\u003EI-PDF edluliselwe kolunye uhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEnye i-app yalolu hlelo ingakunikeza i-PDF eyayivulwe kuyo: ivula i-TakeoffCraft kuthebhu elisha futhi i-PDF ivula khona njengoba uyiwisile. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Ivuliwe (igama), idluliselwe kusuka ku-(app). Ifayela lokuqala alishintshiwe.&quot; Akulayishwa lutho; ifayela lidlula kusitoreji sale bhrawuza futhi liyanyamalala kuso lapho livuleka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ibha yesimo ithi i-PDF &quot;ayifikanga&quot;, ithebhu ilinde isikhathi eside, noma i-PDF isivele ivuliwe kwenye ithebhu: yivule nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amapulani\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuphambene: uma i-MarkupCraft isebenza lapho ukhona futhi ingathatha ifayela, ibha yeshidi ngaphansi komdwebo inenkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E: ivula i-PDF yeshidi elikuskrini ku-MarkupCraft, kuthebhu elisha, ukuze uyibuyekeze futhi uyimake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-ishidi\"\u003EThola ishidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrola uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele bese uchofoza ishidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESesha amashidi\u003C/strong\u003E phezulu kohlu ukuze uhlunge ngenombolo yeshidi, igama lefayela noma ilebula yekhasi. Inani eliseduze ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E likhombisa &quot;3 kwangu-40&quot; uma isihlungi sivuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ishidi elilandelayo kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E elidlule. Zilandela uhlu njengoba luhlungiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-khibhodi ye-Mac engenazo izinkinobho ze-Page Up ne-Page Down, cindezela fn nomcibisholo ophezulu noma ophansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuqanjwa-kwamashidi\"\u003EUkuqanjwa kwamashidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhasi le-PDF elinelebula, njengo \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E, liqanjwa ngalelo lebula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhasi elingenalebula (noma ilebula okuyinombolo yekhasi kuphela) liqanjwa &quot;(igama lefayela), ikhasi (n)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kuvulwe ama-PDF amaningi, amashidi anamalebula aphinde athwale igama lefayela: &quot;A-101 — Architectural&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmagama amashidi awakwazi ukubhalwa ngesandla okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamba-ezungeze-ishidi\"\u003EHamba ezungeze ishidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhendula ivili le-mouse ukuze usondeze ngasendaweni yesikhombi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa ngebhathi lesobunxele noma eliphakathi ukuze ushelelise. Nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E, noma uma uqala ekhoneni lephoyinti lamamaki, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E udonse, noma donsa ngebhathi eliphakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana nekhasi\u003C/span\u003E ukubona lonke ishidi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELingana nobubanzi\u003C/span\u003E ilingana nobubanzi balo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usondeze, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze wehlise isondezo, maphakathi nombono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshidi ngalinye likhumbula isondezo nendawo yalo ngenkathi livulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphambi kokulinganisa ishidi, kudingeka libe nesikali: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isethi yamapulani ivame ukuba yi-PDF eziningi: ezakhiwo, ezesakhiwo, ezomshini. I-TakeoffCraft izivula ndawonye njengohlu olulodwa lwamashidi, futhi ukubala okulodwa kungafaka zonke. Vula ama-PDF Khetha Vula amapulani kweqembu Ifayela, noma cindezela Ctrl+O. (Ezinye izitayela zemenyu zibiza ngokuthi Vula ama-PDF….) Ku-dayalogi yefayela, khetha yonke i-PDF yesethi. Bamba Command / Ctrl / Ctrl ukuze ukhethe eziningi, noma Shift ukuze ukhethe uhla. Khetha Vula. Umlayezo othi \"Ivula (igama)…\" ubonakala lapho ifayela ngalinye lifundwa. Bese wonke amakhasi avela ngaphansi kwe-Amashidi, nekhasi lokuqala le-PDF entsha yokuqala livulwe. Ungawuhudula ufake ama-PDF esuka ku-Finder / File Explorer / your file manager bese uwawisa noma kuphi kwi-TakeoffCraft. Uhlaka oluthi \"Drop PDFs, DWG or DXF drawings, or a .takeoff.json\" luvela ngenkathi uhudula. Ukuze wengeze ama-PDF amanye kamuva, yenza okufanayo futhi. Ama-PDF asevele evulekile ayadlulwa. Isikrini sokuqala siphinde sibonise ama-PDF nokubala okuvulwe kamuva, kumabhrawuza avumela ikhasi ukuvula ifayela futhi (i-Chrome ne-Edge). Chofoza eyodwa ukuyivula; ibhrawuza lingacela imvume kuqala. Bona Amafayela akho. Akulayishwa lutho. Ibhrawuza lifunda ama-PDF kukhompyutha yakho, futhi ayanyamalala ku-TakeoffCraft uma uvala ithebhu noma ukhetha Entsha. Imidwebo ecaleni kwama-PDF Vula amapulani ithatha futhi imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, yodwa noma nama-PDF: isikhala semodeli nezakhiwo zomdwebo ngamunye ziba ngamashidi ohlwini olulodwa. Bona Vula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF, bese Bala kumdwebo. I-PDF edluliselwe kolunye uhlelo Enye i-app yalolu hlelo ingakunikeza i-PDF eyayivulwe kuyo: ivula i-TakeoffCraft kuthebhu elisha futhi i-PDF ivula khona njengoba uyiwisile. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Ivuliwe (igama), idluliselwe kusuka ku-(app). Ifayela lokuqala alishintshiwe.\" Akulayishwa lutho; ifayela lidlula kusitoreji sale bhrawuza futhi liyanyamalala kuso lapho livuleka. Uma ibha yesimo ithi i-PDF \"ayifikanga\", ithebhu ilinde isikhathi eside, noma i-PDF isivele ivuliwe kwenye ithebhu: yivule nge-Vula amapulani. Okuphambene: uma i-MarkupCraft isebenza lapho ukhona futhi ingathatha ifayela, ibha yeshidi ngaphansi komdwebo inenkinobho ye-MarkupCraft: ivula i-PDF yeshidi elikuskrini ku-MarkupCraft, kuthebhu elisha, ukuze uyibuyekeze futhi uyimake. Thola ishidi Skrola uhlu lwe-Amashidi ngakwesobunxele bese uchofoza ishidi. Bhala ku-Sesha amashidi phezulu kohlu ukuze uhlunge ngenombolo yeshidi, igama lefayela noma ilebula yekhasi. Inani eliseduze ne-Amashidi likhombisa \"3 kwangu-40\" uma isihlungi sivuliwe. Cindezela Page Down ishidi elilandelayo kanye Page Up elidlule. Zilandela uhlu njengoba luhlungiwe. Ku-khibhodi ye-Mac engenazo izinkinobho ze-Page Up ne-Page Down, cindezela fn nomcibisholo ophezulu noma ophansi. Ukuqanjwa kwamashidi Ikhasi le-PDF elinelebula, njengo A-101, liqanjwa ngalelo lebula. Ikhasi elingenalebula (noma ilebula okuyinombolo yekhasi kuphela) liqanjwa \"(igama lefayela), ikhasi (n)\". Uma kuvulwe ama-PDF amaningi, amashidi anamalebula aphinde athwale igama lefayela: \"A-101 — Architectural\". Amagama amashidi awakwazi ukubhalwa ngesandla okwamanje. Hamba ezungeze ishidi Phendula ivili le-mouse ukuze usondeze ngasendaweni yesikhombi. Donsa ngebhathi lesobunxele noma eliphakathi ukuze ushelelise. Nge-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo, noma uma uqala ekhoneni lephoyinti lamamaki, bamba Space udonse, noma donsa ngebhathi eliphakathi. Cindezela F noma khetha Lingana nekhasi ukubona lonke ishidi; W noma Lingana nobubanzi ilingana nobubanzi balo. Cindezela + noma = ukuze usondeze, − ukuze wehlise isondezo, maphakathi nombono. Ishidi ngalinye likhumbula isondezo nendawo yalo ngenkathi livulekile. Okulandelayo Ngaphambi kokulinganisa ishidi, kudingeka libe nesikali: Setha isikali.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Vula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF","summary":"Vula ifayela lomdwebo njengamashidi (imodeli nazo zonke izakhiwo), qala ngesikali umdwebo owunikezayo, bonisa noma ufihle izingqimba zawo, futhi uletha imidwebo exhunyiwe.","section":"tasks","order":12,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","cad","umdwebo","vula umdwebo","izakhiwo","isikhala semodeli","isikhala sephepha","amashidi","amayunithi","insunits","isikali sefasitele lokubuka","xref","umdwebo oxhunyiwe","izingqimba","okuqandisiwe","akukho-pdf","ukuprinta","ngaphandle kokuprinta"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-umdwebo","text":"Vula umdwebo","level":2},{"id":"amashidi","text":"Amashidi","level":2},{"id":"isikali","text":"Isikali","level":2},{"id":"ongqimba","text":"Ongqimba","level":2},{"id":"izixhumanisi-zemidwebo-xrefs","text":"Izixhumanisi zemidwebo (xrefs)","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft ivula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF njengoba ivula i-PDF: akudingeki uwuprinte ku-PDF kuqala. Ukubala ngqo kumdwebo kuyanemba, ngoba umdwebo wazi ukuthi yini ngayinye yento. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBala kumdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-umdwebo\"\u003EVula umdwebo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amapulani\u003C/span\u003E kweqembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela le-DWG noma le-DXF. Ungakhetha eziningi, nama-PDF nawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha Vula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngawuhudula ufake imidwebo ku-TakeoffCraft, njenge-PDF. Akulayishwa lutho: ibhrawuza lifunda ifayela kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft ifunda i-DWG kusukela ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018 ne-DXF ye-ASCII kusukela ku-R12 kuya ku-2018. Yenqaba i-DXF yebinary (yigcine njenge-ASCII, noma njenge-DWG) nofayela olungelona nalolunye, futhi isho ngenxa. Ifayela elonakele livuleka ngalokho okwakwazeka ukufundwa, kuvele umlayezo osho lokho; amanani alo angase angaphelele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amashidi\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli\u003C/strong\u003E yisikhala semodeli somdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo ngasinye\u003C/strong\u003E (ithebhu yesikhala sephepha) liyishidi, eliqanjwe ngethebhu yalo, ngokulandelana kwamathebhu. Isakhiwo sibonisa imodeli ngamafasitele ayo, njengoba iprintwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESondeza, shelelisa, ukubambelela emigqeni yomdwebo, amamaki, amanothi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E nokunye kusebenza njengakuPDF. Amashidi omdwebo agcinwa kokubalwa ngegama lefayela nomkhondo wokuqukethwe kwawo, njenge-PDF: vula ifayela futhi ngokuphindiwe, amamaki asemashidini awo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikali\"\u003EIsikali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshidi liqala ngesikali somdwebo owunikezayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E sithatha isikali sefasitele layo elikhulu kunawo wonke. Isikali njengo-1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; sibizwa ngesethi yaso; noma yisiphi esinye sibonakala njengo-&quot;Kusuka kufasitele lomdwebo: 1&quot; = 2.5&#039;&quot;. Uma isakhiwo sinamafasitele ezikali ezihlukile, elikhulu kunawo lisetha isikali seshidi: hlola ezinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha amayunithi omdwebo (amayintshi, amamilimitha, amayizinyawo…) njengesikali, njengo-&quot;Amayunithi omdwebo (amayintshi)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmdwebo ongenamayunithi\u003C/strong\u003E (umdwebo ongakasho ukuthi iyunithi iyinch noma imilimitha) awunasikali: ishidi lithi &quot;Akukho sikali&quot;, futhi ukulinganisa kulo kuyanqatshwa, njengakuPDF ongenasikali. Ukubala akudingi sikali. Nika esinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E nohlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/span\u003E lishintsha isikali noma nini futhi liphumelele kokomdwebo. Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/span\u003E luvaliwe ku-Imodeli, ngoba lungenaso usayizi wephepha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ongqimba\"\u003EOngqimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngqimba\u003C/span\u003E kubha yeshidi ilanda ongqimba bomdwebo nenani lezinto ezikulelo shidi. Ongqimba abavalwe noma abaqandisiwe ifayela bayaqala befihliwe. Khipha itiki kungqimba ukuze uyifihle, noma thikha ongqimba ofihliwe ukuze uyibonise: ishidi liyadwetshwa futhi, okufihliwe kukhishwa ekubaleni nasezintweni ezinikezwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa umdwebo\u003C/span\u003E, ngaphandle uma ucela ukubala nongqimba ofihliwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa bonke ongqimba; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela kongqimba befayela\u003C/span\u003E ihlehlisa izinguquko zakho. Izinketho zongqimba zingezalo iseshini, hhayi zefayela lokubala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izixhumanisi-zemidwebo-xrefs\"\u003EIzixhumanisi zemidwebo (xrefs)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmdwebo oxhumanisa iminye imidwebo uyibonisa lapho ifakwe khona. I-TakeoffCraft ithola umdwebo oxhunyiwe phakathi kwamafayela \u003Cstrong\u003Eavulekile\u003C/strong\u003E, ngegama lefayela lawo: vula umdwebo owubambe nomdwebo oxhunyiwe ndawonye (noma ngokulandelana). Kuze kube yilapho, ibha yesimo ithi imidwebo exhunyiwe emingaki engatholakali, okudwetshwa kuwo kushoda, nokubala kukusho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto i-TakeoffCraft engazifundi noma engazibeki (izinto ze-proxy, izigaba ezingaziwa) zidwetshwa kuwindi lokubala ngohlobo; azikaze zilahlwe ngaphandle kokukhuluma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImidwebo emikhulu kakhulu idwetshwa ngengxenye, nokubala kumisa ekhawulweni, kusho lokho. Esikhundleni salokho vula i-PDF yokuprinta yalowo mdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmdwebo udwetshwa mnyama nangemibala yawo, ufiphale ephepheni elimhlophe. Amatafula wesitayela sokuprinta nezabelo zepeni akusetshenziswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft ivula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF njengoba ivula i-PDF: akudingeki uwuprinte ku-PDF kuqala. Ukubala ngqo kumdwebo kuyanemba, ngoba umdwebo wazi ukuthi yini ngayinye yento. Bona Bala kumdwebo. Vula umdwebo Khetha Vula amapulani kweqembu Ifayela, noma cindezela Ctrl+O. Khetha ifayela le-DWG noma le-DXF. Ungakhetha eziningi, nama-PDF nawo. Khetha Vula. Ungawuhudula ufake imidwebo ku-TakeoffCraft, njenge-PDF. Akulayishwa lutho: ibhrawuza lifunda ifayela kukhompyutha yakho. TakeoffCraft ifunda i-DWG kusukela ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018 ne-DXF ye-ASCII kusukela ku-R12 kuya ku-2018. Yenqaba i-DXF yebinary (yigcine njenge-ASCII, noma njenge-DWG) nofayela olungelona nalolunye, futhi isho ngenxa. Ifayela elonakele livuleka ngalokho okwakwazeka ukufundwa, kuvele umlayezo osho lokho; amanani alo angase angaphelele. Amashidi Imodeli yisikhala semodeli somdwebo. Isakhiwo ngasinye (ithebhu yesikhala sephepha) liyishidi, eliqanjwe ngethebhu yalo, ngokulandelana kwamathebhu. Isakhiwo sibonisa imodeli ngamafasitele ayo, njengoba iprintwa. Sondeza, shelelisa, ukubambelela emigqeni yomdwebo, amamaki, amanothi, Linganisa nokunye kusebenza njengakuPDF. Amashidi omdwebo agcinwa kokubalwa ngegama lefayela nomkhondo wokuqukethwe kwawo, njenge-PDF: vula ifayela futhi ngokuphindiwe, amamaki asemashidini awo. Isikali Ishidi liqala ngesikali somdwebo owunikezayo: Isakhiwo sithatha isikali sefasitele layo elikhulu kunawo wonke. Isikali njengo-1/2\" = 1'-0\" sibizwa ngesethi yaso; noma yisiphi esinye sibonakala njengo-\"Kusuka kufasitele lomdwebo: 1\" = 2.5'\". Uma isakhiwo sinamafasitele ezikali ezihlukile, elikhulu kunawo lisetha isikali seshidi: hlola ezinye nge-Hlola. Imodeli ithatha amayunithi omdwebo (amayintshi, amamilimitha, amayizinyawo…) njengesikali, njengo-\"Amayunithi omdwebo (amayintshi)\". Umdwebo ongenamayunithi (umdwebo ongakasho ukuthi iyunithi iyinch noma imilimitha) awunasikali: ishidi lithi \"Akukho sikali\", futhi ukulinganisa kulo kuyanqatshwa, njengakuPDF ongenasikali. Ukubala akudingi sikali. Nika esinye nge-Linganisa. Linganisa, Hlola nohlu lwe-Okusethiwe ngaphambili lishintsha isikali noma nini futhi liphumelele kokomdwebo. Uhlu lwe-Okusethiwe ngaphambili luvaliwe ku-Imodeli, ngoba lungenaso usayizi wephepha. Ongqimba Ongqimba kubha yeshidi ilanda ongqimba bomdwebo nenani lezinto ezikulelo shidi. Ongqimba abavalwe noma abaqandisiwe ifayela bayaqala befihliwe. Khipha itiki kungqimba ukuze uyifihle, noma thikha ongqimba ofihliwe ukuze uyibonise: ishidi liyadwetshwa futhi, okufihliwe kukhishwa ekubaleni nasezintweni ezinikezwa ku-Linganisa umdwebo, ngaphandle uma ucela ukubala nongqimba ofihliwe. Bonisa konke ibonisa bonke ongqimba; Buyela kongqimba befayela ihlehlisa izinguquko zakho. Izinketho zongqimba zingezalo iseshini, hhayi zefayela lokubala. Izixhumanisi zemidwebo (xrefs) Umdwebo oxhumanisa iminye imidwebo uyibonisa lapho ifakwe khona. I-TakeoffCraft ithola umdwebo oxhunyiwe phakathi kwamafayela avulekile, ngegama lefayela lawo: vula umdwebo owubambe nomdwebo oxhunyiwe ndawonye (noma ngokulandelana). Kuze kube yilapho, ibha yesimo ithi imidwebo exhunyiwe emingaki engatholakali, okudwetshwa kuwo kushoda, nokubala kukusho lokho. Imikhawulo Izinto i-TakeoffCraft engazifundi noma engazibeki (izinto ze-proxy, izigaba ezingaziwa) zidwetshwa kuwindi lokubala ngohlobo; azikaze zilahlwe ngaphandle kokukhuluma. Imidwebo emikhulu kakhulu idwetshwa ngengxenye, nokubala kumisa ekhawulweni, kusho lokho. Esikhundleni salokho vula i-PDF yokuprinta yalowo mdwebo. Umdwebo udwetshwa mnyama nangemibala yawo, ufiphale ephepheni elimhlophe. Amatafula wesitayela sokuprinta nezabelo zepeni akusetshenziswa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-an-ifc-file","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Thatha amanani kwifayela le-IFC 4.3","summary":"Vula ifayela le-IFC 4.3 lomgwaqo, lomgwaqo wesitimela, lebhuloho noma lomsebenzi womhlaba bese uthola inani ngohlobo ngalinye, namabanga, izindawo nevolumu ifayela elizichazayo, njengamanani ahlukile ngohlobo.","section":"tasks","order":13,"keywords":["ifc","ifc4x3","ifc 4.3","umgwaqo","umgwaqo wesitimela","ibhuloho","ipavimenti","ikherbhi","ungqimba","ibheringi","imisebenzi yomhlaba","izinkomba","ubunjiniyela","amanani ahlukile ngohlobo"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-ifayela","text":"Vula ifayela","level":2},{"id":"akwenzi","text":"Akwenzi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-IFC 4.3 lingabamba imigwaqo, imigwaqo yezitimela, amabhuloho, imisebenzi yasolwandle nezingxenye ezakhiwe kuzo: ama-pavement, izingqimba, amakherbhi, imitimbo yezitimela, imisebenzi yomhlaba, amabheringi, amapayili nokunye. I-TakeoffCraft iyazifunda lezo iziguqule zibe amanani ahlukile ngohlobo onganikezwa intengo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ifayela\"\u003EVula ifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amapulani\u003C/span\u003E kweqembu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela le-IFC (ungalikhetha nama-PDF), noma liwuhudulele ku-TakeoffCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKudalwa uhlobo olulodwa olungahlukile ngalunye kanye nohlobo olucacisiwe ngaphambili, isibonelo &quot;Pavement (flexible): count&quot;, futhi, uma ifayela lizichaza, &quot;length&quot; ku-m, &quot;area&quot; ku-m² kanye &quot;volume&quot; ku-m³. Inothi ngayinye lisho ukuthi izinto zingaki ezibaliwe nezingaki ezingazichazanga inani. Ukuvula ifayela elisha ngegama elifanayo kubuyekeza lawo manani kunokungeza amanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akwenzi\"\u003EAkwenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfunda amasethi wamanani (IfcElementQuantity) afayela linawo. Ayilinganisi izimo ze-3D, ngakho into engenaso isethi yamanani ibalwa kodwa ayengezi bude, indawo noma ivolumu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufundwa kuphela izigaba zezingqalasizinda ze-IFC 4.3. Ifayela lesakhiwo (izindonga, izimnyango, amasilabhu) alishintshwa libe amanani lapha; ifayela elingeyona i-IFC 4.3 lithi lokho futhi alilethi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmayunithi ayawefayela wawo, aguqulwe abe ngamamitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ifayela le-IFC 4.3 lingabamba imigwaqo, imigwaqo yezitimela, amabhuloho, imisebenzi yasolwandle nezingxenye ezakhiwe kuzo: ama-pavement, izingqimba, amakherbhi, imitimbo yezitimela, imisebenzi yomhlaba, amabheringi, amapayili nokunye. I-TakeoffCraft iyazifunda lezo iziguqule zibe amanani ahlukile ngohlobo onganikezwa intengo. Vula ifayela Khetha Vula amapulani kweqembu Ifayela, noma cindezela Ctrl+O. Khetha ifayela le-IFC (ungalikhetha nama-PDF), noma liwuhudulele ku-TakeoffCraft. Kudalwa uhlobo olulodwa olungahlukile ngalunye kanye nohlobo olucacisiwe ngaphambili, isibonelo \"Pavement (flexible): count\", futhi, uma ifayela lizichaza, \"length\" ku-m, \"area\" ku-m² kanye \"volume\" ku-m³. Inothi ngayinye lisho ukuthi izinto zingaki ezibaliwe nezingaki ezingazichazanga inani. Ukuvula ifayela elisha ngegama elifanayo kubuyekeza lawo manani kunokungeza amanye. Akwenzi Ifunda amasethi wamanani (IfcElementQuantity) afayela linawo. Ayilinganisi izimo ze-3D, ngakho into engenaso isethi yamanani ibalwa kodwa ayengezi bude, indawo noma ivolumu. Kufundwa kuphela izigaba zezingqalasizinda ze-IFC 4.3. Ifayela lesakhiwo (izindonga, izimnyango, amasilabhu) alishintshwa libe amanani lapha; ifayela elingeyona i-IFC 4.3 lithi lokho futhi alilethi lutho. Amayunithi ayawefayela wawo, aguqulwe abe ngamamitha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"set-the-scale","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Setha isikali","summary":"Nika ishidi ngalinye isikali ngokusethiwe ngaphambili noma ngokulinganisa ngobukhulu obaziwayo, shenxa, futhi uqonde ukuthi kungani amashidi angenasikali angafakiwe emasamanisweni.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["thola isikali","funda isikali","isikali emibhalweni","wonke amashidi","isikali","linganisa","okusethiwe ngaphambili","hlola isikali","qinisekisa","ubukhulu obaziwayo","akunasikali","akukho sikali","isilinganiso","setha isikali"],"headings":[{"id":"sebenzisa-okusethiwe-ngaphambili-uma-i-pdf-iphrintwe-ngobukhulu-obugcwele","text":"Sebenzisa okusethiwe ngaphambili (uma i-PDF iphrintwe ngobukhulu obugcwele)","level":2},{"id":"funda-izikali-emibhalweni-yamashidi","text":"Funda izikali emibhalweni yamashidi","level":2},{"id":"linganisa-ngobukhulu-obaziwayo","text":"Linganisa ngobukhulu obaziwayo","level":2},{"id":"hlola-isikali","text":"Hlola isikali","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-isikali","text":"Shintsha isikali","level":2},{"id":"ukungabalwa-njengo-zero-kwamashidi-angenasikali","text":"Ukungabalwa njengo-zero kwamashidi angenasikali","level":2},{"id":"amathiphu","text":"Amathiphu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIshidi ngalinye linesikali salo. Wena uyasisetha, noma uvumela i-TakeoffCraft ukuthiilifunde emibhalweni yamashidi (ngezansi), bese uhlola. Kuze kube yilapho ishidi linaso, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E zenqaba ukulinganisa kulo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E zisebenza ngaphandle kwesikali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lwamashidi lubonisa isikali ngasinye, noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENo scale\u003C/strong\u003E. Ibha ngaphansi kweshidi elivulekile ikhuluma okufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-okusethiwe-ngaphambili-uma-i-pdf-iphrintwe-ngobukhulu-obugcwele\"\u003ESebenzisa okusethiwe ngaphambili (uma i-PDF iphrintwe ngobukhulu obugcwele)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ishidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula uhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isikali esiphrintiwe kudrowing, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ngaphansi kwe-Architectural. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Isikali salo shidi: 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola (ngezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili kuthatha ukuthi i-PDF yisayizi yangempela yephepha edrowing yenziwelwe yona. Uma othile enze i-PDF nge-&quot;fit to page&quot;, noma kuyisethi esiyingxenye-yesibili, okusethiwe ngaphambili akulungile. Linganisa esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu olugcwele kukhona ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili kwesikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-izikali-emibhalweni-yamashidi\"\u003EFunda izikali emibhalweni yamashidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIdrowing eningi isho isikali sayo: \u003Ccode\u003ESCALE: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ebhokisini lesihloko, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E ngaphansi kwesibonakalo. I-TakeoffCraft ingakufunda futhi isethe wonke amashidi ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula uhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the sheets&#039; text…\u003C/span\u003E (phezulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lubonisa wonke amashidi: isikali sawo manje, nokutshiwo umbhalo wawo — \u003Cstrong\u003ESays 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENo scale in its text\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ESays not to scale\u003C/strong\u003E (NTS).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmashidi angenasikali okhombisa elinye athiswa. Thisa noma susa noma yiliphi, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet the ticked scales\u003C/span\u003E. Ukucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kukodwa kubuyisela konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola ukuhlukaniswa kunye ngalinye ishidini nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (ngezansi): okusethiwe ngaphambili kulungile kuphela uma i-PDF iphrintwe ngobukhulu obugcwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfunda izinhlobo zokubhala zokwakha (\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), zezinjiniyeli (\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) nezemethrikhi (\u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E) ezihambisana \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003Enokusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/a\u003E. Uma ishidi lisho izikali ezingaphezu kwelilodwa (ipulani enemininingwane emikhulu), ithatha leyo elisho kakhulu, futhi eyabhalwa ngemva kwegama elithi SCALE ibalwa kabili; ezinye ziboniswa ngombala obomvu ukuze uzihlole. Ishidi eliskenisiwe alinambhalo: lisethe ngesandla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa-ngobukhulu-obaziwayo\"\u003ELinganisa ngobukhulu obaziwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa lokhu uma ungakholwa isikali esiphrintiwe, uma isethi ishintshiwe usayizi, noma ishidi lithi &quot;not to scale&quot; kodwa linobukhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ishidi bese ukhulisa ibukhulu elide oludlule kahle, njengendawo yegridi noma ubukhulu bakhiwo bonke. Lilide, lilinganiseka kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukugcina kwesinye isiphetho sobukhulu. Khulisa kuso sonke isiphetho ukuze unembe; ungakhulisa nokuhambisa phakathi kokuchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza esinye isiphetho. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukugcina umugqa ku-0°, 45° noma 90°. Ingxoxo \u003Cstrong\u003ECalibrate this sheet\u003C/strong\u003E iyavula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ibanga langempela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EReal distance\u003C/strong\u003E, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E (amafiti ayizinhlamvu), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUkufakwa kobude, irethi nephesenti\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/span\u003E. Ibha yesimo ibonisa isikali njenge &quot;1&quot; = (n)&#039;&quot;, uma sisezinhlamvu ezingu-0.5% kokusethiwe ngaphambili ithi yiliphi, isibonelo &quot;elihambisana ne-1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; (khetha leso sethingo ukuze uthole isikali esinembile)&quot;. I-TakeoffCraft ibuyela kuthuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ukulinganisa kuhambisana nokusethiwe ngaphambili, ukukhetha lokho kunikeza isikali esinembile esikhundleni salokho okuncike kulapho ochofoze khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-isikali\"\u003EHlola isikali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola isikali esisha ngobukhulu besibili njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza zombili iziphetho zobukhulu obuphrintiwe kudrowing. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Check: 12&#039;-6&quot;&quot; ngobude obufanayo ngamafiti ayizinhlamvu nangamamitha, nomugqa wokuhlola uhlala ushiye ishidini ngobude bawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQhathanisa nobukhulu obuphrintiwe. Uma bungalingani, linganisa ngobukhulu obude kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usule umugqa wokuhlola.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-isikali\"\u003EShintsha isikali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha esinye isikali esisethiwe ngaphambili noma linganisa kabusha. Uma ishidi sele linokulinganiswa, i-TakeoffCraft ibuza \u003Cstrong\u003EChange this sheet&#039;s scale?\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ikhombise ukuthi malinganiswe kangaki kabusha. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChange the scale\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke imugqa nendawo eshidini kulinganiswa kabusha ngesikali esisha. Ungakuhlehlisa ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukungabalwa-njengo-zero-kwamashidi-angenasikali\"\u003EUkungabalwa njengo-zero kwamashidi angenasikali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsimaki eshidini elingenasikali alinabude noma indawo yangempela. I-TakeoffCraft ayisoze iyibale njenge-zero, okungenza isilinganiso sakho sibe sephansi ngokungaziwa. Esikhundleni salokho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eishiya lezo zimaki ngaphandle kwamasamanisa,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eibonisa &quot;+(n) unscaled&quot; eceleni kwento ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eibonisa &quot;Akuphelele: (n) izimaki emashidini angenasikali (azifakiwe emasamanisweni)&quot; ekhanda lethebula,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eibhala inani kwikholomu yamanothi kwisipredshithi esithunyelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kungenzeka uma uvula iprojekthi lapho izikali zayo zingazange zisethwe khona. Nika ishidi isikali bese izimaki zibalwa ngokushesha. Izimaki zokubala zihlala zibalwa; azidingi sikali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathiphu\"\u003EAmathiphu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha isikali kuwo wonke amashidi ozowalinganisa ngaphambi kokuqala. Skena uhlu lwamashidi ufuna \u003Cstrong\u003ENo scale\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uthole asele (ibhokisi losesho lubheka amagama amashidi, hhayi izikali).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImininingwane nama-pulani akhuliswe eshidini elifanayo ngokuvamile asebenzisa esinye isikali. I-TakeoffCraft inesikali esisodwa ngeshidi ngalinye; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdrowing yemethrikhi: khetha isikali semethrikhi njenge \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, noma linganisa ngebanga lemethrikhi njenge \u003Ccode\u003E6000 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ishidi ngalinye linesikali salo. Wena uyasisetha, noma uvumela i-TakeoffCraft ukuthiilifunde emibhalweni yamashidi (ngezansi), bese uhlola. Kuze kube yilapho ishidi linaso, Linear, Area, Circle no-Cut-out zenqaba ukulinganisa kulo. Count no-Auto count zisebenza ngaphandle kwesikali. Uhlu lwamashidi lubonisa isikali ngasinye, noma No scale. Ibha ngaphansi kweshidi elivulekile ikhuluma okufanayo. Sebenzisa okusethiwe ngaphambili (uma i-PDF iphrintwe ngobukhulu obugcwele) Vula ishidi. Vula uhlu Preset eqenjini le-Scale. Khetha isikali esiphrintiwe kudrowing, isibonelo 1/8\" = 1'-0\" ngaphansi kwe-Architectural. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Isikali salo shidi: 1/8\" = 1'-0\".\" Hlola (ngezansi). Okusethiwe ngaphambili kuthatha ukuthi i-PDF yisayizi yangempela yephepha edrowing yenziwelwe yona. Uma othile enze i-PDF nge-\"fit to page\", noma kuyisethi esiyingxenye-yesibili, okusethiwe ngaphambili akulungile. Linganisa esikhundleni salokho. Uhlu olugcwele kukhona ku-Okusethiwe ngaphambili kwesikali. Funda izikali emibhalweni yamashidi Idrowing eningi isho isikali sayo: SCALE: 1/4\" = 1'-0\" ebhokisini lesihloko, 1:100 ngaphansi kwesibonakalo. I-TakeoffCraft ingakufunda futhi isethe wonke amashidi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Vula uhlu Preset bese ukhetha From the sheets' text… (phezulu). Uhlu lubonisa wonke amashidi: isikali sawo manje, nokutshiwo umbhalo wawo — Says 1/4\" = 1'-0\", No scale in its text noma Says not to scale (NTS). Amashidi angenasikali okhombisa elinye athiswa. Thisa noma susa noma yiliphi, bese ukhetha Set the ticked scales. Ukucindezela Ctrl+Z kukodwa kubuyisela konke. Hlola ukuhlukaniswa kunye ngalinye ishidini nge-Check (ngezansi): okusethiwe ngaphambili kulungile kuphela uma i-PDF iphrintwe ngobukhulu obugcwele. Ifunda izinhlobo zokubhala zokwakha (3/16\" = 1'-0\", 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"), zezinjiniyeli (1\" = 20') nezemethrikhi (1:50) ezihambisana nokusethiwe ngaphambili. Uma ishidi lisho izikali ezingaphezu kwelilodwa (ipulani enemininingwane emikhulu), ithatha leyo elisho kakhulu, futhi eyabhalwa ngemva kwegama elithi SCALE ibalwa kabili; ezinye ziboniswa ngombala obomvu ukuze uzihlole. Ishidi eliskenisiwe alinambhalo: lisethe ngesandla. Linganisa ngobukhulu obaziwayo Sebenzisa lokhu uma ungakholwa isikali esiphrintiwe, uma isethi ishintshiwe usayizi, noma ishidi lithi \"not to scale\" kodwa linobukhulu. Vula ishidi bese ukhulisa ibukhulu elide oludlule kahle, njengendawo yegridi noma ubukhulu bakhiwo bonke. Lilide, lilinganiseka kakhulu. Khetha Calibrate eqenjini le-Scale, noma cindezela K. Chofoza ukugcina kwesinye isiphetho sobukhulu. Khulisa kuso sonke isiphetho ukuze unembe; ungakhulisa nokuhambisa phakathi kokuchofoza. Chofoza esinye isiphetho. Bamba Shift ukugcina umugqa ku-0°, 45° noma 90°. Ingxoxo Calibrate this sheet iyavula. Thayipha ibanga langempela ku-Real distance, isibonelo 24'-6 1/2\", 24.5 (amafiti ayizinhlamvu), 30\" noma 7.5 m. Bona Ukufakwa kobude, irethi nephesenti. Khetha Set the scale. Ibha yesimo ibonisa isikali njenge \"1\" = (n)'\", uma sisezinhlamvu ezingu-0.5% kokusethiwe ngaphambili ithi yiliphi, isibonelo \"elihambisana ne-1/4\" = 1'-0\" (khetha leso sethingo ukuze uthole isikali esinembile)\". I-TakeoffCraft ibuyela kuthuluzi le-Select. Uma ukulinganisa kuhambisana nokusethiwe ngaphambili, ukukhetha lokho kunikeza isikali esinembile esikhundleni salokho okuncike kulapho ochofoze khona. Hlola isikali Hlola isikali esisha ngobukhulu besibili njalo. Khetha Check eqenjini le-Scale, noma cindezela D. Chofoza zombili iziphetho zobukhulu obuphrintiwe kudrowing. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Check: 12'-6\"\" ngobude obufanayo ngamafiti ayizinhlamvu nangamamitha, nomugqa wokuhlola uhlala ushiye ishidini ngobude bawo. Qhathanisa nobukhulu obuphrintiwe. Uma bungalingani, linganisa ngobukhulu obude kakhulu. Cindezela Esc ukuze usule umugqa wokuhlola. Shintsha isikali Khetha esinye isikali esisethiwe ngaphambili noma linganisa kabusha. Uma ishidi sele linokulinganiswa, i-TakeoffCraft ibuza Change this sheet's scale? futhi ikhombise ukuthi malinganiswe kangaki kabusha. Khetha Change the scale. Yonke imugqa nendawo eshidini kulinganiswa kabusha ngesikali esisha. Ungakuhlehlisa ngo-Ctrl+Z. Ukungabalwa njengo-zero kwamashidi angenasikali Isimaki eshidini elingenasikali alinabude noma indawo yangempela. I-TakeoffCraft ayisoze iyibale njenge-zero, okungenza isilinganiso sakho sibe sephansi ngokungaziwa. Esikhundleni salokho: ishiya lezo zimaki ngaphandle kwamasamanisa, ibonisa \"+(n) unscaled\" eceleni kwento ku-Quantities, ibonisa \"Akuphelele: (n) izimaki emashidini angenasikali (azifakiwe emasamanisweni)\" ekhanda lethebula, ibhala inani kwikholomu yamanothi kwisipredshithi esithunyelwe. Lokhu kungenzeka uma uvula iprojekthi lapho izikali zayo zingazange zisethwe khona. Nika ishidi isikali bese izimaki zibalwa ngokushesha. Izimaki zokubala zihlala zibalwa; azidingi sikali. Amathiphu Setha isikali kuwo wonke amashidi ozowalinganisa ngaphambi kokuqala. Skena uhlu lwamashidi ufuna No scale ukuze uthole asele (ibhokisi losesho lubheka amagama amashidi, hhayi izikali). Imininingwane nama-pulani akhuliswe eshidini elifanayo ngokuvamile asebenzisa esinye isikali. I-TakeoffCraft inesikali esisodwa ngeshidi ngalinye; bona Okungakakhiwa. Idrowing yemethrikhi: khetha isikali semethrikhi njenge 1:100, noma linganisa ngebanga lemethrikhi njenge 6000 mm.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"create-items","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dala izinto zokuthatha amanani","summary":"Yenza izinto ezingumugqa, indawo nezokubala, bese usetha iyunithi, ukuphakama noma ukujula, ukulahleka namazinga empahla nomsebenzi.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["iqembu","izinga lokukhiqiza","usayizi weqembu","iholo","amahora","amahora abasebenzi","izinsuku zeqembu","amahora omsebenzi","into","into entsha","isimo","izimo eziningi","futhi ukale","izinhlobo eziningi","igumbi","umugqa","indawo","ukubala","iyunithi","ukuphakama","ukujula","ukulahleka","impahla","umsebenzi","izinga","umbala","izindleko"],"headings":[{"id":"amanani-abhalwe-akukho-okudwetshwayo","text":"Amanani abhalwe (akukho okudwetshwayo)","level":2},{"id":"yenza-into","text":"Yenza into","level":2},{"id":"khetha-into-oyidwebisa-ngayo","text":"Khetha into oyidwebisa ngayo","level":2},{"id":"setha-into","text":"Setha into","level":2},{"id":"into-eyodwa-izinhlobo-eziningi-zezimpawu","text":"Into eyodwa, izinhlobo eziningi zezimpawu","level":2},{"id":"amazinga-emathebulini","text":"Amazinga emathebulini","level":2},{"id":"ukubiza-kusebenza-kanjani","text":"Ukubiza kusebenza kanjani","level":2},{"id":"umsebenzi-ngeqembu","text":"Umsebenzi ngeqembu","level":2},{"id":"izinto-zemetric","text":"Izinto zemetric","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInto\u003C/strong\u003E ingento oyilinganisayo futhi oyibiza: uhlobo lodonga, ukuqedwa kwesitezi, uphahla, umnyango, isibani. Yonke impawu oyidwebayo ingeyento. Ezinye izinhlelo zibiza lezi ngokuthi izimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgayinye into inohlobo (futhi ingathatha nezinye izinhlobo zezimpawu, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EInto eyodwa, izinhlobo eziningi zezimpawu\u003C/a\u003E):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUdweba\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIbika\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa exhunyiwe yamaphuzu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude, inani lemigqa, nendawo yodonga uma inokuphakama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF noma m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho evaliwe, enezimbobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo, umjikelezo, inani lezindawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF, SY, SQ, ac, ha noma m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza kanye ngento ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthi zingaki\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani elibhalwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho okudwetshwayo: ubhala inani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani obhale lona (noma elilethwe kusuka ku-CivilCraft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha noma m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanani-abhalwe-akukho-okudwetshwayo\"\u003EAmanani abhalwe (akukho okudwetshwayo)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinto kwisilinganiso azikaze zidwetshwe: ukuhamba, izimvume, isiphepho, inkontileka yenkulumo eyodwa, ukumba nokugcwalisa okuphethwe yi-CivilCraft. Zenze \u003Cstrong\u003EInani elibhalwe\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInto entsha\u003C/span\u003E, bhala igama, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInani elibhalwe (akukho mdwebo)\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumhleli wento khetha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/span\u003E (LS yenkulumo eyodwa) bese uthayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInani\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha ukulahleka namazinga njengakunoma iyiphi enye into. Izifomula zomhlanganisela zisebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003EQ\u003C/code\u003E, inani, njengo \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(Q / 12)\u003C/code\u003E imithwalo yamalori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani elibhalwe alithathi zimpawu futhi alenzi isilinganiso sibe sesingaphelele. Uma isilinganiso sinezindawo zezindleko, umhleli uphinde ube nento ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yezindleko\u003C/span\u003E: inani selo liyangena kuleyo ndawo, kumazinga ayo, nasemaphelele ayo, njengokuthi kwenziwe impawu kuleyo ndawo. Amanani alethwe kwenye i-app akhombisa lapho avela khona, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/earthwork#cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/earthwork\" data-hash=\"cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\"\u003EUkumba nezinsimbi zokuphakama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-into\"\u003EYenza into\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-panel ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInto entsha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala igama, njengo \u003Ccode\u003EUdonga lohlobo A langaphakathi\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EIthayela lekhaphethi\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa (ubude)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Into ivela ohlwini ngombala wayo, ibe yinto oyidwebisa ngayo, bese umhleli wayo uvula ngaphansi kohlu. Ibha yesimo ikutshela ithuluzi okufanele ulikhethe ngokulandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E efomini ukuze uyivale ngaphandle kokwengeza into.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ukhetha ithuluzi lokulinganisa kuqala, i-TakeoffCraft isebenzisa into yokugcina yohlobo olufanele, noma ivule ifomu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInto entsha\u003C/span\u003E nohlobo selukhethiwe kade.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-into-oyidwebisa-ngayo\"\u003EKhetha into oyidwebisa ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza into ohlwini. Iba yinto izimpawu ezintsha ezingena kuyo, nezimpawu zayo zikhanyiswe kuwo wonke amashidi kanti ezinye zifiphale. Uma ishidi elivuliwe lingenazo izimpawu zayo, i-TakeoffCraft ikuyisa kwelinye ishidi elinazo. Chofoza into futhi ukuze uyeke ukuyikhanyisa; isahlala iyinto oyidwebisa ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza impawu ngethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E nalo lenza into yayo ibe yamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-into\"\u003ESetha into\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmhleli wento (\u003Cstrong\u003EInto: (igama)\u003C/strong\u003E) unezinkambu ezilandelayo. Ngayinye iyagcinwa uma ushiya inkambu noma ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, futhi noma iyiphi inguquko ingabuyiselwa emuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza ini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgama\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbonakala ohlwini, emathebuleni nasekuthumeleni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThayipha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa, Indawo noma Bala. Iyavalwa uma into sekunezimpawu (&quot;Into enezimpawu igcina uhlobo lwayo&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbala wezimpawu zayo esikrinini nasePDF enezimpawu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani elibikwa ngayo: LF noma m zomugqa; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha noma m² zendawo; EA zokubala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuthi ukale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinye izinhlobo zezimpawu into eyithathayo, ngayinye neyunithi yayo. Bona ngezansi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E (umugqa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphakama kodonga. Into-ke ibuye ibike indawo yodonga (ubude × ukuphakama). Imigqa evela kumodeli ye-BimCraft ithwala iminyango nezifasi zayo: zisuswa kanye, futhi into ibika indawo ephelele, izikhala nendawo esele. Ukubalwa kusuka kuprojekthi ye-BimCraft okukhethwe kuyo indlela yokulinganisa kulinganiswa ngaleyo ndlela nalapha (inothi liyibiza, kanye nomthombo wayo, lithi ayihlolwa yi-quantity surveyor); le ndlela ayishintshwa ku-TakeoffCraft. Izitini noma amabhulokhi nodaka oluvela kuhlobo lodonga lufika njengezingxenye ezimbili: iyunithi zokuyalwa nevolumu kadaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula\u003C/span\u003E (indawo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujula noma ubukhulu, kusetshenziswa ezifomulini zomhlanganisela (isibonelo ivolumu yekhonkolo).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkulahleka %\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwengezwa enanini ngaphambi kokubiza: 10 kusho inani × 1.10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindleko zempahla ngeyunithi. Ilebula ilandela iyunithi: $/SF, $/EA njalo njalo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsebenzi $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindleko zomsebenzi ngeyunithi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInombolo ye-CSI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo yayo ye-CSI MasterFormat, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E (noma umnyango nje, \u003Ccode\u003E09\u003C/code\u003E). Umsebenzi we-workbook othi By division uqoqa izindleko ngayo. Izinto ezivela kuma-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Etrade packs\u003C/a\u003E zinayo sekuyiyo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphakama nokujula kuthatha amafiti namaduyima (\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E8&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) noma amafiti ahlukaniswe ngamadesimali (\u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E) yamayunithi e-imperial, namamitha (\u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700 mm\u003C/code\u003E) wamayunithi e-metric. Amazinga athatha amanani njengo \u003Ccode\u003E12.50\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E, kuze kube amadesimali amane. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUkufaka ubude, izinga nephesenti\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwenkambu, \u003Cstrong\u003EOkulinganisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa amanani ezifomula zento angazisebenzisa, namachashazi azo: Ubude (L), Imigqa (N), Indawo yodonga (A) zomugqa; Indawo (A), Umjikelezo (P), Izindawo (N) zendawo; Bala (N) zokubala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"into-eyodwa-izinhlobo-eziningi-zezimpawu\"\u003EInto eyodwa, izinhlobo eziningi zezimpawu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinto zilinganiswa ngendlela ngaphezu kweyodwa: igumbi linesakhiwo (indawo), ukugcina ngaphansi kodonga lwalo (umugqa) namasango (ukubala). Esikhundleni sezinto ezintathu, yenza eyodwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza into ngohlobo lwayo oluyinhloko, njengento yendawo \u003Ccode\u003EIgumbi 101\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuthi ukale\u003C/span\u003E kumhleli wayo, tshekisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E noma zombili. Ngayinye ithola iyunithi eseceleni kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba ngalo nalo luphi na uthuluzi uhlobo lwalo olwamukelwa yinto: nge-\u003Ccode\u003EIgumbi 101\u003C/code\u003E lamanje, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E idweba isakhiwo sayo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E idweba ukugcina kwayo phansi, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E idweba iminyango yayo. I-TakeoffCraft ayicele enye into.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lwezinto lubonisa inani lonke (\u003Ccode\u003E50.00 SF + 2 EA\u003C/code\u003E). Kuthebula lamanani, umugqa wento uhlala nenani layo elikhulu, bese ngayinye yezinye izinhlobo ithola umugqa wayo ngaphansi kwawo, njenge \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi 101 (bala)\u003C/strong\u003E, nezinga layo lokulahleka nempahla nomsebenzi. Ukuthunyelwa, ithebula lalo shidi nencwadi yencazelo ye-PDF enezimpawu zibhalwe ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkambu zohlobo oluyinhloko zihlala zizo: ukuphakama noma ukujula, ukuthambeka, ukususwa emuva kanye nesimo se-3D kusebenza ezimpawini zalo kuphela. Umugqa wokugcina odwetshwe ngento yendawo ulinganiswa ngokuthi uhamba endaweni ku-plan, futhi ubonakala uyisicaba ku-3D. Izifomula zomhlanganisela zisebenzisa amanani ohlobo oluyinhloko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlobo lungasuswa kuphela uma into ingenazo izimpawu zalo; zisuse, noma uzidlulisele kwenye into ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImpawu ekhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E, kuqala. Izimpawu zingadluliselwa kunoma iyiphi into ethatha uhlobo lwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgezansi kukhona i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E: izingxenye ezifana nezinduku noma ibhodi, ngayinye ineyayo ifomula namazinga. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EUmhlanganisela nezifomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEkugcineni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYisa phezulu\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYisa phansi\u003C/span\u003E ishintsha indawo yento ohlwini nakokuthunyelwa, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa into\u003C/span\u003E isusa yona nazo zonke izimpawu zayo (kuphela emva kokubuza; ungayihlehlisa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto zendawo zinokuthambeka (izindiza zophahla ezilinganiswa ngokuthambeka: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\"\u003EUphahla nokuthambeka\u003C/a\u003E) kanye nokususwa emuva (izimpawu zazo zisuswa endaweni yezinye izinto: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\"\u003ELinganisa izindawo\u003C/a\u003E). Izinto zomugqa zinesimo sokuthambeka (Ilevu, Rake, Hip noma valley) futhi, kwama-rakes nama-hips, nokuthambeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amazinga-emathebulini\"\u003EAmazinga emathebulini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngabuye uthayiphe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkulahleka %\u003C/span\u003E, namazinga empahla nomsebenzi ngqo ethebuleni elingaphansi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgento\u003C/span\u003E). Kuyisimiso esifanayo nasemhleli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubiza-kusebenza-kanjani\"\u003EUkubiza kusebenza kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgayo yonke into nangayo yonke ingxenye yomhlanganisela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENokulahleka\u003C/strong\u003E = inani × (1 + ukulahleka %).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla\u003C/strong\u003E = nokulahleka × impahla ngeyunithi, ijikelezwe kwisenti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E = nokulahleka × umsebenzi ngeyunithi, ujikelezwe kwisenti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsamba\u003C/strong\u003E = impahla + umsebenzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsamba somsebenzi\u003C/span\u003E yengeza yonke into nayo yonke ingxenye. Into ingaba nezinga layo nomhlanganisela ngesikhathi esisodwa; zombili zibalwa, ngakho shiya amazinga alo ku-0 uma izingxenye zawo zithwala izindleko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umsebenzi-ngeqembu\"\u003EUmsebenzi ngeqembu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikhundleni sezinga lomsebenzi ngeyunithi, umsebenzi wento ungavela eqenjini: liyakwazi kangakanani ngehora, linabantu abangaki, nokuthi ngamunye uthola ini. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsebenzi ngeqembu\u003C/span\u003E kumhleli wento, tshekisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala umsebenzi ngeqembu\u003C/span\u003E bese ugcwalisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsibonelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhiqiza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E LF ngehora (kuyunithi yento) yeqembu lonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInani leqembu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E abantu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmholo $/ihora ngamunye\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ibala, kusukela enanini elinokulahleka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eamahora eqembu\u003C/strong\u003E = inani ÷ ukukhiqiza (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eamahora abasebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E = amahora eqembu × inani leqembu (11),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eizinsuku zeqembu\u003C/strong\u003E = amahora eqembu ÷ 8 (0.69),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eumsebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E = amahora abasebenzi × umholo (\\$495.00).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmhleli ukhombisa umphumela nezinga elifika kulo ($4.50/LF). Izinga lomsebenzi lento lisesimweni sokufunda kuphela, emhleli nasethebulini. Ikhanda lethebula lamanani \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E lengeza amahora abasebenzi omsebenzi nezinsuku zeqembu. Ukuthunyelwa kubonisa amahora eqembu ngalinye, nencwadi ye-workbook isebenzisa ifomula yeqembu (\u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)\u003C/code\u003E). Susa ibhokisi ukuze ubuyele ezingeni ngeyunithi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-zemetric\"\u003EIzinto zemetric\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha m (umugqa) noma m² (indawo) njengeyunithi. Amanani, ukuphakama namanani ezifomula kuke kube ngamamitha. Isikali sishidi singaba noma yiliphi iseti noma i-calibration; iyunithi nezikali zizimele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003ELinganisa imigqa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003ELinganisa izindawo ezinezikhala\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\"\u003EBala ngesandla\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Into ingento oyilinganisayo futhi oyibiza: uhlobo lodonga, ukuqedwa kwesitezi, uphahla, umnyango, isibani. Yonke impawu oyidwebayo ingeyento. Ezinye izinhlelo zibiza lezi ngokuthi izimo. Ngayinye into inohlobo (futhi ingathatha nezinye izinhlobo zezimpawu, bona Into eyodwa, izinhlobo eziningi zezimpawu): Uhlobo Udweba Ibika Iyunithi Umugqa Imigqa exhunyiwe yamaphuzu Ubude, inani lemigqa, nendawo yodonga uma inokuphakama LF noma m Indawo Imiphetho evaliwe, enezimbobo Indawo, umjikelezo, inani lezindawo SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha noma m² Bala Ukuchofoza kanye ngento ngayinye Ukuthi zingaki EA Inani elibhalwe Akukho okudwetshwayo: ubhala inani Inani obhale lona (noma elilethwe kusuka ku-CivilCraft) LS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha noma m² Amanani abhalwe (akukho okudwetshwayo) Ezinye izinto kwisilinganiso azikaze zidwetshwe: ukuhamba, izimvume, isiphepho, inkontileka yenkulumo eyodwa, ukumba nokugcwalisa okuphethwe yi-CivilCraft. Zenze Inani elibhalwe: Khetha Into entsha, bhala igama, khetha Inani elibhalwe (akukho mdwebo) bese ukhetha Engeza. Kumhleli wento khetha i-Iyunithi (LS yenkulumo eyodwa) bese uthayipha Inani: 1, 2.5 noma 1,250. Setha ukulahleka namazinga njengakunoma iyiphi enye into. Izifomula zomhlanganisela zisebenzisa Q, inani, njengo ceil(Q / 12) imithwalo yamalori. Inani elibhalwe alithathi zimpawu futhi alenzi isilinganiso sibe sesingaphelele. Uma isilinganiso sinezindawo zezindleko, umhleli uphinde ube nento ethi Indawo yezindleko: inani selo liyangena kuleyo ndawo, kumazinga ayo, nasemaphelele ayo, njengokuthi kwenziwe impawu kuleyo ndawo. Amanani alethwe kwenye i-app akhombisa lapho avela khona, bona Ukumba nezinsimbi zokuphakama. Yenza into Ku-panel ethi Izinto ngakwesokudla, khetha Into entsha. Bhala igama, njengo Udonga lohlobo A langaphakathi noma Ithayela lekhaphethi. Khetha uhlobo: Umugqa (ubude), Indawo noma Bala. Khetha Engeza (noma cindezela Enter). Into ivela ohlwini ngombala wayo, ibe yinto oyidwebisa ngayo, bese umhleli wayo uvula ngaphansi kohlu. Ibha yesimo ikutshela ithuluzi okufanele ulikhethe ngokulandelayo. Cindezela Esc efomini ukuze uyivale ngaphandle kokwengeza into. Uma ukhetha ithuluzi lokulinganisa kuqala, i-TakeoffCraft isebenzisa into yokugcina yohlobo olufanele, noma ivule ifomu le-Into entsha nohlobo selukhethiwe kade. Khetha into oyidwebisa ngayo Chofoza into ohlwini. Iba yinto izimpawu ezintsha ezingena kuyo, nezimpawu zayo zikhanyiswe kuwo wonke amashidi kanti ezinye zifiphale. Uma ishidi elivuliwe lingenazo izimpawu zayo, i-TakeoffCraft ikuyisa kwelinye ishidi elinazo. Chofoza into futhi ukuze uyeke ukuyikhanyisa; isahlala iyinto oyidwebisa ngayo. Chofoza impawu ngethuluzi le-Khetha nalo lenza into yayo ibe yamanje. Setha into Umhleli wento (Into: (igama)) unezinkambu ezilandelayo. Ngayinye iyagcinwa uma ushiya inkambu noma ucindezela Enter, futhi noma iyiphi inguquko ingabuyiselwa emuva. Inkambu Yenza ini Igama Ibonakala ohlwini, emathebuleni nasekuthumeleni. Thayipha Umugqa, Indawo noma Bala. Iyavalwa uma into sekunezimpawu (\"Into enezimpawu igcina uhlobo lwayo\"). Umbala Umbala wezimpawu zayo esikrinini nasePDF enezimpawu. Iyunithi Inani elibikwa ngayo: LF noma m zomugqa; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha noma m² zendawo; EA zokubala. Futhi ukale Ezinye izinhlobo zezimpawu into eyithathayo, ngayinye neyunithi yayo. Bona ngezansi. Ukuphakama (umugqa) Ukuphakama kodonga. Into-ke ibuye ibike indawo yodonga (ubude × ukuphakama). Imigqa evela kumodeli ye-BimCraft ithwala iminyango nezifasi zayo: zisuswa kanye, futhi into ibika indawo ephelele, izikhala nendawo esele. Ukubalwa kusuka kuprojekthi ye-BimCraft okukhethwe kuyo indlela yokulinganisa kulinganiswa ngaleyo ndlela nalapha (inothi liyibiza, kanye nomthombo wayo, lithi ayihlolwa yi-quantity surveyor); le ndlela ayishintshwa ku-TakeoffCraft. Izitini noma amabhulokhi nodaka oluvela kuhlobo lodonga lufika njengezingxenye ezimbili: iyunithi zokuyalwa nevolumu kadaka. Ukujula (indawo) Ukujula noma ubukhulu, kusetshenziswa ezifomulini zomhlanganisela (isibonelo ivolumu yekhonkolo). Ukulahleka % Kwengezwa enanini ngaphambi kokubiza: 10 kusho inani × 1.10. Impahla $/LF Izindleko zempahla ngeyunithi. Ilebula ilandela iyunithi: $/SF, $/EA njalo njalo. Umsebenzi $/LF Izindleko zomsebenzi ngeyunithi. Inombolo ye-CSI Inombolo yayo ye-CSI MasterFormat, njengo 09 21 16 (noma umnyango nje, 09). Umsebenzi we-workbook othi By division uqoqa izindleko ngayo. Izinto ezivela kuma-trade packs zinayo sekuyiyo. Ukuphakama nokujula kuthatha amafiti namaduyima (9'-0\", 8' 6\") noma amafiti ahlukaniswe ngamadesimali (9) yamayunithi e-imperial, namamitha (2.7, 2700 mm) wamayunithi e-metric. Amazinga athatha amanani njengo 12.50 noma $1,250, kuze kube amadesimali amane. Bona Ukufaka ubude, izinga nephesenti. Ngaphansi kwenkambu, Okulinganisiwe ikhombisa amanani ezifomula zento angazisebenzisa, namachashazi azo: Ubude (L), Imigqa (N), Indawo yodonga (A) zomugqa; Indawo (A), Umjikelezo (P), Izindawo (N) zendawo; Bala (N) zokubala. Into eyodwa, izinhlobo eziningi zezimpawu Ezinye izinto zilinganiswa ngendlela ngaphezu kweyodwa: igumbi linesakhiwo (indawo), ukugcina ngaphansi kodonga lwalo (umugqa) namasango (ukubala). Esikhundleni sezinto ezintathu, yenza eyodwa: Yenza into ngohlobo lwayo oluyinhloko, njengento yendawo Igumbi 101. Ngaphansi kwe-Futhi ukale kumhleli wayo, tshekisha Umugqa, Bala noma zombili. Ngayinye ithola iyunithi eseceleni kwayo. Dweba ngalo nalo luphi na uthuluzi uhlobo lwalo olwamukelwa yinto: nge-Igumbi 101 lamanje, Indawo idweba isakhiwo sayo, Umugqa idweba ukugcina kwayo phansi, bese Bala idweba iminyango yayo. I-TakeoffCraft ayicele enye into. Uhlu lwezinto lubonisa inani lonke (50.00 SF + 2 EA). Kuthebula lamanani, umugqa wento uhlala nenani layo elikhulu, bese ngayinye yezinye izinhlobo ithola umugqa wayo ngaphansi kwawo, njenge Igumbi 101 (bala), nezinga layo lokulahleka nempahla nomsebenzi. Ukuthunyelwa, ithebula lalo shidi nencwadi yencazelo ye-PDF enezimpawu zibhalwe ngendlela efanayo. Izinkambu zohlobo oluyinhloko zihlala zizo: ukuphakama noma ukujula, ukuthambeka, ukususwa emuva kanye nesimo se-3D kusebenza ezimpawini zalo kuphela. Umugqa wokugcina odwetshwe ngento yendawo ulinganiswa ngokuthi uhamba endaweni ku-plan, futhi ubonakala uyisicaba ku-3D. Izifomula zomhlanganisela zisebenzisa amanani ohlobo oluyinhloko. Uhlobo lungasuswa kuphela uma into ingenazo izimpawu zalo; zisuse, noma uzidlulisele kwenye into ngaphansi kwe-Impawu ekhethiwe, kuqala. Izimpawu zingadluliselwa kunoma iyiphi into ethatha uhlobo lwazo. Ngezansi kukhona i-Umhlanganisela: izingxenye ezifana nezinduku noma ibhodi, ngayinye ineyayo ifomula namazinga. Bona Umhlanganisela nezifomula. Ekugcineni: Yisa phezulu no-Yisa phansi ishintsha indawo yento ohlwini nakokuthunyelwa, bese Susa into isusa yona nazo zonke izimpawu zayo (kuphela emva kokubuza; ungayihlehlisa). Izinto zendawo zinokuthambeka (izindiza zophahla ezilinganiswa ngokuthambeka: Uphahla nokuthambeka) kanye nokususwa emuva (izimpawu zazo zisuswa endaweni yezinye izinto: Linganisa izindawo). Izinto zomugqa zinesimo sokuthambeka (Ilevu, Rake, Hip noma valley) futhi, kwama-rakes nama-hips, nokuthambeka. Amazinga emathebulini Ungabuye uthayiphe Ukulahleka %, namazinga empahla nomsebenzi ngqo ethebuleni elingaphansi Amanani (Ngento). Kuyisimiso esifanayo nasemhleli. Ukubiza kusebenza kanjani Ngayo yonke into nangayo yonke ingxenye yomhlanganisela: Nokulahleka = inani × (1 + ukulahleka %). Impahla = nokulahleka × impahla ngeyunithi, ijikelezwe kwisenti. Umsebenzi = nokulahleka × umsebenzi ngeyunithi, ujikelezwe kwisenti. Isamba = impahla + umsebenzi. I-Isamba somsebenzi yengeza yonke into nayo yonke ingxenye. Into ingaba nezinga layo nomhlanganisela ngesikhathi esisodwa; zombili zibalwa, ngakho shiya amazinga alo ku-0 uma izingxenye zawo zithwala izindleko. Umsebenzi ngeqembu Esikhundleni sezinga lomsebenzi ngeyunithi, umsebenzi wento ungavela eqenjini: liyakwazi kangakanani ngehora, linabantu abangaki, nokuthi ngamunye uthola ini. Ngaphansi kwe-Umsebenzi ngeqembu kumhleli wento, tshekisha Bala umsebenzi ngeqembu bese ugcwalisa: Inkambu Isibonelo Ukukhiqiza 20 LF ngehora (kuyunithi yento) yeqembu lonke Inani leqembu 2 abantu Umholo $/ihora ngamunye 45 I-TakeoffCraft ibala, kusukela enanini elinokulahleka: amahora eqembu = inani ÷ ukukhiqiza (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5), amahora abasebenzi = amahora eqembu × inani leqembu (11), izinsuku zeqembu = amahora eqembu ÷ 8 (0.69), umsebenzi = amahora abasebenzi × umholo (\\$495.00). Umhleli ukhombisa umphumela nezinga elifika kulo ($4.50/LF). Izinga lomsebenzi lento lisesimweni sokufunda kuphela, emhleli nasethebulini. Ikhanda lethebula lamanani Amanani lengeza amahora abasebenzi omsebenzi nezinsuku zeqembu. Ukuthunyelwa kubonisa amahora eqembu ngalinye, nencwadi ye-workbook isebenzisa ifomula yeqembu (ROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)). Susa ibhokisi ukuze ubuyele ezingeni ngeyunithi. Izinto zemetric Khetha m (umugqa) noma m² (indawo) njengeyunithi. Amanani, ukuphakama namanani ezifomula kuke kube ngamamitha. Isikali sishidi singaba noma yiliphi iseti noma i-calibration; iyunithi nezikali zizimele. Okulandelayo Linganisa imigqa Linganisa izindawo ezinezikhala Bala ngesandla","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"measure-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Linganisa kusuka emdwebeni","summary":"Thatha ubude nezindawo kusuka emigqeni, emajikeni, ku-polyline nasemahatch omdwebo, ngokuwakhetha, ngamajika nezimbobo eziqondile, esikhundleni sokulandelela ngokucofa.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["linganisa umdwebo","ijiyometri","iphola-layini","ijika","isiyingi","imigqa yokufiphaza","bulge","ubude oqondile","indawo eqondile","khetha","iwindi","landelela","kusuka ku-CAD","umugqa","indawo"],"headings":[{"id":"thatha-izinto-njengento-yomugqa-noma-yendawo","text":"Thatha izinto njengento yomugqa noma yendawo","level":2},{"id":"yini-into-ngayinye-ethatha-kuyo","text":"Yini into ngayinye ethatha kuyo","level":2},{"id":"okunembile-nokuseduze","text":"Okunembile nokuseduze","level":2},{"id":"ithathwa-kusuka-kuphi","text":"Ithathwa kusuka kuphi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yeshidi ye-DWG noma ishidi le-DXF ithatha izinto zomdwebo njengemaki, ngakho awuzilandelelisi ngokucofa. Ubude be-polyline, ubude bejika, indawo yesiyingi kanye nendawo ye-hatch nezimbobo zayo kuphuma eqondile, ngezibalo ezisetshenziswa ukubala yonke imaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thatha-izinto-njengento-yomugqa-noma-yendawo\"\u003EThatha izinto njengento yomugqa noma yendawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza noma cofa into \u003Cstrong\u003Eyomugqa\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eyendawo\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E. Ishidi kudingeka isikali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa izinto esheetini ukuze uzikhethe, noma donsa iwindi ozungeze kuyo: konke okuphelele ngaphakathi kwawo kukhethiwe. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yengeza iwindi ekukhethweni; cofa into ekhethiwe futhi ukuze uyisuse. Ibha ibonisa inani eliphelele: &quot;imigqa emi-6: 108&#039;-9 1/8&quot; ngokuphelele.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha inkinobho yokungeza, ebiza inani nento, njengo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd 6 to Edge\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Yonke into iba yimaki eyodwa yento, ngesinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlanza lokho okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-into-ngayinye-ethatha-kuyo\"\u003EYini into ngayinye ethatha kuyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto \u003Cstrong\u003Eyomugqa\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha imigqa, amajika, ama-polyline, amasongo nama-spline ngobude. Umumo ovaliwe ubalwa ngomjikelezo wawo. I-hatch iyasuswa: inendawo, hhayi ubude, futhi ibha iyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto \u003Cstrong\u003Eyendawo\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha imumo evaliwe: ama-polyline avaliwe, amasongo, ama-2D solid, namahatch anemibobo yawo. Imigqa evulekile iyasuswa, futhi ibha iyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okunembile-nokuseduze\"\u003EOkunembile nokuseduze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa, amajika (kuhlanganise nawo wonke ama-bulge), ama-polyline anama-bulge namasongo kunembile: ubude nezindawo zisebenzisa irediyasi nokugoba kwejika, hhayi isithombe salo. Ama-ellipse, ama-spline namahatch anemiphetho eyakhiwe ngamaphethelo amelwa ngamachord angu-degree eyodwa noma ngaphansi kwalokho, okuyisilinganiso esiphakathi kwengxenye yekhulu lephesenti kuma-ellipse nengxenye yeshumi kokunye; ibha ithi zingaki zezinto ozikhethile ezingamajika alolu hlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ithathwa-kusuka-kuphi\"\u003EIthathwa kusuka kuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto ku-model space. \u003Cstrong\u003EA layout\u003C/strong\u003E: imigqa yayo, kanye nezinto zemodeli ngaphakathi kwe-viewport, ziyalingiswa ngayo. Into edlula emphethelweni we-viewport ayinikezwa (iyaphrinta iqunyiwe); into ezungeze ama-viewport omabili ithathwa kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzendlalelo ezibonwa yileshidi kuphela. Amabhulokhi abalwa, akalinganiswa: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBala kusuka emdwebeni\u003C/a\u003E. Ama-polyline ayi-3D, ama-mesh, ama-solid namadlelo awanikezwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Measure drawing ebhareni yeshidi ye-DWG noma ishidi le-DXF ithatha izinto zomdwebo njengemaki, ngakho awuzilandelelisi ngokucofa. Ubude be-polyline, ubude bejika, indawo yesiyingi kanye nendawo ye-hatch nezimbobo zayo kuphuma eqondile, ngezibalo ezisetshenziswa ukubala yonke imaki. Thatha izinto njengento yomugqa noma yendawo Yenza noma cofa into yomugqa noma yendawo ngaphansi kwe-Items. Ishidi kudingeka isikali. Khetha Measure drawing. Cofa izinto esheetini ukuze uzikhethe, noma donsa iwindi ozungeze kuyo: konke okuphelele ngaphakathi kwawo kukhethiwe. Shift yengeza iwindi ekukhethweni; cofa into ekhethiwe futhi ukuze uyisuse. Ibha ibonisa inani eliphelele: \"imigqa emi-6: 108'-9 1/8\" ngokuphelele.\" Khetha inkinobho yokungeza, ebiza inani nento, njengo Add 6 to Edge (noma cindezela Enter). Yonke into iba yimaki eyodwa yento, ngesinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa. Esc ihlanza lokho okukhethiwe. Yini into ngayinye ethatha kuyo Into yomugqa ithatha imigqa, amajika, ama-polyline, amasongo nama-spline ngobude. Umumo ovaliwe ubalwa ngomjikelezo wawo. I-hatch iyasuswa: inendawo, hhayi ubude, futhi ibha iyasho lokho. Into yendawo ithatha imumo evaliwe: ama-polyline avaliwe, amasongo, ama-2D solid, namahatch anemibobo yawo. Imigqa evulekile iyasuswa, futhi ibha iyasho lokho. Okunembile nokuseduze Imigqa, amajika (kuhlanganise nawo wonke ama-bulge), ama-polyline anama-bulge namasongo kunembile: ubude nezindawo zisebenzisa irediyasi nokugoba kwejika, hhayi isithombe salo. Ama-ellipse, ama-spline namahatch anemiphetho eyakhiwe ngamaphethelo amelwa ngamachord angu-degree eyodwa noma ngaphansi kwalokho, okuyisilinganiso esiphakathi kwengxenye yekhulu lephesenti kuma-ellipse nengxenye yeshumi kokunye; ibha ithi zingaki zezinto ozikhethile ezingamajika alolu hlobo. Ithathwa kusuka kuphi Model: izinto ku-model space. A layout: imigqa yayo, kanye nezinto zemodeli ngaphakathi kwe-viewport, ziyalingiswa ngayo. Into edlula emphethelweni we-viewport ayinikezwa (iyaphrinta iqunyiwe); into ezungeze ama-viewport omabili ithathwa kanye. Izendlalelo ezibonwa yileshidi kuphela. Amabhulokhi abalwa, akalinganiswa: bona Bala kusuka emdwebeni. Ama-polyline ayi-3D, ama-mesh, ama-solid namadlelo awanikezwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"snap-to-the-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bambelela emigqeni yomdwebo","summary":"Amaphoyinti agxuma emigqeni ye-PDF uqobo lwayo ngenkathi ulinganisa noma uhlola isikali: amaphelo, ukuphakathi, ukuhlangana noma noma yiphi indawo emgqeni, nophawu olutshela ukuthi yiyiphi.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["bambelela","osnap","object snap","iphelo","ukuphakathi","ukuhlangana","eseduze","ivekthori","imigqa","okunembile","f3","imagnethi","ikhona"],"headings":[{"id":"okubambelelayo","text":"Okubambelelayo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-isebenza-khona","text":"Lapho isebenza khona","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ingekwazi-ukubambelela","text":"Lapho ingekwazi ukubambelela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmapulani amaningi yi-PDF ezivekthori: izindonga nemiphetho yazo imigqa yangempela, hhayi amaphikseli. Ngenkathi ulinganisa, i-TakeoffCraft ibambelela ukuchofoza kwakho kulowo migqa, ngakho umugqa uqala ngqo ekhoneni lodonga, futhi ukuhlola isikali kufunda isilinganiso umklami asidwebile, hhayi iphikseli oliliphindile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBambelela\u003C/span\u003E iyavuleka lapho uqala. Ivulwa ivalwe ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBambelela\u003C/span\u003E kwibha yesimo noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; isilungiselelo sigcinwa kulesi siphequluli (sitholakala futhi ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubambelelayo\"\u003EOkubambelelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma inkomba isondela cishe ngamaphikseli esikrini angu-10 komugqa, uphawu lubonisa lapho ukuchofoza kuzofika, negama lalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUphawu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIgama\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikwele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphelo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphelo lomugqa, noma ikhona lapho imigqa ihlangana. Amaphelo amabili ejwayezi ayabalwa; amaphoyinti angaphakathi awabalwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnxantathu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaphakathi womugqa oqondile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphambano\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlangana\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho imigqa emibili ihlangana, noma lapho omunye uphela kolunye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-hourglass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEmgqeni\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti eliseduze kakhulu emgqeni, uma kungekho iphelo, ukuphakathi noma ukuhlangana okuseduze.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphelo, ukuphakathi noma ukuhlangana okuseduze kakhulu kuyanqoba. Kuphela uma kungekho lutho oluseduze, iphoyinti liyaya emgqeni uqobo. Sondeza ukuze ukhethe phakathi kwamaphoyinti ahlangene: amaphikseli angu-10 angamaphikseli esikrini, ngakho ngokusondeza kakhulu athatha ingxenye encane yephepha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-isebenza-khona\"\u003ELapho isebenza khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubambelela kusebenza kumathuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsiyingi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E, nalapho uhudula ikhona yohlamvu olukhethiwe. Futhi ibeka amaphoyinti ama-arc. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E nokunamathisela akubambelelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphoyinti elibanjelelwe linqoba ukubambelela kwe-45° ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ukuze udwebe ku-45° ngaphandle komugqa, vala ukubambelela nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinganisa ngokubambelela sekuvuliwe. Chofoza eduze kwamaphelo amabili womugqa wesilinganiso noma udonga oluwaziyo: amaphoyinti omabili angena ngokunembile emdwebweni, futhi isikali siphuma sinembile (ibha yesimo ibe isitshela ukuthi yiyiphi i-preset elingana nayo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ingekwazi-ukubambelela\"\u003ELapho ingekwazi ukubambelela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmashidi eskeniwe\u003C/strong\u003E ngumfanekiso ongenamigqa okungabanjelelwa kuwo. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;This sheet has no lines to snap to (a scanned page is a picture).&quot; namaphoyinti aya lapho uchofoza khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImidwebo emikhulu kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E: ukubambelela kufunda kuze kube ngama-400,000 wezingxenye zomugqa ngeshidi ngalinye. Kishidi elinengaphezu kwalokho, kuyasho lokho futhi kubambelele kwezokuqala kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbhalo awubanjelelwa\u003C/strong\u003E, ngaphandle uma i-PDF idweba izinhlamvu zayo njengemigqa (ezinye izipuleti zenza kanjalo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa yeshidi ifundwa ngokuqala ukulivula, ngasemuva; ishidi elikhulu lingathatha isekhondi ngaphambi kokuba amamaki avele.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amapulani amaningi yi-PDF ezivekthori: izindonga nemiphetho yazo imigqa yangempela, hhayi amaphikseli. Ngenkathi ulinganisa, i-TakeoffCraft ibambelela ukuchofoza kwakho kulowo migqa, ngakho umugqa uqala ngqo ekhoneni lodonga, futhi ukuhlola isikali kufunda isilinganiso umklami asidwebile, hhayi iphikseli oliliphindile. Bambelela iyavuleka lapho uqala. Ivulwa ivalwe ngo-Bambelela kwibha yesimo noma nge-F3; isilungiselelo sigcinwa kulesi siphequluli (sitholakala futhi ku-Izilungiselelo). Okubambelelayo Uma inkomba isondela cishe ngamaphikseli esikrini angu-10 komugqa, uphawu lubonisa lapho ukuchofoza kuzofika, negama lalo: Uphawu Igama Lapho Isikwele Iphelo Iphelo lomugqa, noma ikhona lapho imigqa ihlangana. Amaphelo amabili ejwayezi ayabalwa; amaphoyinti angaphakathi awabalwa. Unxantathu Ukuphakathi Maphakathi womugqa oqondile. Isiphambano Ukuhlangana Lapho imigqa emibili ihlangana, noma lapho omunye uphela kolunye. I-hourglass Emgqeni Iphoyinti eliseduze kakhulu emgqeni, uma kungekho iphelo, ukuphakathi noma ukuhlangana okuseduze. Iphelo, ukuphakathi noma ukuhlangana okuseduze kakhulu kuyanqoba. Kuphela uma kungekho lutho oluseduze, iphoyinti liyaya emgqeni uqobo. Sondeza ukuze ukhethe phakathi kwamaphoyinti ahlangene: amaphikseli angu-10 angamaphikseli esikrini, ngakho ngokusondeza kakhulu athatha ingxenye encane yephepha. Lapho isebenza khona Ukubambelela kusebenza kumathuluzi Umugqa, Indawo, Isiyingi, Imbobo, Linganisa no-Hlola, nalapho uhudula ikhona yohlamvu olukhethiwe. Futhi ibeka amaphoyinti ama-arc. Bala, Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo nokunamathisela akubambelelwa. Iphoyinti elibanjelelwe linqoba ukubambelela kwe-45° ngo-Shift: ukuze udwebe ku-45° ngaphandle komugqa, vala ukubambelela nge-F3 kuqala. Linganisa ngokubambelela sekuvuliwe. Chofoza eduze kwamaphelo amabili womugqa wesilinganiso noma udonga oluwaziyo: amaphoyinti omabili angena ngokunembile emdwebweni, futhi isikali siphuma sinembile (ibha yesimo ibe isitshela ukuthi yiyiphi i-preset elingana nayo). Lapho ingekwazi ukubambelela Amashidi eskeniwe ngumfanekiso ongenamigqa okungabanjelelwa kuwo. Ibha yesimo ithi \"This sheet has no lines to snap to (a scanned page is a picture).\" namaphoyinti aya lapho uchofoza khona. Imidwebo emikhulu kakhulu: ukubambelela kufunda kuze kube ngama-400,000 wezingxenye zomugqa ngeshidi ngalinye. Kishidi elinengaphezu kwalokho, kuyasho lokho futhi kubambelele kwezokuqala kuphela. Umbhalo awubanjelelwa, ngaphandle uma i-PDF idweba izinhlamvu zayo njengemigqa (ezinye izipuleti zenza kanjalo). Imigqa yeshidi ifundwa ngokuqala ukulivula, ngasemuva; ishidi elikhulu lingathatha isekhondi ngaphambi kokuba amamaki avele.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"pick-the-lines","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Khetha imigqa ye-PDF","summary":"Chofoza umugqa we-PDF wevekitha ukuze ulinganise yonke indlela exhunyiwe, noma chofoza ngaphakathi kombandela ovaliwe ukuze uthole indawo yawo, ukubonisa ukubekezelela kwesikhala nokuhlehlisa okukodwa ngesigaba ngasinye.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["indlela","khetha","imigqa","umugqa","exhunyiwe","ingxenye yonke","landela","umbandela","isikhala esizungezile","isikhala","ukubekezelela","ukuxhuma","izigaba","tab","vekitha","indawo evela emigqeni","p"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-indlela-noma-umbandela","text":"Khetha indlela noma umbandela","level":2},{"id":"ukubekezelela-kwesikhala","text":"Ukubekezelela kwesikhala","level":2},{"id":"okhiye","text":"Okhiye","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKu-PDF yevekitha izindonga nemiphetho ngumugqa wangempela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyawathatha njengoba edwetshwe: ukuchofoza kanye komugqa kulinganisa konke okuxhunyiwe kuwo, kusuka ekuqaleni kuya ekugcineni, ngakho awudingi ukulandela udonga ngokuchofoza amakhona. Ishidi kudingeka libe nesikali. Ikhasi eliskenisiwe alinamigqa okuyikhetha; sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EOkuqondile\u003C/a\u003E noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/a\u003E kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-indlela-noma-umbandela\"\u003EKhetha indlela noma umbandela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesikhombi uyanqunywa, nezinye izindlela ezingakhethwa zidwetshwe ngokuncane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umugqa: yonke indlela exhunyiwe iyakhethwa. Ibha ephansi kwethuluzi inikeza izigaba zayo, ubude, ukubekezelela kwesikhala kanye nokuthi zingaki izikhala ezixhunyiwe. Indlela ebuyela esiqalweni sayo iyavaleka futhi nobude bayo bayabikwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma chofoza ngaphakathi kombandela ovaliwe, kude nanoma yimuphi umugqa: umbandela ozungeze leliphoyinti ukhethwa njengendawo. Eyincane kakhulu iza kuqala; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uzama olukhulu olulandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma chofoza ngokwesokudla, noma chofoza kabili) ukuze wengeze amamaki. Indlela ekhethiwe iba ngamamaki wento \u003Cstrong\u003Eye-linear\u003C/strong\u003E, umbandela ube ngamamaki wento \u003Cstrong\u003Eye-area\u003C/strong\u003E: into esebenzayo uma inalolo hlobo, kungenjalo eyengezwe kamuva yalolo hlobo. Uma kungekho lutho, ifomu lento entsha livuleka futhi akukho okwengezwayo uze ucindezele \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi. Konke okukhethiwe kwengezwa ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubekezelela-kwesikhala\"\u003EUkubekezelela kwesikhala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbadwetshi bashiya izikhala ezincane lapho imigqa kufanele ihlangane. Imigqa ixhumana uma izinhlangothi zayo zisondele kunokubekezelela kwesikhala. Siqala ngamaphoyinti angu-1.5 eshidini (kuboniswa ngamayunithi wesikali sesheet), futhi indilinga engamachashaza ngobubanzi obufanayo ilandela isikhombi, ihlale phezu kwesiphetho ngasinye sendlela ephansi kwayo. Isikhala ngasinye esixhunyiwe sizungezwa ngoluhlobo oluyiorenji endleleni ekhethiwe, nebha iyasibala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza ukubekezelela kube banzi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kube mncane. Indlela ekhethiwe ixhunywa kabusha masinyane ngokubekezelela okusha. Esihlanganweni indlela iqhubeka iqonde, ngendlela ephendukayo kancane, futhi ishiye igatsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye noma isenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha indlela ephansi kwesikhombi, noma umbandela ozungezile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza enye indlela noma umbandela kokukhethiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZama indlela elandelayo ephansi kwesikhombi, noma umbandela omkhulu olandelayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa isigaba sokugcina endleleni ekhethwe ngokugcina, isigaba ngesigaba. Indlela engasasigaba lutho iyasuswa. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iwukuhlehlisa okuvamile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubekezelela kwesikhala okumncane nokubanzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza amamaki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESula okukhethiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIjika esidwetshweni liyiketango lezingcezu ezimfishane ezigqamile, ngakho ubude balo buncane kancane kunalobo lejika langempela. Ukuze uthole ijika elinembile, linganisa ifayela lomdwebo ngqo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003ELinganisa kumdwebo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhala esixhunyiwe sibalwa njengokuhamba okuqondile kuso, ngakho ububanzi bombandela ovaliwe buyisiqukatha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphela ama-stroke nokugcwaliswa ezindleleni zalelo khasi ngokwalo kuyimigqa. Umbhalo odwetshwe njengezinhlamvu, nemifanekiso akuyona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ku-PDF yevekitha izindonga nemiphetho ngumugqa wangempela. Indlela (P) iyawathatha njengoba edwetshwe: ukuchofoza kanye komugqa kulinganisa konke okuxhunyiwe kuwo, kusuka ekuqaleni kuya ekugcineni, ngakho awudingi ukulandela udonga ngokuchofoza amakhona. Ishidi kudingeka libe nesikali. Ikhasi eliskenisiwe alinamigqa okuyikhetha; sebenzisa Okuqondile noma Indawo kulo. Khetha indlela noma umbandela Khetha Indlela. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesikhombi uyanqunywa, nezinye izindlela ezingakhethwa zidwetshwe ngokuncane. Chofoza umugqa: yonke indlela exhunyiwe iyakhethwa. Ibha ephansi kwethuluzi inikeza izigaba zayo, ubude, ukubekezelela kwesikhala kanye nokuthi zingaki izikhala ezixhunyiwe. Indlela ebuyela esiqalweni sayo iyavaleka futhi nobude bayo bayabikwa. Noma chofoza ngaphakathi kombandela ovaliwe, kude nanoma yimuphi umugqa: umbandela ozungeze leliphoyinti ukhethwa njengendawo. Eyincane kakhulu iza kuqala; Tab uzama olukhulu olulandelayo. Cindezela Enter (noma chofoza ngokwesokudla, noma chofoza kabili) ukuze wengeze amamaki. Indlela ekhethiwe iba ngamamaki wento ye-linear, umbandela ube ngamamaki wento ye-area: into esebenzayo uma inalolo hlobo, kungenjalo eyengezwe kamuva yalolo hlobo. Uma kungekho lutho, ifomu lento entsha livuleka futhi akukho okwengezwayo uze ucindezele Enter futhi. Konke okukhethiwe kwengezwa ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukubekezelela kwesikhala Abadwetshi bashiya izikhala ezincane lapho imigqa kufanele ihlangane. Imigqa ixhumana uma izinhlangothi zayo zisondele kunokubekezelela kwesikhala. Siqala ngamaphoyinti angu-1.5 eshidini (kuboniswa ngamayunithi wesikali sesheet), futhi indilinga engamachashaza ngobubanzi obufanayo ilandela isikhombi, ihlale phezu kwesiphetho ngasinye sendlela ephansi kwayo. Isikhala ngasinye esixhunyiwe sizungezwa ngoluhlobo oluyiorenji endleleni ekhethiwe, nebha iyasibala. ] yenza ukubekezelela kube banzi, [ kube mncane. Indlela ekhethiwe ixhunywa kabusha masinyane ngokubekezelela okusha. Esihlanganweni indlela iqhubeka iqonde, ngendlela ephendukayo kancane, futhi ishiye igatsha. Okhiye Ukhiye noma isenzo Okwenzayo Chofoza Khetha indlela ephansi kwesikhombi, noma umbandela ozungezile. Shift + chofoza Engeza enye indlela noma umbandela kokukhethiwe. Tab Zama indlela elandelayo ephansi kwesikhombi, noma umbandela omkhulu olandelayo. Backspace noma Ctrl+Z Susa isigaba sokugcina endleleni ekhethwe ngokugcina, isigaba ngesigaba. Indlela engasasigaba lutho iyasuswa. Uma kungekho okukhethiwe, Ctrl+Z iwukuhlehlisa okuvamile. [ no-] Ukubekezelela kwesikhala okumncane nokubanzi. Enter Engeza amamaki. Esc Sula okukhethiwe. Okuhle ukukwazi Ijika esidwetshweni liyiketango lezingcezu ezimfishane ezigqamile, ngakho ubude balo buncane kancane kunalobo lejika langempela. Ukuze uthole ijika elinembile, linganisa ifayela lomdwebo ngqo (Linganisa kumdwebo). Isikhala esixhunyiwe sibalwa njengokuhamba okuqondile kuso, ngakho ububanzi bombandela ovaliwe buyisiqukatha. Kuphela ama-stroke nokugcwaliswa ezindleleni zalelo khasi ngokwalo kuyimigqa. Umbhalo odwetshwe njengezinhlamvu, nemifanekiso akuyona.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"measure-linear","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Linganisa imigqa emide","summary":"Thatha izindonga, imipayipi, ukugcina nobunye ubude njengemigqa emide, ngezigaba eziqondile, amajika kanye nokuncamelana kwe-Shift ye-45-degree.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["umugqa","ubude","umugqa omude","polyline","izindonga","lf","linear feet","ijika","igobolondo","45 degrees","ortho","snap","izigaba","polylength","khipha","ukuvuleka","umnyango","igebe","thayipha","othayiphiwe","izixhumanisi","ibanga","ibanga eliqondile","polar"],"headings":[{"id":"dweba-umugqa","text":"Dweba umugqa","level":2},{"id":"imigqa-eqondile-ngezinyathelo-ze-45","text":"Imigqa eqondile ngezinyathelo ze-45°","level":2},{"id":"amajika-nezindonga-ezijikelezayo","text":"Amajika nezindonga ezijikelezayo","level":2},{"id":"thayipha-ubude-nezixhumanisi","text":"Thayipha ubude nezixhumanisi","level":2},{"id":"khipha-ingxenye-yomugqa","text":"Khipha ingxenye yomugqa","level":2},{"id":"bheka-imininingwane-yomugqa","text":"Bheka imininingwane yomugqa","level":2},{"id":"lungisa-umugqa","text":"Lungisa umugqa","level":2},{"id":"indawo-yodonga","text":"Indawo yodonga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EInto ye-linear ilinganisa ubude. Umugqa ngamunye uyinketho yamaphoyinti: izigaba eziqondile, namajika lapho uvula imodi yejika. Into eyodwa ingaba nemigqa emingi kunoma yimuphi umbilo wamashidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphambi kokuqala: ishidi kudingeka isikali (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E) futhi udinga into ye-linear (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EDala izinto zokubala\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-PDF yevekthaza, izicofo zakho zincamelana nemigqa yomdwebo: amaphethelo, izinkomba nezindawo lapho zihlangana (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EUkuncamelana nemigqa yomdwebo\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakuvala).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-umugqa\"\u003EDweba umugqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa into ye-linear ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yamathuluzi, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa ukuqala komugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa ikhona ngalinye ngokulandelana. Ibha yesimo ibonisa &quot;Ubude&quot; (umugqa kuze kube sekugcineni, kuya ekhesini) kanye &quot;nesegimenti&quot; (isegimenti oyidwebayo), ngama-feet namaduma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQeda umugqa: cofa kabili iphoyinti lokugcina, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma cofa ngesokudla. Umugqa udwetshwa ngombala wento bese uba yimaki ekhethiwe. Ubude bento ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E nasethebhuleni le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E buyanda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lihlala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E, ngakho ungaqala omunye umugqa ngokushesha. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgenkathi udweba:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) isusa iphoyinti lokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilahla umugqa ongaqedile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkudonsa kushelelisa ishidi, nevili lisondeza, ngaphandle kokwengeza amaphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-trackpad ye-Mac, ukucofa ngesokudla kuyi-two-finger click (vula i-secondary click ku-System Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Trackpad). I-TakeoffCraft ifunda inkinobho yesibili kuphela, ngakho i-Control-click ingathathwa njengokucofa okuvamile futhi yengeze iphoyinti. Ukucofa kabili noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuqeda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKusikrini sokuthinta, thinta ukubeka amaphoyinti, donsa ngomunwe owodwa ukushelelisa, bese uhlanganisa ngamabili ukusondeza. Qeda ngokucindezela isikhathi eside, ngokuthinta kabili, noma ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni engaphansi kwesheet (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisa iphoyinti lokugcina). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/troubleshooting#touch-screens\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"touch-screens\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigqa-eqondile-ngezinyathelo-ze-45\"\u003EImigqa eqondile ngezinyathelo ze-45°\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lapho ubeka iphoyinti. Isegimenti esisuka ephointini lokugcina siyancamelana nendlela eseduze ka-0°, 45°, 90° noma 135°, sigcine ubude obudonsiwe kuwo. Ibha yesimo iyakukhumbuza: &quot;Shift ncamelanisa ibe ngu-45°&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEmodini yejika kusebenza lapho ijika liphela: i-chord yejika iya ezinyathelweni ze-45° kusukela lapho liqala. Iphoyinti ocofa kulo ejikeni alikaze lincamelaniswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amajika-nezindonga-ezijikelezayo\"\u003EAmajika nezindonga ezijikelezayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgenkathi udweba umugqa, beka iphoyinti lapho ijika liqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodi yejika: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yamathuluzi noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Inkinobho ihlala icindezelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa noma iliphi iphoyinti ejikeni, phakathi kwalo. Ibha yesimo yengeza &quot;(arc: click where it ends)&quot; futhi isibonelo siyagoba ngephoyinti lakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa lapho ijika liphela. Ijika lengezwa. Ubude balo buyubude beJika eliphelele, hhayi uchungechunge lwamachord amafushane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa iphoyinti elilandelayo ejikeni elilandelayo nokuphela kwalo ukuze uqhubeke udweba amajika, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi ubuyele kumasegimenti aqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuqala zilahla iphoyinti elilindile ejikeni; cindezela futhi ukuze ususe amaphoyinti njengejwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thayipha-ubude-nezixhumanisi\"\u003EThayipha ubude nezixhumanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEmva kwephoyinti lokuqala, ungathayipha lapho elilandelayo lizoya khona esikhundleni sokucofa. Thayipha inombolo, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E: ibhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E livula ebhareni yesimo ngalokho okuthayiphile. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubeka iphoyinti; ibhokisi lihlala livulekile elilandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThe next point goes\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; kusuka ephointini lokugcina, ngasepointer (yibheka indlela, bese uthayipha ubude)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; ku-45°, ibalwa ngokuphambene nokuzungeza kusukela ngakwesokunene kwesikrini (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E iya phezulu, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;-90\u003C/code\u003E iya phansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@6&#039;,-4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; ngakwesokunene nango-4&#039; ngaphansi kwephoyinti lokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E#6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; ngakwesokunene nango-4&#039; phezulu kusuka ephointini lokuqala lalo mugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbude buthayiphwa njengakho konke ku-TakeoffCraft (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EAmafomethi okufaka\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E (ngama-feet), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E. &quot;Ngakwesokunene&quot; nokuthi &quot;phezulu&quot; kusho njengoba ubona ishidi, ngisho nalapho ikhasi le-PDF liphendulwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ebhokisini elingenalutho iqeda umugqa, njengoba iqeda esheetini; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala ibhokisi futhi igcine umugqa uqhubeka. Amaphoyinti athayiphiwe adlula ezimisweni ezifanayo nezicofo: ukukhipha, amajika nokuvala indawo, konke kuyasebenza. Ibhokisi elifanayo lisebenza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E nase-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E; emva kwesikhungo sesiyingi lithatha irediyasi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khipha-ingxenye-yomugqa\"\u003EKhipha ingxenye yomugqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga oludlula umnyango noma ifasitele lesitolo lungadwetshwa ngqo bese kubalwa kuphela njengodonga: amasegimenti adlula ukuvuleka angu-\u003Cstrong\u003Eukukhipha\u003C/strong\u003E. Adwetshwa ngamachashazi futhi amancane, futhi awabalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgenkathi udweba:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeka iphoyinti lapho ukuvuleka kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yamathuluzi noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Inkinobho ihlala icindezelwe futhi ibha yesimo ithi amasegimenti alandelayo ngukukhipha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa lapho ukuvuleka kuphela khona. Isegimenti lidwetshwa ngamachashazi; &quot;Ubude&quot; ebhareni yesimo alufaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi uqhubeke ngendlela yodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEmva kokudweba: khetha umugqa. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E, isegimenti ngalinye linebhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E: likhethe ukuze ukhiphe leso segimenti, ulikhulule ukuze libalwe futhi. Lowo nalowo mshintsho uyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa uhlala unesegimenti eyodwa ebalwayo. Ipaneli bese ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EDeducts\u003C/strong\u003E (ubude obukhishiwe) no-\u003Cstrong\u003EDrawn\u003C/strong\u003E (umugqa wonke); \u003Cstrong\u003ELength\u003C/strong\u003E, inani lento, indawo yodonga kanye nezindleko zonke zisebenzisa ubude ngaphandle kokukhipha. Ukubuka kwe-3D kushiya igebe odongeni, i-PDF emakwe idweba okukhishiwe ngamachashazi, futhi ishidi elikhishiwe le-\u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E liyakuhlanganisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhambisa iphoyinti kugcina ukukhipha. Ukungeza noma ukususa amaphoyinti (ngokudweba umugqa kabusha) kuqala ngaphandle kwawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-imininingwane-yomugqa\"\u003EBheka imininingwane yomugqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese ucofa umugqa. \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokunene ibonisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einto eyiphethe (khetha enye into ye-linear ohlwini ukuze uyihambisele lapho),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eishidi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELength\u003C/strong\u003E ngama-feet namaduma nangama-LF,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einani lama-\u003Cstrong\u003ESegments\u003C/strong\u003E, kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EWall area\u003C/strong\u003E uma into inobude,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eubude besegimenti ngalinye, kune &quot;(arc)&quot; ngemva kwamajika, nebhokisi layo le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsheetini, isegimenti ngalinye somugqa okhethiwe libhalwe ubude bayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lungisa-umugqa\"\u003ELungisa umugqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa iphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha umugqa, bese udonsa esinye sezibambo zawo ezisikwele. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uncamelanise isegimenti oyihambisayo ibe ngu-45°. Ijika ligcina ukugoba kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoba ijika\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa okhethiwe ubonisa isibambo esijikelezayo maphakathi nejika ngalinye. Donsa: ijika lidlula lapho uyilethe khona, ngakho liyagoba kakhulu, kancane, noma ngenye indlela. Uma udonselwe emgqeni oqondile phakathi kwamaphethelo alo, liba yisegimenti eliqondile. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlehlisa (&quot;Bend arc&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa umugqa\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yamathuluzi ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; phinda nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwukwazi ukufaka iphoyinti phakathi komugqa okwamanje. Susa umugqa bese uwudweba kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indawo-yodonga\"\u003EIndawo yodonga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENika into ye-linear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). Iyabe ibika \u003Cstrong\u003EWall area (A)\u003C/strong\u003E = ubude × ukuphakama, ngama-SF (noma m² ngento ye-metric), futhi indawo yodonga iya ekholomini yamanothi okuthumela kwe-spreadsheet. Yisebenzise kuma-assemblies ebhodi, upende noma i-insulation: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EInhlanganisela nezifomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Into ye-linear ilinganisa ubude. Umugqa ngamunye uyinketho yamaphoyinti: izigaba eziqondile, namajika lapho uvula imodi yejika. Into eyodwa ingaba nemigqa emingi kunoma yimuphi umbilo wamashidi. Ngaphambi kokuqala: ishidi kudingeka isikali (Setha isikali) futhi udinga into ye-linear (Dala izinto zokubala). Ku-PDF yevekthaza, izicofo zakho zincamelana nemigqa yomdwebo: amaphethelo, izinkomba nezindawo lapho zihlangana (Ukuncamelana nemigqa yomdwebo; F3 iyakuvala). Dweba umugqa Cofa into ye-linear ngaphansi kwe-Items. Khetha Linear ebhareni yamathuluzi, noma cindezela L. Cofa ukuqala komugqa. Cofa ikhona ngalinye ngokulandelana. Ibha yesimo ibonisa \"Ubude\" (umugqa kuze kube sekugcineni, kuya ekhesini) kanye \"nesegimenti\" (isegimenti oyidwebayo), ngama-feet namaduma. Qeda umugqa: cofa kabili iphoyinti lokugcina, cindezela Enter, noma cofa ngesokudla. Umugqa udwetshwa ngombala wento bese uba yimaki ekhethiwe. Ubude bento ohlwini lwe-Items nasethebhuleni le-Quantities buyanda. Ithuluzi lihlala ku-Linear, ngakho ungaqala omunye umugqa ngokushesha. Cindezela Esc ukubuyela ku-Select. Ngenkathi udweba: Backspace (noma Delete) isusa iphoyinti lokugcina. Esc ilahla umugqa ongaqedile. Ukudonsa kushelelisa ishidi, nevili lisondeza, ngaphandle kokwengeza amaphoyinti. Ku-trackpad ye-Mac, ukucofa ngesokudla kuyi-two-finger click (vula i-secondary click ku-System Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Trackpad). I-TakeoffCraft ifunda inkinobho yesibili kuphela, ngakho i-Control-click ingathathwa njengokucofa okuvamile futhi yengeze iphoyinti. Ukucofa kabili noma Enter kuqeda njalo. Kusikrini sokuthinta, thinta ukubeka amaphoyinti, donsa ngomunwe owodwa ukushelelisa, bese uhlanganisa ngamabili ukusondeza. Qeda ngokucindezela isikhathi eside, ngokuthinta kabili, noma ngo-Finish ebhareni engaphansi kwesheet (Back ibuyisa iphoyinti lokugcina). Bona Ukuxazulula izinkinga. Imigqa eqondile ngezinyathelo ze-45° Bamba Shift lapho ubeka iphoyinti. Isegimenti esisuka ephointini lokugcina siyancamelana nendlela eseduze ka-0°, 45°, 90° noma 135°, sigcine ubude obudonsiwe kuwo. Ibha yesimo iyakukhumbuza: \"Shift ncamelanisa ibe ngu-45°\". Emodini yejika kusebenza lapho ijika liphela: i-chord yejika iya ezinyathelweni ze-45° kusukela lapho liqala. Iphoyinti ocofa kulo ejikeni alikaze lincamelaniswe. Amajika nezindonga ezijikelezayo Ngenkathi udweba umugqa, beka iphoyinti lapho ijika liqala. Vula imodi yejika: khetha Arc ebhareni yamathuluzi noma cindezela R. Inkinobho ihlala icindezelwe. Cofa noma iliphi iphoyinti ejikeni, phakathi kwalo. Ibha yesimo yengeza \"(arc: click where it ends)\" futhi isibonelo siyagoba ngephoyinti lakho. Cofa lapho ijika liphela. Ijika lengezwa. Ubude balo buyubude beJika eliphelele, hhayi uchungechunge lwamachord amafushane. Cofa iphoyinti elilandelayo ejikeni elilandelayo nokuphela kwalo ukuze uqhubeke udweba amajika, noma cindezela R futhi ubuyele kumasegimenti aqondile. Backspace noma Esc kuqala zilahla iphoyinti elilindile ejikeni; cindezela futhi ukuze ususe amaphoyinti njengejwayelekile. Thayipha ubude nezixhumanisi Emva kwephoyinti lokuqala, ungathayipha lapho elilandelayo lizoya khona esikhundleni sokucofa. Thayipha inombolo, @ noma #: ibhokisi le-Type livula ebhareni yesimo ngalokho okuthayiphile. Cindezela Enter ukubeka iphoyinti; ibhokisi lihlala livulekile elilandelayo. Type The next point goes 12'6\" 12'-6\" kusuka ephointini lokugcina, ngasepointer (yibheka indlela, bese uthayipha ubude) 12'6\"\u003C45 12'-6\" ku-45°, ibalwa ngokuphambene nokuzungeza kusukela ngakwesokunene kwesikrini (\u003C90 iya phezulu, \u003C-90 iya phansi) @6',-4' 6' ngakwesokunene nango-4' ngaphansi kwephoyinti lokugcina 6',4' (noma #6',4') 6' ngakwesokunene nango-4' phezulu kusuka ephointini lokuqala lalo mugqa Ubude buthayiphwa njengakho konke ku-TakeoffCraft (Amafomethi okufaka): 12'-6 1/2\", 12.5 (ngama-feet), 30\", 3.2 m. \"Ngakwesokunene\" nokuthi \"phezulu\" kusho njengoba ubona ishidi, ngisho nalapho ikhasi le-PDF liphendulwe. Enter ebhokisini elingenalutho iqeda umugqa, njengoba iqeda esheetini; Esc ivala ibhokisi futhi igcine umugqa uqhubeka. Amaphoyinti athayiphiwe adlula ezimisweni ezifanayo nezicofo: ukukhipha, amajika nokuvala indawo, konke kuyasebenza. Ibhokisi elifanayo lisebenza ku-Area nase-Cut-out; emva kwesikhungo sesiyingi lithatha irediyasi. Khipha ingxenye yomugqa Udonga oludlula umnyango noma ifasitele lesitolo lungadwetshwa ngqo bese kubalwa kuphela njengodonga: amasegimenti adlula ukuvuleka angu-ukukhipha. Adwetshwa ngamachashazi futhi amancane, futhi awabalwa. Ngenkathi udweba: Beka iphoyinti lapho ukuvuleka kuqala. Khetha Deduct ebhareni yamathuluzi noma cindezela E. Inkinobho ihlala icindezelwe futhi ibha yesimo ithi amasegimenti alandelayo ngukukhipha. Cofa lapho ukuvuleka kuphela khona. Isegimenti lidwetshwa ngamachashazi; \"Ubude\" ebhareni yesimo alufaki. Cindezela E futhi uqhubeke ngendlela yodonga. Emva kokudweba: khetha umugqa. Ngaphansi kwe-Selected mark, isegimenti ngalinye linebhokisi le-Deduct: likhethe ukuze ukhiphe leso segimenti, ulikhulule ukuze libalwe futhi. Lowo nalowo mshintsho uyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa. Umugqa uhlala unesegimenti eyodwa ebalwayo. Ipaneli bese ibonisa Deducts (ubude obukhishiwe) no-Drawn (umugqa wonke); Length, inani lento, indawo yodonga kanye nezindleko zonke zisebenzisa ubude ngaphandle kokukhipha. Ukubuka kwe-3D kushiya igebe odongeni, i-PDF emakwe idweba okukhishiwe ngamachashazi, futhi ishidi elikhishiwe le-Marks liyakuhlanganisa. Ukuhambisa iphoyinti kugcina ukukhipha. Ukungeza noma ukususa amaphoyinti (ngokudweba umugqa kabusha) kuqala ngaphandle kwawo. Bheka imininingwane yomugqa Khetha Select (V) bese ucofa umugqa. Selected mark ngakwesokunene ibonisa: into eyiphethe (khetha enye into ye-linear ohlwini ukuze uyihambisele lapho), ishidi, Length ngama-feet namaduma nangama-LF, inani lama-Segments, kanye ne-Wall area uma into inobude, ubude besegimenti ngalinye, kune \"(arc)\" ngemva kwamajika, nebhokisi layo le-Deduct. Esheetini, isegimenti ngalinye somugqa okhethiwe libhalwe ubude bayo. Lungisa umugqa Hambisa iphoyinti: khetha umugqa, bese udonsa esinye sezibambo zawo ezisikwele. Bamba Shift ukuze uncamelanise isegimenti oyihambisayo ibe ngu-45°. Ijika ligcina ukugoba kwalo. Goba ijika: umugqa okhethiwe ubonisa isibambo esijikelezayo maphakathi nejika ngalinye. Donsa: ijika lidlula lapho uyilethe khona, ngakho liyagoba kakhulu, kancane, noma ngenye indlela. Uma udonselwe emgqeni oqondile phakathi kwamaphethelo alo, liba yisegimenti eliqondile. Ctrl+Z iyahlehlisa (\"Bend arc\"). Susa umugqa: khetha bese ucindezela Delete, khetha Delete ebhareni yamathuluzi ngaphansi kwe-More, noma Delete mark ephaneli. Hlehlisa: Ctrl+Z; phinda nge-Ctrl+Y. Awukwazi ukufaka iphoyinti phakathi komugqa okwamanje. Susa umugqa bese uwudweba kabusha. Indawo yodonga Nika into ye-linear Height (isibonelo 9'-0\"). Iyabe ibika Wall area (A) = ubude × ukuphakama, ngama-SF (noma m² ngento ye-metric), futhi indawo yodonga iya ekholomini yamanothi okuthumela kwe-spreadsheet. Yisebenzise kuma-assemblies ebhodi, upende noma i-insulation: bona Inhlanganisela nezifomula.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"show-lengths-in-meters","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bonisa ubude ngamamitha","summary":"Funda ubude ngamamitha, ngosentimitha noma ngamamilimitha esikhundleni se-feet-inches, futhi ubone izindawo ngo-m2.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["amamitha","amamitha","sentimitha","amamilimitha","semethrikhi","bonisa ubude njenge","landela okujwayelekile","amayunithi","ukubonisa","m2","amamitha ayisikwele","indawo yodonga","feet-inches","izinga lokushisa","celsius"],"headings":[{"id":"lokho-ozokwenza","text":"Lokho ozokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"lokho-ozokwenza\"\u003ELokho ozokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha indlela i-TakeoffCraft ebonisa ngayo ubude, ukuze iphrojekthi yemethrikhi ifundeke ngamamitha, ngosentimitha noma ngamamilimitha eshidini, ebhalweni lesimo nakumaphaneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E ngegiya ebhala lokusebenza noma ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bese uhlala ethebhini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow lengths as\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeet-inches\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm noma mm. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow Global\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa iyunithi yobude yemethrikhi ephawulwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E, futhi ifiti namayintshi uma kungekho lutho oluphawulwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka eshidini: ubude ebhalweni lesimo, ohlwini lwezinto nasemaphaneli manje bufundeka ngeyunithi okhethile. Ukuphakama, ukujula, ukuqina nezingqimba nakho kuyashintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ufunde izinga lokushisa lezinto ngamadigri C noma F, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow temperatures as\u003C/span\u003E kuleyo thebhu efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubonisa kuphela kuyashintsha. Amanani, izindleko nokuthunyelwa kubalwa ngobude obunembile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInombolo engenayo ichazwe esikhaleni sokuphakama ifundwa ngeyunithi okhonjisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha kwe-1/16, 1/8 ne-1/4 yenshi kuvela kuphela kwe-feet-inches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo elinganiswe ngento yemethrikhi ithi m2 edrowingeni, emaphaneli wezimaki nakuthebula. Umugqa wokuqondile onokuphakama nawo ubonisa indawo yodonga lwawo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lokho ozokwenza Shintsha indlela i-TakeoffCraft ebonisa ngayo ubude, ukuze iphrojekthi yemethrikhi ifundeke ngamamitha, ngosentimitha noma ngamamilimitha eshidini, ebhalweni lesimo nakumaphaneli. Izinyathelo Vula Settings ngegiya ebhala lokusebenza noma ngo-Ctrl+,, bese uhlala ethebhini le-TakeoffCraft. Thola Show lengths as bese ukhetha Feet-inches, m, cm noma mm. Follow Global isebenzisa iyunithi yobude yemethrikhi ephawulwe ku-Settings › Global › Units, futhi ifiti namayintshi uma kungekho lutho oluphawulwe. Bheka eshidini: ubude ebhalweni lesimo, ohlwini lwezinto nasemaphaneli manje bufundeka ngeyunithi okhethile. Ukuphakama, ukujula, ukuqina nezingqimba nakho kuyashintsha. Ukuze ufunde izinga lokushisa lezinto ngamadigri C noma F, khetha Show temperatures as kuleyo thebhu efanayo. Amanothi Ukubonisa kuphela kuyashintsha. Amanani, izindleko nokuthunyelwa kubalwa ngobude obunembile. Inombolo engenayo ichazwe esikhaleni sokuphakama ifundwa ngeyunithi okhonjisiwe. Ukukhetha kwe-1/16, 1/8 ne-1/4 yenshi kuvela kuphela kwe-feet-inches. Indawo elinganiswe ngento yemethrikhi ithi m2 edrowingeni, emaphaneli wezimaki nakuthebula. Umugqa wokuqondile onokuphakama nawo ubonisa indawo yodonga lwawo. Bona Amayunithi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sign-off-the-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amarethi asalahlekile nokusayina isilinganiso sezindleko","summary":"Bona ukuthi yimaphi amagatsha esilinganiso sezindleko anenani kodwa engenarethi, sayina isilinganiso sezindleko ngegama lakho ukuze ifayela lirekhode ubani, nini nesamba esiyisona, bese uchofoza inani ukuze ukhethe izimaki ezalisuka kuzo.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["isilinganiso sezindleko","sayina","ukusayina","savunyelwe","vuma","ukuvuma","irethi elingekho","akukho rethi","ingabhalwa","irethi","isamba","umbuzi wezindleko","irekhodi","ukuhlola","khetha izimaki","inani","landela"],"headings":[{"id":"lokho-ozokwenza","text":"Lokho ozokwenza","level":2},{"id":"amagatsha-angenarethi","text":"Amagatsha angenarethi","level":2},{"id":"sayina-isilinganiso-sezindleko","text":"Sayina isilinganiso sezindleko","level":2},{"id":"chofoza-inani-ukuze-ubone-lapho-lisuka-khona","text":"Chofoza inani ukuze ubone lapho lisuka khona","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"lokho-ozokwenza\"\u003ELokho ozokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola ukuthi wonke amagatsha esilinganiso sezindleko anentengo, bese usayina ngegama lakho. Ifayela lomkhiqizo lirekhoda ubani osayine, nini, nesamba esiyisona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amagatsha-angenarethi\"\u003EAmagatsha angenarethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By item\u003C/strong\u003E, igatsha elinenani kodwa elingenarethi yempahla noma yokusebenza liphathwa njenge \u003Cstrong\u003Eno rate\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi ibha ephezu kwethebula itshela ukuthi zingaki. Igatsha elinjalo alingezi lutho esamanisweni. Into engenarethi yayo ayiphawulwa uma enye yezingxenye zayo inentengo: inhlanganisela ibalwa ngentengo yezingxenye zayo. Isilinganiso sezindleko esithunyelwe sithi \u003Cstrong\u003ENo rate\u003C/strong\u003E kwikholomu yamanothi kowonke amagatsha anjalo futhi siyababala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sayina-isilinganiso-sezindleko\"\u003ESayina isilinganiso sezindleko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003ESayina isilinganiso sezindleko\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphezu kwethebula le-Quantities.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxoxo ichaza isamba osayina nohlu lwamagatsha anganarethi. Thayipha igama lakho futhi, uma uthanda, indima yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003ESayina\u003C/strong\u003E. Ibha manje ithi &quot;Savunyelwe ngu-… ngomhla …&quot; nesamba. Londoloza ukubala amanani ukuze ukugcine efayelini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsayina lihlobene nezibalo osezisayinile. Noma iyiphi inguquko emuva ekuneni, enyeni noma egatsheni isusa isayina, futhi i-TakeoffCraft iyakutshela. Ukuhlehlisa kubuyisela isilinganiso osisayinile, nesayina laso kanye naso. Ukuqamba kabusha igatsha akuyona inguquko yesibalo. \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa isayina\u003C/strong\u003E ulisusa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lokubala amanani elihlelwe ngaphandle kwe-TakeoffCraft ngemva kokusayinwa livulwa ngaphandle kwesayina, nenothi elisho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsilinganiso sezindleko esithunyelwe (CSV ne-XLSX) sibhala isayina ngaphansi kwamasamanisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmuntu kuphela ayisayina. Umsizi we-AI ungabona ukuthi isilinganiso sezindleko sesayinisiwe yini nokuthi yimaphi amarethi asalahlekile; ayinayo indlela yokusayina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chofoza-inani-ukuze-ubone-lapho-lisuka-khona\"\u003EChofoza inani ukuze ubone lapho lisuka khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza inani lenani noma lemali yegatsha ukuze ukhethe izimaki elisuka kuzo. Uma zisesheethini elinye, leyo shidi iyavulwa. Chofoza inani lomugqa we-\u003Cstrong\u003EJob total\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ukhethe zonke izimaki eshidini. Inani elithayiphiwe alinazo izimaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsayinairekhoda igama njengoba lithayiphiwe. Ilogo efayelini, hhayi isayini kagesi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma amaphakheji ebhidi enikezwe abakhandisi noma ama-alternate akhona ekubalweni kwamanani, isamba esisayinwe yisibhidi esiyisisekelo esibonakala njenge \u003Cstrong\u003EJob total\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lokho ozokwenza Hlola ukuthi wonke amagatsha esilinganiso sezindleko anentengo, bese usayina ngegama lakho. Ifayela lomkhiqizo lirekhoda ubani osayine, nini, nesamba esiyisona. Amagatsha angenarethi Ku-Quantities › By item, igatsha elinenani kodwa elingenarethi yempahla noma yokusebenza liphathwa njenge no rate, futhi ibha ephezu kwethebula itshela ukuthi zingaki. Igatsha elinjalo alingezi lutho esamanisweni. Into engenarethi yayo ayiphawulwa uma enye yezingxenye zayo inentengo: inhlanganisela ibalwa ngentengo yezingxenye zayo. Isilinganiso sezindleko esithunyelwe sithi No rate kwikholomu yamanothi kowonke amagatsha anjalo futhi siyababala. Sayina isilinganiso sezindleko Chofoza Sayina isilinganiso sezindleko ngaphezu kwethebula le-Quantities. Ingxoxo ichaza isamba osayina nohlu lwamagatsha anganarethi. Thayipha igama lakho futhi, uma uthanda, indima yakho. Chofoza Sayina. Ibha manje ithi \"Savunyelwe ngu-… ngomhla …\" nesamba. Londoloza ukubala amanani ukuze ukugcine efayelini. Isayina lihlobene nezibalo osezisayinile. Noma iyiphi inguquko emuva ekuneni, enyeni noma egatsheni isusa isayina, futhi i-TakeoffCraft iyakutshela. Ukuhlehlisa kubuyisela isilinganiso osisayinile, nesayina laso kanye naso. Ukuqamba kabusha igatsha akuyona inguquko yesibalo. Susa isayina ulisusa. Ifayela lokubala amanani elihlelwe ngaphandle kwe-TakeoffCraft ngemva kokusayinwa livulwa ngaphandle kwesayina, nenothi elisho lokho. Isilinganiso sezindleko esithunyelwe (CSV ne-XLSX) sibhala isayina ngaphansi kwamasamanisa. Umuntu kuphela ayisayina. Umsizi we-AI ungabona ukuthi isilinganiso sezindleko sesayinisiwe yini nokuthi yimaphi amarethi asalahlekile; ayinayo indlela yokusayina. Chofoza inani ukuze ubone lapho lisuka khona Chofoza inani lenani noma lemali yegatsha ukuze ukhethe izimaki elisuka kuzo. Uma zisesheethini elinye, leyo shidi iyavulwa. Chofoza inani lomugqa we-Job total ukuze ukhethe zonke izimaki eshidini. Inani elithayiphiwe alinazo izimaki. Okuhle ukukwazi Isayinairekhoda igama njengoba lithayiphiwe. Ilogo efayelini, hhayi isayini kagesi. Uma amaphakheji ebhidi enikezwe abakhandisi noma ama-alternate akhona ekubalweni kwamanani, isamba esisayinwe yisibhidi esiyisisekelo esibonakala njenge Job total.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"draw-arcs-ten-methods","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dweba amajika ngezindlela eziyishumi","summary":"Khetha indlela yokudweba ijika: amaphoyinti amathathu, noma isiqalo, isikhungo, isiphetho, i-engeli, ubude, isiqondiso noma iradiyasi.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["ijika","amajika","igobolondo","udonga oluphindekile","3-point","iradiyasi","i-engeli","ubude besoka","isiqondiso","isikhungo","isiqalo","isiphetho","indlela yejika"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba umphetho ogobile emugqeni, endaweni noma embobweni, usebenzisa indlela yejika ehambisana nobukhulu obunawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQala umugqa, umphetho noma imbobo bese ubeka iphoyinti lapho igobolondo liqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela ye-Arc\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni leshidi. Ibonakala kuphela ngenkathi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe. Khetha 3-Point, Start, Center, End, Start, Center, Angle, Start, Center, Length, Start, End, Angle, Start, End, Direction, Start, End, Radius, Center, Start, End, Center, Start, Angle noma Center, Start, Length.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELandela ibha yesimo. Itshela ukuthi lindeni: isikhungo, iphoyinti lokuphela, i-engeli, ubude, isiqondiso noma iradiyasi. Chofoza iphoyinti, noma uthayiphe inombolo (i-engeli, ubude, iradiyasi nesiqondiso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma inkinobho yokugcina inikeziwe, ijika lingezwa emugqeni. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhansela ijika, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela isinyathelo sayo sokugcina, no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vala i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIjika liyenqatshwa, nomlayezo kwibha yesimo, uma amaphoyinti ayo ehlanganyela noma eme eqondile, noma uma iradiyasi ingafiki kuphoyinti lokuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbude bayo ubude bejika ngqo, futhi amafayela endala avulwa ngendlela efanayo. Okwengeziwe: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003ELinganisa imigqa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba umphetho ogobile emugqeni, endaweni noma embobweni, usebenzisa indlela yejika ehambisana nobukhulu obunawo. Izinyathelo Qala umugqa, umphetho noma imbobo bese ubeka iphoyinti lapho igobolondo liqala. Vula Ijika ethuluzini noma cindezela R. Vula Indlela ye-Arc ebhalweni leshidi. Ibonakala kuphela ngenkathi i-Ijika ivuliwe. Khetha 3-Point, Start, Center, End, Start, Center, Angle, Start, Center, Length, Start, End, Angle, Start, End, Direction, Start, End, Radius, Center, Start, End, Center, Start, Angle noma Center, Start, Length. Landela ibha yesimo. Itshela ukuthi lindeni: isikhungo, iphoyinti lokuphela, i-engeli, ubude, isiqondiso noma iradiyasi. Chofoza iphoyinti, noma uthayiphe inombolo (i-engeli, ubude, iradiyasi nesiqondiso). Uma inkinobho yokugcina inikeziwe, ijika lingezwa emugqeni. Esc ikhansela ijika, Backspace ibuyisela isinyathelo sayo sokugcina, no-R vala i-Ijika. Amanothi Ijika liyenqatshwa, nomlayezo kwibha yesimo, uma amaphoyinti ayo ehlanganyela noma eme eqondile, noma uma iradiyasi ingafiki kuphoyinti lokuphela. Ubude bayo ubude bejika ngqo, futhi amafayela endala avulwa ngendlela efanayo. Okwengeziwe: Linganisa imigqa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"office-layout","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Isakhiwo sehhovisi: ukuhlelwa, izifinyezo, isihloko namakhanda kusuka kuMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo\"","summary":"Vula i-add-on yeMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo, bese isilinganiso, amanani ngeshidi, okuthunyelwayo nalokho umsizi akufundayo kuthatha isakhiwo sohlu lwehhovisi lakho, ohlu olufanayo lwe-BimCraft oluthathayo.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["isakhiwo sehhovisi","isimo sehhovisi","imigomo yokuzenzakalelayo","okwengeziwe","isakhiwo sohlu","hlanganisa ngohlobo","hlanganisa ngeshidi","isifinyezo","izifinyezo","isihloko","amakhanda","amakhapitali","isakhiwo sesilinganiso","isakhiwo sokuthumela","izilungiselelo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okuthinta-isakhiwo","text":"Okuthinta isakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"okugcinayo-kwazo","text":"Okugcinayo kwazo","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza i-TakeoffCraft ilungise amatafula ayo njengoba ehhovisi lakho ezikhipha, ngaphandle kokusetha kuwo wonke ukubala. Isakhiwo sisethwa kanye, kuMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo, futhi sisebenza kuzo zonke izinhlelo kule kompyutha: lokho osethe ku-BimCraft noma ku-CadCraft kusetshenziswa yi-TakeoffCraft, nakuhle kwalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe\u003C/strong\u003E bese uvula \u003Cstrong\u003EImigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/strong\u003E. Ivalekile kuze kube yilapho uyivula; uma ivaliwe noma kungekho lutho olusethiwe, i-TakeoffCraft ifana nangaphambili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Imigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/strong\u003E bese uthola \u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo sohlu (isimo sehhovisi)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmgomo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenziwa yi-TakeoffCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela amashedyuli ngo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E luhlela isilinganiso ngohlobo lwento (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga\u003C/strong\u003E lihlela amanani ngeshidi ngeshidi lawo. \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho ukuhlelwa\u003C/strong\u003E kushiya kokubili kungahlelwanga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzifinyezo kumashedyuli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsifinyezo ngaphansi kwesigaba ngasinye nesamba\u003C/strong\u003E wengeza isifinyezo ngaphansi kwesigaba ngasinye. Isamba somsebenzi sihlala sikhona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsihloko sohlu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa ngaphezu kwetafula, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E{schedule}: office layout\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhanda wekholomu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengoba kubhalwe, NGAMAKHAPITALI noma Ngamakhapitali Aqala Ngawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala Izilungiselelo. Amatafula alandela masinyane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuthinta-isakhiwo\"\u003EOkuthinta isakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanani › Ngento\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003ENgeshidi\u003C/strong\u003E: amakhanda wamaqembu, isifinyezo ngaphansi kweqembu ngalinye, isihloko kanye nendlela yamakhanda. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesihloko utshela ukuthi yiziphi izingxenye umgomo wehhovisi owazisetha. Imigqa iyimigqa efanayo: usaphuma izintengo nokulahleka kuyo, futhi uchofoze izibalo ukuze ukhethe amamaki azo. Ingxenye noma isimo sesibili sihlala ngaphansi kwento yaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinganiso esithunyelwe\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV ne-XLSX): amaqembu nezifinyezo ezifanayo. Kwi-workbook isifinyezo yi-formula ye-\u003Ccode\u003ESUBTOTAL\u003C/code\u003E ngaphezu kweqembu lawo, nesamba sepulojekthi nso, ngakho akukho okubalwa kabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkufundwa ngumsizi\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E (ngeshidi) bayengeza ibhlokhi ye-\u003Ccode\u003Elayout\u003C/code\u003E enamaqembu, imigqa nezifinyezo, bese bethi yiziphi izingxenye ehhovisi elizisethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okugcinayo-kwazo\"\u003EOkugcinayo kwazo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanani › Ngendawo\u003C/strong\u003E awukwenzi ukuhlelwa kwayo kabusha, futhi iyayigcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsamba sepulojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E, izengezo zesifinyezo sethenda kanye nokungakhethwa akuhlelwa kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlelwa okungenayo ikholomu etafuleni kushiywa: isilinganiso asinawo uleveli, namanani ngeshidi aginywe uhlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigomo igcinwa kule bhrawuza kuwo wonke ama-app e-CadCraft futhi ihamba nefayela leMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo (\u003Cstrong\u003EGcina kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003ELayisha kufayela\u003C/strong\u003E endaweni efanayo), ukuze ihhovisi lilabelane ngefayela elilodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsilinganiso esithunyelwe njenge-CSV esinamaqembu silokho sokufunda. Ukuze ulethe isilinganiso emuva njengomtapo wezintengo, sithumele ngaphandle kokuhlelwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimo sase-BimCraft salo misebenzi: amashedyuli, izilungiselelo nokuthunyelwa. I-TakeoffCraft ayinayo imigomo yayo okwamanje, ngakho azikho izigaba zeMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo › TakeoffCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza i-TakeoffCraft ilungise amatafula ayo njengoba ehhovisi lakho ezikhipha, ngaphandle kokusetha kuwo wonke ukubala. Isakhiwo sisethwa kanye, kuMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo, futhi sisebenza kuzo zonke izinhlelo kule kompyutha: lokho osethe ku-BimCraft noma ku-CadCraft kusetshenziswa yi-TakeoffCraft, nakuhle kwalokho. Izinyathelo Vula Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe bese uvula Imigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo. Ivalekile kuze kube yilapho uyivula; uma ivaliwe noma kungekho lutho olusethiwe, i-TakeoffCraft ifana nangaphambili. Vula Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Imigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo bese uthola Isakhiwo sohlu (isimo sehhovisi): Umgomo Okwenziwa yi-TakeoffCraft Hlela amashedyuli ngo Uhlobo luhlela isilinganiso ngohlobo lwento (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). Izinga lihlela amanani ngeshidi ngeshidi lawo. Igumbi no-Akukho ukuhlelwa kushiya kokubili kungahlelwanga Izifinyezo kumashedyuli Isifinyezo ngaphansi kwesigaba ngasinye nesamba wengeza isifinyezo ngaphansi kwesigaba ngasinye. Isamba somsebenzi sihlala sikhona Isihloko sohlu Umugqa ngaphezu kwetafula, isibonelo {schedule}: office layout Amakhanda wekholomu Njengoba kubhalwe, NGAMAKHAPITALI noma Ngamakhapitali Aqala Ngawo Vala Izilungiselelo. Amatafula alandela masinyane. Okuthinta isakhiwo Amanani › Ngento no-Ngeshidi: amakhanda wamaqembu, isifinyezo ngaphansi kweqembu ngalinye, isihloko kanye nendlela yamakhanda. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesihloko utshela ukuthi yiziphi izingxenye umgomo wehhovisi owazisetha. Imigqa iyimigqa efanayo: usaphuma izintengo nokulahleka kuyo, futhi uchofoze izibalo ukuze ukhethe amamaki azo. Ingxenye noma isimo sesibili sihlala ngaphansi kwento yaso. Isilinganiso esithunyelwe (CSV ne-XLSX): amaqembu nezifinyezo ezifanayo. Kwi-workbook isifinyezo yi-formula ye-SUBTOTAL ngaphezu kweqembu lawo, nesamba sepulojekthi nso, ngakho akukho okubalwa kabili. Okufundwa ngumsizi: takeoff_estimate no-takeoff_quantities (ngeshidi) bayengeza ibhlokhi ye-layout enamaqembu, imigqa nezifinyezo, bese bethi yiziphi izingxenye ehhovisi elizisethe. Okugcinayo kwazo Amanani › Ngendawo awukwenzi ukuhlelwa kwayo kabusha, futhi iyayigcina. Isamba sepulojekthi, izengezo zesifinyezo sethenda kanye nokungakhethwa akuhlelwa kabusha. Ukuhlelwa okungenayo ikholomu etafuleni kushiywa: isilinganiso asinawo uleveli, namanani ngeshidi aginywe uhlobo. Okuhle ukukwazi Imigomo igcinwa kule bhrawuza kuwo wonke ama-app e-CadCraft futhi ihamba nefayela leMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo (Gcina kufayela / Layisha kufayela endaweni efanayo), ukuze ihhovisi lilabelane ngefayela elilodwa. Isilinganiso esithunyelwe njenge-CSV esinamaqembu silokho sokufunda. Ukuze ulethe isilinganiso emuva njengomtapo wezintengo, sithumele ngaphandle kokuhlelwa. Isimo sase-BimCraft salo misebenzi: amashedyuli, izilungiselelo nokuthunyelwa. I-TakeoffCraft ayinayo imigomo yayo okwamanje, ngakho azikho izigaba zeMigomo Yokuzenzakalelayo ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo › TakeoffCraft.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"follow-a-teammate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Landela umuntu ohlanganyela esikhathini se-Live","summary":"Bona ubani osesikhathini, ayenzani, futhi uhambise ukubuka kwakho kanye nokwakhe.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["landela","live","uhlu lwabantu","ikilasi","abahlanganyeli","ukukhona","isikhombisi","isikhathi","cela wonke umuntu andilandele","ukufundisa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenzeka","text":"Okuzokwenzeka","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenzeka\"\u003EOkuzokwenzeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikhathini se-Live, bona ithuluzi neshidi lomuntu ngamunye, bese uhambisa ukubuka kwakho ngokukalandela komunye wabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQala noma ujoyine isikhathi se-Live kusuka ku-CadCraft Studio. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/work-live\"\u003ESebenza ngokuqondile nabanye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbantu\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uvule uhlu lwabantu. Umugqa ngamunye unombala womuntu negama lakhe, ithuluzi ayisebenzisayo, ishidi aliphethe, nesikhathi sokuhlelwa kwakhe kokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandela\u003C/span\u003E egameni. Ukubuka kwakho kuhamba nokwakhe, futhi ibha ikutshela ukuthi uyamlandela; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iyayiyeka. Ukuhambisa noma ukusondeza ngokwakho nakho kuyayiyeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENjengomphathi, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECela wonke umuntu andilandele\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini ukuze abanye bakucele ukuthi bakulandele. Bazothola ibha enokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandela\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYeka ukucela wonke umuntu ukuthi andilandele\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyeke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma umuntu esheshini elinye, ibha ithi liphi. Uma ukubuka kwakhe kungelandelwa kokwakho, ithi nalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhona kwabantu akugcinwa ekubaleni noma kuhlehliso lomuntu ngamunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenzeka Esikhathini se-Live, bona ithuluzi neshidi lomuntu ngamunye, bese uhambisa ukubuka kwakho ngokukalandela komunye wabo. Izinyathelo Qala noma ujoyine isikhathi se-Live kusuka ku-CadCraft Studio. Bheka Sebenza ngokuqondile nabanye. Khetha inkinobho ethi Abantu ukuze uvule uhlu lwabantu. Umugqa ngamunye unombala womuntu negama lakhe, ithuluzi ayisebenzisayo, ishidi aliphethe, nesikhathi sokuhlelwa kwakhe kokugcina. Khetha Landela egameni. Ukubuka kwakho kuhamba nokwakhe, futhi ibha ikutshela ukuthi uyamlandela; Misa iyayiyeka. Ukuhambisa noma ukusondeza ngokwakho nakho kuyayiyeka. Njengomphathi, khetha Cela wonke umuntu andilandele ohlwini ukuze abanye bakucele ukuthi bakulandele. Bazothola ibha enokuthi Landela. Khetha Yeka ukucela wonke umuntu ukuthi andilandele ukuze uyeke. Amanothi Uma umuntu esheshini elinye, ibha ithi liphi. Uma ukubuka kwakhe kungelandelwa kokwakho, ithi nalokho. Ukukhona kwabantu akugcinwa ekubaleni noma kuhlehliso lomuntu ngamunye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"measure-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Linganisa izindawo nemibobo","summary":"Phonononga amafloor, amasilingi nezilabhu, sike izimbobo kuzo, engeza imiphetho ejikelezayo, amasongo nemibobo ezungezile, bese ufunda indawo nomjikelezo.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["ukugcwalisa igumbi","flood fill","paint bucket","cofa ngaphakathi kwegumbi","indawo ezenzakalelayo","back-out","backout","insika","shaft","khipha kwezinto eziningi","indawo","polygon","outline","square feet","sf","cut-out","imbobo","khipha","isiyingi","okuzungezile","ijika","perimeter","iphansi","isileyili","islebhu"],"headings":[{"id":"phonononga-indawo","text":"Phonononga indawo","level":2},{"id":"imiphetho-ejikelezayo","text":"Imiphetho ejikelezayo","level":2},{"id":"isiyingi","text":"Isiyingi","level":2},{"id":"gcwalisa-igumbi-ngokucofa-kanye","text":"Gcwalisa igumbi ngokucofa kanye","level":2},{"id":"sika-imbobo-endaweni","text":"Sika imbobo endaweni","level":2},{"id":"ukukhipha-kwezinto-eziningi-izinsika-ama-shaft-nezimbobo","text":"Ukukhipha kwezinto eziningi: izinsika, ama-shaft nezimbobo","level":2},{"id":"funda-indawo","text":"Funda indawo","level":2},{"id":"lungisa-indawo","text":"Lungisa indawo","level":2},{"id":"ukujula-kuma-volume","text":"Ukujula kuma-volume","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EInto yendawo ilinganisa indawo evaliwe. Umugqa ngamunye ungaba nezimbobo ezisikwe kuwo (i-shaft, insika, ipulanta), nemiphetho yawo ingaba eqondile noma ejikelezayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphambi kokuqala: ishidi kudingeka isikali (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E) futhi udinga into yendawo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EDala izinto zokubala\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phonononga-indawo\"\u003EPhonononga indawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa into yendawo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yamathuluzi, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa ikhona ngalinye legumbi noma leslebhu ngokulandelana. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngamaphethelo angu-0°, 45° kanye no-90°. Kusukela ephointini lesithathu, umugqa uyagcwaliseka, futhi ibha yesimo ibonisa &quot;Indawo&quot; kanye &quot;nomjikelezo&quot;. Indilinga encane ivela izungeze iphoyinti lokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala umugqa: cofa iphoyinti lokuqala (ngaphakathi endilingeni yalo), cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, cofa kabili, noma cofa ngesokudla. Indawo igcwaliswa kancane ngombala wento, ibhalwe ngezikwele zayo ze-feet, bese ibe yimaki ekhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa ikhona lokugcina; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilahla umugqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa oziqhumayo uyenqatshwa: &quot;Umugqa uziqhumile, ngakho indawo yawo izoba engalungile. Wudweba futhi ungaziqhumi.&quot; Dweba indawo efana nesibalo esingu-8 njengezindawo ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imiphetho-ejikelezayo\"\u003EImiphetho ejikelezayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgenkathi uphonononga, vula imodi yejika (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Emva kwekhona, cofa iphoyinti emgqeni wejika, bese ucofa lapho ijika liphela. Ukuvala umugqa ngejika, yenza leso sicofo sokugcina ephointini lokuqala. Indawo nomjikelezo kusebenzisa ijika eliqondile. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi ukuze uthole imiphetho eqondile. Ukuguqula ijika ngemva kwalokho, khetha indawo bese udonsa isibambo esizungezile esiphakathi nejika. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003ELinganisa imigqa emide\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiyingi\"\u003EIsiyingi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgento yendawo, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa isikhungo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa noma iliphi iphoyinti emaphethelweni. Ngenkathi uhambisa, ibha yesimo ibonisa irediyasi nendawo. Isiyingi sengezwa njengemaki yendawo enendawo eqondile nomjikelezo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcwalisa-igumbi-ngokucofa-kanye\"\u003EGcwalisa igumbi ngokucofa kanye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma amagumbi edwetshwe njengezindonga ezivaliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ithatha ifloor ngokucofa kanye:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into yendawo (isibonelo ifinishi lefloor) bese unikeza ishidi isikali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa ngaphakathi kwegumbi, endaweni evulekile (hhayi emugqeni noma kulebula).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ifunda imigqa yeshidi, ithole isikhala esizungeze ukucofa bese ilinganisa ngokulandela izindonga zangaphakathi, njengendawo yento yamanje. Ukuvulwa kwemnyango kuya kuthi \u003Cstrong\u003E4&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E kuthathwa njengokuvaliwe, ngakho umugqa uqonda ngqo phezu komnyango; \u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo › TakeoffCraft › Room fill closes openings up to\u003C/strong\u003E iguqula lobubanzi (3&#039;-0&quot; kuya ku-8&#039;-0&quot;). Amagama amagumbi, izinto zasendlini kanye nezixhobo ngaphakathi akwenzi izimbobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIyenqaba, isho ngenxa yalutho, uma:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukucofa kumugqa (&quot;Lokho kusemgqeni&quot;);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisikhala asivaliwe: ukuvulwa okubanzi kunesilungiselelo kuvumela ukuthi kuphume kumphetho weshidi. Phakamisa isilungiselelo, noma linganisa leligumbi ngesandla nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisikhala sincane kakhulu (isimbulo, hhayi igumbi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma umnyango ubanzi kunesilungiselelo, ukugcwaliswa kungena egumbini elilandelayo bese kuphonononga bobabili ndawonye: hlehlisa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), phakamisa isilungiselelo, bese ucofa futhi. Hlola umugqa njengendawo nanoma iyiphi: donsa amakhona ukuze uwulungise. Ishidi eliskenwe lisebenza ngendlela efanayo, kodwa imigqa yalo kufanele ibe mnyama ngokwanele; imigqa egreyi ekhanyayo ingenza ukugcwaliswa kungame.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-imbobo-endaweni\"\u003ESika imbobo endaweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese ucofa indawo. Iveza izibambo ezisikwele emakhoneni ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yamathuluzi (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a cut-out\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa amakhona embobo, ngaphakathi endaweni. Imodi yejika isebenza nalapha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYivale njengendawo: cofa iphoyinti layo lokuqala, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, cofa kabili, noma cofa ngesokudla. Imbobo ishiywe ingagcwaliswanga, nebha yesimo ithi &quot;Imbobo yengeziwe. Dweba enye, noma cindezela Esc.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba ezinye izimbobo endaweni efanayo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbobo ezungezile: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a round cut-out\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E, cofa isikhungo sayo, bese ucofa iphoyinti emaphethelweni ayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbobo kufanele ihlale ngokuphelele endaweni futhi ingagqumi enye imbobo. Uma kungenjalo, i-TakeoffCraft iyenqaba: &quot;Imbobo kufanele ihlale ngokuphelele endaweni.&quot; noma &quot;Imibobo ayikwazi ukugqumana.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkususa imbobo yokugcina, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove last cut-out\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhipha-kwezinto-eziningi-izinsika-ama-shaft-nezimbobo\"\u003EUkukhipha kwezinto eziningi: izinsika, ama-shaft nezimbobo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImbobo ingumaki wendawo oyodwa. \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out\u003C/strong\u003E idwetshwa kanye bese ikhishwa kuyo yonke indawo ehlangana nayo, kwizinto ozikhethile: dweba izinsika kanye, zikhishwe ku-floor finish, esileyilini nasekuslebhuleni ndawonye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza into yendawo yazo, njengo &quot;Izinsika&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzilungiselelweni zento, thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out: its marks take their area out of other items\u003C/strong\u003E. Uhlu lwezinye izinto zendawo luyavela, zonke zithikiwe: susa ukuthikwa kwezo ezingafanele ukuthintwa yi-back-out (isibonelo upende wezindonga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThatha ama-back-out ngokusebenzisa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E, njengoba kujwayelekile. Ngayinye idwetshwa ngamachashazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke imaki yendawo yento ethikiwe esheetini efanayo ilahlekelwa yingxenye ye-back-out eyihlangana nayo: i-back-out yonke uma ingaphakathi, ingxenye ehlangana kuphela uma idlula emphethelweni, nalutho ngaphakathi kwembobo. Ipaneli yendawo ekhethiwe ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-outs\u003C/strong\u003E nendawo esele. Inani lento, izifomula zayo zenhlanganisela, izindleko, ukubuka kwe-3D nokuthunyelwa konke kusebenzisa indawo esele; amanothi okulinganisa asho ukuthi ama-back-out akhiphe malini. Into ye-back-out ibala indawo yayo (shiya izindleko zayo ziyi-zero uma ungayibiza).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-back-out kufanele ibe \u003Cstrong\u003Econvex\u003C/strong\u003E: i-rectangle, isiyingi noma noma yimuphi umugqa ongenaye ikhona elingaphakathi. I-TakeoffCraft iyenqaba uma ungayidweba kanjalo; dweba isinsika esinesimo se-L njengama-back-out amabili. Ama-back-out awanazimbobo, futhi ama-back-out amabili agqumanayo bayabalwa bobabili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmjikelezo (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) awushintshi: ama-back-out akhipha indawo kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-indawo\"\u003EFunda indawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha indawo. \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELine\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo esele: umugqa ngaphandle kwezimbobo. Yilokho okubalwa yilento.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOutline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo ephelele ngaphakathi komugqa (ibonakala uma kukhona izimbobo).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut-outs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimbobo ezingaki, nendawo yazo ephelele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerimeter\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude bomphetho womugqa, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekanye\u003C/strong\u003E namaphethelo ayo yonke imbobo (&quot;nezimbobo&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmjikelezo ufaka amaphethelo embobo ngenhloso, njengezimo zomphetho noma isisekelo esizungeza imbobo. Uma udinga umphetho wangaphandle kuphela, gcina imibobo ngaphandle kwaleyo nto noma linganisa umphetho wangaphandle njengomugqa omude.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsici se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E sento sinquma ukuthi umphumela ubikwa kanjani: SF, SY noma m². Ipaneli ye-\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E nebha yesimo njalo zibonisa izikwele ze-feet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lungisa-indawo\"\u003ELungisa indawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa ikhona\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha indawo bese udonsa isibambo sekhona (izimbobo nazo zinezibambo). Uma isimo esisha sigqumana noma sisunduza imbobo ngaphandle, ikhona liyabuyiswa: &quot;Iphoyinti libuyiselwe.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisela kwenye into\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha enye into yendawo ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EItem\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yamathuluzi ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukujula-kuma-volume\"\u003EUkujula kuma-volume\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENika into yendawo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E yeslebhu) bese usebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E kwisingxenye ye-assembly ukuthola ama-cubic yards. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EInhlanganisela nezifomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Into yendawo ilinganisa indawo evaliwe. Umugqa ngamunye ungaba nezimbobo ezisikwe kuwo (i-shaft, insika, ipulanta), nemiphetho yawo ingaba eqondile noma ejikelezayo. Ngaphambi kokuqala: ishidi kudingeka isikali (Setha isikali) futhi udinga into yendawo (Dala izinto zokubala). Phonononga indawo Cofa into yendawo ngaphansi kwe-Items. Khetha Area ebhareni yamathuluzi, noma cindezela A. Cofa ikhona ngalinye legumbi noma leslebhu ngokulandelana. Bamba Shift ngamaphethelo angu-0°, 45° kanye no-90°. Kusukela ephointini lesithathu, umugqa uyagcwaliseka, futhi ibha yesimo ibonisa \"Indawo\" kanye \"nomjikelezo\". Indilinga encane ivela izungeze iphoyinti lokuqala. Vala umugqa: cofa iphoyinti lokuqala (ngaphakathi endilingeni yalo), cindezela Enter, cofa kabili, noma cofa ngesokudla. Indawo igcwaliswa kancane ngombala wento, ibhalwe ngezikwele zayo ze-feet, bese ibe yimaki ekhethiwe. Backspace isusa ikhona lokugcina; Esc ilahla umugqa. Umugqa oziqhumayo uyenqatshwa: \"Umugqa uziqhumile, ngakho indawo yawo izoba engalungile. Wudweba futhi ungaziqhumi.\" Dweba indawo efana nesibalo esingu-8 njengezindawo ezimbili. Imiphetho ejikelezayo Ngenkathi uphonononga, vula imodi yejika (Arc noma R). Emva kwekhona, cofa iphoyinti emgqeni wejika, bese ucofa lapho ijika liphela. Ukuvala umugqa ngejika, yenza leso sicofo sokugcina ephointini lokuqala. Indawo nomjikelezo kusebenzisa ijika eliqondile. Cindezela R futhi ukuze uthole imiphetho eqondile. Ukuguqula ijika ngemva kwalokho, khetha indawo bese udonsa isibambo esizungezile esiphakathi nejika. Bona Linganisa imigqa emide. Isiyingi Ngento yendawo, khetha Circle noma cindezela O. Cofa isikhungo. Cofa noma iliphi iphoyinti emaphethelweni. Ngenkathi uhambisa, ibha yesimo ibonisa irediyasi nendawo. Isiyingi sengezwa njengemaki yendawo enendawo eqondile nomjikelezo. Gcwalisa igumbi ngokucofa kanye Uma amagumbi edwetshwe njengezindonga ezivaliwe, Room (B) ithatha ifloor ngokucofa kanye: Khetha into yendawo (isibonelo ifinishi lefloor) bese unikeza ishidi isikali. Khetha Room eqenjini le-Takeoff, noma cindezela B. Cofa ngaphakathi kwegumbi, endaweni evulekile (hhayi emugqeni noma kulebula). I-TakeoffCraft ifunda imigqa yeshidi, ithole isikhala esizungeze ukucofa bese ilinganisa ngokulandela izindonga zangaphakathi, njengendawo yento yamanje. Ukuvulwa kwemnyango kuya kuthi 4'-0\" kuthathwa njengokuvaliwe, ngakho umugqa uqonda ngqo phezu komnyango; Izilungiselelo › TakeoffCraft › Room fill closes openings up to iguqula lobubanzi (3'-0\" kuya ku-8'-0\"). Amagama amagumbi, izinto zasendlini kanye nezixhobo ngaphakathi akwenzi izimbobo. Iyenqaba, isho ngenxa yalutho, uma: ukucofa kumugqa (\"Lokho kusemgqeni\"); isikhala asivaliwe: ukuvulwa okubanzi kunesilungiselelo kuvumela ukuthi kuphume kumphetho weshidi. Phakamisa isilungiselelo, noma linganisa leligumbi ngesandla nge-Area; isikhala sincane kakhulu (isimbulo, hhayi igumbi). Uma umnyango ubanzi kunesilungiselelo, ukugcwaliswa kungena egumbini elilandelayo bese kuphonononga bobabili ndawonye: hlehlisa (Ctrl+Z), phakamisa isilungiselelo, bese ucofa futhi. Hlola umugqa njengendawo nanoma iyiphi: donsa amakhona ukuze uwulungise. Ishidi eliskenwe lisebenza ngendlela efanayo, kodwa imigqa yalo kufanele ibe mnyama ngokwanele; imigqa egreyi ekhanyayo ingenza ukugcwaliswa kungame. Sika imbobo endaweni Khetha Select (V) bese ucofa indawo. Iveza izibambo ezisikwele emakhoneni ayo. Khetha Cut-out ebhareni yamathuluzi (noma cindezela X), noma Add a cut-out ngaphansi kwe-Selected mark. Cofa amakhona embobo, ngaphakathi endaweni. Imodi yejika isebenza nalapha. Yivale njengendawo: cofa iphoyinti layo lokuqala, cindezela Enter, cofa kabili, noma cofa ngesokudla. Imbobo ishiywe ingagcwaliswanga, nebha yesimo ithi \"Imbobo yengeziwe. Dweba enye, noma cindezela Esc.\" Dweba ezinye izimbobo endaweni efanayo, noma cindezela Esc. Imbobo ezungezile: khetha Add a round cut-out ngaphansi kwe-Selected mark, cofa isikhungo sayo, bese ucofa iphoyinti emaphethelweni ayo. Imbobo kufanele ihlale ngokuphelele endaweni futhi ingagqumi enye imbobo. Uma kungenjalo, i-TakeoffCraft iyenqaba: \"Imbobo kufanele ihlale ngokuphelele endaweni.\" noma \"Imibobo ayikwazi ukugqumana.\" Ukususa imbobo yokugcina, khetha Remove last cut-out. Ukukhipha kwezinto eziningi: izinsika, ama-shaft nezimbobo Imbobo ingumaki wendawo oyodwa. Back-out idwetshwa kanye bese ikhishwa kuyo yonke indawo ehlangana nayo, kwizinto ozikhethile: dweba izinsika kanye, zikhishwe ku-floor finish, esileyilini nasekuslebhuleni ndawonye. Yenza into yendawo yazo, njengo \"Izinsika\". Ezilungiselelweni zento, thikha Back-out: its marks take their area out of other items. Uhlu lwezinye izinto zendawo luyavela, zonke zithikiwe: susa ukuthikwa kwezo ezingafanele ukuthintwa yi-back-out (isibonelo upende wezindonga). Thatha ama-back-out ngokusebenzisa i-Area noma Circle, njengoba kujwayelekile. Ngayinye idwetshwa ngamachashazi. Yonke imaki yendawo yento ethikiwe esheetini efanayo ilahlekelwa yingxenye ye-back-out eyihlangana nayo: i-back-out yonke uma ingaphakathi, ingxenye ehlangana kuphela uma idlula emphethelweni, nalutho ngaphakathi kwembobo. Ipaneli yendawo ekhethiwe ibonisa Back-outs nendawo esele. Inani lento, izifomula zayo zenhlanganisela, izindleko, ukubuka kwe-3D nokuthunyelwa konke kusebenzisa indawo esele; amanothi okulinganisa asho ukuthi ama-back-out akhiphe malini. Into ye-back-out ibala indawo yayo (shiya izindleko zayo ziyi-zero uma ungayibiza). I-back-out kufanele ibe convex: i-rectangle, isiyingi noma noma yimuphi umugqa ongenaye ikhona elingaphakathi. I-TakeoffCraft iyenqaba uma ungayidweba kanjalo; dweba isinsika esinesimo se-L njengama-back-out amabili. Ama-back-out awanazimbobo, futhi ama-back-out amabili agqumanayo bayabalwa bobabili. Umjikelezo (P) awushintshi: ama-back-out akhipha indawo kuphela. Funda indawo Khetha indawo. Selected mark ibonisa: Line Meaning Area Indawo esele: umugqa ngaphandle kwezimbobo. Yilokho okubalwa yilento. Outline Indawo ephelele ngaphakathi komugqa (ibonakala uma kukhona izimbobo). Cut-outs Izimbobo ezingaki, nendawo yazo ephelele. Perimeter Ubude bomphetho womugqa, kanye namaphethelo ayo yonke imbobo (\"nezimbobo\"). Umjikelezo ufaka amaphethelo embobo ngenhloso, njengezimo zomphetho noma isisekelo esizungeza imbobo. Uma udinga umphetho wangaphandle kuphela, gcina imibobo ngaphandle kwaleyo nto noma linganisa umphetho wangaphandle njengomugqa omude. Isici se-Unit sento sinquma ukuthi umphumela ubikwa kanjani: SF, SY noma m². Ipaneli ye-Selected mark nebha yesimo njalo zibonisa izikwele ze-feet. Lungisa indawo Hambisa ikhona: khetha indawo bese udonsa isibambo sekhona (izimbobo nazo zinezibambo). Uma isimo esisha sigqumana noma sisunduza imbobo ngaphandle, ikhona liyabuyiswa: \"Iphoyinti libuyiselwe.\" Hambisela kwenye into: khetha enye into yendawo ohlwini lwe-Item ngaphansi kwe-Selected mark. Susa: Delete, Delete ebhareni yamathuluzi ngaphansi kwe-More, noma Delete mark. Ukujula kuma-volume Nika into yendawo Depth (isibonelo 0'-4\" yeslebhu) bese usebenzisa A * H / 27 kwisingxenye ye-assembly ukuthola ama-cubic yards. Bona Inhlanganisela nezifomula.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"roofs-and-slopes","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uphahla nokuthambeka","summary":"Nika indawo yayo ukuthambeka ukuze ulinganise indawo yophahla kusuka epulanini, bese ulinganisa amaphethelo, izindonga ezithambekile nemisele ngaphansi kwawo.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["uphahla","ukuthambeka","isilinganiso sokuthambeka","ukuphakama","ukuhamba","6:12","umphetho othambekile","ifindo","umsele","igabhulu","izikwele","indawo ethambekile","indawo yepulani","ubude beqiniso"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuthayipha-ukuthambeka","text":"Ukuthayipha ukuthambeka","level":2},{"id":"izindawo-zophahla","text":"Izindawo zophahla","level":2},{"id":"imiphetho-ethambekile-amafindo-nemisele","text":"Imiphetho ethambekile, amafindo nemisele","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIpulani yophahla ibonisa ngayinye indiza yophahla ilele, njengoba ibonakala evela phezulu. Uphahla ngokwalo bukhulu kakhulu: indiza ethambeke ngo-6:12 inendawo engaba ngu-12% ngaphezu kwepulani yayo, nemiphetho yayo ethambekile imide kakhulu kunokuba ibonakala. Nika into yakho ukuthambeka kwayo, futhi i-TakeoffCraft izolinganisa ngaphansi kokuthambeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthayipha-ukuthambeka\"\u003EUkuthayipha ukuthambeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthambeka yisimo sokukhuphuka ngo-12 wokuhamba, njengoba kubonakala kuzimpawu zokuthambeka zepulani lophahla. Thayipha njenge \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E noma nje \u003Ccode\u003E6\u003C/code\u003E; ukuhamba okunye nakho kuyasebenza (\u003Ccode\u003E4:10\u003C/code\u003E ingu-4.8:12). Ingalo nayo iyasebenza ngophawu lwedigri: \u003Ccode\u003E26.57°\u003C/code\u003E. Okuyinkali noma \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E kusho okulingene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izindawo-zophahla\"\u003EIzindawo zophahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza into yendawo yokufaka uphahla, noma vula eyodwa oyinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzilungiselelweni zayo, thayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVikeleka ngamacala ngamunye wendiza epulanini nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, njengokujwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndiza ngayinye ibalwa ngendawo yepulani yayo ephindwe ngesilinganiso sokuthambeka: √(1 + (ukuphakama ÷ 12)²), okungu-1.118 ku-6:12 nokungu-1.414 ku-12:12. Khetha indiza ukuze ubone i-\u003Cstrong\u003EArea\u003C/strong\u003E (ethambekile), i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPlan area\u003C/strong\u003E nesilinganiso sokuthambeka i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESlope factor\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindiza ngokuthambeka okwehlukile: khetha indiza bese uthayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E yayo engxenyeni yayo. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze isebenzise eyento. Ukubuka kwe-3D, izinhlanganisela (\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E iyindawo ethambekile), izindleko nokuthunyelwa konke kusebenzisa indawo ethambekile. Ukukhipha izinto ezindizeni ezithambekile, njengamafasitela ophahla, nakho kukhishwa ngalokhu kuthambeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmmande \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E uhlala uyipherimitha yepulani. Linganisa amaphethelo, imiphetho ethambekile, ifindo nemisele njengemigqa yokuhamba (ngezansi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imiphetho-ethambekile-amafindo-nemisele\"\u003EImiphetho ethambekile, amafindo nemisele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza into yomugqa, njenge &quot;Rake edge&quot; noma &quot;Hips&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003ERake\u003C/strong\u003E (umphetho othambekile, njengawegabhulu) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EHip or valley\u003C/strong\u003E (umugqa lapho izindiza ezimbili zihlangana), bese uthayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E yezindiza zophahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba imigqa yokuhamba epulanini nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphetho othambekile ubalwa ngobude bawo epulanini ophindwe nesilinganiso sokuthambeka. Ifindo noma umsele uhamba ngo-45° epulanini phakathi kwezindiza ezimbili zokuthambeka okufanayo, ngakho ubude bawo beqiniso bungobude bepulani ophindwe ne-√(1 + (ukuphakama ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 ku-6:12, 1.225 ku-12:12.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa owodwa ungaba nezinhlobo ezimbili. Khetha wona: kungxenye ngayinye engxenyeni yayo kukhona uhlu lokuthambeka — \u003Cstrong\u003EItem&#039;s\u003C/strong\u003E (ukusethwa kwento), \u003Cstrong\u003ELevel\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ERake\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EHip or valley\u003C/strong\u003E — nobude bayo ngaphansi kokuthambeka. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E yomugqa engxenyeni yawo ithatha indawo yeyento kuzo zonke izingxenye zawo. Ingxenye nayo ibonisa i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPlan length\u003C/strong\u003E, namalebula esheethini abonisa ubude ngaphansi kokuthambeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhipha kusasebenza: ingxenye ekhishiwe ayibali lutho, noma ithambekile noma cha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafindo nemisele ithatha ukuthi zombili izindiza zinokuthambeka okufanayo. Ngezindiza zokuthambeka okwehlukile, linganisa ifindo ngobude bayo beqiniso ngenye indlela, noma yidweba njengomphetho othambekile onokuthambeka okulinganayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ipulani yophahla ibonisa ngayinye indiza yophahla ilele, njengoba ibonakala evela phezulu. Uphahla ngokwalo bukhulu kakhulu: indiza ethambeke ngo-6:12 inendawo engaba ngu-12% ngaphezu kwepulani yayo, nemiphetho yayo ethambekile imide kakhulu kunokuba ibonakala. Nika into yakho ukuthambeka kwayo, futhi i-TakeoffCraft izolinganisa ngaphansi kokuthambeka. Ukuthayipha ukuthambeka Ukuthambeka yisimo sokukhuphuka ngo-12 wokuhamba, njengoba kubonakala kuzimpawu zokuthambeka zepulani lophahla. Thayipha njenge 6:12, 6/12 noma nje 6; ukuhamba okunye nakho kuyasebenza (4:10 ingu-4.8:12). Ingalo nayo iyasebenza ngophawu lwedigri: 26.57°. Okuyinkali noma 0 kusho okulingene. Izindawo zophahla Yenza into yendawo yokufaka uphahla, noma vula eyodwa oyinayo. Ezilungiselelweni zayo, thayipha i-Pitch, njengo 6:12. Vikeleka ngamacala ngamunye wendiza epulanini nge-Area, njengokujwayelekile. Indiza ngayinye ibalwa ngendawo yepulani yayo ephindwe ngesilinganiso sokuthambeka: √(1 + (ukuphakama ÷ 12)²), okungu-1.118 ku-6:12 nokungu-1.414 ku-12:12. Khetha indiza ukuze ubone i-Area (ethambekile), i-Plan area nesilinganiso sokuthambeka i-Slope factor. Izindiza ngokuthambeka okwehlukile: khetha indiza bese uthayipha i-Pitch yayo engxenyeni yayo. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze isebenzise eyento. Ukubuka kwe-3D, izinhlanganisela (A iyindawo ethambekile), izindleko nokuthunyelwa konke kusebenzisa indawo ethambekile. Ukukhipha izinto ezindizeni ezithambekile, njengamafasitela ophahla, nakho kukhishwa ngalokhu kuthambeka. Ummande P uhlala uyipherimitha yepulani. Linganisa amaphethelo, imiphetho ethambekile, ifindo nemisele njengemigqa yokuhamba (ngezansi). Imiphetho ethambekile, amafindo nemisele Yenza into yomugqa, njenge \"Rake edge\" noma \"Hips\". Setha i-Slope ibe Rake (umphetho othambekile, njengawegabhulu) noma Hip or valley (umugqa lapho izindiza ezimbili zihlangana), bese uthayipha i-Pitch yezindiza zophahla. Dweba imigqa yokuhamba epulanini nge-Linear. Umphetho othambekile ubalwa ngobude bawo epulanini ophindwe nesilinganiso sokuthambeka. Ifindo noma umsele uhamba ngo-45° epulanini phakathi kwezindiza ezimbili zokuthambeka okufanayo, ngakho ubude bawo beqiniso bungobude bepulani ophindwe ne-√(1 + (ukuphakama ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 ku-6:12, 1.225 ku-12:12. Umugqa owodwa ungaba nezinhlobo ezimbili. Khetha wona: kungxenye ngayinye engxenyeni yayo kukhona uhlu lokuthambeka — Item's (ukusethwa kwento), Level, Rake noma Hip or valley — nobude bayo ngaphansi kokuthambeka. I-Pitch yomugqa engxenyeni yawo ithatha indawo yeyento kuzo zonke izingxenye zawo. Ingxenye nayo ibonisa i-Plan length, namalebula esheethini abonisa ubude ngaphansi kokuthambeka. Ukukhipha kusasebenza: ingxenye ekhishiwe ayibali lutho, noma ithambekile noma cha. Amafindo nemisele ithatha ukuthi zombili izindiza zinokuthambeka okufanayo. Ngezindiza zokuthambeka okwehlukile, linganisa ifindo ngobude bayo beqiniso ngenye indlela, noma yidweba njengomphetho othambekile onokuthambeka okulinganayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"count-by-hand","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bala ngesandla","summary":"Chofoza ngalinye lomnyango, into yokukhanyisa noma idivayisi ukuze uyibale, hlola izinani zakho, bese ulungisa amaphutha.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["bala","ngamunye","ea","izinto zokukhanyisa","izimnyango","amadivayisi","izimfanekiso","ukubala ngesandla","ukubala ngokuchofoza","ukuthelela"],"headings":[{"id":"bala","text":"Bala","level":2},{"id":"lungisa-ukubala","text":"Lungisa ukubala","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-wamachashaza-esikrinini-nasepdf","text":"Usayizi wamachashaza, esikrinini nasePDF","level":2},{"id":"izimfanekiso-eziningi-ezifanayo","text":"Izimfanekiso eziningi ezifanayo","level":2},{"id":"ukusebenzisa-izinani-ezifomula","text":"Ukusebenzisa izinani ezifomula","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EInto yokubala ibala izinto: izimnyango, izinto zokukhanyisa, amasokhethi, izinto zepulambing. Ngayinye ochofoza eshidini yengeza impawu yokubala. Ukubala akudingi isikali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bala\"\u003EBala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza noma chofoza into yokubala ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E (uhlobo lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ngayinye eshidini. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kubeka ichashaza ngombala wento, bese inani lento lenyuka ngo-1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambela eshidini elilandelayo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) uqhubeke nokubala. Ithuluzi lihlala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uma uqedile. I-TakeoffCraft ibuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkudonsa kusashelelisa nevili lisasondeza uma ubala, ngakho ungazulazula eshidini ngaphandle kokwengeza amachashaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza into yokubala ukuze uqaqamise amachashaza ayo kuwo wonke amashidi. Uhlu lwamashidi bese lubonisa ukuthi zingaki kwelinye ngalinye, okusiza ukuthola amashidi ongawabalanga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lungisa-ukubala\"\u003ELungisa ukubala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa ichashaza\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), chofoza ichashaza, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa uphawu\u003C/span\u003E. Noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngemva kokuchofoza okungalungile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa ichashaza\u003C/strong\u003E: likhethe, bese ulidonsa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbalwe ngaphansi kwento engalungile\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha ichashaza bese ukhetha into yokubala efanele ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EInto\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImpawu ekhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-wamachashaza-esikrinini-nasepdf\"\u003EUsayizi wamachashaza, esikrinini nasePDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmachashaza agcina usayizi munye esikrinini noma ukusondeza kangakanani. Ukuze uwashintshe, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E, ithebhu ye-TakeoffCraft, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi wophawu lokubala\u003C/strong\u003E: Ncane kakhulu, Ncane, Maphakathi (okuzenzakalelayo) noma Enkulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthumela (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF emakwe\u003C/span\u003E) kudweba ichashaza ngalinye ngosayizi ofanayo ephepheni, kungakhathaliseki usayizi weshidi: isibukeli se-PDF esibonisa ngo-100% sibonisa amachashaza njengoba ekhona esikrinini. Lapho amachashaza eshidini angathintana, ukuthumela kwenza amachashaza alelo shidi ancane ukuze ngayinye ifundeke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimfanekiso-eziningi-ezifanayo\"\u003EIzimfanekiso eziningi ezifanayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgesimfanekiso esiphindaphindeka kakhulu eshidini, zama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/a\u003E: bopha esisodwa, bheka okutholakele, bese ukwengeza konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusebenzisa-izinani-ezifomula\"\u003EUkusebenzisa izinani ezifomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani lento yokubala ngu-\u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E. Izingxenye zomhlanganisela zingayisebenzisa, njengamahinji \u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E ezimnyangweni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EImihlanganisela namafomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Into yokubala ibala izinto: izimnyango, izinto zokukhanyisa, amasokhethi, izinto zepulambing. Ngayinye ochofoza eshidini yengeza impawu yokubala. Ukubala akudingi isikali. Bala Yenza noma chofoza into yokubala ngaphansi kwe-Izinto (uhlobo lwe-Bala). Khetha Bala ethuluzini, noma cindezela C. Chofoza ngayinye eshidini. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kubeka ichashaza ngombala wento, bese inani lento lenyuka ngo-1. Hambela eshidini elilandelayo (Page Down) uqhubeke nokubala. Ithuluzi lihlala ku-Bala. Cindezela Esc uma uqedile. I-TakeoffCraft ibuyela ku-Khetha. Ukudonsa kusashelelisa nevili lisasondeza uma ubala, ngakho ungazulazula eshidini ngaphandle kokwengeza amachashaza. Chofoza into yokubala ukuze uqaqamise amachashaza ayo kuwo wonke amashidi. Uhlu lwamashidi bese lubonisa ukuthi zingaki kwelinye ngalinye, okusiza ukuthola amashidi ongawabalanga. Lungisa ukubala Susa ichashaza: khetha Khetha (V), chofoza ichashaza, bese ucindezela Delete noma khetha Susa uphawu. Noma cindezela Ctrl+Z ngemva kokuchofoza okungalungile. Hambisa ichashaza: likhethe, bese ulidonsa. Ibalwe ngaphansi kwento engalungile: khetha ichashaza bese ukhetha into yokubala efanele ohlwini lwe-Into ngaphansi kwe-Impawu ekhethiwe. Usayizi wamachashaza, esikrinini nasePDF Amachashaza agcina usayizi munye esikrinini noma ukusondeza kangakanani. Ukuze uwashintshe, vula Izilungiselelo, ithebhu ye-TakeoffCraft, bese ukhetha Usayizi wophawu lokubala: Ncane kakhulu, Ncane, Maphakathi (okuzenzakalelayo) noma Enkulu. Ukuthumela (Thumela › I-PDF emakwe) kudweba ichashaza ngalinye ngosayizi ofanayo ephepheni, kungakhathaliseki usayizi weshidi: isibukeli se-PDF esibonisa ngo-100% sibonisa amachashaza njengoba ekhona esikrinini. Lapho amachashaza eshidini angathintana, ukuthumela kwenza amachashaza alelo shidi ancane ukuze ngayinye ifundeke. Izimfanekiso eziningi ezifanayo Ngesimfanekiso esiphindaphindeka kakhulu eshidini, zama Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo: bopha esisodwa, bheka okutholakele, bese ukwengeza konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Ukusebenzisa izinani ezifomula Inani lento yokubala ngu-N. Izingxenye zomhlanganisela zingayisebenzisa, njengamahinji N * 3 ezimnyangweni. Bona Imihlanganisela namafomula.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"auto-count","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bala isimbuzo ngokuzenzakalelayo","summary":"Bhoksisa isimbuzo esisodwa, vumela i-TakeoffCraft ithole ezinye kulesi shidi noma kuwo wonke amashidi avulekile, buyekeza ukufana ngesilayidi, bese uzengeza zonke ngesinyathelo esisodwa.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["noma yiliphi i-angle","ephendukile","ejikiwe","esinye isikali","isikali esihlukile","ukubala okuzenzakalelayo","ukubala ngokuzenzakalelayo","ukusesha izimpawu","thola izimpawu","iphethini","ithempulethi","ukufana","bona","ithuluzi lokubala"],"headings":[{"id":"thola-izimpawu","text":"Thola izimpawu","level":2},{"id":"buyekeza-izimpawu","text":"Buyekeza izimpawu","level":2},{"id":"yengeza","text":"Yengeza","level":2},{"id":"okuyithola-nokuyiphuthelwa","text":"Okuyithola nokuyiphuthelwa","level":2},{"id":"isivinini-nama-browser","text":"Isivinini nama-browser","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E ithola yonke ikhophi yesimbuzo emva kokuthi ubhokise esisodwa. Bese ubuka ukufana kulo shidi, bese wengeza lezo ozamukelayo njengezimpawu zokubala. Kuyisisekelo, hhayi isiqinisekiso: hlala ubuka ngaphambi kokuthi wengeze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-izimpawu\"\u003EThola izimpawu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza noma chofoza into yokubala ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ishidi lapho kuvela khona isimbuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lamathuluzi, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ibha ivela phezulu kweshidi: &quot;Hudula ibhokisi ozungeze isimbuzo esisodwa kuleshidi.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze useshe wonke amashidi avulekile, hhayi leli kuphela, tshekisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESesha wonke amashidi avulekile\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESondeza ukuze isimbuzo sibonakale kahle, bese uhudula ibhokisi eliqinile ozungeze ikhophi eyodwa yaso. Faka isimbuzo sonke; amaphepha amhlophe azungezile ayasikwa. Ibha ikhombisa &quot;Iyasesha…&quot; nebha yenqubekela phambili nenkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhasi liyaphendula: ungasondeza, ushelelise, futhi uhambe phakathi kwamashidi. Ukukhetha elinye ithuluzi, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kuyayeka ukusesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho isiphela, izimpawu zivela kwishidi njengamabhokisi anombala wento, nebha ikhombisa isifinyezo esifana ne-&quot;Izimpawu ezingu-22, ezingu-19 zokungeza (ezingu-3 zesivele zibaliwe). Chofoza ibhokisi ukuze uliyenqabe noma ulibuyisele.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E, ukuhudula kwishidi kudweba ibhokisi esikhundleni sokushelelisa. Ukuze ushelelise, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uhudule, noma hudula ngenkinobho ephakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyekeza-izimpawu\"\u003EBuyekeza izimpawu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChofoza ibhokisi\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uliyenqabe. Ibhokisi elenqatshiwe libonakala lifakwe imigqa yokudonsa futhi lihlakaniswe. Chofoza futhi ukuze uliyibuyisele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa isilayidi se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkufana\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E (50% kuya ku-95%, siqala ku-75%). Okuphezulu kukhombisa okufanayo okuseduze kuphela; okuphansi kukhombisa okungaqinile kangako. Isilayidi sihlunga kuphela lokho okutholakele; asiseshi futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEsesivele sibaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E: izimpawu endaweni esivele inophawu lokubala lalo kuleli thuluzi ziqala zinqatshiwe, ukuze ungabali okufanayo kabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanye amashidi\u003C/strong\u003E: uma useshe wonke amashidi avulekile, hamba phakathi kwamashidi ngohlu lwamashidi noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese ubuyekeza ngalinye. Isifinyezo sikhombisa amashidi amaningi anezimpawu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yengeza\"\u003EYengeza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E. Inkinobho ikhombisa inani, njengo &quot;Engeza izimpawu ezingu-19&quot;. Izimpawu zokubala zingezwa endaweni ephakathi kwebhokisi ngalinye elamukelekile: &quot;Kungezwe izimpawu zokubala ezingu-19 ku-\\&quot;Duplex receptacle\\&quot;. Ctrl+Z ususa zonke.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELonke iqoqo liyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, ngakho i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E eyodwa iyasusa konke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uyeke ukubuyekeza ungengezi lutho, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELahla\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ukukhetha elinye ithuluzi nakho kuyilahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuyithola-nokuyiphuthelwa\"\u003EOkuyithola nokuyiphuthelwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft iqhathanisa umdwebo, ngamaphikseli, nesimbuzo obhokishe sona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthola isimbuzo esiphendukile ngama-0°, 90°, 180° no-270°. Tshekisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENoma yiliphi iangle (kancane)\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni le-auto count ngaphambi kokudweba ibhokisi ukuze ithole nanoma iyiphi i-angle: ihlola yonke ngama-15°, bese iqinisa ngayinye ibe ngu-1.5°. Lokhu kuthatha cishe izikhathi eziyisithupha isikhathi eside. Ayitholi isimbuzo esiphendukile njengesibuko (ngaphandle uma isimbuzo sifana nakho njengesibuko).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESesha wonke amashidi avulekile\u003C/span\u003E etshekishiwe, ishidi elinesikali esihlukile liseshwa ngosayizi ofanele lesimbuzo kuleyo ndawo: isifanekiso esidwetshwe ngesikali kwi-plan ye-1/8&quot; singu-ingxenye yesibili yaso kwi-plan ye-1/4&quot;, futhi sisatholakala. Leli shidi liseshwa futhi ngosayizi webhokisi lalo, kumathegi nezimpawu ezishicilelwe ngosayizi ofanayo kuwo wonke amashidi. Lokhu kudinga isikali kuzo zombili amashidi; ishidi elingenaso isikali liseshwa ngosayizi webhokisi kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpawu ezifana kakhulu zingafana zodwa: i-duplex nesiquad sokufaka, noma amathegi amabili ezinto ahlukaniswa ngohlamvu olulodwa. Phakamisa isilayidi kuze kusale okufanele kuphela, bese unqenya okunye ngesandla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimbuzo esivinjelwe yimigqa, ukufakwa kwemigqa noma umbhalo sithola amaphuzu aphansi futhi kungadinga isilayidi esiphansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmabhokisi amancane kakhulu ayenqatshelwa: &quot;Leli bhokisi lincane kakhulu. Hudula ozungeze isimbuzo sonke.&quot; Ibhokisi elingenalutho nalo liyenqatshelwa: &quot;Leli bhokisi lingenalutho cishe. Hudula ozungeze isimbuzo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIshidi elingaba likhulu kakhulu ngosayizi odingekayo walo simbuzo liyadlulwa, futhi isifinyezo sithi &quot;ishidi eli-1 libe likhulu kakhulu ukuze lisheshwe ngosayizi walo simbuzo.&quot; Hudula isimbuzo esikhulu, noma ubale leli shidi ngesandla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kungatholakali lutho, ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Azikho izifanele. Nciphisa isilayidi sokufana, noma bhoksisa isimbuzo ngokuqinile.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isivinini-nama-browser\"\u003EIsivinini nama-browser\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusesha kusebenza ngesisebenzi esingemuva, ngakho ikhasi liyaphendula futhi ungayeka noma nini. Ishidi ngalinye liqala ukudwetshwa ngosayizi wokusebenza ekhasini ngokwalo, okungabangela ukuthi ishidi elikhulu kakhulu limise umzuzwana. Lisebenza kuChrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari yamanje. Ukusesha amashidi amaningi kuthatha isikhathi eside; ibha yenqubekela phambili ihamba ishidi ngeshidi. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, i-auto count iyasebenza uma ibha yohlelo ikhombisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E igcina nesisebenzi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo ithola yonke ikhophi yesimbuzo emva kokuthi ubhokise esisodwa. Bese ubuka ukufana kulo shidi, bese wengeza lezo ozamukelayo njengezimpawu zokubala. Kuyisisekelo, hhayi isiqinisekiso: hlala ubuka ngaphambi kokuthi wengeze. Thola izimpawu Yenza noma chofoza into yokubala ngaphansi kwe-Izinto. Vula ishidi lapho kuvela khona isimbuzo. Khetha Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo ebhareni lamathuluzi, noma cindezela S. Ibha ivela phezulu kweshidi: \"Hudula ibhokisi ozungeze isimbuzo esisodwa kuleshidi.\" Ukuze useshe wonke amashidi avulekile, hhayi leli kuphela, tshekisha Sesha wonke amashidi avulekile. Sondeza ukuze isimbuzo sibonakale kahle, bese uhudula ibhokisi eliqinile ozungeze ikhophi eyodwa yaso. Faka isimbuzo sonke; amaphepha amhlophe azungezile ayasikwa. Ibha ikhombisa \"Iyasesha…\" nebha yenqubekela phambili nenkinobho Khansela. Ikhasi liyaphendula: ungasondeza, ushelelise, futhi uhambe phakathi kwamashidi. Ukukhetha elinye ithuluzi, noma Esc, kuyayeka ukusesha. Lapho isiphela, izimpawu zivela kwishidi njengamabhokisi anombala wento, nebha ikhombisa isifinyezo esifana ne-\"Izimpawu ezingu-22, ezingu-19 zokungeza (ezingu-3 zesivele zibaliwe). Chofoza ibhokisi ukuze uliyenqabe noma ulibuyisele.\" Ku-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo, ukuhudula kwishidi kudweba ibhokisi esikhundleni sokushelelisa. Ukuze ushelelise, bamba Space uhudule, noma hudula ngenkinobho ephakathi. Buyekeza izimpawu Chofoza ibhokisi ukuze uliyenqabe. Ibhokisi elenqatshiwe libonakala lifakwe imigqa yokudonsa futhi lihlakaniswe. Chofoza futhi ukuze uliyibuyisele. Hambisa isilayidi se-Ukufana (50% kuya ku-95%, siqala ku-75%). Okuphezulu kukhombisa okufanayo okuseduze kuphela; okuphansi kukhombisa okungaqinile kangako. Isilayidi sihlunga kuphela lokho okutholakele; asiseshi futhi. Esesivele sibaliwe: izimpawu endaweni esivele inophawu lokubala lalo kuleli thuluzi ziqala zinqatshiwe, ukuze ungabali okufanayo kabili. Amanye amashidi: uma useshe wonke amashidi avulekile, hamba phakathi kwamashidi ngohlu lwamashidi noma nge-Page Down bese ubuyekeza ngalinye. Isifinyezo sikhombisa amashidi amaningi anezimpawu. Yengeza Khetha Engeza. Inkinobho ikhombisa inani, njengo \"Engeza izimpawu ezingu-19\". Izimpawu zokubala zingezwa endaweni ephakathi kwebhokisi ngalinye elamukelekile: \"Kungezwe izimpawu zokubala ezingu-19 ku-\\\"Duplex receptacle\\\". Ctrl+Z ususa zonke.\" Lonke iqoqo liyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, ngakho i-Ctrl+Z eyodwa iyasusa konke. Ukuze uyeke ukubuyekeza ungengezi lutho, khetha Lahla noma cindezela Esc. Ukukhetha elinye ithuluzi nakho kuyilahla. Okuyithola nokuyiphuthelwa I-TakeoffCraft iqhathanisa umdwebo, ngamaphikseli, nesimbuzo obhokishe sona. Ithola isimbuzo esiphendukile ngama-0°, 90°, 180° no-270°. Tshekisha Noma yiliphi iangle (kancane) ebhareni le-auto count ngaphambi kokudweba ibhokisi ukuze ithole nanoma iyiphi i-angle: ihlola yonke ngama-15°, bese iqinisa ngayinye ibe ngu-1.5°. Lokhu kuthatha cishe izikhathi eziyisithupha isikhathi eside. Ayitholi isimbuzo esiphendukile njengesibuko (ngaphandle uma isimbuzo sifana nakho njengesibuko). Uma Sesha wonke amashidi avulekile etshekishiwe, ishidi elinesikali esihlukile liseshwa ngosayizi ofanele lesimbuzo kuleyo ndawo: isifanekiso esidwetshwe ngesikali kwi-plan ye-1/8\" singu-ingxenye yesibili yaso kwi-plan ye-1/4\", futhi sisatholakala. Leli shidi liseshwa futhi ngosayizi webhokisi lalo, kumathegi nezimpawu ezishicilelwe ngosayizi ofanayo kuwo wonke amashidi. Lokhu kudinga isikali kuzo zombili amashidi; ishidi elingenaso isikali liseshwa ngosayizi webhokisi kuphela. Izimpawu ezifana kakhulu zingafana zodwa: i-duplex nesiquad sokufaka, noma amathegi amabili ezinto ahlukaniswa ngohlamvu olulodwa. Phakamisa isilayidi kuze kusale okufanele kuphela, bese unqenya okunye ngesandla. Isimbuzo esivinjelwe yimigqa, ukufakwa kwemigqa noma umbhalo sithola amaphuzu aphansi futhi kungadinga isilayidi esiphansi. Amabhokisi amancane kakhulu ayenqatshelwa: \"Leli bhokisi lincane kakhulu. Hudula ozungeze isimbuzo sonke.\" Ibhokisi elingenalutho nalo liyenqatshelwa: \"Leli bhokisi lingenalutho cishe. Hudula ozungeze isimbuzo.\" Ishidi elingaba likhulu kakhulu ngosayizi odingekayo walo simbuzo liyadlulwa, futhi isifinyezo sithi \"ishidi eli-1 libe likhulu kakhulu ukuze lisheshwe ngosayizi walo simbuzo.\" Hudula isimbuzo esikhulu, noma ubale leli shidi ngesandla. Uma kungatholakali lutho, ibha yesimo ithi \"Azikho izifanele. Nciphisa isilayidi sokufana, noma bhoksisa isimbuzo ngokuqinile.\" Isivinini nama-browser Ukusesha kusebenza ngesisebenzi esingemuva, ngakho ikhasi liyaphendula futhi ungayeka noma nini. Ishidi ngalinye liqala ukudwetshwa ngosayizi wokusebenza ekhasini ngokwalo, okungabangela ukuthi ishidi elikhulu kakhulu limise umzuzwana. Lisebenza kuChrome, Edge, Firefox ne-Safari yamanje. Ukusesha amashidi amaningi kuthatha isikhathi eside; ibha yenqubekela phambili ihamba ishidi ngeshidi. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, i-auto count iyasebenza uma ibha yohlelo ikhombisa Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi: Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi igcina nesisebenzi. Bona Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"count-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bala emdwebweni","summary":"Bala amabhulokhi, izinto ezisesendaweni, noma umbhalo ngqo kusuka ku-DWG noma i-DXF. Ngokunembile, namabhulokhi angaphakathi kwamanye, namabhulokhi anezinhlobo ezihlukahlukene nezinhlu zamabhulokhi kuphathwa, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["bala emdwebweni","ukubala kwe-CAD","ukubala amabhulokhi","bala amabhulokhi","faka","igama lebhulokhi","amabhulokhi angaphakathi","ibhulokhi elinamandla","inhlobo","minsert","uhlu","isendawo","izinhlobo ezihlukahlukene","ongqimba","uhlobo lwento","izindilinga","umbhalo","isici","ithegi","ongqimba abafihliwe","inani elinembile","indlela","amasango","izinto zokukhanyisa"],"headings":[{"id":"bala-ibhulokhi","text":"Bala ibhulokhi","level":2},{"id":"okubalwayo","text":"Okubalwayo","level":3},{"id":"okungabalwa","text":"Okungabalwa","level":3},{"id":"yonke-yalo-shidi-noma-umdwebo-wonke","text":"Yonke yalo shidi, noma umdwebo wonke","level":2},{"id":"bala-ukubalwa-futhi","text":"Bala ukubalwa futhi","level":2},{"id":"ngohlobo-nongqimba","text":"Ngohlobo nongqimba","level":2},{"id":"ngombhalo","text":"Ngombhalo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kufanele-usebenzise-ukubala-okuzenzakalelayo","text":"Lapho kufanele usebenzise Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala kwe-CAD\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni leshidi (umyalo \u003Cstrong\u003EBala emdwebweni\u003C/strong\u003E kwezinye izitayela zemenyu) ibala okutholakala ku-DWG noma i-DXF. Lapho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E kufuna isithombe senkomba bese kungaphuthelwa noma kutholwe okungelona, lokhu kubala izinto: yonke ifakwa yebhulokhi enegama elithi \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR-36\u003C/code\u003E ingumnyango oyodwa. Vula umdwebo kuqala: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EVula umdwebo we-DWG noma i-DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bala-ibhulokhi\"\u003EBala ibhulokhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ishidi lomdwebo. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala kwe-CAD\u003C/span\u003E isebhalweni leshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYikhethe. Iwindi ludweba amabhulokhi nokuthi kangaki kwelinye ngalinye. Sesha ngegama, bese ukhetha elilodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka umugqa ongaphansi kohlu: okungu-22 okutholakele, okungu-22 okuzongezwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYengeza ku\u003C/span\u003E, khetha into yokubala, noma shiya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpawu entsha yokubala\u003C/span\u003E bese unikeza igama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha inkinobho yokungeza, ebala inani: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izimpawu angu-22\u003C/span\u003E. Izimpawu zivela ezindaweni zokufakwa kwebhulokhi, futhi inani lento liyinani lokubala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa izimpawu (nento entsha) ndawonye. Isilinganiso sezindleko, ishidithi nei-PDF emakwe ziphatha into njengenye into yokubala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okubalwayo\"\u003EOkubalwayo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYonke ifakwa yegama lebhulokhi\u003C/strong\u003E, noma ngasiphi isikali nanoma yiliphi i-engeli, kumodeli noma ephepheni. Amagama amabhulokhi awanandaba nezinhlamvu ezinkulu nezincane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwamabhulokhi\u003C/strong\u003E (MINSERT): ikhophi ngayinye kuhlu iyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmabhulokhi angaphakathi kwamanye.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhulokhi elibekwe ngaphakathi kwelinye libalwa ezingeni ngalinye. Uhlu lusho ukuthi &quot;6 ngaphakathi kwamanye amabhulokhi&quot;; susa ukukhetha kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala namabhulokhi angaphakathi kwamanye amabhulokhi futhi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubale kuphela okufakwe ngqo emdwebweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmabhulokhi anamandla.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhulokhi elinamandla libalwa ngegama lalo, hhayi ngamakhophi angenamagama (\u003Ccode\u003E*U12\u003C/code\u003E) afayela ligcina. Izimo zalo zidwetshwa ngokwehlukana (&quot;Single 12, Double 4&quot;): khetha imo ukuze ubale lezo kuphela, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYonke imisho\u003C/span\u003E. Uma ifayela lingasho ukuthi ikhophi ibonisa imo ephi, ziyadwetshwa njenge-&quot;(imo engaziwa)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsihlungo songqimba.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhulokhi emaqenjini amaningi: khetha elilodwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngqimbeni\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okungabalwa\"\u003EOkungabalwa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOngqimba abafihliwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Into esendaweni evaliwe noma eqandekile kufayela (noma eyifihla ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngqimba\u003C/span\u003E) iyashiywa, nomugqa uthi ziningi kangakanani: &quot;3 on hidden layers left out&quot;. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala nazo futhi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uzifake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela alinkiwe angavulwanga\u003C/strong\u003E awabalwa; iwindi liyatshela lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezibekwe ngqo phezu kwezinye zohlobo olufanayo\u003C/strong\u003E zibalwa njengezimbili (ziyizinto ezimbili), futhi iwindi liyatshela: ngokuvamile kuyiphutha lokudweba elifanele ukubhekwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yonke-yalo-shidi-noma-umdwebo-wonke\"\u003EYonke yalo shidi, noma umdwebo wonke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELokho ishidi elibonisa\u003C/strong\u003E libala izinto ishidi elizibonisayo: ku-ilayawuti, izinto zemodeli ezingaphakathi kwamafasitela alo okubuka (ongqimba obanjiwe kufasitela akubalwa lapho) kanye nezakhiwo zeilayawuti ngokwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmdwebo wonke, into ngayinye kanye\u003C/strong\u003E ubala imodeli kanye, nezimpawu ku-ishidi lemodeli, futhi ayibali okubonwa izakhiwo eziningi kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubala okubonwa yi-ilayawuti nokubala okubonwa yimodeli kunika inani elifanayo ngezinto ezifanayo; ungayengezi zombili kwento eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bala-ukubalwa-futhi\"\u003EBala ukubalwa futhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubala kabusha ibhulokhi elifanayo ngento efanayo kwengeza okusha kuphela: &quot;Okungu-22 sekubalwe kwangaphambili.&quot; Impawu ngayinye imelela into eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngohlobo-nongqimba\"\u003ENgohlobo nongqimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgongqimba nohlobo\u003C/span\u003E khetha ongqimba nohlobo lwento (izindilinga, amaphola-layini, imigqa yokufiphaza…): &quot;zonke izindilinga ku-E-LITE&quot;. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala futhi izinto ezingaphakathi kwamabhulokhi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uphinde ufake lezo ezingaphakathi kwezakhiwo zamabhulokhi, endaweni ngayinye lapho ibhulokhi lifakwe khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngombhalo\"\u003ENgombhalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgombhalo\u003C/span\u003E bhala umbhalo, njengo \u003Ccode\u003EA3\u003C/code\u003E, bese uchaza ukuthi uphelele, uqukethe lokho, noma ungamagama aphelele. Umbhalo wezinto, umbhalo wokuhola kanye nezinani zesici sebhulokhi zonke ziyabalwa (isici sethegi \u003Ccode\u003EITEM = A3\u003C/code\u003E siyatholakala); khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwisici\u003C/span\u003E ukubala isici esisodwa kuphela. Imibhalo evame kakhulu ibalwa ukuze ichofozwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kufanele-usebenzise-ukubala-okuzenzakalelayo\"\u003ELapho kufanele usebenzise Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E kuma-PDF nasezimfanekisweni emdwebweni ezingewona amabhulokhi (ezidwetshwe zikhululekile, noma ezihlukaniswe). Ezidwetshwe njengamabhulokhi, zibale lapha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukubala kwe-CAD ebhalweni leshidi (umyalo Bala emdwebweni kwezinye izitayela zemenyu) ibala okutholakala ku-DWG noma i-DXF. Lapho Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo kufuna isithombe senkomba bese kungaphuthelwa noma kutholwe okungelona, lokhu kubala izinto: yonke ifakwa yebhulokhi enegama elithi DOOR-36 ingumnyango oyodwa. Vula umdwebo kuqala: Vula umdwebo we-DWG noma i-DXF. Bala ibhulokhi Vula ishidi lomdwebo. I-Ukubala kwe-CAD isebhalweni leshidi. Yikhethe. Iwindi ludweba amabhulokhi nokuthi kangaki kwelinye ngalinye. Sesha ngegama, bese ukhetha elilodwa. Bheka umugqa ongaphansi kohlu: okungu-22 okutholakele, okungu-22 okuzongezwa. Ngaphansi kwe-Yengeza ku, khetha into yokubala, noma shiya Impawu entsha yokubala bese unikeza igama. Khetha inkinobho yokungeza, ebala inani: Engeza izimpawu angu-22. Izimpawu zivela ezindaweni zokufakwa kwebhulokhi, futhi inani lento liyinani lokubala. Yisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: Ctrl+Z isusa izimpawu (nento entsha) ndawonye. Isilinganiso sezindleko, ishidithi nei-PDF emakwe ziphatha into njengenye into yokubala. Okubalwayo Yonke ifakwa yegama lebhulokhi, noma ngasiphi isikali nanoma yiliphi i-engeli, kumodeli noma ephepheni. Amagama amabhulokhi awanandaba nezinhlamvu ezinkulu nezincane. Uhlu lwamabhulokhi (MINSERT): ikhophi ngayinye kuhlu iyodwa. Amabhulokhi angaphakathi kwamanye. Ibhulokhi elibekwe ngaphakathi kwelinye libalwa ezingeni ngalinye. Uhlu lusho ukuthi \"6 ngaphakathi kwamanye amabhulokhi\"; susa ukukhetha kwe-Bala namabhulokhi angaphakathi kwamanye amabhulokhi futhi ukuze ubale kuphela okufakwe ngqo emdwebweni. Amabhulokhi anamandla. Ibhulokhi elinamandla libalwa ngegama lalo, hhayi ngamakhophi angenamagama (*U12) afayela ligcina. Izimo zalo zidwetshwa ngokwehlukana (\"Single 12, Double 4\"): khetha imo ukuze ubale lezo kuphela, noma Yonke imisho. Uma ifayela lingasho ukuthi ikhophi ibonisa imo ephi, ziyadwetshwa njenge-\"(imo engaziwa)\". Isihlungo songqimba. Ibhulokhi emaqenjini amaningi: khetha elilodwa ngaphansi kwe-Ongqimbeni. Okungabalwa Ongqimba abafihliwe. Into esendaweni evaliwe noma eqandekile kufayela (noma eyifihla ku-Ongqimba) iyashiywa, nomugqa uthi ziningi kangakanani: \"3 on hidden layers left out\". Khetha Bala nazo futhi ukuze uzifake. Amafayela alinkiwe angavulwanga awabalwa; iwindi liyatshela lokho. Izinto ezibekwe ngqo phezu kwezinye zohlobo olufanayo zibalwa njengezimbili (ziyizinto ezimbili), futhi iwindi liyatshela: ngokuvamile kuyiphutha lokudweba elifanele ukubhekwa. Yonke yalo shidi, noma umdwebo wonke Lokho ishidi elibonisa libala izinto ishidi elizibonisayo: ku-ilayawuti, izinto zemodeli ezingaphakathi kwamafasitela alo okubuka (ongqimba obanjiwe kufasitela akubalwa lapho) kanye nezakhiwo zeilayawuti ngokwazo. Umdwebo wonke, into ngayinye kanye ubala imodeli kanye, nezimpawu ku-ishidi lemodeli, futhi ayibali okubonwa izakhiwo eziningi kabusha. Ukubala okubonwa yi-ilayawuti nokubala okubonwa yimodeli kunika inani elifanayo ngezinto ezifanayo; ungayengezi zombili kwento eyodwa. Bala ukubalwa futhi Ukubala kabusha ibhulokhi elifanayo ngento efanayo kwengeza okusha kuphela: \"Okungu-22 sekubalwe kwangaphambili.\" Impawu ngayinye imelela into eyodwa. Ngohlobo nongqimba Ku-Ngongqimba nohlobo khetha ongqimba nohlobo lwento (izindilinga, amaphola-layini, imigqa yokufiphaza…): \"zonke izindilinga ku-E-LITE\". Khetha Bala futhi izinto ezingaphakathi kwamabhulokhi ukuze uphinde ufake lezo ezingaphakathi kwezakhiwo zamabhulokhi, endaweni ngayinye lapho ibhulokhi lifakwe khona. Ngombhalo Ku-Ngombhalo bhala umbhalo, njengo A3, bese uchaza ukuthi uphelele, uqukethe lokho, noma ungamagama aphelele. Umbhalo wezinto, umbhalo wokuhola kanye nezinani zesici sebhulokhi zonke ziyabalwa (isici sethegi ITEM = A3 siyatholakala); khetha Kwisici ukubala isici esisodwa kuphela. Imibhalo evame kakhulu ibalwa ukuze ichofozwe. Lapho kufanele usebenzise Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo Sebenzisa Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo kuma-PDF nasezimfanekisweni emdwebweni ezingewona amabhulokhi (ezidwetshwe zikhululekile, noma ezihlukaniswe). Ezidwetshwe njengamabhulokhi, zibale lapha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"count-everything","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bala konke esethini","summary":"Bopha ikhiye lezimfanekiso bodwa, bese i-TakeoffCraft ibala yonke imfanekiso kuyo kuwo wonke amashidi avulekile ngokusebenza kanye. Ngalinye lisixhumanisi eshidini layo, futhi ubuyekeza ngaphambi kokuthi kwengezwe lutho.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["bala konke","ikhiye","ikhiye lezimfanekiso","sonke isethi","wonke amashidi","onke amashidi","yonke imnyango","yonke into yokukhanyisa","amadivayisi","uhlu","izimfanekiso","ukubala okuzenzakalelayo","bala konke","isethi yamapulani","amashidi angama-200","izinga lokufana","ukufana"],"headings":[{"id":"bala-ikhiye","text":"Bala ikhiye","level":2},{"id":"hlola-izinani","text":"Hlola izinani","level":2},{"id":"yengeza","text":"Yengeza","level":2},{"id":"usizo-lwakho","text":"Usizo lwakho","level":2},{"id":"izimfanekiso-zanoma-yiliphi-i-engeli","text":"Izimfanekiso zanoma yiliphi i-engeli","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala konke\u003C/span\u003E ifunda ikhiye lezimfanekiso bese ibala ngayinye kuyo kuwo wonke amashidi avulekile. Iyi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E yekhiye lonke ngesikhathi esisodwa. Ukufana kwezimfanekiso okuvamile kumashidi akho, hhayi imodeli eqeqeshiwe, futhi akukho okuphuma kukhompyutha yakho. Buyekeza izinani ngaphambi kokuthi uwengeze: kuwusizo, akusiyo isiqinisekiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bala-ikhiye\"\u003EBala ikhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula amapulani. Ikhiye eliselinye ishidi liyanele: izimfanekiso namagama azo eduze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala konke\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ibhokisi uzungeze ikhiye, izimfanekiso namagama. Isihloko esingenasimfanekiso eduze kwaso (SYMBOL LEGEND) siyashiywa sodwa. Iphaneli ibala ngayinye ngesithombe sayo negama elibhalwe eduze kwayo. Igama libe yigama lento, ngakho liguqule lapha uma uthanda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa ukukhetha kwanoma yiluphi uphawu ongafuni ukulubala. Uphawu olungasesheshwa (lusincane kakhulu, noma lungenalutho) buyachaza ukuthi kungani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala kumashidi angu-N\u003C/span\u003E. Ibha ikhombisa ishidi elisheshwayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E imisa ukusebenza. Ikhasi lisasebenziseka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhiye lezimfanekiso zalo azibalwa eshidini lalo. Ishidi elidwetshwe ngesikali esihlukile lisheshwa ngalesi sikali, futhi izimfanekiso ziyatholakala zigoqwe kunoma iyiphi ikona elilungile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-izinani\"\u003EHlola izinani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgayinye imfanekiso ibonisa inani layo namahlinzeka ngaphansi kwayo, isixhumanisi ngeshidi ngalinye elinalo (&quot;E-103: 4&quot;). Chofoza esinye ukuze uye kuleyo shidi. Okutholakele kubhokishwe ngombala wento.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChofoza ibhokisi\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ususe lokho okutholakele. Liba yimigqa emfushane futhi liqunjelwe; chofoza futhi ukuze ubuyise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa izinga lokufana\u003C/strong\u003E (kusukela ku-50% kuya ku-100%, liqala ezilungiselelweni zakho). Phezulu kugcina ukufana okuseduze kuphela. Isilayidi sihlunga kuphela lokho okutholakele; akusesheshwa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimfanekiso ezimbili ezibukeka zifana (isokhethi lezimbili nelezine) zingafana endaweni efanayo. Ukufana okungcono kuyithatha, futhi iphaneli iyatshela ukuthi zingaki izindawo ezinjalo, ukuze ukwazi ukuhlola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIshidi elikhulu kakhulu ukuthi lisheshwe ngosayizi wemfanekiso liyadlulwa, futhi iphaneli iyashoo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yengeza\"\u003EYengeza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYengeza izimpawu angu-N\u003C/span\u003E. Ngayinye imfanekiso iba yinto yokubala enempawu kuyo yonke okutholakele. Igama elikhona kakade njengento yakho yokubala liyasetshenziswa (akukho okuphindwayo lapho usuke umakile ngesandla). Konke lokhu kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela zonke izinto nezimpawu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwamukelwe nakho kuyanikela futhi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkufundiwe\u003C/span\u003E: izimfanekiso zikhunjulwa ku-fayela lokubala amanani ngesikhathi esizayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usizo-lwakho\"\u003EUsizo lwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvumela abasizi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E, bangafunda ikhiye (legend_open), basebenzise ukubala ngemuva (legend_count_start, bese legend_count_status), bafunde izinani (legend_count_result) futhi bazengeze (legend_count_add, okungabonisa kuqala okuzongezwa). Kuyisisebenzi esifanayo osibonayo ephaneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimfanekiso-zanoma-yiliphi-i-engeli\"\u003EIzimfanekiso zanoma yiliphi i-engeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimfanekiso zanoma yiliphi i-engeli\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokubala ukuze uphinde uthole izimfanekiso ezidwetshwe ngengile engesiyo engqo (ipulaki lodonga elithekelelayo, into yokukhanyisa ejikelezwe ukuze ilandele uphahla). Ukusesha kujikeleza ngayinye imfanekiso njalo ngamadigri angu-15; imfanekiso ejikile idinga ukusesha kanye, kanti imfanekiso engejikile ingathatha kuze kube kasithupha isikhathi eside. Yishiye ingakhethiwe kumapulani adwetshwe asikwele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdinga izimfanekiso ezidwetshwe ngendlela efanayo nasekhiyeni. Ikhiye elidwetshwe ngosayizi ohlukile kumashidi lihle uma izikali zamashidi zisethiwe; ngaphandle kwezikali, izimfanekiso zisheshwa ngosayizi wekhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImfanekiso enodonga noma umugqa omude odweba ngqo kuyo ingadlula, ngoba ayisafani nesithombe sekhiye. Hlola okutholakele eshidini lokuqala ngaphambi kokwethemba okunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIskeni elingenalutho lisasebenza: izimfanekiso zitholakala ngemigqa yazo, bese uthayipha amagama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Bala konke ifunda ikhiye lezimfanekiso bese ibala ngayinye kuyo kuwo wonke amashidi avulekile. Iyi-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo yekhiye lonke ngesikhathi esisodwa. Ukufana kwezimfanekiso okuvamile kumashidi akho, hhayi imodeli eqeqeshiwe, futhi akukho okuphuma kukhompyutha yakho. Buyekeza izinani ngaphambi kokuthi uwengeze: kuwusizo, akusiyo isiqinisekiso. Bala ikhiye Vula amapulani. Ikhiye eliselinye ishidi liyanele: izimfanekiso namagama azo eduze. Khetha Bala konke ethuluzini. Hudula ibhokisi uzungeze ikhiye, izimfanekiso namagama. Isihloko esingenasimfanekiso eduze kwaso (SYMBOL LEGEND) siyashiywa sodwa. Iphaneli ibala ngayinye ngesithombe sayo negama elibhalwe eduze kwayo. Igama libe yigama lento, ngakho liguqule lapha uma uthanda. Susa ukukhetha kwanoma yiluphi uphawu ongafuni ukulubala. Uphawu olungasesheshwa (lusincane kakhulu, noma lungenalutho) buyachaza ukuthi kungani. Khetha Bala kumashidi angu-N. Ibha ikhombisa ishidi elisheshwayo; Khansela imisa ukusebenza. Ikhasi lisasebenziseka. Ikhiye lezimfanekiso zalo azibalwa eshidini lalo. Ishidi elidwetshwe ngesikali esihlukile lisheshwa ngalesi sikali, futhi izimfanekiso ziyatholakala zigoqwe kunoma iyiphi ikona elilungile. Hlola izinani Ngayinye imfanekiso ibonisa inani layo namahlinzeka ngaphansi kwayo, isixhumanisi ngeshidi ngalinye elinalo (\"E-103: 4\"). Chofoza esinye ukuze uye kuleyo shidi. Okutholakele kubhokishwe ngombala wento. Chofoza ibhokisi ukuze ususe lokho okutholakele. Liba yimigqa emfushane futhi liqunjelwe; chofoza futhi ukuze ubuyise. Hambisa izinga lokufana (kusukela ku-50% kuya ku-100%, liqala ezilungiselelweni zakho). Phezulu kugcina ukufana okuseduze kuphela. Isilayidi sihlunga kuphela lokho okutholakele; akusesheshwa futhi. Izimfanekiso ezimbili ezibukeka zifana (isokhethi lezimbili nelezine) zingafana endaweni efanayo. Ukufana okungcono kuyithatha, futhi iphaneli iyatshela ukuthi zingaki izindawo ezinjalo, ukuze ukwazi ukuhlola. Ishidi elikhulu kakhulu ukuthi lisheshwe ngosayizi wemfanekiso liyadlulwa, futhi iphaneli iyashoo. Yengeza Khetha Yengeza izimpawu angu-N. Ngayinye imfanekiso iba yinto yokubala enempawu kuyo yonke okutholakele. Igama elikhona kakade njengento yakho yokubala liyasetshenziswa (akukho okuphindwayo lapho usuke umakile ngesandla). Konke lokhu kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z ibuyisela zonke izinto nezimpawu. Okwamukelwe nakho kuyanikela futhi ku-Okufundiwe: izimfanekiso zikhunjulwa ku-fayela lokubala amanani ngesikhathi esizayo. Usizo lwakho Uma uvumela abasizi ku-Izilungiselelo, bangafunda ikhiye (legend_open), basebenzise ukubala ngemuva (legend_count_start, bese legend_count_status), bafunde izinani (legend_count_result) futhi bazengeze (legend_count_add, okungabonisa kuqala okuzongezwa). Kuyisisebenzi esifanayo osibonayo ephaneli. Izimfanekiso zanoma yiliphi i-engeli Khetha Izimfanekiso zanoma yiliphi i-engeli ngaphambi kokubala ukuze uphinde uthole izimfanekiso ezidwetshwe ngengile engesiyo engqo (ipulaki lodonga elithekelelayo, into yokukhanyisa ejikelezwe ukuze ilandele uphahla). Ukusesha kujikeleza ngayinye imfanekiso njalo ngamadigri angu-15; imfanekiso ejikile idinga ukusesha kanye, kanti imfanekiso engejikile ingathatha kuze kube kasithupha isikhathi eside. Yishiye ingakhethiwe kumapulani adwetshwe asikwele. Okufanele wazi Idinga izimfanekiso ezidwetshwe ngendlela efanayo nasekhiyeni. Ikhiye elidwetshwe ngosayizi ohlukile kumashidi lihle uma izikali zamashidi zisethiwe; ngaphandle kwezikali, izimfanekiso zisheshwa ngosayizi wekhiye. Imfanekiso enodonga noma umugqa omude odweba ngqo kuyo ingadlula, ngoba ayisafani nesithombe sekhiye. Hlola okutholakele eshidini lokuqala ngaphambi kokwethemba okunye. Iskeni elingenalutho lisasebenza: izimfanekiso zitholakala ngemigqa yazo, bese uthayipha amagama.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"what-it-learned","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Okufundwe yi-TakeoffCraft kokubalwa kwakho","summary":"I-TakeoffCraft igcina izimpawu oziqinisekisile nge-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo, amasethi wezimo zakho, izinhlanganisela ozisebenzisa kakhulu nemikhuba oyiphindayo kuwo wonke amakhasi, konke ngaphakathi kwefayela lokubalwa lwayo. Bheka, sebenzisa, susa.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["funda","okufundiwe","ukufunda","umsizi","khumbula","izimpawu","amathempelethi","njengomsebenzi wokugcina","umsebenzi wokugcina","isethi yezimo","izimo","sebenzisa kabusha","izinhlanganisela","ezisetshenziswa kakhulu","iziphakamiso","phinda kuwo wonke amakhasi","wonke amakhasi","ibhulokhi yesihloko","ipethini","sula konke","khohlwa","ubumfihlo"],"headings":[{"id":"izimpawu","text":"Izimpawu","level":2},{"id":"amasethi-wezimo","text":"Amasethi wezimo","level":2},{"id":"njengomsebenzi-wokugcina","text":"Njengomsebenzi wokugcina","level":2},{"id":"izinhlanganisela-ozisebenzisa-kakhulu","text":"Izinhlanganisela ozisebenzisa kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"phinda-kuwo-wonke-amakhasi","text":"Phinda kuwo wonke amakhasi","level":2},{"id":"bheka-susa","text":"Bheka, susa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-uyazi","text":"Okufanele uyazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft iba ngcono ngokuthi usebenza kakhulu ngayo. Ifunda \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuphela kulokho okwamukelayo\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizimpawu owaziboxe nge-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/a\u003E bese uzengeza,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamasethi wezimo ozigcinayo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizinhlanganisela ozisebenzisayo (kanye ngomsebenzi),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamaphethini wezimaki ozipheyo kuwo wonke amakhasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwukufanisa okulula kumashidi akho, okufana nokusesha okusetshenziswa yi-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo. Akuyona imodeli eqeqeshiwe. Konke ayifundayo kugcinwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekulelifayela lalokhu kubalwa\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E), futhi akukho lutho olithunyelwa noma kuphi. Ukuyithatha iye emsebenzini olandelayo, sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/what-it-learned#same-as-last-job\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/what-it-learned\" data-hash=\"same-as-last-job\"\u003ENjengomsebenzi wokugcina\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar (isibani, eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E) ukuze ubone konke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimpawu\"\u003EIzimpawu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uboxa isimpawu nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E, isimpawu osiboxile siyagcinwa, nezinga lokufanisa owalamukela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind on this sheet\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind on every sheet\u003C/span\u003E. Ukubuyekeza kwe-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo okujwayelekile kuyavulwa: chofoza ibhokisi ukuze uyikhiphe, hambisa isilayidi, bese uzengeza. Akukho okungezwa size wenze lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uvula ishidi elingenalo isimpawu esifundiwe, ibha esiphezulu inikeza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind …\u003C/span\u003E salo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E iyawufihla lelo shidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ukubala kungenaso isinto segama elifanayo, ukwengeza izimaki kwengeza nento (isinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkungeza futhi isimpawu sento efanayo kubalwa kulowo esawaziyo; isimpawu esibukeka ngenye indlela sigcinwa njengesesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENjenge-Auto count, ifumana isimpawu ngama-engeli alungile nasemashidini esilinganiso esihlukile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amasethi-wezimo\"\u003EAmasethi wezimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsethi igcina izimo zokubalwa (izinto namayunithi, amazinga, ukulahlekelwa nezinhlanganisela), ngaphandle kwezimaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave this takeoff&#039;s conditions as a set…\u003C/span\u003E bese unikeza igama. Isethi enegama elifanayo iyashintshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEkubalweni okunesethi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E ifaka izimo ezingekho kuyo. Izimo ezinegama nohlobo olufanayo ziyashiywa ngaphandle kokuthintwa. Kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"njengomsebenzi-wokugcina\"\u003ENjengomsebenzi wokugcina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lomsebenzi wokugcina liqukethe lokho okufundile. Ukuqala umsebenzi omusha kusuka kulo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula amapulani amasha, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESame as last job…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha i-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E yomsebenzi wokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThika lokho okufanele kuletwe: izimo zawo (ezo kuphela ezingekho kulokhu kubalwa), nalokho okufundile (izimpawu, amasethi, izinhlanganisela, amaphethini). Bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBring them in\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimo zawo zigcinwa njengesethi equmbethe igama lalowo msebenzi. Izimaki nezinani zawo zihlala kwifayela lawo. Konke kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlanganisela-ozisebenzisa-kakhulu\"\u003EIzinhlanganisela ozisebenzisa kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto enenhlanganisela ibalwa njengesetshenziswe kanye ngomsebenzi lapho inenani futhi ulondoloza ukubala. Umsebenzi uyisethi yamafayela eplani okubalwa kuwo, ngakho ukulondoloza kabusha lokubala kuvele akubaliwe kabili. Uhlu oluphansi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssemblies you use most\u003C/span\u003E ibeka ezisetshenziswa kakhulu phambili. Lukhipha ezikhona kakade kulokhu kubalwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E ifaka eyodwa njengoba uyisebenzise ekugcineni, nazo zonke izingxenye zayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phinda-kuwo-wonke-amakhasi\"\u003EPhinda kuwo wonke amakhasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwezimaki ezifanayo kuwo wonke amakhasi esethi, njengenani lebhulokhi yesihloko noma umbhalo ojwayelekile:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izimaki eshidini elilodwa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EKhetha izimaki\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeat the selected marks on every page…\u003C/span\u003E, bese uqamba ipethini bese uqinisekisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZihamba kuwo wonke amanye amakhasi avulekile \u003Cstrong\u003Eanosayizi ofanayo\u003C/strong\u003E, endaweni efanayo, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ubude nezindawo zihamba kuphela emakhasini anesilinganiso esifanayo; izinani zihamba kunoma yiliphi ikhasi lalolo sayizi. Ikhasi elinazo sele liyadlulwa. Ipethini iyagcinwa, ngakho amakhasi ovula kamuva athola isiphakamiso ebhendeni, noma usebenzise \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeat on every page\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-susa\"\u003EBheka, susa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okufundiwe kudweshwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E. Inkomba isusa into eyodwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear all\u003C/span\u003E isusa konke okufundiwe futhi ishiye izinto nezimaki zakho zisendaweni. Womabili angahlehliswa kuze uvale ukubala, futhi womabili agcinwa nokubala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uyeke ukufunda kokubalwa okukodwa, susa ukukhethwa kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn from this takeoff\u003C/span\u003E. Akukho okusha okufundwayo, kanti okudweshiwe kuhlala kuze ukususe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-uyazi\"\u003EOkufanele uyazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinguqulo zangaphambili ze-TakeoffCraft zivula ifayela elinento efundiwe ngokujwayelekile. Zinganaki lolo lolwazi, futhi uma zilondoloza ifayela futhi, ziyalususa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimpawu esifundiwe siyisithombe esincane sento oyiboxile, esigcinwa kulelifayela (ama-KB ambalwa ngamunye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpawu ezifundiwe ziyasesha njengoba i-Auto count isesha, ngakho imikhawulo efanayo iyasebenza: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EUkubala isimpawu ngokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-TakeoffCraft iba ngcono ngokuthi usebenza kakhulu ngayo. Ifunda kuphela kulokho okwamukelayo: izimpawu owaziboxe nge-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo bese uzengeza, amasethi wezimo ozigcinayo, izinhlanganisela ozisebenzisayo (kanye ngomsebenzi), amaphethini wezimaki ozipheyo kuwo wonke amakhasi. Kuwukufanisa okulula kumashidi akho, okufana nokusesha okusetshenziswa yi-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo. Akuyona imodeli eqeqeshiwe. Konke ayifundayo kugcinwa kulelifayela lalokhu kubalwa (.takeoff.json), futhi akukho lutho olithunyelwa noma kuphi. Ukuyithatha iye emsebenzini olandelayo, sebenzisa Njengomsebenzi wokugcina. Khetha Learned ku-toolbar (isibani, eduze kwe-Auto count) ukuze ubone konke. Izimpawu Uma uboxa isimpawu nge-Auto count bese ukhetha Add, isimpawu osiboxile siyagcinwa, nezinga lokufanisa owalamukela. Ku-Learned, khetha Find on this sheet noma Find on every sheet. Ukubuyekeza kwe-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo okujwayelekile kuyavulwa: chofoza ibhokisi ukuze uyikhiphe, hambisa isilayidi, bese uzengeza. Akukho okungezwa size wenze lokho. Uma uvula ishidi elingenalo isimpawu esifundiwe, ibha esiphezulu inikeza Find … salo. Not now iyawufihla lelo shidi. Uma ukubala kungenaso isinto segama elifanayo, ukwengeza izimaki kwengeza nento (isinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa). Ukungeza futhi isimpawu sento efanayo kubalwa kulowo esawaziyo; isimpawu esibukeka ngenye indlela sigcinwa njengesesibili. Njenge-Auto count, ifumana isimpawu ngama-engeli alungile nasemashidini esilinganiso esihlukile. Amasethi wezimo Isethi igcina izimo zokubalwa (izinto namayunithi, amazinga, ukulahlekelwa nezinhlanganisela), ngaphandle kwezimaki. Ku-Learned, khetha Save this takeoff's conditions as a set… bese unikeza igama. Isethi enegama elifanayo iyashintshwa. Ekubalweni okunesethi, Add ifaka izimo ezingekho kuyo. Izimo ezinegama nohlobo olufanayo ziyashiywa ngaphandle kokuthintwa. Kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa. Njengomsebenzi wokugcina Ifayela lomsebenzi wokugcina liqukethe lokho okufundile. Ukuqala umsebenzi omusha kusuka kulo: Vula amapulani amasha, bese ukhetha Learned › Same as last job…. Khetha i-.takeoff.json yomsebenzi wokugcina. Thika lokho okufanele kuletwe: izimo zawo (ezo kuphela ezingekho kulokhu kubalwa), nalokho okufundile (izimpawu, amasethi, izinhlanganisela, amaphethini). Bese ukhetha Bring them in. Izimo zawo zigcinwa njengesethi equmbethe igama lalowo msebenzi. Izimaki nezinani zawo zihlala kwifayela lawo. Konke kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa. Izinhlanganisela ozisebenzisa kakhulu Into enenhlanganisela ibalwa njengesetshenziswe kanye ngomsebenzi lapho inenani futhi ulondoloza ukubala. Umsebenzi uyisethi yamafayela eplani okubalwa kuwo, ngakho ukulondoloza kabusha lokubala kuvele akubaliwe kabili. Uhlu oluphansi Assemblies you use most ibeka ezisetshenziswa kakhulu phambili. Lukhipha ezikhona kakade kulokhu kubalwa. Add ifaka eyodwa njengoba uyisebenzise ekugcineni, nazo zonke izingxenye zayo. Phinda kuwo wonke amakhasi Kwezimaki ezifanayo kuwo wonke amakhasi esethi, njengenani lebhulokhi yesihloko noma umbhalo ojwayelekile: Khetha izimaki eshidini elilodwa (Khetha izimaki). Ku-Learned, khetha Repeat the selected marks on every page…, bese uqamba ipethini bese uqinisekisa. Zihamba kuwo wonke amanye amakhasi avulekile anosayizi ofanayo, endaweni efanayo, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ubude nezindawo zihamba kuphela emakhasini anesilinganiso esifanayo; izinani zihamba kunoma yiliphi ikhasi lalolo sayizi. Ikhasi elinazo sele liyadlulwa. Ipethini iyagcinwa, ngakho amakhasi ovula kamuva athola isiphakamiso ebhendeni, noma usebenzise Repeat on every page ohlwini. Bheka, susa Konke okufundiwe kudweshwe ku-Learned. Inkomba isusa into eyodwa. Clear all isusa konke okufundiwe futhi ishiye izinto nezimaki zakho zisendaweni. Womabili angahlehliswa kuze uvale ukubala, futhi womabili agcinwa nokubala. Ukuze uyeke ukufunda kokubalwa okukodwa, susa ukukhethwa kwe-Learn from this takeoff. Akukho okusha okufundwayo, kanti okudweshiwe kuhlala kuze ukususe. Okufanele uyazi Izinguqulo zangaphambili ze-TakeoffCraft zivula ifayela elinento efundiwe ngokujwayelekile. Zinganaki lolo lolwazi, futhi uma zilondoloza ifayela futhi, ziyalususa. Isimpawu esifundiwe siyisithombe esincane sento oyiboxile, esigcinwa kulelifayela (ama-KB ambalwa ngamunye). Izimpawu ezifundiwe ziyasesha njengoba i-Auto count isesha, ngakho imikhawulo efanayo iyasebenza: Ukubala isimpawu ngokuzenzakalelayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"price-memory","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Inkumbulo yezintengo kusuka kwimisebenzi yakho yakudala","summary":"I-TakeoffCraft ikhumbula amazinga osebenzise kumabalo wangaphambili, kule kompyutha kuphela, ukuze ukubala okusha kuqale ngalokho ukhokhe ngakho ngesikhathi esedlule. Bona kuwo, usebenzise kuwo, ukhohlwe kuwo.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["inkumbulo yentengo","izintengo","khumbula izintengo","ukubala kwakamuva","imisebenzi yakudala","intengo ejwayelekile","imediyane","amazinga","engakhishwanga intengo","buyekeza intengo","funda kubalo lwangaphambili","khohlwa","umtapo"],"headings":[{"id":"okukhunjuliwayo","text":"Okukhunjuliwayo","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-kukubala-olusha","text":"Sebenzisa kukubala olusha","level":2},{"id":"bona-shintsha-khohlwa","text":"Bona, shintsha, khohlwa","level":2},{"id":"nomsizi-wakho","text":"Nomsizi wakho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi (uphawu lwe-dollar) livula okukhunjulwayo yi-TakeoffCraft ngezintengo osebenzise zona. Iluhlu elilula: ngegama ngalinye lento, amazinga kumabalo akho amuva. Igcinwa kule bhrawuza (ku-Studio, ibhrawuza layo) ecaleni komtapo wezintengo, ingasoze ingene efayeleni lokubala, futhi ayikho ethunyelwa noyiphi indawo. Ayisiyo imodeli eqeqeshiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukhunjuliwayo\"\u003EOkukhunjuliwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ulondoloza ukubala, yonke into enentengo futhi esetshenzisiwe (inamamaki noma inani elithayiwe elingaphezu kwe-zero) ikhunjulwa ngegama nohlobo lwayo: izinga lezinto, izinga labasebenzi, ukulahleka kanye neyunithi. Ukubala kwefayela kuyiwo wonke amapulani okhishwa kuwo, ngakho ukulondoloza ukubala okufanayo futhi kubuyisela izintengo zawo, akwengezi omunye umsebenzi. Ukubala okungu-12 okugcina kugcinwa ngegama ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uqale ngomsebenzi wakudala, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFunda kusuka kubalo olwedlule…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ukubala okulondoloziwe (.json). Izinto zalo ezinentengo nezisetshenzisiwe zikhunjulwa ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmagama ayahambisana uma amagama awo efana, nanoma kunjani amacala noma izimpawu (&quot;2x4 Stud, 8 ft&quot; no &quot;2x4 stud 8 FT&quot; zifana). Amanye amagama ohlobo olufanayo (into ye-linear nento yokubala) akuyona intengo efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-kukubala-olusha\"\u003ESebenzisa kukubala olusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza izinto zokubala olusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELokhu kubalo\u003C/span\u003E ubona yonke into enentengo okhunjuliwe, okuyo manje kuyo, amazinga okubala kokugcina, amazinga ajwayelekile (phakathi kwemisebenzi ekhunjuliwe) nobubanzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa okokugcina\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa ojwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E kwento eyodwa, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBela izinto ezingu-N ezingenantengo kusuka enkumbulweni\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ugcwalise zonke izinto ezingenayo intengo kusuka kubalo lokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsinyathelo ngasinye siyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E siyasibuyisela emuva. Igama elifana nalo kuphela (igama elilodwa lingaphakathi kwelinye) liyakubonisa, futhi izinkinobho zisebenzisa izintengo zegama elifana nalo. Intengo ekhunjulwe ngayinye ayikaze ibekwe kwento ngefidi: ingxoxo ithi iyunithi ahlukile futhi iyishiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-shintsha-khohlwa\"\u003EBona, shintsha, khohlwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke okugcinwe enkumbulweni\u003C/span\u003E ludweba wonke amagama namazinga nenani lemisebenzi. Inkinobho yemfucuza ikhohlwa igama elilodwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula wonke amanani\u003C/span\u003E ikhohlwa lonke. Vala \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhumbula amanani ami lapho ngigcina ibalo\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyeke ukukhumbula; okusele kuhlala kuze kube yilapho ukukhohlwa. Okubalwa kwakho nomtapo wezintengo akukaze kuthintwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nomsizi-wakho\"\u003ENomsizi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvumele abasizi ezilungiselelweni, bangafunda okukhunjuliwe ngezinto zokubala (prices_list) futhi banikeze izinto intengo kusuka kukho (prices_apply, engabonisa kuqala). Iluhlu olufanayo naledayalogi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amanani kwithuluzi (uphawu lwe-dollar) livula okukhunjulwayo yi-TakeoffCraft ngezintengo osebenzise zona. Iluhlu elilula: ngegama ngalinye lento, amazinga kumabalo akho amuva. Igcinwa kule bhrawuza (ku-Studio, ibhrawuza layo) ecaleni komtapo wezintengo, ingasoze ingene efayeleni lokubala, futhi ayikho ethunyelwa noyiphi indawo. Ayisiyo imodeli eqeqeshiwe. Okukhunjuliwayo Uma ulondoloza ukubala, yonke into enentengo futhi esetshenzisiwe (inamamaki noma inani elithayiwe elingaphezu kwe-zero) ikhunjulwa ngegama nohlobo lwayo: izinga lezinto, izinga labasebenzi, ukulahleka kanye neyunithi. Ukubala kwefayela kuyiwo wonke amapulani okhishwa kuwo, ngakho ukulondoloza ukubala okufanayo futhi kubuyisela izintengo zawo, akwengezi omunye umsebenzi. Ukubala okungu-12 okugcina kugcinwa ngegama ngalinye. Ukuze uqale ngomsebenzi wakudala, khetha Funda kusuka kubalo olwedlule… bese ukhetha ukubala okulondoloziwe (.json). Izinto zalo ezinentengo nezisetshenzisiwe zikhunjulwa ngendlela efanayo. Amagama ayahambisana uma amagama awo efana, nanoma kunjani amacala noma izimpawu (\"2x4 Stud, 8 ft\" no \"2x4 stud 8 FT\" zifana). Amanye amagama ohlobo olufanayo (into ye-linear nento yokubala) akuyona intengo efanayo. Sebenzisa kukubala olusha Yenza izinto zokubala olusha. Khetha Amanani. Ngaphansi kwe-Lokhu kubalo ubona yonke into enentengo okhunjuliwe, okuyo manje kuyo, amazinga okubala kokugcina, amazinga ajwayelekile (phakathi kwemisebenzi ekhunjuliwe) nobubanzi. Khetha Sebenzisa okokugcina noma Sebenzisa ojwayelekile kwento eyodwa, noma Bela izinto ezingu-N ezingenantengo kusuka enkumbulweni ukuze ugcwalise zonke izinto ezingenayo intengo kusuka kubalo lokugcina. Isinyathelo ngasinye siyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z siyasibuyisela emuva. Igama elifana nalo kuphela (igama elilodwa lingaphakathi kwelinye) liyakubonisa, futhi izinkinobho zisebenzisa izintengo zegama elifana nalo. Intengo ekhunjulwe ngayinye ayikaze ibekwe kwento ngefidi: ingxoxo ithi iyunithi ahlukile futhi iyishiya. Bona, shintsha, khohlwa Konke okugcinwe enkumbulweni ludweba wonke amagama namazinga nenani lemisebenzi. Inkinobho yemfucuza ikhohlwa igama elilodwa; Sula wonke amanani ikhohlwa lonke. Vala Khumbula amanani ami lapho ngigcina ibalo ukuze uyeke ukukhumbula; okusele kuhlala kuze kube yilapho ukukhohlwa. Okubalwa kwakho nomtapo wezintengo akukaze kuthintwe. Nomsizi wakho Uma uvumele abasizi ezilungiselelweni, bangafunda okukhunjuliwe ngezinto zokubala (prices_list) futhi banikeze izinto intengo kusuka kukho (prices_apply, engabonisa kuqala). Iluhlu olufanayo naledayalogi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"supplier-stock","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hlola umgcinimali womhlinzeki nezikhathi zokulinda","summary":"Engeza uhlu lomgcinimali womhlinzeki (CSV noma ishidi lesipredishithi) bese i-TakeoffCraft ihlola okudingwa ukubalwa, kanye nokulahleka, ngalo: kwanele emgcinimalini, nokuthi ukulinda kuzoba isikhathi esingakanani. Ukushoda nokulinda isikhathi eside kuvela ku-ipaneli Yezinkinga.","section":"tasks","order":74,"keywords":["umhlinzeki","umgcinimali","usemgcinimalini","isikhathi sokulethwa","ukutholakala","ukushoda","backorder","uhlu lokuyala","csv","sku","umthengisi","izinto zokwakha","inikezelo","izinkinga"],"headings":[{"id":"ifayela","text":"Ifayela","level":2},{"id":"hlola-umbalo","text":"Hlola umbalo","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-eshidi-nethala-lamanani","text":"Amafayela eshidi nethala lamanani","level":2},{"id":"ku-ipaneli-yezinkinga","text":"Ku-ipaneli Yezinkinga","level":2},{"id":"nomsizi-wakho","text":"Nomsizi wakho","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInikezelo\u003C/span\u003E phezu kwethuluzi (ilori) ihlola okudingwa ukubalwa kwakho ngokumelene nohlu lomgcinimali womhlinzeki. Imigqa yomhlinzeki ebalulekile igcinwa efayelini lokubala lakho. Akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi, futhi akukho okucela umhlinzeki: wena uletha ifayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifayela\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-CSV elinomugqa wesihloko. Lidinga ikholomu yegama noma ye-SKU, nekholomu yomgcinimali noma yesikhathi sokulethwa. Lezi zihloko ziyavunywa (noma yiliphi uhlelo, noma yimaphi amacala): Item, Name, Description noma Product; SKU, Part noma Item #; In stock, On hand, Available noma Quantity; Lead time noma Delivery days; Unit noma UOM; Price noma Cost; Supplier noma Vendor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmgcinimali ungaba inombolo (1,200), &quot;In stock&quot; noma &quot;Out of stock&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhathi sokulethwa singaba &quot;5 days&quot;, &quot;2 weeks&quot;, &quot;2-3 weeks&quot; (oluthathwe olude), &quot;3 months&quot;, &quot;same day&quot; noma &quot;backorder&quot;. Inombolo evamile ingeyesihloko (izinsuku, ngaphandle uma isihloko sisho amaviki noma izinyanga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmafayela e-Excel awafundwa: gcina ishidi njenge-CSV kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-umbalo\"\u003EHlola umbalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInikezelo\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ifayela lomhlinzeki…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha i-CSV. Engeza amafayela amaningi: kuze kube ngamafayela amahlanu, izimuva ezingu-2,000 kulonke, lezo ezihambisana nezinto zakho kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke into, isimo sesibili kanye nezingxenye zesakhiwo ezinenani ihlanganiswa nomugqa ngegama, noma nge-SKU egameni layo. Igama elifanayo (elisesinye) lisetshenziswa uma kungekho elifanayo ngokuphelele, futhi kuyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkudingwa umbalo\u003C/span\u003E, ezimfushane zivela kuqala: &quot;Short by 120 EA&quot;, &quot;Lead time 21 days&quot;, &quot;On backorder&quot;, &quot;Unit differs&quot;, &quot;No stock figure&quot; noma &quot;In stock&quot;. Ukudinga kubandakanya ukulahleka. Iyunithi yomhlinzeki engafani neyesilinganiso (iton ngokuchasene nefithi) iyabikwa futhi ayiqhathaniswa ngalutho. Umugqa ngamunye unento \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha into\u003C/span\u003E, eyakuyisa kulolo hlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhathi eside kakhulu esifunwayo (izinsuku)\u003C/span\u003E (okuzenzakalelayo kungu-14). Into engekho emgcinimalini futhi elinda ngaphezu kwalokho imakwa, nesifinyezo sitshela ukulinda okude okubalulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lokuyala (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E ilanda izinto ezishoda, nenani elishodayo, umhlinzeki, nesikhathi sokulethwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShiya ngaphandle\u003C/span\u003E isusa ukudinga ekuhloleni (kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-eshidi-nethala-lamanani\"\u003EAmafayela eshidi nethala lamanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lomhlinzeki lungaba incwadi ye-Excel (.xlsx) njenge-CSV: ishidi lokuqala liyafundwa, ngamagama wamakholomu afanayo. Izifomula azisebenzi; inani elibanjwe yifayela ngokwalo liyafundwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela lamanani sele lengeziwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani angena emtapweni\u003C/span\u003E kuleli bhokisi isetha intengo yempahla yayo yonke into ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/a\u003E elinamanani ifayela: igama elifanayo, neyunithi efanayo (noma engakhulunywanga). Umsebenzi, ukulahleka, ubude nezinhlanganisela kuhlala njengoba kunjalo, futhi inothi lento lisho ukuthi intengo yaphuma kuphi ifayela. Into ngamamitha ayipriciwe ngohlu lwamafithi, futhi into engenagama elifanayo ishiywa ngaphandle; umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi kuyangana kangakanani okushiywe ngenxa yeyunithi. Phinda ukupriciwa kusuka ku-Umtapo ukuze ufake amanani amasha kulo mbalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ipaneli-yezinkinga\"\u003EKu-ipaneli Yezinkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushoda kuyisexwayiso, nokulinda isikhathi eside kuyinothi, ku-ipaneli eyabelanwa yezinkinga (&quot;Supplier stock&quot;), ngakho zihlala nezinye izinhlolo zonke. Ungayamukela ngesizathu, futhi ukwamukela kugcinwa embalweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nomsizi-wakho\"\u003ENomsizi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvumela abasizi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E, bangafunda ukuhlola (supply_check). Ukungeza ifayela lomhlinzeki kungokwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzibalo zomgcinimali zilungile njengalo ifayela oliwengezayo. Engeza ifayela futhi ukuze uvuselele: ifayela elinegama elifanayo liyawushintsha owangaphambilini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Inikezelo phezu kwethuluzi (ilori) ihlola okudingwa ukubalwa kwakho ngokumelene nohlu lomgcinimali womhlinzeki. Imigqa yomhlinzeki ebalulekile igcinwa efayelini lokubala lakho. Akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi, futhi akukho okucela umhlinzeki: wena uletha ifayela. Ifayela Ifayela le-CSV elinomugqa wesihloko. Lidinga ikholomu yegama noma ye-SKU, nekholomu yomgcinimali noma yesikhathi sokulethwa. Lezi zihloko ziyavunywa (noma yiliphi uhlelo, noma yimaphi amacala): Item, Name, Description noma Product; SKU, Part noma Item #; In stock, On hand, Available noma Quantity; Lead time noma Delivery days; Unit noma UOM; Price noma Cost; Supplier noma Vendor. Umgcinimali ungaba inombolo (1,200), \"In stock\" noma \"Out of stock\". Isikhathi sokulethwa singaba \"5 days\", \"2 weeks\", \"2-3 weeks\" (oluthathwe olude), \"3 months\", \"same day\" noma \"backorder\". Inombolo evamile ingeyesihloko (izinsuku, ngaphandle uma isihloko sisho amaviki noma izinyanga). Amafayela e-Excel awafundwa: gcina ishidi njenge-CSV kuqala. Hlola umbalo Khetha Inikezelo, bese Engeza ifayela lomhlinzeki… bese ukhetha i-CSV. Engeza amafayela amaningi: kuze kube ngamafayela amahlanu, izimuva ezingu-2,000 kulonke, lezo ezihambisana nezinto zakho kuqala. Yonke into, isimo sesibili kanye nezingxenye zesakhiwo ezinenani ihlanganiswa nomugqa ngegama, noma nge-SKU egameni layo. Igama elifanayo (elisesinye) lisetshenziswa uma kungekho elifanayo ngokuphelele, futhi kuyasho lokho. Ngaphansi kwe-Okudingwa umbalo, ezimfushane zivela kuqala: \"Short by 120 EA\", \"Lead time 21 days\", \"On backorder\", \"Unit differs\", \"No stock figure\" noma \"In stock\". Ukudinga kubandakanya ukulahleka. Iyunithi yomhlinzeki engafani neyesilinganiso (iton ngokuchasene nefithi) iyabikwa futhi ayiqhathaniswa ngalutho. Umugqa ngamunye unento Khetha into, eyakuyisa kulolo hlobo. Setha Isikhathi eside kakhulu esifunwayo (izinsuku) (okuzenzakalelayo kungu-14). Into engekho emgcinimalini futhi elinda ngaphezu kwalokho imakwa, nesifinyezo sitshela ukulinda okude okubalulekile. Uhlu lokuyala (CSV) ilanda izinto ezishoda, nenani elishodayo, umhlinzeki, nesikhathi sokulethwa. Shiya ngaphandle isusa ukudinga ekuhloleni (kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa). Amafayela eshidi nethala lamanani Uhlu lomhlinzeki lungaba incwadi ye-Excel (.xlsx) njenge-CSV: ishidi lokuqala liyafundwa, ngamagama wamakholomu afanayo. Izifomula azisebenzi; inani elibanjwe yifayela ngokwalo liyafundwa. Uma ifayela lamanani sele lengeziwe, Amanani angena emtapweni kuleli bhokisi isetha intengo yempahla yayo yonke into ku-Umtapo elinamanani ifayela: igama elifanayo, neyunithi efanayo (noma engakhulunywanga). Umsebenzi, ukulahleka, ubude nezinhlanganisela kuhlala njengoba kunjalo, futhi inothi lento lisho ukuthi intengo yaphuma kuphi ifayela. Into ngamamitha ayipriciwe ngohlu lwamafithi, futhi into engenagama elifanayo ishiywa ngaphandle; umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi kuyangana kangakanani okushiywe ngenxa yeyunithi. Phinda ukupriciwa kusuka ku-Umtapo ukuze ufake amanani amasha kulo mbalo. Ku-ipaneli Yezinkinga Ukushoda kuyisexwayiso, nokulinda isikhathi eside kuyinothi, ku-ipaneli eyabelanwa yezinkinga (\"Supplier stock\"), ngakho zihlala nezinye izinhlolo zonke. Ungayamukela ngesizathu, futhi ukwamukela kugcinwa embalweni. Nomsizi wakho Uma uvumela abasizi ku-Izilungiselelo, bangafunda ukuhlola (supply_check). Ukungeza ifayela lomhlinzeki kungokwakho. Okufanele ukwazi Izibalo zomgcinimali zilungile njengalo ifayela oliwengezayo. Engeza ifayela futhi ukuze uvuselele: ifayela elinegama elifanayo liyawushintsha owangaphambilini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kopisha, namathisela uphinde uphindaphinde izimpawu","summary":"Kopisha izimpawu nezinto zazo, namathisela lapho uchofoza khona noma endaweni efanayo kwelinye ishidi, phinda, sika, susa nikhethe konke, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa ngasinye.","section":"tasks","order":75,"keywords":["kopisha","namathisela","sika","phinda","namathisela endaweni","ibhodi lokopha","khetha konke","khetha lutho","izimpawu eziningi","ukuphindwa","ifloro elijwayelekile","lowo mdwebo","elinye ishidi","kopisha into","phinda into"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-izimpawu","text":"Khetha izimpawu","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-namathisela-lapho-uchofoza","text":"Kopisha namathisela lapho uchofoza","level":2},{"id":"namathisela-endaweni","text":"Namathisela endaweni","level":2},{"id":"isikali-kufanele-sifane","text":"Isikali kufanele sifane","level":2},{"id":"phinda","text":"Phinda","level":2},{"id":"sika-nokususa","text":"Sika nokususa","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-into","text":"Kopisha into","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIqembu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E lethuluzi libamba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E. Imenyu yalo ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkunye\u003C/span\u003E inezinye, nokhiye bayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha konke\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/span\u003E. Konke lokhu kunesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-izimpawu\"\u003EKhetha izimpawu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uchofoza impawu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uchofoze ezinye izimpawu ukuze uzengeze. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza impawu ekhethiwe iyayisusa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha konke\u003C/span\u003E) ukuthatha zonke izimpawu eshidini elivulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kukhethwe izimpawu eziningi, iphaneli esokudla ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EIzimpawu ezikhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: zingaki zento ngayinye, nezinkinobho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa izimpawu\u003C/span\u003E. Izibambi zamakhona zivela kuphela uma kukhethwe impawu eyodwa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/span\u003E) ucisha ukukhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-namathisela-lapho-uchofoza\"\u003EKopisha namathisela lapho uchofoza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izimpawu bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E). Izimpawu zikopishwa nezinto zazo, kuhlanganise nomhlanganisela wento ngayinye, ukulahleka nezindleko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIya eshidini ofuna ukuzibeka kulo (lingaba yishidi elifanayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E). Ikhophi eyisicaba-ngamachashaza ilandela isikhombi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho okufanele khona. Maphakathi ezimpawu ezikopishiwe afika esikhombini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhansela futhi ayengezi lutho. Izimpawu ezinamathiselwe zikhethwa ngemva kwalokho, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuzisusa futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-takeoff efanayo, izimpawu ezinamathiselwe zihamba kwi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eizinto ezifanayo\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakho amanani azo engeza kulezo zinto. Kwenye takeoff (ithebhu enye, noma ngemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntsha\u003C/span\u003E), kusetshenziswa into enegama nohlobo olufanayo; ngaphandle kwalokho into yengezwa nomhlanganisela wayo. Uma igama selithathwe yinto yohlobo oluhlukile, into engeziwe ibizwa ngokuthi &quot;(igama) (ikhophi)&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimpawu ezinamathiselwe zihamba endaweni yezindleko ekhethwe phezulu ephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E (noma kungekho). Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EIzindawo zezindleko\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"namathisela-endaweni\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E) ibeka ikhophi endaweni efanayo ngqo eshidini elivulekile, ngokuma kwayo ekhasini. Yisebenzise ifloro elijwayelekile: bala izinga 2, kopisha, vula izinga 3, namathisela endaweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENamathisela endaweni udinga ishidi \u003Cstrong\u003Eelifanayo ngosayizi\u003C/strong\u003E nelakopishwa kulo. Kushidi losayizi ohlukile i-TakeoffCraft iyatshela futhi ayinamathisi lutho; sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E uchofoze. Eshidini elakopishwa kulo, ikhophi ifika phezu kwezimpawu zokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikali-kufanele-sifane\"\u003EIsikali kufanele sifane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbude nezindawo kuncike esikalini seshidi. Umugqa okala u-10&#039; ngo-1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; wawuzokala u-20&#039; eshidini elingu-1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;. Ngakho i-TakeoffCraft inamathisela imigqa nezindawo kuphela eshidini elinesikali \u003Cstrong\u003Eesifanayo\u003C/strong\u003E neshidi elavela kulo, futhi iyatshela uma lingenjalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIshidi elivulekile alinasikali okwamanje: linike okokuqala (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E), bese unamathisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIshidi elivulekile linesikali esehlukile: umlayezo ubiza zombili izikali. Namathisela eshidini elinesikali elifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinani azidingi sikali: izinani ezikopishiwe zinamathiselwa noma kuphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phinda\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E) ikopisha izimpawu ezikhethiwe ibeke ikhophi esikhombini ngokushesha; chofoza lapho okufanele khona. Akukho okungezwa kuze uchofoze, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E akushiyi lutho. Ukuphinda akushintshi lokho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E alunamathisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-nokususa\"\u003ESika nokususa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E) ikopisha izimpawu ezikhethiwe bese iyazisusa. Zinamathisele lapho zifanele, noma uhlehlise ukusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E) isusa izimpawu ezikhethiwe ngaphandle kokuzikopisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-into\"\u003EKopisha into\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmhleli wento (ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto\u003C/strong\u003E) uphela ngalokhu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha into\u003C/span\u003E: ikopisha into nomhlanganisela wayo, ukulahleka nezindleko, ngaphandle kwezimpawu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E bese yengeza ikhophi yayo kule takeoff, noma kwenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda into\u003C/span\u003E: yengeza ikhophi ngokushesha, ibizwa ngokuthi &quot;(igama) (ikhophi)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhophi ihlala kulo kompyutha: igcinwa kule thebhu nasesitoreji sesiphequluli, ukuze ithebhu enye ye-TakeoffCraft ikwazi ukunamathisela. Akulayishwa lutho, futhi i-clipboard yesistimu ayisetshenziswa, ngakho awukwazi ukunamathisela izimpawu ezinhlelweni zanoma yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhophi ivela kishidi elilodwa ngesikhathi. Izimpawu zinamathiselwa njengoba zinjalo: akukakhona ukujikeleza noma ukuzibonisa ikhophi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Iqembu le-Hlela lethuluzi libamba Hlehlisa, Phinda wenze, Kopisha kanye ne-Namathisela. Imenyu yalo ethi Okunye inezinye, nokhiye bayo: Sika, Kopisha, Namathisela, Namathisela endaweni, Phinda, Susa, Khetha konke kanye ne-Khetha lutho. Konke lokhu kunesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa nge-Ctrl+Z. Khetha izimpawu Khetha Khetha (V) bese uchofoza impawu. Bamba Shift uchofoze ezinye izimpawu ukuze uzengeze. Shift + chofoza impawu ekhethiwe iyayisusa futhi. Noma cindezela Ctrl+A (Khetha konke) ukuthatha zonke izimpawu eshidini elivulekile. Uma kukhethwe izimpawu eziningi, iphaneli esokudla ibonisa Izimpawu ezikhethiwe: zingaki zento ngayinye, nezinkinobho ze-Kopisha, Phinda, Sika kanye ne-Susa izimpawu. Izibambi zamakhona zivela kuphela uma kukhethwe impawu eyodwa. Esc (Khetha lutho) ucisha ukukhetha. Kopisha namathisela lapho uchofoza Khetha izimpawu bese ucindezela Ctrl+C (Kopisha). Izimpawu zikopishwa nezinto zazo, kuhlanganise nomhlanganisela wento ngayinye, ukulahleka nezindleko. Iya eshidini ofuna ukuzibeka kulo (lingaba yishidi elifanayo). Cindezela Ctrl+V (Namathisela). Ikhophi eyisicaba-ngamachashaza ilandela isikhombi. Chofoza lapho okufanele khona. Maphakathi ezimpawu ezikopishiwe afika esikhombini. Esc ikhansela futhi ayengezi lutho. Izimpawu ezinamathiselwe zikhethwa ngemva kwalokho, ngakho Delete noma Ctrl+Z kuzisusa futhi. Ku-takeoff efanayo, izimpawu ezinamathiselwe zihamba kwi-izinto ezifanayo, ngakho amanani azo engeza kulezo zinto. Kwenye takeoff (ithebhu enye, noma ngemva kwe-Entsha), kusetshenziswa into enegama nohlobo olufanayo; ngaphandle kwalokho into yengezwa nomhlanganisela wayo. Uma igama selithathwe yinto yohlobo oluhlukile, into engeziwe ibizwa ngokuthi \"(igama) (ikhophi)\". Izimpawu ezinamathiselwe zihamba endaweni yezindleko ekhethwe phezulu ephaneli ye-Izinto (noma kungekho). Bona Izindawo zezindleko. Namathisela endaweni Ctrl+Shift+V (Namathisela endaweni) ibeka ikhophi endaweni efanayo ngqo eshidini elivulekile, ngokuma kwayo ekhasini. Yisebenzise ifloro elijwayelekile: bala izinga 2, kopisha, vula izinga 3, namathisela endaweni. Namathisela endaweni udinga ishidi elifanayo ngosayizi nelakopishwa kulo. Kushidi losayizi ohlukile i-TakeoffCraft iyatshela futhi ayinamathisi lutho; sebenzisa Namathisela uchofoze. Eshidini elakopishwa kulo, ikhophi ifika phezu kwezimpawu zokuqala. Isikali kufanele sifane Ubude nezindawo kuncike esikalini seshidi. Umugqa okala u-10' ngo-1/4\" = 1'-0\" wawuzokala u-20' eshidini elingu-1/8\" = 1'-0\". Ngakho i-TakeoffCraft inamathisela imigqa nezindawo kuphela eshidini elinesikali esifanayo neshidi elavela kulo, futhi iyatshela uma lingenjalo: Ishidi elivulekile alinasikali okwamanje: linike okokuqala (Setha isikali), bese unamathisela. Ishidi elivulekile linesikali esehlukile: umlayezo ubiza zombili izikali. Namathisela eshidini elinesikali elifanayo. Izinani azidingi sikali: izinani ezikopishiwe zinamathiselwa noma kuphi. Phinda Ctrl+D (Phinda) ikopisha izimpawu ezikhethiwe ibeke ikhophi esikhombini ngokushesha; chofoza lapho okufanele khona. Akukho okungezwa kuze uchofoze, futhi Esc akushiyi lutho. Ukuphinda akushintshi lokho Namathisela alunamathisela. Sika nokususa Ctrl+X (Sika) ikopisha izimpawu ezikhethiwe bese iyazisusa. Zinamathisele lapho zifanele, noma uhlehlise ukusika. Delete noma Backspace (Susa) isusa izimpawu ezikhethiwe ngaphandle kokuzikopisha. Kopisha into Umhleli wento (ngaphansi kwe-Izinto) uphela ngalokhu: Kopisha into: ikopisha into nomhlanganisela wayo, ukulahleka nezindleko, ngaphandle kwezimpawu. Namathisela bese yengeza ikhophi yayo kule takeoff, noma kwenye. Phinda into: yengeza ikhophi ngokushesha, ibizwa ngokuthi \"(igama) (ikhophi)\". Ikhophi ihlala kulo kompyutha: igcinwa kule thebhu nasesitoreji sesiphequluli, ukuze ithebhu enye ye-TakeoffCraft ikwazi ukunamathisela. Akulayishwa lutho, futhi i-clipboard yesistimu ayisetshenziswa, ngakho awukwazi ukunamathisela izimpawu ezinhlelweni zanoma yini. Ikhophi ivela kishidi elilodwa ngesikhathi. Izimpawu zinamathiselwa njengoba zinjalo: akukakhona ukujikeleza noma ukuzibonisa ikhophi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"carbon-and-5d-prices","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ikhabhoni esetshenziswe nethebula lentengo le-5D","summary":"Ikhabhoni ibala ikhabhoni esetshenziswe yakho konke okukalwe kusukela ekunani ngalinye nethebula elivulekile lezici, bese ithumela amazinga akho ukubala njengethebula lentengo lezindleko ze-5D ku-BimCraft.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["ikhabhoni","ikhabhoni esetshenziswe","kgco2e","co2","izici","a1-a3","ukuthutha","ukulahleka","5d","ithebula lentengo","izindleko","bimcraft","epd"],"headings":[{"id":"ikhabhoni-esetshenziswe","text":"Ikhabhoni esetshenziswe","level":2},{"id":"ithebula-lentengo-lezindleko-ze-5d","text":"Ithebula lentengo lezindleko ze-5D","level":2},{"id":"nomsizi-wakho","text":"Nomsizi wakho","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECarbon\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi lezinto ibala ikhabhoni esetshenziswe yakho konke okukalile, futhi iguqule amazinga akho ibe ithebula lentengo imodeli yokwakha engalisebenzisa. Kuyisilinganiso, hhayi ukuhlolwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhabhoni-esetshenziswe\"\u003EIkhabhoni esetshenziswe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani ngalinye lento, kanye nokulahleka kwalo, liphindwa ngomugqa wethebula lezici. Umugqa uhambisana ngamagama egama lento (&quot;concrete slab&quot; ithola umugqa onegama elithi concrete). Ithebula liyithebula elivulekile elisetshenziswa yi-BimCraft, ngakho ifayela olilayishile lapha lisebenza nalapho. \u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa enikezwe yiphrogram ingamanani aqalayo: ajwayelekile, angahlolwanga futhi awavela kunoma yisiphi isizinda sedatha.\u003C/strong\u003E Ingxoxo iyakutshela ngasezibalweni; yishintshe ngomthombo wakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kunani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECarbon\u003C/span\u003E. Izinto ezibalwayo zidwetshwe nezikhilogremu zazo ze-CO2e; isamba sikuphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThikisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA4 transport\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA5 site waste\u003C/span\u003E ukubala nalezo zigaba, emigqeni enikeza inani lazo. Isigaba somkhiqizo sihlala sibalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkusebenzisa omunye umugqa kwento, noma ukungakhethi, sebenzisa uhlu oluse mugqeni wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFactors from a file…\u003C/span\u003E ilayisha ithebula lezici (JSON noma CSV) elenziwe ngomthombo wakho; imigqa yalo ithatha indawo yemigqa eqalayo enesihloko esifanayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFactors (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E igcina eyakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsici sibalwa ngamitha, ngamitha ayisikwele, ngamitha ekhyubhu, ngento noma ngekhilogremu. Umugqa ukalwe ngamafidi noma ngamafidi ayisikwele uyaguqulwa. Isici sekhilogremu sidinga ivolumu (amayadi ekhyubhu noma amamitha) nokuminyana komugqa. Into eyidinga inani elingalikali lingadwetshwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E nesizathu, ingaqagelwa. Isamba esiqhubekayo esisesimweni sebha sibonisa lesi sibalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa yakho yezici, okukhethile kwakho, nezigaba ozibalayo, kugcinwa kufayela lombalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ithebula-lentengo-lezindleko-ze-5d\"\u003EIthebula lentengo lezindleko ze-5D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D prices (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D prices (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E zigcina amazinga okubala njengethebula lentengo: umugqa owodwa ngento eyiprayisiwe ngayinye, nezinga layo lezinto nomsebenzi ngeyunithi kanye nokulahleka kwalo. Layisha kwi-cost pane ye-BimCraft (Ikhabhoni esetshenziswe nezindleko ze-5D) ukuze ubale imisebenzi yemodeli yokwakha ngalawo mazinga afanayo owenze ithenda. Izinto ezikalwe ngeyunithi ethebula elingayinaki, nezinto ezingenazinga, ziyashiywa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nomsizi-wakho\"\u003ENomsizi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvumela abasizi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, bangafunda ikhabhoni (carbon_check). Ukulayisha izici kungowakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okuthunyelwa noma kuphi. Izibalo zilungile njengezici ozilayishile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Carbon kwithuluzi lezinto ibala ikhabhoni esetshenziswe yakho konke okukalile, futhi iguqule amazinga akho ibe ithebula lentengo imodeli yokwakha engalisebenzisa. Kuyisilinganiso, hhayi ukuhlolwa. Ikhabhoni esetshenziswe Inani ngalinye lento, kanye nokulahleka kwalo, liphindwa ngomugqa wethebula lezici. Umugqa uhambisana ngamagama egama lento (\"concrete slab\" ithola umugqa onegama elithi concrete). Ithebula liyithebula elivulekile elisetshenziswa yi-BimCraft, ngakho ifayela olilayishile lapha lisebenza nalapho. Imigqa enikezwe yiphrogram ingamanani aqalayo: ajwayelekile, angahlolwanga futhi awavela kunoma yisiphi isizinda sedatha. Ingxoxo iyakutshela ngasezibalweni; yishintshe ngomthombo wakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kunani. Khetha Carbon. Izinto ezibalwayo zidwetshwe nezikhilogremu zazo ze-CO2e; isamba sikuphezulu. Thikisa A4 transport noma A5 site waste ukubala nalezo zigaba, emigqeni enikeza inani lazo. Isigaba somkhiqizo sihlala sibalwa. Ukusebenzisa omunye umugqa kwento, noma ukungakhethi, sebenzisa uhlu oluse mugqeni wayo. Factors from a file… ilayisha ithebula lezici (JSON noma CSV) elenziwe ngomthombo wakho; imigqa yalo ithatha indawo yemigqa eqalayo enesihloko esifanayo. Factors (JSON) igcina eyakho. Isici sibalwa ngamitha, ngamitha ayisikwele, ngamitha ekhyubhu, ngento noma ngekhilogremu. Umugqa ukalwe ngamafidi noma ngamafidi ayisikwele uyaguqulwa. Isici sekhilogremu sidinga ivolumu (amayadi ekhyubhu noma amamitha) nokuminyana komugqa. Into eyidinga inani elingalikali lingadwetshwa ngaphansi kwe-Left out nesizathu, ingaqagelwa. Isamba esiqhubekayo esisesimweni sebha sibonisa lesi sibalo. Imigqa yakho yezici, okukhethile kwakho, nezigaba ozibalayo, kugcinwa kufayela lombalo. Ithebula lentengo lezindleko ze-5D 5D prices (JSON) no-5D prices (CSV) zigcina amazinga okubala njengethebula lentengo: umugqa owodwa ngento eyiprayisiwe ngayinye, nezinga layo lezinto nomsebenzi ngeyunithi kanye nokulahleka kwalo. Layisha kwi-cost pane ye-BimCraft (Ikhabhoni esetshenziswe nezindleko ze-5D) ukuze ubale imisebenzi yemodeli yokwakha ngalawo mazinga afanayo owenze ithenda. Izinto ezikalwe ngeyunithi ethebula elingayinaki, nezinto ezingenazinga, ziyashiywa. Nomsizi wakho Uma uvumela abasizi ku-Settings, bangafunda ikhabhoni (carbon_check). Ukulayisha izici kungowakho. Okufanele ukwazi Akukho okuthunyelwa noma kuphi. Izibalo zilungile njengezici ozilayishile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"tag-schedule","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Letha uhlu lwamathegi njengamanani","summary":"Uhlu lwamathegi olukhishwe kumodeli yesakhiwo (CSV) luba amanani ahlelwe embalweni, ngomunye ngamunye wethegi, ukuze inani nezindawo zemodeli zihlale ngasemuva kwalokho ukulinganisile.","section":"tasks","order":77,"keywords":["amathegi","uhlu lwamathegi","imodeli yesakhiwo","bimcraft","ifc","amanani","csv","uhlu","ukungenisa","inani elihlelwe"],"headings":[{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathegi\u003C/span\u003E phezu kwethuluzi ilethe uhlu lwamathegi elisindiswe njenge-CSV ngu-BimCraft. Ithegi ngalinye elihlukile liba inani elihlelwe, uhlobo olufanayo nalokho okuvela ekumbeni nasekugcwaliseni kwe-CivilCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwi-BimCraft, yenza uhlu lwamathegi ofuna bese uligcina njenge-CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathegi\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETshela ukuthi ikholomu iyiphi equmba umugqa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQamba umugqa ngokusebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E, ngokuvamile ithegi) nokuthi iyiphi ebamba inombolo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInani kusuka kukholomu\u003C/span\u003E). Ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala imigqa\u003C/span\u003E umugqa ngamunye ubalwa njengo-1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iyunithi. Ubude obungamamilimitha buba yimitha ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhindaphinda ngo\u003C/span\u003E 0.001.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinani\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa enethegi efanayo iyengezwa ndawonye. Iseli elingesiyo inombolo liyashiywa ngaphandle futhi libalwe esifinyezweni. Ukulethwa kohlu lofanayo kuvuselela amanani osewanawo kunokuwengeza amanye; amagama, amazinga nokulahleka kwawo kuhlala kungokwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani elihlelwe alilinganiswanga esheshini, ngakho alinazo izimaki. Akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi; ifayela lifundwa lapha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amathegi phezu kwethuluzi ilethe uhlu lwamathegi elisindiswe njenge-CSV ngu-BimCraft. Ithegi ngalinye elihlukile liba inani elihlelwe, uhlobo olufanayo nalokho okuvela ekumbeni nasekugcwaliseni kwe-CivilCraft. Kwi-BimCraft, yenza uhlu lwamathegi ofuna bese uligcina njenge-CSV. Khetha Amathegi bese ukhetha ifayela. Tshela ukuthi ikholomu iyiphi equmba umugqa (Qamba umugqa ngokusebenzisa, ngokuvamile ithegi) nokuthi iyiphi ebamba inombolo (Inani kusuka kukholomu). Ngo-Bala imigqa umugqa ngamunye ubalwa njengo-1. Khetha iyunithi. Ubude obungamamilimitha buba yimitha ngo-Phindaphinda ngo 0.001. Engeza izinani. Imigqa enethegi efanayo iyengezwa ndawonye. Iseli elingesiyo inombolo liyashiywa ngaphandle futhi libalwe esifinyezweni. Ukulethwa kohlu lofanayo kuvuselela amanani osewanawo kunokuwengeza amanye; amagama, amazinga nokulahleka kwawo kuhlala kungokwakho. Okufanele ukwazi Inani elihlelwe alilinganiswanga esheshini, ngakho alinazo izimaki. Akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi; ifayela lifundwa lapha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"assemblies","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izinhlanganisela namafomula","summary":"Engeza izingxenye kwento bese uvumela amafomula aguqule ubude, indawo noma inani libe yizinsimbi, amapuleti, amashidi ebhodi, ukhonkolo nezinto zokuxhuma, kanye nesibonelo sodonga.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["inhlanganisela","izingxenye","ifomula","izinsimbi","ibhodi lodonga","amashidi","amapuleti","ukhonkolo","amayadi ekhyubhu","izinto zokuxhuma","iresiphi","ejwayelekile","izingxenye zento"],"headings":[{"id":"izinguquko-ongazisebenzisa","text":"Izinguquko ongazisebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"isibonelo-udonga-langaphakathi","text":"Isibonelo: udonga langaphakathi","level":2},{"id":"amanye-amafomula","text":"Amanye amafomula","level":2},{"id":"uma-ifomula-ingalungile","text":"Uma ifomula ingalungile","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2},{"id":"susa-ingxenye","text":"Susa ingxenye","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInhlanganisela\u003C/strong\u003E yento uhlu lwezingxenye, ngayinye inefomula yobuningi kanye namazinga ayo okulahleka nezinga lentengo. Ifomula isebenzisa amanani aphelele aphimisiwe waleyo nto, ngakho ukukala kodonga kodwa kunikeza izinsimbi, amapuleti nebhodi ngesikhathi esisodwa, futhi ayavuselelwa njengoba ukala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinguquko-ongazisebenzisa\"\u003EIzinguquko ongazisebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo lwento\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E ubude, \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E ukuphakama, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E indawo yodonga (L × H), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E inani lemigqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E indawo, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E umzila (umphethe + izingxenye ezinqunyiwe), \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E ujula noma ukuqina, \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E inani lezindawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E inani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanani asebenzisa iyunithi yento ngokwayo: amafidi namafidi ayisikwele zezinto ze-LF ne-SF, nemitha nemitha ayisikwele zezinto ze-m nezi-m². Kuzinto ze-SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E isemayadini ayisikwele, kanti \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E sihlala emafidini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafomula asebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E (noma × ÷), amabhulaketi, izinombolo, nemisebenzi \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emax\u003C/code\u003E kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E. Imithetho ephelele itholakala ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EUlimi lwamafomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isibonelo-udonga-langaphakathi\"\u003EIsibonelo: udonga langaphakathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAke sithi ukale \u003Cstrong\u003EUdonga langaphakathi uhlobo A\u003C/strong\u003E njengento yomugqa: imigqa engu-4 eyizinga lamafidi angu-120 LF, no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E usethwe ku-\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Amanani akalwe akhombisa L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF yodonga, uhlangothi olulodwa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd component\u003C/span\u003E. Kuvela ingxenye ebizwa ngokuthi &quot;Ingxenye&quot;, ine-ifomula \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E nomphumela ngaphansi kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Ccode\u003EIzinsimbi 16 in o.c.\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity formula\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E. Umphumela uyavuselelwa njengoba uthayipha: &quot;= 94 EA&quot;. Lokho kuyinsimbi eyodwa njalo ngamayintshi angu-16 ngesikhathi samafidi angu-120 (90), kanye neyengeziwe ukuvala ngayinye yemigqa engu-4.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd component\u003C/span\u003E futhi ngamapuleti: igama \u003Ccode\u003EAmapuleti, phezulu nephansi\u003C/code\u003E, iyunithi \u003Ccode\u003ELF\u003C/code\u003E, ifomula \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2\u003C/code\u003E. Umphumela: 240 LF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza ibhodi: igama \u003Ccode\u003EIbhodi legypsum 4x8, zombili izinhlangothi\u003C/code\u003E, iyunithi \u003Ccode\u003Eamashidi\u003C/code\u003E, ifomula \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32)\u003C/code\u003E. Umphumela: amashidi angu-68 (SF angu-2,160 webhodi ÷ 32 SF ngeshidi = 67.5, ibuyiselwe phezulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGcwalisa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $\u003C/span\u003E yengxenye ngayinye. Ingxenye ngayinye ithola umugqa wayo ngaphansi kwento ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, ibizwa njengento, futhi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E iyihlanganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma izindleko zodonga zonke zisezingxenyeni, shiya izinga lezinto nomsebenzi lento ku-0, ngaphandle kwalokho zibalwa kabili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulahleka kusetshenziswa ngemva kwefomula futhi akuzungezwa: amashidi angu-68 nokulahleka kwama-10% kuba amashidi angu-74.8. Ukuze uoda amashidi aphelele, faka ukulahleka ngaphakathi kwefomula, njengo \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1)\u003C/code\u003E, bese ushiya ukulahleka kwengxenye ku-0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanye-amafomula\"\u003EAmanye amafomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzelwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInto\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfomula\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinsimbi ngamayintshi angu-24 ngaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 2) + N\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-insulation batts, SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa nobude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpende, zombili izinhlangothi, amagaloni ngo-350 SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa nobude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 350)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhathoni wethayili ngo-15 SF, okungu-10% okwengeziwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 1.1 / 15)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmphetho wodonga noma ukuhlaza komphetho, LF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkhonkolo, amayadi ekhyubhu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo nokujula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkhonkolo ozungezwe waba ikota yeyadi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo nokujula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmahinji, amathathu ngomnyango\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkungenani ibhokisi elilodwa, elilodwa ngo-12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-ifomula-ingalungile\"\u003EUma ifomula ingalungile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi kwefomula uba umlayezo wephutha, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;X&quot; ayisilinganiso esikalwe lapha. Sebenzisa L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EKukhona &quot;)&quot; ekhishiwe.\u003C/code\u003E Ingxenye-ke ayinanani, umugqa wayo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E ubonisa &quot;Iphutha lefomula: …&quot;, futhi ihedha ithi &quot;Akuphelele: iphutha lefomula eli-1 (akubalwanga kumaphelele)&quot;. Lungisa ifomula, bese amaphelele avuselelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfomula ehlukanisa ngo-zero iyiphutha nayo (&quot;Ifomula ihlukanisa ngo-zero.&quot;), isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EA / H\u003C/code\u003E kuto engenayo ujula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmafomula asebenza ngamaphelele wento, hhayi umugqa ngomugqa. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E yengeza insimbi eyodwa ngomugqa; ayikabi khona ukuzungezwa ngomugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfomula ingasebenzisa kuphela izinguquko zento yayo, hhayi zento enye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuya kwezingxenye ezingama-50 ngento, nezinhlamvu ezingama-500 ngefomula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-ingxenye\"\u003ESusa ingxenye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove component\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwayo. Ungayibuyisela nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Inhlanganisela yento uhlu lwezingxenye, ngayinye inefomula yobuningi kanye namazinga ayo okulahleka nezinga lentengo. Ifomula isebenzisa amanani aphelele aphimisiwe waleyo nto, ngakho ukukala kodonga kodwa kunikeza izinsimbi, amapuleti nebhodi ngesikhathi esisodwa, futhi ayavuselelwa njengoba ukala. Izinguquko ongazisebenzisa Uhlobo lwento Izinguquko Umugqa L ubude, H ukuphakama, A indawo yodonga (L × H), N inani lemigqa Indawo A indawo, P umzila (umphethe + izingxenye ezinqunyiwe), H ujula noma ukuqina, N inani lezindawo Inani N inani Amanani asebenzisa iyunithi yento ngokwayo: amafidi namafidi ayisikwele zezinto ze-LF ne-SF, nemitha nemitha ayisikwele zezinto ze-m nezi-m². Kuzinto ze-SY, A isemayadini ayisikwele, kanti P no-H sihlala emafidini. Amafomula asebenzisa + - * / (noma × ÷), amabhulaketi, izinombolo, nemisebenzi ceil, floor, round, min, max kanye ne-abs. Imithetho ephelele itholakala ku-Ulimi lwamafomula. Isibonelo: udonga langaphakathi Ake sithi ukale Udonga langaphakathi uhlobo A njengento yomugqa: imigqa engu-4 eyizinga lamafidi angu-120 LF, no-Height usethwe ku-9'-0\". Amanani akalwe akhombisa L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF yodonga, uhlangothi olulodwa). Khetha into ngaphansi kwe-Items. Ku-Assembly, khetha Add component. Kuvela ingxenye ebizwa ngokuthi \"Ingxenye\", ine-ifomula L nomphumela ngaphansi kwayo. Thayipha Izinsimbi 16 in o.c. ku-Name no EA ku-Unit. Ku-Quantity formula, thayipha ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N. Umphumela uyavuselelwa njengoba uthayipha: \"= 94 EA\". Lokho kuyinsimbi eyodwa njalo ngamayintshi angu-16 ngesikhathi samafidi angu-120 (90), kanye neyengeziwe ukuvala ngayinye yemigqa engu-4. Khetha Add component futhi ngamapuleti: igama Amapuleti, phezulu nephansi, iyunithi LF, ifomula L * 2. Umphumela: 240 LF. Engeza ibhodi: igama Ibhodi legypsum 4x8, zombili izinhlangothi, iyunithi amashidi, ifomula ceil(A * 2 / 32). Umphumela: amashidi angu-68 (SF angu-2,160 webhodi ÷ 32 SF ngeshidi = 67.5, ibuyiselwe phezulu). Gcwalisa i-Waste %, i-Material $ ne-Labor $ yengxenye ngayinye. Ingxenye ngayinye ithola umugqa wayo ngaphansi kwento ku-Quantities, ibizwa njengento, futhi i-Job total iyihlanganisa. Uma izindleko zodonga zonke zisezingxenyeni, shiya izinga lezinto nomsebenzi lento ku-0, ngaphandle kwalokho zibalwa kabili. Ukulahleka kusetshenziswa ngemva kwefomula futhi akuzungezwa: amashidi angu-68 nokulahleka kwama-10% kuba amashidi angu-74.8. Ukuze uoda amashidi aphelele, faka ukulahleka ngaphakathi kwefomula, njengo ceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1), bese ushiya ukulahleka kwengxenye ku-0. Amanye amafomula Okwenzelwa Into Ifomula Izinsimbi ngamayintshi angu-24 ngaphakathi Umugqa ceil(L / 2) + N Ama-insulation batts, SF Umugqa nobude A Upende, zombili izinhlangothi, amagaloni ngo-350 SF Umugqa nobude ceil(A * 2 / 350) Amakhathoni wethayili ngo-15 SF, okungu-10% okwengeziwe Indawo ceil(A * 1.1 / 15) Umphetho wodonga noma ukuhlaza komphetho, LF Indawo P Ukhonkolo, amayadi ekhyubhu Indawo nokujula A * H / 27 Ukhonkolo ozungezwe waba ikota yeyadi Indawo nokujula ceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4 Amahinji, amathathu ngomnyango Inani N * 3 Okungenani ibhokisi elilodwa, elilodwa ngo-12 Inani max(1, ceil(N / 12)) Uma ifomula ingalungile Umugqa ongaphansi kwefomula uba umlayezo wephutha, isibonelo \"X\" ayisilinganiso esikalwe lapha. Sebenzisa L, H, A, N. noma Kukhona \")\" ekhishiwe. Ingxenye-ke ayinanani, umugqa wayo ku-Quantities ubonisa \"Iphutha lefomula: …\", futhi ihedha ithi \"Akuphelele: iphutha lefomula eli-1 (akubalwanga kumaphelele)\". Lungisa ifomula, bese amaphelele avuselelwa. Ifomula ehlukanisa ngo-zero iyiphutha nayo (\"Ifomula ihlukanisa ngo-zero.\"), isibonelo A / H kuto engenayo ujula. Imikhawulo Amafomula asebenza ngamaphelele wento, hhayi umugqa ngomugqa. ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N yengeza insimbi eyodwa ngomugqa; ayikabi khona ukuzungezwa ngomugqa. Ifomula ingasebenzisa kuphela izinguquko zento yayo, hhayi zento enye. Kuya kwezingxenye ezingama-50 ngento, nezinhlamvu ezingama-500 ngefomula. Susa ingxenye Khetha Remove component ngaphansi kwayo. Ungayibuyisela nge-Ctrl+Z.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"price-library","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Umtapo wezintengo","summary":"Gcina izinto zakho, amazinga nezinhlanganisela emtapweni, uwungenise kusuka ku-CSV noma kusuka kwesilinganiso sangaphambili, engeze izinto kuwo kunoma iyiphi ukubala, bese ubuyekeza izintengo zokubala kuwo.","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["umtapo","amaphakhi wokuhweba","uhlu lwentengo","ibhuku lentengo","isiphequluli sezindleko","ngenisa i-csv","amazinga","izinhlanganisela","sebenzisa kabusha","izinto zesifanekiso","buyekeza izintengo","buyekeza intengo"],"headings":[{"id":"gcwalisa-umtapo","text":"Gcwalisa umtapo","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-kukubala","text":"Sebenzisa kukubala","level":2},{"id":"amakholomu-e-csv","text":"Amakholomu e-CSV","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmtapo wezintengo\u003C/strong\u003E ugcina izinto oyisebenzisa ekubaleni ngakunye: uhlobo lwazo, iyunithi, ukuphakama, ukulahleka, amazinga ezinto nezabasebenzi, kanye nenhlanganisela yazo. Igcinwa kule bhrawuza, ngaphandle kwanoma yikuphi ukubala, ngakho noma yikuphi ukubala okuvulwe lapha kungawusebenzisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E phezulu kwephaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcwalisa-umtapo\"\u003EGcwalisa umtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa i-CSV…\u003C/span\u003E ifunda ishidi lezibalo elilondolozwe njenge-CSV (bona amakholomu angezansi). Izinto ezinegama nohlobo olufanayo esele emtapweni ziyashintshwa; ezinye ziyengezwa. Imigqa engafundeki iyadlulwa, futhi ithi yiyiphi nokuthi kungani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinto zalo kubalo\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha yonke into yokubala okuvulekile emtapweni, namazinga nenhlanganisela yayo (hhayi amamaki ayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsilinganiso se-CSV ethunyelwe yi-TakeoffCraft (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EThumela isilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E) siyangeniswa njengoba sinjalo: intengo yokubala kwakamuva iba yisisekelo sokubala okulandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmaphakhi wokuhweba…\u003C/span\u003E engeza izinhlanganisela mahhala zomsebenzi wokuhweba, njengodonga lwe-drywall, ugesi noma ukhonkolo, ngaphandle kwentengo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EAmaphakhi wokuhweba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza umtapo njenge-CSV, ukuze ugcine ikhophi, uwuhlele ku-spreadsheet noma uwunikeze umngani. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E uwusula (chofoza kabili).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmtapo uphila kwisitoreji salo sebhrawuza. Ibhrawuza elihlukile, ikhompyutha ehlukile noma iwindi eliyimfihlo linesalo layo (noma lingenalo). Wuthumele ukuze uwuhambise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-kukubala\"\u003ESebenzisa kukubala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThikha izinto (bhala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola kumtapo\u003C/span\u003E ukuze unciphise uhlu) bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kukubala\u003C/span\u003E. Zingezwa nezinhlanganisela zazo ngesinyathelo esisodwa esingahlehliswa nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Igama elisesele kukubala lithola inombolo, njengo \u003Ccode\u003ECarpet (2)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza izintengo\u003C/span\u003E inikeza izinto zokubala amazinga nokulahleka komtapo, kuzo zonke izinto ezifana negama nohlobo nemigqa yenhlanganisela yegama elifanayo. Ukuphakama, amayunithi namafomula kuhlala njengoba kunjalo. Ukucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuzibuyisela zonke izintengo ezindala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakholomu-e-csv\"\u003EAmakholomu e-CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wokuqala uqamba amakholomu, nganoma yiluphi uhlelo; amanye amakholomu ayanganakwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkholomu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkungena kuyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem (noma Name)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lento. Kuyadingeka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area noma Count (LF, SF no-EA nazo ziyasebenza). Uma kushiywe ngaphandle, iyunithi iyanquma.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF noma m; SF, SY noma m²; EA. Ngaphandle: iyunithi evamile yohlobo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E10%\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial per unit, Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmazinga afana no-\u003Ccode\u003E2.10\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeight (noma Depth)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E, noma \u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E kumayunithi e-metric.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EComponent, Formula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa onegama le-Component (noma uhlobo \u003Ccode\u003EComponent\u003C/code\u003E) uyingxenye yenhlanganisela yento ephezulu kuwo. Iyunithi, Waste namazinga ayo ayawo; ifomula yawo isebenzisa izinhlamvu zento, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIzinhlanganisela namafomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EItem,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula\nPartition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9&#039;-0&quot;,,\n,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N\nVCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,,\nDuplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,,\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhoma, amasemikholoni noma amathebhu kuzo zonke ayasebenza phakathi kwamakholomu.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Umtapo wezintengo ugcina izinto oyisebenzisa ekubaleni ngakunye: uhlobo lwazo, iyunithi, ukuphakama, ukulahleka, amazinga ezinto nezabasebenzi, kanye nenhlanganisela yazo. Igcinwa kule bhrawuza, ngaphandle kwanoma yikuphi ukubala, ngakho noma yikuphi ukubala okuvulwe lapha kungawusebenzisa. Vula ngo-Umtapo phezulu kwephaneli Izinto. Gcwalisa umtapo Ngenisa i-CSV… ifunda ishidi lezibalo elilondolozwe njenge-CSV (bona amakholomu angezansi). Izinto ezinegama nohlobo olufanayo esele emtapweni ziyashintshwa; ezinye ziyengezwa. Imigqa engafundeki iyadlulwa, futhi ithi yiyiphi nokuthi kungani. Engeza izinto zalo kubalo ikopisha yonke into yokubala okuvulekile emtapweni, namazinga nenhlanganisela yayo (hhayi amamaki ayo). Isilinganiso se-CSV ethunyelwe yi-TakeoffCraft (bona Thumela isilinganiso) siyangeniswa njengoba sinjalo: intengo yokubala kwakamuva iba yisisekelo sokubala okulandelayo. Amaphakhi wokuhweba… engeza izinhlanganisela mahhala zomsebenzi wokuhweba, njengodonga lwe-drywall, ugesi noma ukhonkolo, ngaphandle kwentengo. Bona Amaphakhi wokuhweba. Thumela i-CSV ilondoloza umtapo njenge-CSV, ukuze ugcine ikhophi, uwuhlele ku-spreadsheet noma uwunikeze umngani. Sula uwusula (chofoza kabili). Umtapo uphila kwisitoreji salo sebhrawuza. Ibhrawuza elihlukile, ikhompyutha ehlukile noma iwindi eliyimfihlo linesalo layo (noma lingenalo). Wuthumele ukuze uwuhambise. Sebenzisa kukubala Thikha izinto (bhala ku-Thola kumtapo ukuze unciphise uhlu) bese ukhetha Engeza kukubala. Zingezwa nezinhlanganisela zazo ngesinyathelo esisodwa esingahlehliswa nge-Ctrl+Z. Igama elisesele kukubala lithola inombolo, njengo Carpet (2). Buyekeza izintengo inikeza izinto zokubala amazinga nokulahleka komtapo, kuzo zonke izinto ezifana negama nohlobo nemigqa yenhlanganisela yegama elifanayo. Ukuphakama, amayunithi namafomula kuhlala njengoba kunjalo. Ukucindezela Ctrl+Z kuzibuyisela zonke izintengo ezindala. Amakholomu e-CSV Umugqa wokuqala uqamba amakholomu, nganoma yiluphi uhlelo; amanye amakholomu ayanganakwa. Ikholomu Okungena kuyo Item (noma Name) Igama lento. Kuyadingeka. Type Linear, Area noma Count (LF, SF no-EA nazo ziyasebenza). Uma kushiywe ngaphandle, iyunithi iyanquma. Unit LF noma m; SF, SY noma m²; EA. Ngaphandle: iyunithi evamile yohlobo. Waste % 10 noma 10%. Material per unit, Labor per unit Amazinga afana no-2.10 noma $1,250. Height (noma Depth) 9'-0\", 9, noma 2.7 kumayunithi e-metric. Component, Formula Umugqa onegama le-Component (noma uhlobo Component) uyingxenye yenhlanganisela yento ephezulu kuwo. Iyunithi, Waste namazinga ayo ayawo; ifomula yawo isebenzisa izinhlamvu zento, bona Izinhlanganisela namafomula. Item,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula Partition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9'-0\",, ,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N VCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,, Duplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,, Amakhoma, amasemikholoni noma amathebhu kuzo zonke ayasebenza phakathi kwamakholomu.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"trade-packs","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amaphakhi wokuhweba","summary":"Engeza ama-assembly amahhala wokuhweba ku-umtapo wakho wamanani, uwasuse ngesinyathelo esisodwa, futhi wabelane ngomtapo wakho njengephakhi.","section":"tasks","order":83,"keywords":["iphakhi lokuhweba","iphakhi","ama-assembly","izifanekiso","izinto zokuqala","ugesi","drywall","ifreyimu","ukupenda","ukhonkolo","ifulowa","ukwakha ngamatshe","uphahla","isiding","ukwakha ngezinkuni","amapayipi","hvac","insulation","ukuhlobisa","decking","general contractor","csi","masterformat","cc0","engeza","susa","yabelana"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-iphakhi","text":"Engeza iphakhi","level":2},{"id":"susa-iphakhi","text":"Susa iphakhi","level":2},{"id":"okusemphakhini","text":"Okusemphakhini","level":2},{"id":"yabelana-ngomtapo-wakho-njengephakhi","text":"Yabelana ngomtapo wakho njengephakhi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphakhi lokuhweba\u003C/strong\u003E yisethi yezinto ezilungele ukusetshenziswa zokuhweba eyodwa: ngayinye inayo iyunithi yayo, ubude noma ukujula kwayo, ukulahleka kwayo, kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003Eassembly\u003C/strong\u003E yayo, izingxenye nezifomula ezishintsha umugqa, indawo noma inani elilinganisiwe libe izinto zokwakha. Udonga lwe-drywall, isibonelo, lulethe ireyili, izinkonzo, amashidi, izikulufo, ithephu kanye ne-compound.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphakhi angezwa ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Eumtapo wamanani\u003C/a\u003E, futhi kusuka lapho wengeza izinto zawo kunoma yimuphi umbalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-iphakhi\"\u003EEngeza iphakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E phezulu kwepaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmaphakhi wokuhweba…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E: imperial (LF, SF), metric (m, m²) noma zombili. Yonke i-assembly iza kuzo zombili izinhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwephakhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto zephakhi zivela emtapweni, zibekwe ithegi ngegama lephakhi. Ukuzisebenzisa, zikhethe emtapweni bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kumsebenzi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphakhi alilethi amanani.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinto zalo zibonisa &quot;set your rate&quot; emtapweni. Amazinga angokwakho: zibhale emtapweni noma ku-item editor, noma ulethe uhlu lwentengo lwakho njenge-CSV usebenzise \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza izintengo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma usuvele unento efanayo ngegama nangohlobo emtapweni wakho, iphakhi lishiya eyakho njengoba kunjalo. Ukungeza kabusha iphakhi kuthatha indawo yezinto zalo ngenguqulo entsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-iphakhi\"\u003ESusa iphakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphakathi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmaphakhi wokuhweba…\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwephakhi oliwengezile, bese kanye futhi ukuqinisekisa. Yonke into eyavela kulo ishiya umtapo ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Izinto osezengeziwe embalweni wokubala zihlala kuleyo mbala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusemphakhini\"\u003EOkusemphakhini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImithombo nemininingwane\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwephakhi ukubona ukuthi yayibhalwe kuphi ngayinye i-assembly: amakhodi wokwakha, izindinganiso namahhovisi emibutho yokuhweba, nemihlahlandlela yokufaka. Ku-umtapo, bamba iphoyinti phezu kwento ukuze ufunde imithombo nezimo zayo, njengesikhala sezinkonzo noma izinga lokusakaza lopende. Hlola lokho ngomsebenzi wakho nedatha yemikhiqizo yakho, bese ushintsha izifomula lapho zingafani (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAma-assembly nezifomula\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke iphakhi imakwe \u003Cstrong\u003EStarter: not reviewed by an estimator yet\u003C/strong\u003E kuze kube yilapho abalinganisi abasebenzayo sebeliphenyile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke into iphinde ithwale inombolo yayo ye-CSI MasterFormat, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yabelana-ngomtapo-wakho-njengephakhi\"\u003EYabelana ngomtapo wakho njengephakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela njengephakhi…\u003C/span\u003E emtapweni iyawulondoloza njengefayela lephakhi (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccpack.json\u003C/code\u003E) okungeziwa yinoma ubani nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifayela lephakhi…\u003C/span\u003E. Ngokuzenzakalelayo ishiya izinto ezivela emaphakhini owengezile, futhi ayinawo amanani. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka amazinga ami njengamazinga wesampula\u003C/span\u003E ukuthumela namazinga akho: aphuma enelebula yesifunda nosuku owunikezayo, futhi noma ngubani owengeza iphakhi uyakhetha ukuthi uwasebenzise yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela ephakhi ayidatha evamile, hhayi izinhlelo. I-TakeoffCraft ihlola yonke ingxenye yefayela ngaphambi kokuyisebenzisa futhi ishiye noma yini engayifundi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Iphakhi lokuhweba yisethi yezinto ezilungele ukusetshenziswa zokuhweba eyodwa: ngayinye inayo iyunithi yayo, ubude noma ukujula kwayo, ukulahleka kwayo, kanye ne-assembly yayo, izingxenye nezifomula ezishintsha umugqa, indawo noma inani elilinganisiwe libe izinto zokwakha. Udonga lwe-drywall, isibonelo, lulethe ireyili, izinkonzo, amashidi, izikulufo, ithephu kanye ne-compound. Amaphakhi angezwa ku-umtapo wamanani, futhi kusuka lapho wengeza izinto zawo kunoma yimuphi umbalo. Engeza iphakhi Vula Umtapo phezulu kwepaneli Izinto, bese Amaphakhi wokuhweba…. Khetha Amayunithi: imperial (LF, SF), metric (m, m²) noma zombili. Yonke i-assembly iza kuzo zombili izinhlelo. Khetha Engeza eduze kwephakhi. Izinto zephakhi zivela emtapweni, zibekwe ithegi ngegama lephakhi. Ukuzisebenzisa, zikhethe emtapweni bese ukhetha Engeza kumsebenzi. Iphakhi alilethi amanani. Izinto zalo zibonisa \"set your rate\" emtapweni. Amazinga angokwakho: zibhale emtapweni noma ku-item editor, noma ulethe uhlu lwentengo lwakho njenge-CSV usebenzise Buyekeza izintengo. Uma usuvele unento efanayo ngegama nangohlobo emtapweni wakho, iphakhi lishiya eyakho njengoba kunjalo. Ukungeza kabusha iphakhi kuthatha indawo yezinto zalo ngenguqulo entsha. Susa iphakhi Ngaphakathi kwe-Amaphakhi wokuhweba…, khetha Susa eduze kwephakhi oliwengezile, bese kanye futhi ukuqinisekisa. Yonke into eyavela kulo ishiya umtapo ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Izinto osezengeziwe embalweni wokubala zihlala kuleyo mbala. Okusemphakhini Khetha Imithombo nemininingwane ngaphansi kwephakhi ukubona ukuthi yayibhalwe kuphi ngayinye i-assembly: amakhodi wokwakha, izindinganiso namahhovisi emibutho yokuhweba, nemihlahlandlela yokufaka. Ku-umtapo, bamba iphoyinti phezu kwento ukuze ufunde imithombo nezimo zayo, njengesikhala sezinkonzo noma izinga lokusakaza lopende. Hlola lokho ngomsebenzi wakho nedatha yemikhiqizo yakho, bese ushintsha izifomula lapho zingafani (bheka Ama-assembly nezifomula). Yonke iphakhi imakwe Starter: not reviewed by an estimator yet kuze kube yilapho abalinganisi abasebenzayo sebeliphenyile. Yonke into iphinde ithwale inombolo yayo ye-CSI MasterFormat, njengo 09 21 16. Yabelana ngomtapo wakho njengephakhi Thumela njengephakhi… emtapweni iyawulondoloza njengefayela lephakhi (.ccpack.json) okungeziwa yinoma ubani nge-Vula ifayela lephakhi…. Ngokuzenzakalelayo ishiya izinto ezivela emaphakhini owengezile, futhi ayinawo amanani. Khetha Faka amazinga ami njengamazinga wesampula ukuthumela namazinga akho: aphuma enelebula yesifunda nosuku owunikezayo, futhi noma ngubani owengeza iphakhi uyakhetha ukuthi uwasebenzise yini. Amafayela ephakhi ayidatha evamile, hhayi izinhlelo. I-TakeoffCraft ihlola yonke ingxenye yefayela ngaphambi kokuyisebenzisa futhi ishiye noma yini engayifundi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"earthwork","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Umsebenzi womhlaba namaphoyinti okuphakama","summary":"Maka amaphoyinti okuphakama esheshini lesayithi, uwanikeze i-CivilCraft ukuze kwakhiwe umphezulu nokumba nokugcwalisa, bese uthatha amanani okumba alula lapha.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["umsebenzi womhlaba","ukumbiwa","ukumba","ukugcwalisa","ukumba nokugcwalisa","ukulinganisa umhlaba","ukuphakama kwamaphoyinti","ukuphakama","ikhonthuwa","umphezulu","ukuhlukaniswa","civilcraft","amaphoyinti","pnezd","umsele"],"headings":[{"id":"ukumbiwa-okulula-lapha","text":"Ukumbiwa okulula lapha","level":2},{"id":"amaphoyinti-okuphakama-ye-civilcraft","text":"Amaphoyinti okuphakama ye-CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"ukumba-nokugcwalisa-ku-civilcraft","text":"Ukumba nokugcwalisa ku-CivilCraft","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa lokho okudwetshwe eshidini. Umsebenzi womhlaba udinga umphezulu womhlaba, ngakho wabelwana ne-CivilCraft, eyakha imiphezulu ngamaphoyinti, ilinganise izinga bese ibala ukumba, ukugcwalisa nokuthuthwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukumbiwa-okulula-lapha\"\u003EUkumbiwa okulula lapha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgesisekelo esimbiwe ngobujuqu obufanayo, into enendawo enobujuqu iyanele: ivolumu ingu-indawo × \u003Cstrong\u003Eukujula\u003C/strong\u003E. Iphakethe lomkhandlu omkhulu \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Etrade pack\u003C/a\u003E linento yokumba ngobuningi (ivolumu yomhlaba osemgodini, ivolumu ekhululekile nemithwalo yamalori) kanye nento yomsele wezinsiza (ukumba, ukubeka ngaphansi nokugcwalisa ngobude nobujuqu).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphoyinti-okuphakama-ye-civilcraft\"\u003EAmaphoyinti okuphakama ye-CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha isikali seshidi lesayithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza into ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubala\u003C/strong\u003E, njengo &quot;Izinga lomhlaba elikhona&quot;, bese uchofoza ngamunye amaphoyinti okuphakama eshidini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uphawu bese uthayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E kwi-panel ethi Uphawu olukhethiwe: \u003Ccode\u003E102.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E102&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E31.24 m\u003C/code\u003E. Ukuphakama okungaphansi kwe-zero nokuyi-zero kuyamukeleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama kwamaphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E. Uthola ifayela lamaphoyinti (\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E) elinamakholomu i-Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation kanye ne-Description, umugqa owodwa ngephoyinti ngalinye elimakiwe eshidini elivuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula leli fayela ku-CivilCraft (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ENgenisa amaphoyinti\u003C/a\u003E). Yakha umphezulu ngamaphoyinti (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EAkha umphezulu\u003C/a\u003E); kusukela lapho iqhathanisa imiphezulu bese inikeza ukumba nokugcwalisa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EIvolumu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Northing ne-Easting yizixhumanisi zeshidi ngokwalo, ezibalwa ngamafidi kusukela ekhoneni lephepha ngesikali salo: izinkathazo nevolumu phakathi kwamaphoyinti ziyiqiniso, kodwa azisiyo izixhumanisi zokuhlola zesayithi lakho. Zihambise ziye ezixhumanisweni zesayithi ku-CivilCraft uma udinga lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphoyinti eshidi ezahlukene awabelani ngezixhumanisi, ngakho ukuthumela kuthatha ishidi elivuliwe kuphela. Ukuphakama kulondolozwa nge-takeoff futhi kuthuthwa ngokukopisha nokunamathisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukumba-nokugcwalisa-ku-civilcraft\"\u003EUkumba nokugcwalisa ku-CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmsebenzi womhlaba we-CivilCraft ubuyela njengezinto ezimbili ongazithengisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-CivilCraft, linganisa amaphedi nezindlela zakho, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela ku-TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi womhlaba\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EIvolumu yomsebenzi womhlaba\u003C/a\u003E). Ilondoloza ifayela lamanani (\u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-TakeoffCraft, vula ngo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ukubala amanani\u003C/span\u003E, noma uyiphonse ku-app. Ukubala kwakho kuhlala kuvulekile: ifayela lengeza \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork: cut\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork: fill\u003C/strong\u003E njengo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#typed-quantities-no-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003Etyped quantities\u003C/a\u003E ngamayunithi e-cubic yards (CY) uma iphrojekthi ingeyamafidi, noma ngama-cubic metres (m³) uma iphrojekthi ingeyamamitha. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E siyasihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQamba kabusha, setha udoti, amarethi namakhomponenti njengoba ufisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uklelo lushintsha, thumela futhi kusuka ku-CivilCraft bese uvula ifayela elisha: lawo mazinto amabili afanayo athola amanani amasha. Amagama awo, amarethi, udoti namakhomponenti kuhlala njengoba uwasethile. Uma iyunithi yephrojekthi yeshintsha, ibha yesimo iyasho lokho: hlola amarethi. Ifayela lephrojekthi ye-CivilCraft ehlukile lengeza amazinto amabili ayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanani angamavolumu omhlaba njengoba i-CivilCraft yawalinganisa (indlela yegridi): akukho ukuncipha noma ukukhula. Engeza lawo njengodoti, noma nge-fomula njenge \u003Ccode\u003EQ * 1.25\u003C/code\u003E ukuze uthole ivolumu ekhululekile. Umhleli wento ukhombisa ukuthi ngayinye yavela phi nini; ikholomu yamanothi esilinganisweni nayo iyasho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lamanani liyi-JSON elilula (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-quantities&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), ngakho isikripthi noma enye iprogram ingalibhala nayo: igama le-app, iphrojekthi, nezinto ezinokhiye, igama, iyunithi nobuningi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"I-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa lokho okudwetshwe eshidini. Umsebenzi womhlaba udinga umphezulu womhlaba, ngakho wabelwana ne-CivilCraft, eyakha imiphezulu ngamaphoyinti, ilinganise izinga bese ibala ukumba, ukugcwalisa nokuthuthwa. Ukumbiwa okulula lapha Ngesisekelo esimbiwe ngobujuqu obufanayo, into enendawo enobujuqu iyanele: ivolumu ingu-indawo × ukujula. Iphakethe lomkhandlu omkhulu trade pack linento yokumba ngobuningi (ivolumu yomhlaba osemgodini, ivolumu ekhululekile nemithwalo yamalori) kanye nento yomsele wezinsiza (ukumba, ukubeka ngaphansi nokugcwalisa ngobude nobujuqu). Amaphoyinti okuphakama ye-CivilCraft Setha isikali seshidi lesayithi. Yenza into ye-Ukubala, njengo \"Izinga lomhlaba elikhona\", bese uchofoza ngamunye amaphoyinti okuphakama eshidini. Khetha uphawu bese uthayipha Ukuphakama kwi-panel ethi Uphawu olukhethiwe: 102.5, 102'-6\" noma 31.24 m. Ukuphakama okungaphansi kwe-zero nokuyi-zero kuyamukeleka. Vula imenyu ethi Thumela bese ukhetha Ukuphakama kwamaphoyinti. Uthola ifayela lamaphoyinti (.csv) elinamakholomu i-Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation kanye ne-Description, umugqa owodwa ngephoyinti ngalinye elimakiwe eshidini elivuliwe. Vula leli fayela ku-CivilCraft (bheka Ngenisa amaphoyinti). Yakha umphezulu ngamaphoyinti (Akha umphezulu); kusukela lapho iqhathanisa imiphezulu bese inikeza ukumba nokugcwalisa (Ivolumu). I-Northing ne-Easting yizixhumanisi zeshidi ngokwalo, ezibalwa ngamafidi kusukela ekhoneni lephepha ngesikali salo: izinkathazo nevolumu phakathi kwamaphoyinti ziyiqiniso, kodwa azisiyo izixhumanisi zokuhlola zesayithi lakho. Zihambise ziye ezixhumanisweni zesayithi ku-CivilCraft uma udinga lokho. Amaphoyinti eshidi ezahlukene awabelani ngezixhumanisi, ngakho ukuthumela kuthatha ishidi elivuliwe kuphela. Ukuphakama kulondolozwa nge-takeoff futhi kuthuthwa ngokukopisha nokunamathisela. Ukumba nokugcwalisa ku-CivilCraft Umsebenzi womhlaba we-CivilCraft ubuyela njengezinto ezimbili ongazithengisa: Ku-CivilCraft, linganisa amaphedi nezindlela zakho, bese ukhetha Thumela ku-TakeoffCraft ngaphansi kwe-Umsebenzi womhlaba (Ivolumu yomsebenzi womhlaba). Ilondoloza ifayela lamanani (.quantities.json). Ku-TakeoffCraft, vula ngo Vula ukubala amanani, noma uyiphonse ku-app. Ukubala kwakho kuhlala kuvulekile: ifayela lengeza Earthwork: cut no Earthwork: fill njengo typed quantities ngamayunithi e-cubic yards (CY) uma iphrojekthi ingeyamafidi, noma ngama-cubic metres (m³) uma iphrojekthi ingeyamamitha. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z siyasihlehlisa. Qamba kabusha, setha udoti, amarethi namakhomponenti njengoba ufisa. Uma uklelo lushintsha, thumela futhi kusuka ku-CivilCraft bese uvula ifayela elisha: lawo mazinto amabili afanayo athola amanani amasha. Amagama awo, amarethi, udoti namakhomponenti kuhlala njengoba uwasethile. Uma iyunithi yephrojekthi yeshintsha, ibha yesimo iyasho lokho: hlola amarethi. Ifayela lephrojekthi ye-CivilCraft ehlukile lengeza amazinto amabili ayo. Amanani angamavolumu omhlaba njengoba i-CivilCraft yawalinganisa (indlela yegridi): akukho ukuncipha noma ukukhula. Engeza lawo njengodoti, noma nge-fomula njenge Q * 1.25 ukuze uthole ivolumu ekhululekile. Umhleli wento ukhombisa ukuthi ngayinye yavela phi nini; ikholomu yamanothi esilinganisweni nayo iyasho lokho. Ifayela lamanani liyi-JSON elilula (\"format\": \"cadcraft-quantities\"), ngakho isikripthi noma enye iprogram ingalibhala nayo: igama le-app, iphrojekthi, nezinto ezinokhiye, igama, iyunithi nobuningi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"bid-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izindawo zezindleko","summary":"Phawula izimaka ngesakhiwo, ngesitezi noma ngesigaba, yenza ukubala indawo eyodwa ngesikhathi, bese ufunda inani nezindleko zendawo ngayinye.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["engeza okukhethwayo","susela okukhethwayo","ithenda elisisekelo","okukhethwayo","indawo yezindleko","indawo","isakhiwo","isitezi","izinga","isigaba","ukuhlukaniswa","isitezi esijwayelekile","isamba esincane","ngendawo"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-indawo-yezindleko","text":"Yenza indawo yezindleko","level":2},{"id":"bala-ngendawo","text":"Bala ngendawo","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-izimaka-kwenye-indawo","text":"Hambisa izimaka kwenye indawo","level":2},{"id":"qamba-kabusha-hlela-kabusha-noma-susa","text":"Qamba kabusha, hlela kabusha noma susa","level":2},{"id":"funda-izinani-ngendawo","text":"Funda izinani ngendawo","level":2},{"id":"okukhethwayo-ithenda-elisisekelo-ukwengeza-nokususa","text":"Okukhethwayo: ithenda elisisekelo, ukwengeza nokususa","level":2},{"id":"ku-export","text":"Ku-export","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yezindleko\u003C/strong\u003E ingxenye yomsebenzi oyibiza ngokwayo: isakhiwo, isitezi, isigaba, ingxenye. Ngayinye imaka ingaba kwindawo yezindleko eyodwa. Inani nesilinganiso sezindleko kungafundwa ngendawo ngayinye, nesamba esincane sayo, kanti isamba somsebenzi sihlala yisamba sakho konke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-indawo-yezindleko\"\u003EYenza indawo yezindleko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhezulu kwephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, vula uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yezindleko entsha…\u003C/strong\u003E, thayipha igama njengo &quot;Isakhiwo A&quot; noma &quot;Isitezi 2&quot;, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EYenze yona\u003C/strong\u003E. Indawo entsha iba yamanje. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Izimaka ezintsha ziya ku-(igama). Izimaka ezisezindaweni zezindleko ezinye ziyafiphala.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bala-ngendawo\"\u003EBala ngendawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho indawo yezindleko ikhethiwe ohlwini, zonke izimaka ezintsha ziya kuyo: imigqa, izindawo, imibuthano, izinani, izimaka ezengezwa yi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, nokuhlanganiswa. Izimaka ezisezindaweni zezindleko ezinye, nezingasezindaweni, ziyafiphala ushidi ukuze ubone okuyini kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ENo bid area\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini ukubala ngaphandle kwayo; akukho okufiphala ngalesosikhathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmasitezi ajwayelekile: bala i-Isitezi 2, khetha izimaka zayo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kushidi), zikopishe, khetha Isitezi 3 ohlwini bese unamathisela. Izikhopi ziya ku-Isitezi 3. Uma amasitezi efana futhi ungadingi ukuwahlukanisa, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/typical-groups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/typical-groups\"\u003Eiqembu elijwayelekile\u003C/a\u003E libala isitezi esisodwa izikhathi eziningi kunalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-izimaka-kwenye-indawo\"\u003EHambisa izimaka kwenye indawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha imaka eyodwa noma eminingi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImaka ekhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIzimaka ezikhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E), khetha indawo kusipaji se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Izimaka ezi-3 zihanjiswe ziya ku-Isitezi 2.&quot; Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qamba-kabusha-hlela-kabusha-noma-susa\"\u003EQamba kabusha, hlela kabusha noma susa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EPhatha izindawo zezindleko…\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini. Bhala phezu kwegama ukulibiza kabusha, sebenzisa izimpandla ukushintsha ukulandelana (amathebula nencwadi yokusebenza kuyalandela), noma susa enye ngebhasikidi. Ukususa indawo yezindleko kugcina izimaka zayo: zisuke zingasemandleni endaweni yezindleko. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlehlisa ushintsho ngalunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-izinani-ngendawo\"\u003EFunda izinani ngendawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E (ibonakala uma ukubala sekunendawo yezindleko). Indawo ngayinye ibhala izinto eziyiphethe, nenani layo, iyunithi nesamba, bese kuba umugqa wesamba esincane. Izimaka ezingekho ndaweni yezindleko zifika ekugcineni, njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003ENo bid area\u003C/strong\u003E. Chofoza umugqa wento ukuze uyigqamise futhi wenze leyo ndawo ibe yamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlanganisela zibalwa ngendawo ngayinye ngamaphelele ayo. Ifomula ezungezayo, njengo \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 4)\u003C/code\u003E, ingenza amanani amakhulu kancane ezindaweni ndawonye kunasemsebenzini wonke, njengoba kwenzeka kwithenda elibalwe ngendawo ngayinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukhethwayo-ithenda-elisisekelo-ukwengeza-nokususa\"\u003EOkukhethwayo: ithenda elisisekelo, ukwengeza nokususa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yezindleko ingaba \u003Cstrong\u003Eokukhethwayo\u003C/strong\u003E (alternate): umsebenzi umnikazi angawungeza ethendeni, noma awususe kulo. Ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EPhatha izindawo zezindleko…\u003C/strong\u003E, indawo ngayinye inohlu olusecaleni kwegama layo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkukhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBase bid\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEthendeni, njengokujwayelekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd alternate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbalwa yodwa futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eishiywe ngaphandle kwethenda elisisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuthuthukiswa kwekhaphethi, isiphahla esengeziwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct alternate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEthendeni elisisekelo, futhi inikezwa njengokususwa: &quot;susa isiphahla&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBala umsebenzi wokukhetha endaweni yezindleko yawo njengakwezinye izindawo. Uma ukubala sekunokukhetha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhanda lethebula le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E lithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIthenda elisisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E esikhundleni se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E: konke ukubala ngaphandle kokwengeza okukhethwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E iphela ngethenda elisisekelo nomugqa owodwa wokukhetha ngakunye: \u003Cstrong\u003E+$300.00\u003C/strong\u003E ngokwengeziwe, \u003Cstrong\u003E−$1,050.00\u003C/strong\u003E ngokususiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkukhethwayo kubiza kuphela izinto ezinezimaka kuyo, nezinhlanganisela zazo, ukuze ingxenye yento enye ingangeni ngokungazelelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-exports, i-CSV iphela ngethenda elisisekelo nokukhethwayo, futhi incwadi yokusebenza ithola ishidi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EAlternates\u003C/strong\u003E: ithenda elisisekelo, izinto zokukhetha ngakunye nokushintsha kwazo, kanye nethenda elisisekelo nakho konke okungeziwe okususiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-export\"\u003EKu-export\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E yengeza ishidi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EBy bid area\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto nezingxenye zendawo ngayinye ngenani, inani ngokulahleka, izinto zokusebenza, umsebenzi nesamba, isamba esincane ngendawo (ifomula ye-\u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E) kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EAll bid areas\u003C/strong\u003E ekugcineni. Ishidi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E lithola ikholomu ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EBid area\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukubala okungenayo izindawo zezindleko kuthunyelwa njengakuqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EAmakholomu okuthumela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo zezindleko zigcinwa kwifayela lephrojekthi kanye nezimaka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indawo yezindleko ingxenye yomsebenzi oyibiza ngokwayo: isakhiwo, isitezi, isigaba, ingxenye. Ngayinye imaka ingaba kwindawo yezindleko eyodwa. Inani nesilinganiso sezindleko kungafundwa ngendawo ngayinye, nesamba esincane sayo, kanti isamba somsebenzi sihlala yisamba sakho konke. Yenza indawo yezindleko Phezulu kwephaneli ye-Items, vula uhlu lwe-Bid area. Khetha Indawo yezindleko entsha…, thayipha igama njengo \"Isakhiwo A\" noma \"Isitezi 2\", bese ukhetha Yenze yona. Indawo entsha iba yamanje. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Izimaka ezintsha ziya ku-(igama). Izimaka ezisezindaweni zezindleko ezinye ziyafiphala.\" Bala ngendawo Lapho indawo yezindleko ikhethiwe ohlwini, zonke izimaka ezintsha ziya kuyo: imigqa, izindawo, imibuthano, izinani, izimaka ezengezwa yi-Auto count, nokuhlanganiswa. Izimaka ezisezindaweni zezindleko ezinye, nezingasezindaweni, ziyafiphala ushidi ukuze ubone okuyini kuphi. Khetha No bid area ohlwini ukubala ngaphandle kwayo; akukho okufiphala ngalesosikhathi. Amasitezi ajwayelekile: bala i-Isitezi 2, khetha izimaka zayo (Ctrl+A kushidi), zikopishe, khetha Isitezi 3 ohlwini bese unamathisela. Izikhopi ziya ku-Isitezi 3. Uma amasitezi efana futhi ungadingi ukuwahlukanisa, iqembu elijwayelekile libala isitezi esisodwa izikhathi eziningi kunalokho. Hambisa izimaka kwenye indawo Khetha imaka eyodwa noma eminingi (Shift + chofoza, noma Ctrl+A). Ngaphansi kwe-Imaka ekhethiwe (noma Izimaka ezikhethiwe), khetha indawo kusipaji se-Bid area. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Izimaka ezi-3 zihanjiswe ziya ku-Isitezi 2.\" Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Qamba kabusha, hlela kabusha noma susa Khetha Phatha izindawo zezindleko… ohlwini. Bhala phezu kwegama ukulibiza kabusha, sebenzisa izimpandla ukushintsha ukulandelana (amathebula nencwadi yokusebenza kuyalandela), noma susa enye ngebhasikidi. Ukususa indawo yezindleko kugcina izimaka zayo: zisuke zingasemandleni endaweni yezindleko. Ctrl+Z ihlehlisa ushintsho ngalunye. Funda izinani ngendawo Ku-Quantities, khetha By area (ibonakala uma ukubala sekunendawo yezindleko). Indawo ngayinye ibhala izinto eziyiphethe, nenani layo, iyunithi nesamba, bese kuba umugqa wesamba esincane. Izimaka ezingekho ndaweni yezindleko zifika ekugcineni, njenge-No bid area. Chofoza umugqa wento ukuze uyigqamise futhi wenze leyo ndawo ibe yamanje. Izinhlanganisela zibalwa ngendawo ngayinye ngamaphelele ayo. Ifomula ezungezayo, njengo ceil(L / 4), ingenza amanani amakhulu kancane ezindaweni ndawonye kunasemsebenzini wonke, njengoba kwenzeka kwithenda elibalwe ngendawo ngayinye. Okukhethwayo: ithenda elisisekelo, ukwengeza nokususa Indawo yezindleko ingaba okukhethwayo (alternate): umsebenzi umnikazi angawungeza ethendeni, noma awususe kulo. Ku-Phatha izindawo zezindleko…, indawo ngayinye inohlu olusecaleni kwegama layo: Ukukhetha Okwenzayo Base bid Ethendeni, njengokujwayelekile. Add alternate Ibalwa yodwa futhi ishiywe ngaphandle kwethenda elisisekelo: ukuthuthukiswa kwekhaphethi, isiphahla esengeziwe. Deduct alternate Ethendeni elisisekelo, futhi inikezwa njengokususwa: \"susa isiphahla\". Bala umsebenzi wokukhetha endaweni yezindleko yawo njengakwezinye izindawo. Uma ukubala sekunokukhetha: Ikhanda lethebula le-Quantities lithi Ithenda elisisekelo esikhundleni se-Job total: konke ukubala ngaphandle kokwengeza okukhethwayo. By area iphela ngethenda elisisekelo nomugqa owodwa wokukhetha ngakunye: +$300.00 ngokwengeziwe, −$1,050.00 ngokususiwe. Okukhethwayo kubiza kuphela izinto ezinezimaka kuyo, nezinhlanganisela zazo, ukuze ingxenye yento enye ingangeni ngokungazelelwe. Ku-exports, i-CSV iphela ngethenda elisisekelo nokukhethwayo, futhi incwadi yokusebenza ithola ishidi elithi Alternates: ithenda elisisekelo, izinto zokukhetha ngakunye nokushintsha kwazo, kanye nethenda elisisekelo nakho konke okungeziwe okususiwe. Ku-export XLSX yengeza ishidi elithi By bid area: izinto nezingxenye zendawo ngayinye ngenani, inani ngokulahleka, izinto zokusebenza, umsebenzi nesamba, isamba esincane ngendawo (ifomula ye-SUM) kanye ne-All bid areas ekugcineni. Ishidi le-Marks lithola ikholomu ethi Bid area. Ukubala okungenayo izindawo zezindleko kuthunyelwa njengakuqala. Bona Amakholomu okuthumela. Izindawo zezindleko zigcinwa kwifayela lephrojekthi kanye nezimaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"typical-groups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amaqembu avamile","summary":"Hlola iyunithi, igumbi noma uphahla oluvamile kanye kuphela bese uluba kangangoba lusho ukuphindeka kwalo, shintsha inani nanoma nini, futhi ubone ukuthi yiziphi izimaki ezivamile.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["okuvamile","iqembu elivamile","phinda","inani lokuphindeka","phindaphinda","izikhathi","iyunithi","igumbi lehhotela","ifulethi","uphahla oluvamile","x24","amakhophi"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-iqembu-elivamile","text":"Yenza iqembu elivamile","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-kamuva","text":"Shintsha kamuva","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sivame ukuphindeka: amagumbi ehhotela ayi-24 afanayo, izitezi ezi-6 ezivamile, izindawo zokupaka ezingu-40 ezinemigqa efanayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EIqembu elivamile\u003C/strong\u003E likuvumela ukuthi uhlole elilodwa kwalezo bese uliba izikhathi zalo zokuphindeka, ngaphandle kokudweba amakhophi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-iqembu-elivamile\"\u003EYenza iqembu elivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola iyunithi eyodwa: izindonga zayo, ifulowa layo, izinsimbi zayo; noma yiziphi izinto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izimaki zayo ngethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza enye, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza ezinye (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EKhetha izimaki\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImaki ekhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuvamile\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu elivamile elisha…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENika igama (\u003Ccode\u003EUnit A\u003C/code\u003E) nokuthi liphindeka kangaki (\u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E), bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza iqembu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke inani lalezo zimaki manje libalwa izikhathi ezingu-24: udonga lwe-10 ft lunika i-240 ft, ifulowa le-80 SF linika i-1,920 SF, izimpande ezimbili zinika 48. Izindleko ziyalandela, futhi izifomula zama-assembly zibona izinani eziphindiwe (\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E nayo ibala umugqa ngamunye izikhathi ezingu-24).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikrinini, ibhokisi elimpunga lizungeza izimaki zeqembu ngegama nenani lalo, njengo \u003Cstrong\u003EUnit A ×24\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-kamuva\"\u003EShintsha kamuva\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaqembu afakwe ohlwini ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaqembu avamile\u003C/strong\u003E kwipaneli yesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha inombolo ngemuva kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ushintse ukuthi ibalwa kangaki (1 kuya kwangu-10,000). Yonke inani liyavuselelwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgegama libhokisini layo legama, liyashintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsithonjana sebhokisi sikhetha izimaki zalo (futhi sibonise ishidi lazo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgaleji ikhipha iqembu. Izimaki zalo zihlala, zibalwa kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wengeze izimaki eqenjini noma uzikhiphe, zikhethe bese ukhetha iqembu (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkuvamile (×1)\u003C/span\u003E) ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuvamile\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimaki zeqembu zingaba kumashidi amaningi, futhi zibe zezinto eziningi. Imaki ngayinye ingaba eqenjini elilodwa kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhophi owanamathisela awasebenzi eqenjini: ikhophi eyanamathiselwa yeyunithi evamile ibizobalwa izikhathi ezingu-24 futhi. Sebenzisa iqembu lokuthi &quot;into efanayo N izikhathi&quot;, bese ukopisha futhi unamathisele amakhophi odwebayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimaki zidwetshwe kanye, ngakho ukubuka kwe-3D nePDF emakwe kubonisa iyunithi eyodwa; amanani, ukuthunyelwa nethebula ngalinye leshidi kubala ngu-×N. Ishidi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E lokuthunyelwa kwe-Excel lisho ukuthi yiziphi izimaki ezivamile nokuthi zibalwa kangaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgezindawo zethenda, izimaki zeqembu zibalwa ×N endaweni yazo yethenda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Isakhiwo sivame ukuphindeka: amagumbi ehhotela ayi-24 afanayo, izitezi ezi-6 ezivamile, izindawo zokupaka ezingu-40 ezinemigqa efanayo. Iqembu elivamile likuvumela ukuthi uhlole elilodwa kwalezo bese uliba izikhathi zalo zokuphindeka, ngaphandle kokudweba amakhophi. Yenza iqembu elivamile Hlola iyunithi eyodwa: izindonga zayo, ifulowa layo, izinsimbi zayo; noma yiziphi izinto. Khetha izimaki zayo ngethuluzi Khetha: chofoza enye, bese Shift + chofoza ezinye (Khetha izimaki). Ngaphansi kwe-Imaki ekhethiwe, vula Okuvamile bese ukhetha Iqembu elivamile elisha…. Nika igama (Unit A) nokuthi liphindeka kangaki (24), bese ukhetha Yenza iqembu. Yonke inani lalezo zimaki manje libalwa izikhathi ezingu-24: udonga lwe-10 ft lunika i-240 ft, ifulowa le-80 SF linika i-1,920 SF, izimpande ezimbili zinika 48. Izindleko ziyalandela, futhi izifomula zama-assembly zibona izinani eziphindiwe (N nayo ibala umugqa ngamunye izikhathi ezingu-24). Esikrinini, ibhokisi elimpunga lizungeza izimaki zeqembu ngegama nenani lalo, njengo Unit A ×24. Shintsha kamuva Amaqembu afakwe ohlwini ngaphansi kwe-Amaqembu avamile kwipaneli yesokudla: Shintsha inombolo ngemuva kwe-× ukuze ushintse ukuthi ibalwa kangaki (1 kuya kwangu-10,000). Yonke inani liyavuselelwa. Ngegama libhokisini layo legama, liyashintsha. Isithonjana sebhokisi sikhetha izimaki zalo (futhi sibonise ishidi lazo). Igaleji ikhipha iqembu. Izimaki zalo zihlala, zibalwa kanye. Ukuze wengeze izimaki eqenjini noma uzikhiphe, zikhethe bese ukhetha iqembu (noma Akuvamile (×1)) ngaphansi kwe-Okuvamile. Okufanele ukwazi Izimaki zeqembu zingaba kumashidi amaningi, futhi zibe zezinto eziningi. Imaki ngayinye ingaba eqenjini elilodwa kuphela. Amakhophi owanamathisela awasebenzi eqenjini: ikhophi eyanamathiselwa yeyunithi evamile ibizobalwa izikhathi ezingu-24 futhi. Sebenzisa iqembu lokuthi \"into efanayo N izikhathi\", bese ukopisha futhi unamathisele amakhophi odwebayo. Izimaki zidwetshwe kanye, ngakho ukubuka kwe-3D nePDF emakwe kubonisa iyunithi eyodwa; amanani, ukuthunyelwa nethebula ngalinye leshidi kubala ngu-×N. Ishidi elithi Marks lokuthunyelwa kwe-Excel lisho ukuthi yiziphi izimaki ezivamile nokuthi zibalwa kangaki. Ngezindawo zethenda, izimaki zeqembu zibalwa ×N endaweni yazo yethenda.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izikhishwa, izinguqulo kanye nelogi yokushintsha komdwebo","summary":"Gcina umlando owodwa wezikhishwa kanye nemodeli yomklami: funda izikhishwa, rekhoda imiyalo yesayithi, amadwebo okukhiqiza kanye namamodeli axhunyiwe ngokuya esikhishweni, bese ufunda ilogi yokushintsha komdwebo.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["isikhishwa","inguqulo","izinguqulo","ilogi yokushintsha","ilogi yokushintsha komdwebo","ireji yomdwebo","umyalo wesayithi","idwebo lokukhiqiza","imodeli exhunyiwe","ithenda","ukwakha","umlando wezikhishwa","uhlu lwamanani","ukubala amanani"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenza ngomlando wezikhishwa ofanayo nalowo wonke ithimba. Bona ukuthi yimaphi amashidi aphume ngayiphi inguqulo, bese ugcina okwenzeka esayithini ngokuxhumana nesikhishwa okuphethe kuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzikhishwa nezinguqulo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFunda umlando wezikhishwa\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E elilondoloziwe ku-BimCraft noma kwenye i-app. Izikhishwa nezirekhodi zalo ziyengezwa kowakho. Akukho okusulwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza irekhodi\u003C/strong\u003E lomyalo wesayithi, idwebo lokukhiqiza, isethi yezimaka, imodeli exhunyiwe noma inothi. Khetha isikhishwa okuphethe kuso nesimo sayo. Ifayela olikhethile liqoshwa ngegama lalo, usayizi kanye ne-SHA-256; ifayela lihlala lapho lisemi khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlogi yokushintsha komdwebo\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa umugqa owodwa weshidi ngalinye nekholomu eyodwa yesikhishwa ngasinye. Inguqulo ephakathi kwamabhulakethi ikhishwe futhi ayishintshiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELanda ilogi yokushintsha (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E iyalondoloza izikhishwa, ithebula leshidi kanye namarekhodi. \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza umlando wezikhishwa\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala ifayela ezinye ii-app ezilifundayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERekhoda isikhishwa\u003C/strong\u003E sikhipha amashidi wakho alinganisiwe, isibonelo nge-uhlu lwamanani. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquko kusukela\u003C/strong\u003E bese kutshela ukuthi yiziphi amashidi alinganiswe kabusha emva kwalesosikhishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmlando ulondolozwa ku-takeoff file. Lowo nalowo mshintsho uyi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkufunda ifayela elifanayo kabili akungezi lutho kabili. Uma amakhophi amabili enerekhodi elifanayo, elisha liyagcinwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Sebenza ngomlando wezikhishwa ofanayo nalowo wonke ithimba. Bona ukuthi yimaphi amashidi aphume ngayiphi inguqulo, bese ugcina okwenzeka esayithini ngokuxhumana nesikhishwa okuphethe kuso. Izinyathelo Vula Izikhishwa nezinguqulo. Khetha Funda umlando wezikhishwa bese ukhetha ifayela .issues.json elilondoloziwe ku-BimCraft noma kwenye i-app. Izikhishwa nezirekhodi zalo ziyengezwa kowakho. Akukho okusulwayo. Khetha Engeza irekhodi lomyalo wesayithi, idwebo lokukhiqiza, isethi yezimaka, imodeli exhunyiwe noma inothi. Khetha isikhishwa okuphethe kuso nesimo sayo. Ifayela olikhethile liqoshwa ngegama lalo, usayizi kanye ne-SHA-256; ifayela lihlala lapho lisemi khona. Ilogi yokushintsha komdwebo ibonisa umugqa owodwa weshidi ngalinye nekholomu eyodwa yesikhishwa ngasinye. Inguqulo ephakathi kwamabhulakethi ikhishwe futhi ayishintshiwe. Landa ilogi yokushintsha (CSV) iyalondoloza izikhishwa, ithebula leshidi kanye namarekhodi. Londoloza umlando wezikhishwa ibhala ifayela ezinye ii-app ezilifundayo. Okuhle ukukwazi Rekhoda isikhishwa sikhipha amashidi wakho alinganisiwe, isibonelo nge-uhlu lwamanani. Izinguquko kusukela bese kutshela ukuthi yiziphi amashidi alinganiswe kabusha emva kwalesosikhishwa. Umlando ulondolozwa ku-takeoff file. Lowo nalowo mshintsho uyi-Undo eyodwa. Ukufunda ifayela elifanayo kabili akungezi lutho kabili. Uma amakhophi amabili enerekhodi elifanayo, elisha liyagcinwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"read-quantities","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Funda amanani nesilinganiso sezindleko","summary":"Sebenzisa ithebula lamanani ngento nangeshidi, isamba somsebenzi, ukugqamisa, nesexwayiso sokuthi Akuphelele.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["amanani","izamba","ngento","ngeshidi","isamba somsebenzi","isilinganiso sezindleko","isifinyezo","umbiko","gqamisa","akuphelele","izindleko"],"headings":[{"id":"ngento","text":"Ngento","level":2},{"id":"ngeshidi","text":"Ngeshidi","level":2},{"id":"ngendawo","text":"Ngendawo","level":2},{"id":"isexwayiso-sokuthi-akuphelele","text":"Isexwayiso sokuthi Akuphelele","level":2},{"id":"gqamisa-into","text":"Gqamisa into","level":2},{"id":"amasamanisa-ento-ngaseceleni","text":"Amasamanisa ento ngaseceleni","level":2},{"id":"izimaki-kuma-pdf-angavulwanga","text":"Izimaki kuma-PDF angavulwanga","level":2},{"id":"igumbi-elengeziwe","text":"Igumbi elengeziwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthebula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwewindi yisilinganiso sakho sezindleko esiphilayo. Lishintsha ngokushesha lapho udweba, usule, ushintsha isikali noma uhlele irethi. Amanani awagcinwa; alinganiswa kabusha kusukela ezimakini njalo, ngakho awanakuba ngaphandle kwesikhathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngento\"\u003ENgento\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E (okuzenzakalelayo). Into ngayinye inomugqa wayo, nezingxenye zayo zomhlangano zinemigqa ngaphansi kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkholomu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama, nombala wento. &quot;+(n) unscaled&quot; kusho ukuthi ezinye izimaki zisemashidini angenaso isikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsamba esilinganisiwe ngeyunithi yento (izingxenye: umphumela wefomula).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, noma iyunithi yengxenye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulahleka %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuthayipha lapha noma kumhleli wento.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokulahleka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani × (1 + ukulahleka).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImpahla/iyunithi, Ukusebenza/iyunithi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmarethi; ungawathayipha lapha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImpahla, Ukusebenza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokulahleka × irethi, kuzungezwe kusenti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsamba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImpahla + ukusebenza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wokugcina, \u003Cstrong\u003EIsamba sembangi\u003C/strong\u003E, wengeza amakholomu empahla, okusebenza nesamba. Leli samba libonakala futhi ngakwesokudla kwesihloko sethebula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThayipha kuseli lokulahleka noma lerethi bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze endaweni ukuze usebenzise. Inani ingxenye ye-TakeoffCraft engayifunda liyogxilwa ngomugqa obomvu, futhi ibha yesimo ichaza isizathu, isibonelo &quot;Thayipha inani njengo-12.50.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza umugqa wento ukuze ugqamise izimaki zayo kuwo wonke amashidi bese uya kushidi elinazo. Lokhu kufana nokuchofoza kuyo ngaphansi kuka-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngeshidi\"\u003ENgeshidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E ukubona inani lento ngalinye kuleshidi ngalinye, nenani lezimaki. Chofoza umugqa ukuze uvule leshidi nento egqanyisiwe. Sebenzisa lokhu ukuhlola ukuthi wonke amashidi abalwe, noma ukwehlukanisa amanani ngomgangatho noma ngendawo yomsebenzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngendawo\"\u003ENgendawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ukubala amanani kunezindawo zokunikezela, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E ibala izinto zendawo ngayinye nesamba esincane. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EIzindawo zokunikezela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isexwayiso-sokuthi-akuphelele\"\u003EIsexwayiso sokuthi Akuphelele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kukhona okushiywe emasamanisweni, isihloko sibonisa isexwayiso, isibonelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Akuphelele: iphutha elingu-1 lefomula, izimaki ezingu-6 emashidini angenasikali (azifakiwe emasamanisweni)&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphutha efomula\u003C/strong\u003E: ifomula yengxenye yomhlangano ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa. Umugqa wayo uthi &quot;Iphutha lefomula: …&quot;. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies#when-a-formula-is-wrong\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-hash=\"when-a-formula-is-wrong\"\u003EUkuhlangana nefomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimaki emashidini angenasikali\u003C/strong\u003E: nika lawo mashidi isikali. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zincazelo zifakwa nasespredshithi ethunyelwe, ngakho isilinganiso sezindleko esingaphelele asisoze sibonakale siphelele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gqamisa-into\"\u003EGqamisa into\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza into ngaphansi kuka-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E noma ethebulini. Izimaki zayo zihlala zingokugcwele kuwo wonke amashidi, nezinye zifiphale. Uhlu lwamashidi lubonisa &quot;(n) egqanyisiwe&quot; kuleshidi ngalinye elinezimaki zayo. Chofoza into futhi ukuze uyeke ukuyigqamisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amasamanisa-ento-ngaseceleni\"\u003EAmasamanisa ento ngaseceleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgayinye into ohlwini lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E nayo ibonisa inani layo. Ibhlokhi ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E kumhleli wento ibonisa amanani afomula zayo zisebenzisa: ubude, izigijimi nendawo yodonga; indawo, ubude bomphetho nenani lezindawo; noma inani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimaki-kuma-pdf-angavulwanga\"\u003EIzimaki kuma-PDF angavulwanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubala amanani kungafaka izimaki kuma-PDF ongawavulanga kuleli sikhathi. Zisabalwa kuwo wonke amasamanisa; uhlu lwamashidi luqamba la ma-PDF. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ELondoloza futhi uvule kabusha ukubala amanani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"igumbi-elengeziwe\"\u003EIgumbi elengeziwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho yompondo ngakwesokudla kwesihloko se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E ifihla ithebula ukuze ishidi libe nendawo engaphezu. Chofoza futhi ukuze ubuyisele ithebula.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ithebula Quantities ngaphansi kwewindi yisilinganiso sakho sezindleko esiphilayo. Lishintsha ngokushesha lapho udweba, usule, ushintsha isikali noma uhlele irethi. Amanani awagcinwa; alinganiswa kabusha kusukela ezimakini njalo, ngakho awanakuba ngaphandle kwesikhathi. Ngento Khetha By item (okuzenzakalelayo). Into ngayinye inomugqa wayo, nezingxenye zayo zomhlangano zinemigqa ngaphansi kwayo. Ikholomu Incazelo Into Igama, nombala wento. \"+(n) unscaled\" kusho ukuthi ezinye izimaki zisemashidini angenaso isikali. Inani Isamba esilinganisiwe ngeyunithi yento (izingxenye: umphumela wefomula). Iyunithi LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, noma iyunithi yengxenye. Ukulahleka % Kuthayipha lapha noma kumhleli wento. Ngokulahleka Inani × (1 + ukulahleka). Impahla/iyunithi, Ukusebenza/iyunithi Amarethi; ungawathayipha lapha. Impahla, Ukusebenza Ngokulahleka × irethi, kuzungezwe kusenti. Isamba Impahla + ukusebenza. Umugqa wokugcina, Isamba sembangi, wengeza amakholomu empahla, okusebenza nesamba. Leli samba libonakala futhi ngakwesokudla kwesihloko sethebula. Thayipha kuseli lokulahleka noma lerethi bese ucindezela Enter noma uchofoze endaweni ukuze usebenzise. Inani ingxenye ye-TakeoffCraft engayifunda liyogxilwa ngomugqa obomvu, futhi ibha yesimo ichaza isizathu, isibonelo \"Thayipha inani njengo-12.50.\" Chofoza umugqa wento ukuze ugqamise izimaki zayo kuwo wonke amashidi bese uya kushidi elinazo. Lokhu kufana nokuchofoza kuyo ngaphansi kuka-Items. Ngeshidi Khetha By sheet ukubona inani lento ngalinye kuleshidi ngalinye, nenani lezimaki. Chofoza umugqa ukuze uvule leshidi nento egqanyisiwe. Sebenzisa lokhu ukuhlola ukuthi wonke amashidi abalwe, noma ukwehlukanisa amanani ngomgangatho noma ngendawo yomsebenzi. Ngendawo Uma ukubala amanani kunezindawo zokunikezela, By area ibala izinto zendawo ngayinye nesamba esincane. Bona Izindawo zokunikezela. Isexwayiso sokuthi Akuphelele Uma kukhona okushiywe emasamanisweni, isihloko sibonisa isexwayiso, isibonelo: \"Akuphelele: iphutha elingu-1 lefomula, izimaki ezingu-6 emashidini angenasikali (azifakiwe emasamanisweni)\" Amaphutha efomula: ifomula yengxenye yomhlangano ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa. Umugqa wayo uthi \"Iphutha lefomula: …\". Bona Ukuhlangana nefomula. Izimaki emashidini angenasikali: nika lawo mashidi isikali. Bona Setha isikali. Lezi zincazelo zifakwa nasespredshithi ethunyelwe, ngakho isilinganiso sezindleko esingaphelele asisoze sibonakale siphelele. Gqamisa into Chofoza into ngaphansi kuka-Items noma ethebulini. Izimaki zayo zihlala zingokugcwele kuwo wonke amashidi, nezinye zifiphale. Uhlu lwamashidi lubonisa \"(n) egqanyisiwe\" kuleshidi ngalinye elinezimaki zayo. Chofoza into futhi ukuze uyeke ukuyigqamisa. Amasamanisa ento ngaseceleni Ngayinye into ohlwini lwe-Items nayo ibonisa inani layo. Ibhlokhi ethi Measured kumhleli wento ibonisa amanani afomula zayo zisebenzisa: ubude, izigijimi nendawo yodonga; indawo, ubude bomphetho nenani lezindawo; noma inani. Izimaki kuma-PDF angavulwanga Ukubala amanani kungafaka izimaki kuma-PDF ongawavulanga kuleli sikhathi. Zisabalwa kuwo wonke amasamanisa; uhlu lwamashidi luqamba la ma-PDF. Bona Londoloza futhi uvule kabusha ukubala amanani. Igumbi elengeziwe Inkinobho yompondo ngakwesokudla kwesihloko se-Quantities ifihla ithebula ukuze ishidi libe nendawo engaphezu. Chofoza futhi ukuze ubuyisele ithebula.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"markups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amanothi, amafu nokuqaqambisa","summary":"Phawula imibuzo nezinguquko kumashidi ngamanothi, amafu okubuyekeza nokuqaqambisa, landelela ngayinye njengevulekile, iphendulwe noma ivaliwe, bese uyithumela ku-PDF emakwe.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["ukumaka","izimaki","inothi","amazwana","umbuzo","rfi","ifu","ifu lokubuyekeza","qaqambisa","isimo","vulekile","iphendulwe","ivaliwe","ukubuyekeza","uhlu lwezimaki"],"headings":[{"id":"engeza-eyodwa","text":"Engeza eyodwa","level":2},{"id":"isimo-nokuhlela","text":"Isimo nokuhlela","level":2},{"id":"uhlu","text":"Uhlu","level":2},{"id":"yabelana-ngazo","text":"Yabelana ngazo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzimaki zezinto ofuna ukuzikhumbula noma ukuzibuza ngesikhathi uthatha amanani: &quot;qinisekisa uhlobo lwesisekelo&quot;, ifu lokubuyekeza elizungeza udonga oshintshile, inothi eqaqanjiswe ipulani. Zihlala esheetini nesimo sazo, zidweywe ohlwini olulodwa, futhi zishicilelwe ku-PDF emakwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EAzibalwa ngakho\u003C/strong\u003E: akukho nani, akukho zinxephezelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-eyodwa\"\u003EEngeza eyodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu kwesheet bese ukhetha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHow\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENote\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa lapho izofika khona, uthayiphe inothi, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E. Ibonakala njengephinikhodi ejikelezayo nomugqa wayo wokuqala ecaleni kwayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECloud\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa ikhona elilodwa, bese ukhetha elisha elicashile, uthayiphe inothi (noma ushiye lingenalutho). Ifu lokubuyekeza elinemiphetho ejikelezayo lizungeza ibhokisi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHighlight\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa amakhona amabili: ibhokisi eliphuzi elibonakalayo, nenothi uma ufisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E emva kokhona lokuqala iyakhansela. Ithuluzi lihlala livulekile okulandelayo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isimo-nokuhlela\"\u003EIsimo nokuhlela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECofa imaki nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyikhethe. Ipaneli yesokudla ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkup\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo nesheet yayo, \u003Cstrong\u003EStatus\u003C/strong\u003E yayo — Vulekile, Iphendulwe noma Ivaliwe — kanye nombhalo wayo, ongawushintsha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E) iyayisusa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyibuyisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpinikhodi yenothi iba yiorenji uma ivulekile, ibhlu uma iphendulwe, futhi igrey uma ivaliwe; ifu elivaliwe liba igrey.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimaki\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokudla zidweba zonke izimaki zomsebenzi wokubala ngesimo sazo, futhi zitshela ukuthi zingaki ezisavulekile. Thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EVulekile kuphela\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubone okusasele ukuthi kuxazululwe. Cofa umugqa ukuze uye esheetini wayo futhi uyikhethe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yabelana-ngazo\"\u003EYabelana ngazo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E iyazidweba emakhasini: okuqaqambisiwe, amafu nopini, ngalinye nebhokisi elinikeza isimo sayo ngamakhamandla (VULEKILE, IPHENDULIWE, IVALIWE) nombhalo wayo. Ikhasi elinezimaki kodwa elingenazo izimaki zokubala nalo liyafakwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E yengeza umsebenzi wewebhu \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkups\u003C/strong\u003E: ishidi, uhlobo, isimo nombhalo, umugqa owodwa ngamunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZiyagcinwa ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E nakwi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF enokubala ngaphakathi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Izimaki zezinto ofuna ukuzikhumbula noma ukuzibuza ngesikhathi uthatha amanani: \"qinisekisa uhlobo lwesisekelo\", ifu lokubuyekeza elizungeza udonga oshintshile, inothi eqaqanjiswe ipulani. Zihlala esheetini nesimo sazo, zidweywe ohlwini olulodwa, futhi zishicilelwe ku-PDF emakwe. Azibalwa ngakho: akukho nani, akukho zinxephezelo. Engeza eyodwa Vula Markup ebhareni ephezulu kwesheet bese ukhetha: Markup How Note Cofa lapho izofika khona, uthayiphe inothi, bese ukhetha Add. Ibonakala njengephinikhodi ejikelezayo nomugqa wayo wokuqala ecaleni kwayo. Cloud Cofa ikhona elilodwa, bese ukhetha elisha elicashile, uthayiphe inothi (noma ushiye lingenalutho). Ifu lokubuyekeza elinemiphetho ejikelezayo lizungeza ibhokisi. Highlight Cofa amakhona amabili: ibhokisi eliphuzi elibonakalayo, nenothi uma ufisa. Esc emva kokhona lokuqala iyakhansela. Ithuluzi lihlala livulekile okulandelayo; V ibuyela ku-Select. Isimo nokuhlela Cofa imaki nge-Select ukuze uyikhethe. Ipaneli yesokudla ibonisa Markup: uhlobo nesheet yayo, Status yayo — Vulekile, Iphendulwe noma Ivaliwe — kanye nombhalo wayo, ongawushintsha. Delete (noma Delete) iyayisusa; Ctrl+Z iyibuyisela. Ipinikhodi yenothi iba yiorenji uma ivulekile, ibhlu uma iphendulwe, futhi igrey uma ivaliwe; ifu elivaliwe liba igrey. Uhlu Izimaki ngakwesokudla zidweba zonke izimaki zomsebenzi wokubala ngesimo sazo, futhi zitshela ukuthi zingaki ezisavulekile. Thikha Vulekile kuphela ukuze ubone okusasele ukuthi kuxazululwe. Cofa umugqa ukuze uye esheetini wayo futhi uyikhethe. Yabelana ngazo Marked PDF iyazidweba emakhasini: okuqaqambisiwe, amafu nopini, ngalinye nebhokisi elinikeza isimo sayo ngamakhamandla (VULEKILE, IPHENDULIWE, IVALIWE) nombhalo wayo. Ikhasi elinezimaki kodwa elingenazo izimaki zokubala nalo liyafakwa. XLSX yengeza umsebenzi wewebhu Markups: ishidi, uhlobo, isimo nombhalo, umugqa owodwa ngamunye. Ziyagcinwa ku-.takeoff.json nakwi-PDF enokubala ngaphakathi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"check-in-3d","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hlola ukubala ngo-3D","summary":"Bona izindonga, izilebhu nezinani zomdwebo ovulekile zimi phezu komdwebo, zijikeleze, bese uchofoza enye ukuze ukhethe imaka yayo.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["png","isithombe","isithombe-skrini","isitaki","amasitezi","ukubukeka kohlangothi","glb","gltf","hlinzeka nge-3d","ukuthambo kodonga","ukuphakama kwesisekelo","ukuvulwa","ukuphakama kwesivalo","3d","three d","hlola","buka","izindonga","ukuphakama kodonga","ilebhu","ujula","ivolumu","zungeza","imodeli","ukukhetha","isometric","ukubona ngokujula"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-ukubuka-nge-3d","text":"Vula ukubuka nge-3D","level":2},{"id":"okubonayo","text":"Okubonayo","level":2},{"id":"bheka-ngokuzungeza","text":"Bheka ngokuzungeza","level":2},{"id":"imigodi-enobukhulu-isisekelo-nezivulo","text":"Imigodi enobukhulu, isisekelo nezivulo","level":2},{"id":"gcoba-izitezi","text":"Gcoba izitezi","level":2},{"id":"gcina-ukubuka-nge-3d-njengesithombe","text":"Gcina ukubuka nge-3D njengesithombe","level":2},{"id":"gcina-ukubuka-nge-3d-njengemodeli","text":"Gcina ukubuka nge-3D njengemodeli","level":2},{"id":"khetha-imaka-kwi-3d","text":"Khetha imaka kwi-3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka nge-3D akuyena omunye umdwebo, kodwa ukuhlola: kumisa ukubala kweshidi phezu kweshidi ngokwalo, ngakho indonga eyisiphazamisi, ilebhu eliphindwe, noma inani elingekho libonakala ngokushesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphambi kokuqala: ishidi kudingeka libe nesikali (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E). Ukuphakama nokujula kudinga amafidi angempela, ngakho ishidi elingenasikali, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E iyakutshela futhi ihlale ishidi elisicaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ukubuka-nge-3d\"\u003EVula ukubuka nge-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa ishidi ofuna ukulihlola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E kwibha ebonisa igama lishidi nesikali, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Okokuqala, ukubuka nge-3D kuthatha isikhathi sokulayisha. Ishidi lidwetshwa phansi, futhi ukubala kumi kulo ngombala wento ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubuyela, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E futhi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the sheet\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ukukhetha ithuluzi lokudweba (Umugqa, Indawo, Inani, njll.) nakho kuyabuyisela, ngoba izimaka zidwetshwa esheethini elisicaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhombisa ishidi kuscreen; shintsha amashidi ohlwini lwamashidi, noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, nokubuka nge-3D kuyalandela. Ukubona amafulaha amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, wawagxumele ngezansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonayo\"\u003EOkubonayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImaka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa onento enobude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdonga lobo bude ngomugqa. Imigqa egobile ilandela ijika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa ongenabude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa oshiywe ishidi. Nikeza into ukuphakama ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EItem\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uyimise.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo enento enojula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlebhu lalobo bujula, nezingxenye zalo zokususa zivuliwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo engenajula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpuleti elincane elingu-2&quot;, ukuze libonakale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIposi elincane kuphoyinti ngalinye elibaliwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphakama kuyinkambu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E yomugqa, nokujula kuyinkambu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E yento yendawo, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EItem\u003C/strong\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EDala izinto zokubala\u003C/a\u003E). Shintsha, bese ukubuka nge-3D kuyavuselelwa ngokushesha. Inothi ngaphansi kwegama leshidi lichaza ukuthi ishidi libambe ini, isibonelo &quot;Lelishidi ku-3D: izindonga ezi-2, ilebhu eli-1, izinani ezi-3&quot;, nokuthi yimingqa noma izindawo ezingaki ezingenabude noma ujula. Ukuchofoza kudlula kuso kuya kokubukwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinombolo azishintshi ku-3D: indawo yodonga iyubude bayo ngokoqobo ngokuphakama kwalo, nevolumu yelebhu iyindawo yalo ephelele (umphethe ngaphandle kwezingxenye ezisusiwe, amajika angokoqobo) ngokujula kwalo. Amajika adwetshwa njengezicucu ezimfushane kuscreen kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bheka-ngokuzungeza\"\u003EBheka ngokuzungeza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza ukubala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + donsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwheel yemouse\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza nokukhulisa ngasekhesini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuswayipha ngeminwe emibili kutrackpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ishelelisa). Ukuqina ngeminwe kusondeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBottom\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibuko ejwayelekile, ibekwe ekubalweni. Ukubuka nge-3D kuvulwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspective\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubona ngokujula kuvulwa noma kuvalwa (ngaphandle kwalokho kuba parallel).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom extents\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi lonke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheet\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonisa noma ufihle umdwebo phansi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka, ngakwesokudla phezulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza isinqe, umphetho noma ikhona ukubheka kusuka lapho; donsa ukuzungeza; donsa indandatho yekhampasi ukuphendula; inkinobho yendlu ibuyisela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhona ingaba ikhyubhu lokubuka, uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z, noma akukho lutho: khetha ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, ethebhu le-TakeoffCraft, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhombisi sekhona\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E). Ishidi elisicaba alinaso isikhombisi sekhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmunwe owodwa uzungeza; iminwe emibili iyaqina ukusondeza nokudlulisa ukushelelisa. Ukuthinta kukhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigodi-enobukhulu-isisekelo-nezivulo\"\u003EImigodi enobukhulu, isisekelo nezivulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa onobude uma unokuphakama wenza ukuma njengesiqeshana esincane. Ukuze uyibone njengodonga langempela, nikeza into isimo sayo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIn 3D\u003C/strong\u003E emilungiselelweni yayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbukhulu bodonga\u003C/strong\u003E (8&quot;, 0.2 m): udonga luba yinto eqinile, ingqumile kumugqa owudwebile, namakhona anqunyiwe ngamahlaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kwesisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga luqala leligama phezu komgqa (isofithi, ikhabinethi ephezulu). Izinto zendawo nazo zinakho: uphahla ku-9&#039;-0&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhanda lokuvulwa\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye esusiwe (umnyango, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#deduct-a-part-of-a-run\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"deduct-a-part-of-a-run\"\u003ESusa ingxenye yomugqa\u003C/a\u003E) igcina udonga phezu kwalobo bukhulu, ukuze umnyango ubonakale njengomnyango. Ngaphandle kwalo, ingxenye esusiwe ishiya igebe liya phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zibumba ukubuka nge-3D kuphela: izinani (ubude, indawo yodonga, izindleko) zihlala njengoba zazinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcoba-izitezi\"\u003EGcoba izitezi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ama-PDF wezitezi zonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-3D, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevels…\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha ukuphakama kwesitezi ngasinye, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E sesitezi esingaphansi nomsindo \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E esilandelayo. Okungenalutho kususa ishidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStack\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ishidi elinezinga libonisa ukubala kwalo ngokuphakama kwalo; ishidi elisesikrinini lilele ngaphansi kwesitezi salo, ezinye zibonakala ngemigqa yazo. Inothi lithi amasitezi amangaki agciniwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmashidi ahlanganiswa ngendawo asendaweni yawo ekhasini, ngakho lokhu kusebenza kumapulani esitezi afakwe ngendlela efanayo (usayizi weshidi nesikhundla esifanayo). Ishidi elinezinga kodwa lingenasikali liyashiywa, futhi inothi lithi kanjalo. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStack\u003C/span\u003E futhi ukwenza ishidi elilodwa ngesikhathi. Amazinga agcinwa kanye nokubala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-ukubuka-nge-3d-njengesithombe\"\u003EGcina ukubuka nge-3D njengesithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini le-3D ukuze uthole isithombe sokubuka njengoba kukhonjisiwe kuscreen (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D.png\u003C/code\u003E); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E kwenza kube kabili (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D@2x.png\u003C/code\u003E), ukuze kuphrintwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-ukubuka-nge-3d-njengemodeli\"\u003EGcina ukubuka nge-3D njengemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini le-3D. Uthola ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E (glTF, binary) lalokho okubonwayo: isitezi esisesikrinini, noma zonke izitezi ezigcwele, eliqhubeka ngezinye izinhlelo ze-3D: into eyodwa ngemaka ngayinye, ibizwa ngegama lento, ngombala wento, ngamamitha nge-Y iphezulu. Ishidi ngokwalo nemigqa yalo akukho kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-imaka-kwi-3d\"\u003EKhetha imaka kwi-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza udonga, ilebhu, ipuleti noma iposi. Imaka yalo iba imaka ekhethiwe, njengoba ubuyichofoza kushidi: ivela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E, into yalo iba yamanje, nebha yesimo inika ubude nobude bayo, noma indawo, ujula namayadi ekhyubhu. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + chofoza yengeza izimaka ekukhetheni noma iyisusa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa izimaka ezikhethiwe futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iziletha emuva; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayikhethi lutho. Ngemuva kushidi, izimaka ezifanayo zisakhethiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmdwebo ulandela isitayela: ku-Imodeli, ishidi elisesikrinini liba mnyama njengombukwa osicaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ukubuka nge-3D akuyena omunye umdwebo, kodwa ukuhlola: kumisa ukubala kweshidi phezu kweshidi ngokwalo, ngakho indonga eyisiphazamisi, ilebhu eliphindwe, noma inani elingekho libonakala ngokushesha. Ngaphambi kokuqala: ishidi kudingeka libe nesikali (Setha isikali). Ukuphakama nokujula kudinga amafidi angempela, ngakho ishidi elingenasikali, 3D iyakutshela futhi ihlale ishidi elisicaba. Vula ukubuka nge-3D Bonisa ishidi ofuna ukulihlola. Khetha 3D kwibha ebonisa igama lishidi nesikali, noma cindezela 3. Okokuqala, ukubuka nge-3D kuthatha isikhathi sokulayisha. Ishidi lidwetshwa phansi, futhi ukubala kumi kulo ngombala wento ngayinye. Ukubuyela, khetha 3D futhi, Back to the sheet, noma cindezela 3. Ukukhetha ithuluzi lokudweba (Umugqa, Indawo, Inani, njll.) nakho kuyabuyisela, ngoba izimaka zidwetshwa esheethini elisicaba. Ikhombisa ishidi kuscreen; shintsha amashidi ohlwini lwamashidi, noma nge-Page Down ne-Page Up, nokubuka nge-3D kuyalandela. Ukubona amafulaha amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, wawagxumele ngezansi. Okubonayo Imaka Ku-3D Umugqa onento enobude Udonga lobo bude ngomugqa. Imigqa egobile ilandela ijika. Umugqa ongenabude Umugqa oshiywe ishidi. Nikeza into ukuphakama ngaphansi kwe-Item ukuze uyimise. Indawo enento enojula Ilebhu lalobo bujula, nezingxenye zalo zokususa zivuliwe. Indawo engenajula Ipuleti elincane elingu-2\", ukuze libonakale. Inani Iposi elincane kuphoyinti ngalinye elibaliwe. Ukuphakama kuyinkambu ye-Height yomugqa, nokujula kuyinkambu ye-Depth yento yendawo, ngaphansi kwe-Item (bona Dala izinto zokubala). Shintsha, bese ukubuka nge-3D kuyavuselelwa ngokushesha. Inothi ngaphansi kwegama leshidi lichaza ukuthi ishidi libambe ini, isibonelo \"Lelishidi ku-3D: izindonga ezi-2, ilebhu eli-1, izinani ezi-3\", nokuthi yimingqa noma izindawo ezingaki ezingenabude noma ujula. Ukuchofoza kudlula kuso kuya kokubukwayo. Izinombolo azishintshi ku-3D: indawo yodonga iyubude bayo ngokoqobo ngokuphakama kwalo, nevolumu yelebhu iyindawo yalo ephelele (umphethe ngaphandle kwezingxenye ezisusiwe, amajika angokoqobo) ngokujula kwalo. Amajika adwetshwa njengezicucu ezimfushane kuscreen kuphela. Bheka ngokuzungeza Isenzo Okwenzayo Donsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi Zungeza ukubala. Shift + donsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla Shelelisa. Iwheel yemouse Sondeza nokukhulisa ngasekhesini. Ukuswayipha ngeminwe emibili kutrackpad Zungeza (Shift ishelelisa). Ukuqina ngeminwe kusondeza. Iso, Top, Front, Back, Left, Right, Bottom Imibuko ejwayelekile, ibekwe ekubalweni. Ukubuka nge-3D kuvulwa ku-Iso. Perspective Ukubona ngokujula kuvulwa noma kuvalwa (ngaphandle kwalokho kuba parallel). Zoom extents noma F Ishidi lonke. Sheet Bonisa noma ufihle umdwebo phansi. Ikhyubhu lokubuka, ngakwesokudla phezulu Chofoza isinqe, umphetho noma ikhona ukubheka kusuka lapho; donsa ukuzungeza; donsa indandatho yekhampasi ukuphendula; inkinobho yendlu ibuyisela ku-Iso. Ikhona ingaba ikhyubhu lokubuka, uphawu oluncane lwe-X, Y, Z, noma akukho lutho: khetha ku-Settings, ethebhu le-TakeoffCraft, ngaphansi kwe-Isikhombisi sekhona (Izilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft). Ishidi elisicaba alinaso isikhombisi sekhona. Umunwe owodwa uzungeza; iminwe emibili iyaqina ukusondeza nokudlulisa ukushelelisa. Ukuthinta kukhetha. Imigodi enobukhulu, isisekelo nezivulo Umugqa onobude uma unokuphakama wenza ukuma njengesiqeshana esincane. Ukuze uyibone njengodonga langempela, nikeza into isimo sayo ngaphansi kwe-In 3D emilungiselelweni yayo: Ubukhulu bodonga (8\", 0.2 m): udonga luba yinto eqinile, ingqumile kumugqa owudwebile, namakhona anqunyiwe ngamahlaba. Ukuphakama kwesisekelo: udonga luqala leligama phezu komgqa (isofithi, ikhabinethi ephezulu). Izinto zendawo nazo zinakho: uphahla ku-9'-0\". Ikhanda lokuvulwa: ingxenye esusiwe (umnyango, Susa ingxenye yomugqa) igcina udonga phezu kwalobo bukhulu, ukuze umnyango ubonakale njengomnyango. Ngaphandle kwalo, ingxenye esusiwe ishiya igebe liya phezulu. Lezi zibumba ukubuka nge-3D kuphela: izinani (ubude, indawo yodonga, izindleko) zihlala njengoba zazinjalo. Gcoba izitezi Vula ama-PDF wezitezi zonke. Ku-3D, khetha Levels… bese uthayipha ukuphakama kwesitezi ngasinye, njengo 0 sesitezi esingaphansi nomsindo 12' esilandelayo. Okungenalutho kususa ishidi. Khetha Stack. Yonke ishidi elinezinga libonisa ukubala kwalo ngokuphakama kwalo; ishidi elisesikrinini lilele ngaphansi kwesitezi salo, ezinye zibonakala ngemigqa yazo. Inothi lithi amasitezi amangaki agciniwe. Amashidi ahlanganiswa ngendawo asendaweni yawo ekhasini, ngakho lokhu kusebenza kumapulani esitezi afakwe ngendlela efanayo (usayizi weshidi nesikhundla esifanayo). Ishidi elinezinga kodwa lingenasikali liyashiywa, futhi inothi lithi kanjalo. Khetha Stack futhi ukwenza ishidi elilodwa ngesikhathi. Amazinga agcinwa kanye nokubala. Gcina ukubuka nge-3D njengesithombe Khetha PNG ebhalini le-3D ukuze uthole isithombe sokubuka njengoba kukhonjisiwe kuscreen (… 3D.png); Shift + chofoza PNG kwenza kube kabili (… 3D@2x.png), ukuze kuphrintwe. Gcina ukubuka nge-3D njengemodeli Khetha GLB ebhalini le-3D. Uthola ifayela .glb (glTF, binary) lalokho okubonwayo: isitezi esisesikrinini, noma zonke izitezi ezigcwele, eliqhubeka ngezinye izinhlelo ze-3D: into eyodwa ngemaka ngayinye, ibizwa ngegama lento, ngombala wento, ngamamitha nge-Y iphezulu. Ishidi ngokwalo nemigqa yalo akukho kuyo. Khetha imaka kwi-3D Chofoza udonga, ilebhu, ipuleti noma iposi. Imaka yalo iba imaka ekhethiwe, njengoba ubuyichofoza kushidi: ivela ngaphansi kwe-Selected mark, into yalo iba yamanje, nebha yesimo inika ubude nobude bayo, noma indawo, ujula namayadi ekhyubhu. Shift + chofoza yengeza izimaka ekukhetheni noma iyisusa. Delete isusa izimaka ezikhethiwe futhi Ctrl+Z iziletha emuva; Esc ayikhethi lutho. Ngemuva kushidi, izimaka ezifanayo zisakhethiwe. Umdwebo ulandela isitayela: ku-Imodeli, ishidi elisesikrinini liba mnyama njengombukwa osicaba.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"export-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Thumela isilinganiso nePDF emakwe","summary":"Landa isilinganiso njenge-workbook ye-XLSX enezifomula eziphilayo noma njenge-CSV, nokopisha ama-PDF akho ngokubukeka kokubala okudwetshiwe.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["isiphakamiso","isifinyezo sethenda","thumela","xlsx","spreadsheet","workbook","csv","pdf emakwe","phrinta ukubala","umbiko","yabelana","thumela","ilejendi"],"headings":[{"id":"isilinganiso-njenge-spreadsheet-xlsx","text":"Isilinganiso njenge-spreadsheet (XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"isilinganiso-njenge-csv","text":"Isilinganiso njenge-CSV","level":2},{"id":"isilinganiso-ku-google-sheets","text":"Isilinganiso ku-Google Sheets","level":2},{"id":"amarethi-angekho-nokusayina","text":"Amarethi angekho nokusayina","level":2},{"id":"pdf-emakwe","text":"PDF emakwe","level":2},{"id":"akukho-okuthunyelwayo","text":"Akukho okuthunyelwayo?","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-ukubala-futhi","text":"Londoloza ukubala futhi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkuthumela kuyizinkomba zokulanda. Zenziwa ekhompyutheni yakho kusukela ekubaleni namaPDF avuliwe; akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isilinganiso-njenge-spreadsheet-xlsx\"\u003EIsilinganiso njenge-spreadsheet (XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ethuleni bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E. Isiphequluli sakho silanda \u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Kuthunyelwe (name).xlsx (isilinganiso nezifomula eziphilayo, ngeshidi, ngemaki, izikali).&quot; bese ingeza isexwayiso uma isilinganiso singaphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula kuhlelo lwakho lwe-spreadsheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-workbook inamashidi amane, namanye ama-report alandelayo uma ehambisana:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIshidi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuqukethwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa ngento nangekhomponenti ngayinye: inani, udoti, inani nodoti, amarethi, impahla, umsebenzi, isamba, amanothi. Isamba sephrojekthi ngaphansi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBy sheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lento ngayinye kushidi ngalinye, nenani lemaki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImaki ngayinye: ishidi, into, uhlobo, inani, nemininingwane (ubude bezingxenye, izindawo ezigcwele nezikhishiwe, umjikelo).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScales\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi ngalinye elinesikali noma amaemaki: isikali salo, ukuthi sasethwa kanjani (ipreset, noma silinganiswe ngebanga elifakiwe), namafidi ngeyunithi ye-PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff summary\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lento ngayinye, inombolo ye-CSI, amaemaki namashidi, ngaphandle kwamanani.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke ingxenye yokuhlanganiswa ifakwe ndawonye ekubaleni (ingxenye efanayo esetshenziswa izinto eziningi ingumugqa owodwa), nodoti nezindleko zempahla, nezinto eziyisebenzisayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuote request\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwempahla lokuthumela kumnikezi: izinani nodoti, ikholomu yamarethi amayunithi engenalutho, nezengeziwe nesamba ezigcwalisa uma amanani efakwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBy division\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImpahla, umsebenzi nesamba ngesigaba se-CSI MasterFormat, uma izinto zinenombolo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInombolo ye-CSI\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENge\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003Eisifinyezo sethenda\u003C/a\u003E, ishidi le-Estimate liphela nemarkup yalo (inzuzo yabasebenzi, intela yokuthengisa, izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo, ibhondi nethenda), njengezifomula eziphilayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshidi le-Estimate ligcina \u003Cstrong\u003Eizifomula eziphilayo\u003C/strong\u003E: inani nodoti, izinani zempahla nomsebenzi ezizungeziwe, isamba sawo wonke umugqa nesamba sephrojekthi. Izinhlelo ze-spreadsheet ziyabala kabusha, ngakho ungashintsha irethi noma udoti kuspredishithi bese amasamba ayalandela. Izinombolo ezibalwe yi-TakeoffCraft nazo zigcinwe emaseli, futhi ziyafana kuze kube yisenti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkholomu yamanothi ibala ifomula yekhomponenti ngayinye, amaphutha ezifomula, amaemaki emashidini angenasikali, indawo yodonga nomjikelo. Uma kukhona okushiyiwe, umugqa wesamba sephrojekthi uthi &quot;Incomplete: see the notes above&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-workbook ihlolwe ku-LibreOffice Calc, yabalwa kabusha yanikeza amasamba afanayo. Ayikavulwa ku-Excel. Imininingwane ngekholomu ngayinye itholakala ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EAmakholomu okuthumela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isilinganiso-njenge-csv\"\u003EIsilinganiso njenge-CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula imenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E. Uthola \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E: imigqa namakholomu afanayo nalawo weshidi le-Estimate, njengamanani avamile (akukho zifomula), kanye nesamba sephrojekthi. Sebenzisa ukunamathisela kwenye inhlelo yezilinganiso noma yezezimali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CSV inesilinganiso kuphela; ngamanani ngeshidi nohlu lwemaki, sebenzisa i-XLSX. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwezinto zokwakha\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu efanayo ilondoloza uhlu lwempahla lodwa njenge-CSV, lokuyala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isilinganiso-ku-google-sheets\"\u003EIsilinganiso ku-Google Sheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphezulu kwethebhula lamanani, \u003Cstrong\u003EKopisha ye-Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E ufaka isilinganiso ekhliphodini njengombhalo ohlukaniswe ngamathebhu, ngemigqa efanayo ne-CSV. Ku-Google Sheet, chofoza iseli A1 bese unamathisela. I-TakeoffCraft ayingeni ngemvume ku-Google futhi ayithumeli lutho lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amarethi-angekho-nokusayina\"\u003EAmarethi angekho nokusayina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa onamanani kodwa ongenarethi uthi \u003Cstrong\u003ENo rate\u003C/strong\u003E kumanothi wawo, futhi ukuthumela kuwabala ngaphansi kwamasamba. Uma isilinganiso sasayinwa, ukuthumela kukhomba ukuthi ubani asayina, nini nangani isamba. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\"\u003EAmarethi angekho nokusayina isilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-emakwe\"\u003EPDF emakwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ama-PDF ofuna ukuwadweba amaemaki awo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E. Kuvela &quot;Ibhala i-PDF emakwe…&quot;, bese isiphequluli sakho silanda ifayela elilodwa nge-PDF emakwe ngayinye, igama layo ngu \u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwikhophi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eimigqa idwetshwe njengemigqa ngombala wento yayo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizindawo zigcwaliswe kancane ngomugqa oqinile, nezikhishiwe zishiywe zivulekile,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamanani ngamachashazi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eikhasi ngalinye elinemaki lithola ilejendi encane ekhoneni laso eliphansi kwesobunxele: umbala wento ngayinye, igama nenani kulelo khasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-PDF akho ayinhloko awashintshiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanothi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKubhalwa ama-PDF avuliwe kuphela. Amaemaki kuma-PDF angavulekile ahlala emagameni ahlanganisiwe kodwa awadwetshwanga; vula lawo ama-PDF kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmagama asendabeni yelejendi asebenzisa ifonti evamile ye-PDF. Izinhlamvu ezingakwazi ukuboniswa ziphrintwa njenge-&quot;?&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PDF ebethelwe ingeke ikopishwe nemaki: &quot;Le PDF ivikelwe ngephasiwedi noma ifihliwe, ngakho ikhophi enemaki ayikwazi ukubhalwa. Ukubala ngokwakho kulungile; thumela i-spreadsheet esikhundleni salokho.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkokuqala \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E ethebhu ilayisha umbhali we-PDF. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ikhona kuphela uma ibha ye-app ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kunama-PDF amaningi amakwe, i-Chrome ne-Edge zingabuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singavumela yini ukulanda amafayela amaningi. Khetha Vumela, noma uzothola ifayela lokuqala kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukho-okuthunyelwayo\"\u003EAkukho okuthunyelwayo?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E zidinga okungenani into eyodwa: &quot;Akukho okuthunyelwayo okwamanje: yenza into bese uyibala.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E idinga amaemaki kuPDF evuliwe: &quot;Akukho maemaki kuma-PDF avuliwe okwamanje.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-ukubala-futhi\"\u003ELondoloza ukubala futhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthumela kuyombiko. Ukuze uqhubeke nokusebenza ngokubala kamuva, khetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ukubala amanani\u003C/span\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ELondoloza nevule futhi ukubala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze wengeze izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo, intela nebhondi bese uthumela isiphakamiso, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003EIsifinyezo sethenda nesiphakamiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukuthumela kuyizinkomba zokulanda. Zenziwa ekhompyutheni yakho kusukela ekubaleni namaPDF avuliwe; akukho okuthunyelwa noma yikuphi. Isilinganiso njenge-spreadsheet (XLSX) Vula imenyu ethi Thumela ethuleni bese ukhetha XLSX. Isiphequluli sakho silanda (name).xlsx. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Kuthunyelwe (name).xlsx (isilinganiso nezifomula eziphilayo, ngeshidi, ngemaki, izikali).\" bese ingeza isexwayiso uma isilinganiso singaphelele. Vula kuhlelo lwakho lwe-spreadsheet. I-workbook inamashidi amane, namanye ama-report alandelayo uma ehambisana: Ishidi Okuqukethwe Estimate Umugqa ngento nangekhomponenti ngayinye: inani, udoti, inani nodoti, amarethi, impahla, umsebenzi, isamba, amanothi. Isamba sephrojekthi ngaphansi. By sheet Inani lento ngayinye kushidi ngalinye, nenani lemaki. Marks Imaki ngayinye: ishidi, into, uhlobo, inani, nemininingwane (ubude bezingxenye, izindawo ezigcwele nezikhishiwe, umjikelo). Scales Ishidi ngalinye elinesikali noma amaemaki: isikali salo, ukuthi sasethwa kanjani (ipreset, noma silinganiswe ngebanga elifakiwe), namafidi ngeyunithi ye-PDF. Takeoff summary Inani lento ngayinye, inombolo ye-CSI, amaemaki namashidi, ngaphandle kwamanani. Material list Yonke ingxenye yokuhlanganiswa ifakwe ndawonye ekubaleni (ingxenye efanayo esetshenziswa izinto eziningi ingumugqa owodwa), nodoti nezindleko zempahla, nezinto eziyisebenzisayo. Quote request Uhlu lwempahla lokuthumela kumnikezi: izinani nodoti, ikholomu yamarethi amayunithi engenalutho, nezengeziwe nesamba ezigcwalisa uma amanani efakwa. By division Impahla, umsebenzi nesamba ngesigaba se-CSI MasterFormat, uma izinto zinenombolo ye-Inombolo ye-CSI. Ngeisifinyezo sethenda, ishidi le-Estimate liphela nemarkup yalo (inzuzo yabasebenzi, intela yokuthengisa, izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo, ibhondi nethenda), njengezifomula eziphilayo. Ishidi le-Estimate ligcina izifomula eziphilayo: inani nodoti, izinani zempahla nomsebenzi ezizungeziwe, isamba sawo wonke umugqa nesamba sephrojekthi. Izinhlelo ze-spreadsheet ziyabala kabusha, ngakho ungashintsha irethi noma udoti kuspredishithi bese amasamba ayalandela. Izinombolo ezibalwe yi-TakeoffCraft nazo zigcinwe emaseli, futhi ziyafana kuze kube yisenti. Ikholomu yamanothi ibala ifomula yekhomponenti ngayinye, amaphutha ezifomula, amaemaki emashidini angenasikali, indawo yodonga nomjikelo. Uma kukhona okushiyiwe, umugqa wesamba sephrojekthi uthi \"Incomplete: see the notes above\". I-workbook ihlolwe ku-LibreOffice Calc, yabalwa kabusha yanikeza amasamba afanayo. Ayikavulwa ku-Excel. Imininingwane ngekholomu ngayinye itholakala ku-Amakholomu okuthumela. Isilinganiso njenge-CSV Vula imenyu ethi Thumela bese ukhetha CSV. Uthola (name).csv: imigqa namakholomu afanayo nalawo weshidi le-Estimate, njengamanani avamile (akukho zifomula), kanye nesamba sephrojekthi. Sebenzisa ukunamathisela kwenye inhlelo yezilinganiso noma yezezimali. I-CSV inesilinganiso kuphela; ngamanani ngeshidi nohlu lwemaki, sebenzisa i-XLSX. Uhlu lwezinto zokwakha kumenyu efanayo ilondoloza uhlu lwempahla lodwa njenge-CSV, lokuyala. Isilinganiso ku-Google Sheets Ngaphezulu kwethebhula lamanani, Kopisha ye-Google Sheets ufaka isilinganiso ekhliphodini njengombhalo ohlukaniswe ngamathebhu, ngemigqa efanayo ne-CSV. Ku-Google Sheet, chofoza iseli A1 bese unamathisela. I-TakeoffCraft ayingeni ngemvume ku-Google futhi ayithumeli lutho lapho. Amarethi angekho nokusayina Umugqa onamanani kodwa ongenarethi uthi No rate kumanothi wawo, futhi ukuthumela kuwabala ngaphansi kwamasamba. Uma isilinganiso sasayinwa, ukuthumela kukhomba ukuthi ubani asayina, nini nangani isamba. Bheka Amarethi angekho nokusayina isilinganiso. PDF emakwe Vula ama-PDF ofuna ukuwadweba amaemaki awo. Vula imenyu ethi Thumela bese ukhetha Marked PDF. Kuvela \"Ibhala i-PDF emakwe…\", bese isiphequluli sakho silanda ifayela elilodwa nge-PDF emakwe ngayinye, igama layo ngu (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf. Kwikhophi: imigqa idwetshwe njengemigqa ngombala wento yayo, izindawo zigcwaliswe kancane ngomugqa oqinile, nezikhishiwe zishiywe zivulekile, amanani ngamachashazi, ikhasi ngalinye elinemaki lithola ilejendi encane ekhoneni laso eliphansi kwesobunxele: umbala wento ngayinye, igama nenani kulelo khasi. Ama-PDF akho ayinhloko awashintshiwe. Amanothi: Kubhalwa ama-PDF avuliwe kuphela. Amaemaki kuma-PDF angavulekile ahlala emagameni ahlanganisiwe kodwa awadwetshwanga; vula lawo ama-PDF kuqala. Amagama asendabeni yelejendi asebenzisa ifonti evamile ye-PDF. Izinhlamvu ezingakwazi ukuboniswa ziphrintwa njenge-\"?\". I-PDF ebethelwe ingeke ikopishwe nemaki: \"Le PDF ivikelwe ngephasiwedi noma ifihliwe, ngakho ikhophi enemaki ayikwazi ukubhalwa. Ukubala ngokwakho kulungile; thumela i-spreadsheet esikhundleni salokho.\" Okokuqala Marked PDF ethebhu ilayisha umbhali we-PDF. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ikhona kuphela uma ibha ye-app ibonisa Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi; bheka Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Uma kunama-PDF amaningi amakwe, i-Chrome ne-Edge zingabuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singavumela yini ukulanda amafayela amaningi. Khetha Vumela, noma uzothola ifayela lokuqala kuphela. Akukho okuthunyelwayo? XLSX ne-CSV zidinga okungenani into eyodwa: \"Akukho okuthunyelwayo okwamanje: yenza into bese uyibala.\" Marked PDF idinga amaemaki kuPDF evuliwe: \"Akukho maemaki kuma-PDF avuliwe okwamanje.\" Londoloza ukubala futhi Ukuthumela kuyombiko. Ukuze uqhubeke nokusebenza ngokubala kamuva, khetha futhi Londoloza ukubala amanani: bheka Londoloza nevule futhi ukubala. Ukuze wengeze izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo, intela nebhondi bese uthumela isiphakamiso, bheka Isifinyezo sethenda nesiphakamiso.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"bid-summary","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Isifinyezo sethenda nesiphakamiso","summary":"Engeza umthwalo womsebenzi, intela yokuthengisa, izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo nebhondi ku-isilinganiso sezindleko, bhala okufakiwe nokungafakiwe, bese ulanda i-PDF yesiphakamiso ukuze uyithumele.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["ithenda","umthwalo womsebenzi","umthwalo","umholo","isiphakamiso","ikhowithi","izindleko zokuphatha","inzuzo","ukumaka","umbhalo","intela yokuthengisa","ibhondi","okufakiwe","okungafakiwe","imigomo","isignesha","ikliyenti","intengo"],"headings":[{"id":"ukumaka","text":"Ukumaka","level":2},{"id":"isiphakamiso","text":"Isiphakamiso","level":2},{"id":"ku-exports","text":"Ku-exports","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsilinganiso sezindleko silinganisa lokho okukalile. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsifinyezo sethenda\u003C/strong\u003E siyishintsha ibe yintengo: sengeza intela yokuthengisa, izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo nebhondi, futhi senza \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-PDF yesiphakamiso\u003C/strong\u003E nokufakiwe kwakho nokungafakiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid summary &amp; proposal…\u003C/span\u003E. Konke okukuso kugcinwa kanye nokubala, futhi ushintsho ngalunye lungahlehliswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukumaka\"\u003EUkumaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBhala iphesenti kunoma iyiphi kwezinhlanu (shiya ezinye ku-0). Ziqoqwa ngale ndlela, ngayinye phezu kwalokho okungaphezulu kwayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKubalwa njenge\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto, Umsebenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanani esilinganiso sezindleko (ithenda elisisekelo uma ukubala sekunokukhetha \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas#alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-hash=\"alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\"\u003Eokukhethwayo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmthwalo womsebenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% womthwalo × umsebenzi: intela yomholo, ukuvikelwa nezinzuzo ezinholweni zezisebenzi zakho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindleko\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto + umsebenzi + umthwalo womsebenzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntela yokuthengisa ezintweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% yentela × izinto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindleko zokuphatha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% wokuphatha × (izindleko + intela).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInzuzo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% wenzuzo × (izindleko + intela + izindleko zokuphatha).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhondi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E% webhondi × konke okungenhla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthenda\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsamba semigqa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ngamunye uzungezwa ukuya kusenti. Incwadi yokusebenza ikhombisa imigqa efanayo ngaphansi kwesamba sethebula le-Estimate, ngamafomula aphilayo. Isifinyezo siyavuselelwa njengoba uthayipha: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ithatha iphesenti. Ukukhetha ngakunye kukhonjiswa ngezinkulungwane ezifanayo ngezindleko zakho, ukuze umnikazi abone ukuthi ukususa kwakho kushintsha kanjani ngempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphakamiso\"\u003EIsiphakamiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGcwalisa okufanele isiphakamiso sikutshele:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E (igama lebalo uma lingenalutho), \u003Cstrong\u003EKu\u003C/strong\u003E (ikliyenti) no-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusuka\u003C/strong\u003E (inkampani yakho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkufakiwe\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkungafakiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: eyodwa ngomugqa; udashi noma ibhulethi ngaphambili kuyalungile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigomo\u003C/strong\u003E: umbhalo ongakhethiwe, njengo &quot;Kusebenza izinsuku ezingama-30.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDweba izinto nezinani\u003C/strong\u003E: umsebenzi, into ngayinye, namanani, kungekho mitengo. Susa ukuthikwa ukuze ube isiphakamiso sesamba esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProposal PDF\u003C/span\u003E. I-PDF (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;takeoff&gt; - proposal.pdf\u003C/code\u003E) inedethi, ibhlogo yentengo enakho konke ukumaka nethenda, okukhethwayo, umsebenzi, okufakiwe nokungafakiwe, imigomo, nemigqa yokusayina nedethi. Uma amanye amanani engakwazi ukulinganiswa (ishidi elingenasikali), lokho kubhalwa ngaphansi kwentengo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-exports\"\u003EKu-exports\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ukubala sekunesifinyezo sethenda, i-CSV iphela ngaso futhi incwadi yokusebenza ithola ishidi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EBid summary\u003C/strong\u003E, ngomugqa ngamunye, iphesenti lawo nesamba lawo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EThumela isilinganiso sezindleko\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isilinganiso sezindleko silinganisa lokho okukalile. Isifinyezo sethenda siyishintsha ibe yintengo: sengeza intela yokuthengisa, izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo nebhondi, futhi senza i-PDF yesiphakamiso nokufakiwe kwakho nokungafakiwe. Vula kusuka ku-Export › Bid summary & proposal…. Konke okukuso kugcinwa kanye nokubala, futhi ushintsho ngalunye lungahlehliswa. Ukumaka Bhala iphesenti kunoma iyiphi kwezinhlanu (shiya ezinye ku-0). Ziqoqwa ngale ndlela, ngayinye phezu kwalokho okungaphezulu kwayo: Umugqa Kubalwa njenge Izinto, Umsebenzi Amanani esilinganiso sezindleko (ithenda elisisekelo uma ukubala sekunokukhetha okukhethwayo). Umthwalo womsebenzi % womthwalo × umsebenzi: intela yomholo, ukuvikelwa nezinzuzo ezinholweni zezisebenzi zakho. Izindleko Izinto + umsebenzi + umthwalo womsebenzi. Intela yokuthengisa ezintweni % yentela × izinto. Izindleko zokuphatha % wokuphatha × (izindleko + intela). Inzuzo % wenzuzo × (izindleko + intela + izindleko zokuphatha). Ibhondi % webhondi × konke okungenhla. Ithenda Isamba semigqa. Umugqa ngamunye uzungezwa ukuya kusenti. Incwadi yokusebenza ikhombisa imigqa efanayo ngaphansi kwesamba sethebula le-Estimate, ngamafomula aphilayo. Isifinyezo siyavuselelwa njengoba uthayipha: Enter ithatha iphesenti. Ukukhetha ngakunye kukhonjiswa ngezinkulungwane ezifanayo ngezindleko zakho, ukuze umnikazi abone ukuthi ukususa kwakho kushintsha kanjani ngempela. Isiphakamiso Gcwalisa okufanele isiphakamiso sikutshele: Iphrojekthi (igama lebalo uma lingenalutho), Ku (ikliyenti) no-Ukusuka (inkampani yakho). Okufakiwe no-Okungafakiwe: eyodwa ngomugqa; udashi noma ibhulethi ngaphambili kuyalungile. Imigomo: umbhalo ongakhethiwe, njengo \"Kusebenza izinsuku ezingama-30.\" Dweba izinto nezinani: umsebenzi, into ngayinye, namanani, kungekho mitengo. Susa ukuthikwa ukuze ube isiphakamiso sesamba esisodwa. Khetha Proposal PDF. I-PDF (\u003Ctakeoff\u003E - proposal.pdf) inedethi, ibhlogo yentengo enakho konke ukumaka nethenda, okukhethwayo, umsebenzi, okufakiwe nokungafakiwe, imigomo, nemigqa yokusayina nedethi. Uma amanye amanani engakwazi ukulinganiswa (ishidi elingenasikali), lokho kubhalwa ngaphansi kwentengo. Ku-exports Uma ukubala sekunesifinyezo sethenda, i-CSV iphela ngaso futhi incwadi yokusebenza ithola ishidi le-Bid summary, ngomugqa ngamunye, iphesenti lawo nesamba lawo. Bona Thumela isilinganiso sezindleko.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"bid-leveling","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amaphakheji ethenda nokulinganisa amathenda","summary":"Hlukanisa isilinganiso sezindleko sibe amaphakheji ngomsebenzi, uthumele umsebenzi wephakheji ngalinye kubakhandisi bezingxenye, uqhathanise amathenda abuya kumsebenzi ofanayo, bese usebenzisa ithenda elikhethiwe njengentengo yephakheji.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["ukulinganisa amathenda","ukulinganisa","iphakheji lethenda","umkhandisi wengxenye","ithenda lengxenye","ithenda elincane","isifaki","umsebenzi","isigaba se-csi","qhathanisa amathenda","ithebhu lamathenda","umbhidi","ukugunyaza","ithenda elikhethiwe","sebenzisa ithenda","intengo yengxenye"],"headings":[{"id":"amaphakheji","text":"Amaphakheji","level":2},{"id":"faka-amathenda","text":"Faka amathenda","level":2},{"id":"ukulinganisa-kwamathenda","text":"Ukulinganisa kwamathenda","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-ithenda-njengentengo-yephakheji","text":"Sebenzisa ithenda njengentengo yephakheji","level":2},{"id":"amathenda-abuya-nge-imeyili","text":"Amathenda abuya nge-imeyili","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUmkhandisi omkhulu uthumela umsebenzi wale trade kubakhandisi bezingxenye aqhathanise lokho okubuyayo. I-TakeoffCraft yenza kokubili kusukela ekubalweni: vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphakheji\"\u003EAmaphakheji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKukhona iphakheji eyodwa ngesigaba se-CSI ngasinye osisebenzisayo ezintweni zakho (amadijithi amabili okuqala e-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E yento, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EDala izinto zokubala\u003C/a\u003E). Izinto ezingenanombolo zenza iphakheji zodwa. Iphakheji ngayinye ibonisa izinto zayo, amashidi amamaka ayo akuwo, nezindleko zethu zawo (izinto nomsebenzi ngaphambi kwezengeziwe, kusukela ethendeni elisisekelo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E ukulanda okuzothunyelwa kumkhandisi wengxenye: yonke into nenombolo yayo ye-CSI, inani, iyunithi namashidi ayo. Alinawo amanani. Kubahlinzeki bezinto, isicelo sekhothishini ku-incwadi yokusebenza sinohlu lwezingxenye (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EThumela isilinganiso sezindleko\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-amathenda\"\u003EFaka amathenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsigcawini esingenalutho ngaphansi kwephakheji, thayipha igama lombhidi nesamba sethenda, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the bid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ithenda lishiya ingxenye yomsebenzi ngaphandle, vula uhlu lwayo lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E bese uthike lezo zinto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulungisa igama noma isamba, bhala phezu kwalo etafuleni; inkinobho ye-× isusa ithenda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUshintsho ngalunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa esihlehlisa ngaso \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, namathenda agcinwa kanye nokubala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulinganisa-kwamathenda\"\u003EUkulinganisa kwamathenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathenda akavamisile ukumboza umsebenzi ofanayo. Ukulinganisa kufaka \u003Cstrong\u003Eisifaki\u003C/strong\u003E kuyo yonke into eshiywe ngezindleko zethu, ukuze ithenda ngalinye liqhathaniswe kuwo wonke iphakheji:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkulinganisiwe = ithenda + izifaki\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthenda elincane elilinganisiwe liphawulwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ELow\u003C/strong\u003E; uma kulingana, elifakwe kuqala. \u003Cstrong\u003ENgokumelene nezindleko zethu\u003C/strong\u003E kuyilokho okulinganisiwe ukususa izindleko zethu zephakheji: okungalungile kusho ngaphansi kwazo. Ithenda elibonakala lincane lingalahleka uma umsebenzi walo okhishiwe ubalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIncwadi yokusebenza inesheethi \u003Cstrong\u003EUkulinganisa kwamathenda\u003C/strong\u003E enayo yonke iphakheji enamathenda: isilinganiso sezindleko zethu, ithenda ngalinye, izifaki zalo, isamba salo esilinganisiwe nomehluko, nokuthi ithenda ngalinye lishiye ini, njengamafomula aphilayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-ithenda-njengentengo-yephakheji\"\u003ESebenzisa ithenda njengentengo yephakheji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse\u003C/span\u003E kuthenda bese lingena entengweni yephakheji lonke esilinganisweni sezindleko zakho: ukuprayisa kwephakheji ngokwalo (izinto, izimo zazo zesibili kanye nezingxenye zenhlanganisela) kuyakhishwa esamba somsebenzi, izinto zihlala njengezinani nezinga lakho lezindleko ukuze zibhekiswe kuzo, kanti umugqa owodwa, \u003Cstrong\u003EChosen bid\u003C/strong\u003E, uphethe inani lethenda. Izinto ethendeni elizishiyile zihlala ngezindleko zakho, okuyilokho ukulinganisa okwakubalwe njengesifaki. Khetha elinye ithenda, noma khetha lelo elifanayo ukuze ulibuyisele; ngalunye kuyisinyathelo esihlehlisa ngaso \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsifinyezweni sethenda, amathenda aphansi aba umugqa owodwa ngaphakathi kwezindleko: izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo nebhondi zengezwa phezulu kwawo njengazo zonke ezinye izindleko; intela yokuthengisa (ezintweni kuphela) nezindleko zomsebenzi (emsebenzini) akuzona. Ishidi le-Estimate ku-incwadi yokusebenza linesikhundla sethenda elikhethiwe njengomugqa walo, futhi ibhlogo yokumaka iyangeza, ngamafomula aphilayo. Uhlu lwezinto lushiya impahla yephakheji elinikeziwe, ngoba umkhandisi wengxenye uyiyinikezayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphakheji eliphakathi kwendawo yezindleko yokukhetha alilinganiswa kabusha: okukhethwayo nezingqikithi zendawo yezindleko zisasebenzisa izindleko zakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathenda-abuya-nge-imeyili\"\u003EAmathenda abuya nge-imeyili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwudingi ukuthayipha amathenda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend for bids…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwephakheji ithumela umkhandisi ngamunye ixhumanisi ekhasini lapho athayipha khona inani ngomugqa ngamunye; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGet prices\u003C/span\u003E idonsa lokho akuthumele kule tafula. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\"\u003EThumela iphakheji ngamathenda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthayipha ithenda ngesandla kusasebenza, futhi ithenda elithayiphwe ngesandla nelivela ewebhusayithini ziphakathi kwazo. Amathenda avela ewebhusayithini ahlonywa ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb, late\u003C/strong\u003E uma efike ngemva kwesikhathi sokuphela); inani lawo liyashintsha kuphela uma umbhidi ethumela inguqulo entsha, ngakho okuhlelwe nguwe kuhlala kuze kube yilapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Umkhandisi omkhulu uthumela umsebenzi wale trade kubakhandisi bezingxenye aqhathanise lokho okubuyayo. I-TakeoffCraft yenza kokubili kusukela ekubalweni: vula Export › Bid packages and leveling…. Amaphakheji Kukhona iphakheji eyodwa ngesigaba se-CSI ngasinye osisebenzisayo ezintweni zakho (amadijithi amabili okuqala e-CSI number yento, bona Dala izinto zokubala). Izinto ezingenanombolo zenza iphakheji zodwa. Iphakheji ngayinye ibonisa izinto zayo, amashidi amamaka ayo akuwo, nezindleko zethu zawo (izinto nomsebenzi ngaphambi kwezengeziwe, kusukela ethendeni elisisekelo). Khetha Scope CSV ukulanda okuzothunyelwa kumkhandisi wengxenye: yonke into nenombolo yayo ye-CSI, inani, iyunithi namashidi ayo. Alinawo amanani. Kubahlinzeki bezinto, isicelo sekhothishini ku-incwadi yokusebenza sinohlu lwezingxenye (bona Thumela isilinganiso sezindleko). Faka amathenda Esigcawini esingenalutho ngaphansi kwephakheji, thayipha igama lombhidi nesamba sethenda, bese ukhetha Add the bid. Uma ithenda lishiya ingxenye yomsebenzi ngaphandle, vula uhlu lwayo lwe-Left out bese uthike lezo zinto. Ukulungisa igama noma isamba, bhala phezu kwalo etafuleni; inkinobho ye-× isusa ithenda. Ushintsho ngalunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa esihlehlisa ngaso Ctrl+Z, namathenda agcinwa kanye nokubala. Ukulinganisa kwamathenda Amathenda akavamisile ukumboza umsebenzi ofanayo. Ukulinganisa kufaka isifaki kuyo yonke into eshiywe ngezindleko zethu, ukuze ithenda ngalinye liqhathaniswe kuwo wonke iphakheji: Okulinganisiwe = ithenda + izifaki Ithenda elincane elilinganisiwe liphawulwa ku-Low; uma kulingana, elifakwe kuqala. Ngokumelene nezindleko zethu kuyilokho okulinganisiwe ukususa izindleko zethu zephakheji: okungalungile kusho ngaphansi kwazo. Ithenda elibonakala lincane lingalahleka uma umsebenzi walo okhishiwe ubalwa. Incwadi yokusebenza inesheethi Ukulinganisa kwamathenda enayo yonke iphakheji enamathenda: isilinganiso sezindleko zethu, ithenda ngalinye, izifaki zalo, isamba salo esilinganisiwe nomehluko, nokuthi ithenda ngalinye lishiye ini, njengamafomula aphilayo. Sebenzisa ithenda njengentengo yephakheji Khetha Use kuthenda bese lingena entengweni yephakheji lonke esilinganisweni sezindleko zakho: ukuprayisa kwephakheji ngokwalo (izinto, izimo zazo zesibili kanye nezingxenye zenhlanganisela) kuyakhishwa esamba somsebenzi, izinto zihlala njengezinani nezinga lakho lezindleko ukuze zibhekiswe kuzo, kanti umugqa owodwa, Chosen bid, uphethe inani lethenda. Izinto ethendeni elizishiyile zihlala ngezindleko zakho, okuyilokho ukulinganisa okwakubalwe njengesifaki. Khetha elinye ithenda, noma khetha lelo elifanayo ukuze ulibuyisele; ngalunye kuyisinyathelo esihlehlisa ngaso Ctrl+Z. Esifinyezweni sethenda, amathenda aphansi aba umugqa owodwa ngaphakathi kwezindleko: izindleko zokuphatha, inzuzo nebhondi zengezwa phezulu kwawo njengazo zonke ezinye izindleko; intela yokuthengisa (ezintweni kuphela) nezindleko zomsebenzi (emsebenzini) akuzona. Ishidi le-Estimate ku-incwadi yokusebenza linesikhundla sethenda elikhethiwe njengomugqa walo, futhi ibhlogo yokumaka iyangeza, ngamafomula aphilayo. Uhlu lwezinto lushiya impahla yephakheji elinikeziwe, ngoba umkhandisi wengxenye uyiyinikezayo. Iphakheji eliphakathi kwendawo yezindleko yokukhetha alilinganiswa kabusha: okukhethwayo nezingqikithi zendawo yezindleko zisasebenzisa izindleko zakho. Amathenda abuya nge-imeyili Awudingi ukuthayipha amathenda. Send for bids… ngaphansi kwephakheji ithumela umkhandisi ngamunye ixhumanisi ekhasini lapho athayipha khona inani ngomugqa ngamunye; Get prices idonsa lokho akuthumele kule tafula. Bona Thumela iphakheji ngamathenda. Ukuthayipha ithenda ngesandla kusasebenza, futhi ithenda elithayiphwe ngesandla nelivela ewebhusayithini ziphakathi kwazo. Amathenda avela ewebhusayithini ahlonywa ngokuthi web (noma web, late uma efike ngemva kwesikhathi sokuphela); inani lawo liyashintsha kuphela uma umbhidi ethumela inguqulo entsha, ngakho okuhlelwe nguwe kuhlala kuze kube yilapho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"bid-invitations","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Thumela iphakheji ngamathenda","summary":"Thumela iphakheji lethenda kubakhandisi bezingxenye ngemeyili, uvumele bathayipha amanani ekhasini elingadingi i-akhawunti, ugcine amanani evaliwe kuze kufike isikhathi sokuvulwa, bese uwahlanganisa esheethini lokulinganisa.","section":"tasks","order":103,"keywords":["thumela ngamathenda","isimemo","isimemo sethenda","umbhidi","umkhandisi wengxenye","mema","imeyili","isicelo samanani","amathenda avaliwe","ukuvulwa kwethenda","usuku lethenda","ithenda elisemuva","usuku lokuphela","isikhumbuzo","amarekhodi abakhandisi","inshulansi","ukugunyazwa","csv","xhuma","amashidi pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"ngaphambi-kokuthumela","text":"Ngaphambi kokuthumela","level":2},{"id":"thumela-iphakheji","text":"Thumela iphakheji","level":2},{"id":"okubonwa-ngumbhidi","text":"Okubonwa ngumbhidi","level":2},{"id":"amathenda-avaliwe-nokuvulwa","text":"Amathenda avaliwe nokuvulwa","level":2},{"id":"thola-amanani","text":"Thola amanani","level":2},{"id":"ewebhusayithini","text":"Ewebhusayithini","level":2},{"id":"ubani-obona-ini-nokuthi-isikhathi-esingakanani","text":"Ubani obona ini, nokuthi isikhathi esingakanani","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend for bids…\u003C/span\u003E ithumela iphakheji elilodwa kubantu obakhethile. Iwebhusayithi imemela ngayinye ngemeyili ngexhumanisi; bavula ikhasi, babone umsebenzi bese bathayipha inani lomugqa ngamunye. Ubona amanani esheethini lokulinganisa, ilungele ukuqhathaniswa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-leveling\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-leveling\"\u003EAmaphakheji wethenda nokulinganisa kwethenda\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthumela \u003Cstrong\u003Eakuvulekele wonke umuntu okwamanje.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngesikhathi isici sisahlolwa, sisebenza kumaakhawunti avunyelwe yithimba le-CadCraft; uma eyakho engenjalo, ingxoxo iyakutshela. Ikhasi lombhidi lisebenza kuyo yonke imemo esiyithumele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphambi-kokuthumela\"\u003ENgaphambi kokuthumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUdinga i-akhawunti ye-CadCraft enekheli eliqinisekisiwe. I-TakeoffCraft esiphequluleni icela ukuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma\u003C/strong\u003E: ithebhu ivuleka ku-getcadcraft.com, ucindezela Xhuma, bese leyo thebhu ithola ukungena okusebenza izinsuku ezingama-30, kuphela kumaphakheji wethenda, kuze uvale ithebhu ye-TakeoffCraft. Ungayisusa noma nini ekhasini lakho lokuphepha. Iwindi le-Studio alikwazi ukuthumela okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENika into ngayinye inombolo ye-CSI: iphakheji ingumsebenzi wezinto zesigaba esisodwa se-CSI (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EDala izinto zokubala\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinganisa amashidi aphethe amamaka ephakheji, ukuze amanani ababhidi babona abalinganiswe ngokukala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-iphakheji\"\u003EThumela iphakheji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend for bids…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwephakheji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGcwalisa isihloko, iphrojekthi nomlayezo ongakhethwa, nesikhathi \u003Cstrong\u003Esokuphela\u003C/strong\u003E ngesikhathi sendawo yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShiya \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep prices sealed\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe ukuze ufihle wonke amanani kuze kufike \u003Cstrong\u003Eisikhathi sokuvula\u003C/strong\u003E (hhayi ngaphambi kwesikhathi sokuphela), noma ususe ukuthikwa ukuze ubone amanani njengoba efika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShiya ibhokisi lamashidi lithikiwe ukuze uthumele i-PDF yamashidi aphethe amamaka ephakheji, nemaka adwetshwe kuwo. Amanani akho awasoze afakwe kulokho okuthunyelwayo: amagama ezinto, izinombolo ze-CSI, izinani, iziyunithi namagama amashidi kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha abantu obamemayo, ngabanye ngomugqa, njenge \u003Ccode\u003EIgama &lt;name@company.com&gt;\u003C/code\u003E noma ikheli kuphela, noma uthike abantu ezincwadini zakho zabakhandisi. Kuya kwabangu-60 ngesikhathi, kuya kwangu-100 ngephakheji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend invitations\u003C/span\u003E. Ngamunye uthola imeyili eyodwa esobala enegama lakho nekheli leimeyili yakho, isikhathi sokuphela nexhumanisi; izimpendulo ziya kuwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxoxo itshela ukuthi bangaki abathunyelwe, futhi iqamba noma yimuphi owenqatshiwe: ababemenyiwe kuleli phakheji, abacelile ukungathunyelwa imemo yethenda, ikheli elingelona elisemthethweni, noma kudlule umkhawulo wokuthumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonwa-ngumbhidi\"\u003EOkubonwa ngumbhidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi ngexhumanisi elide eliyimfihlo, ngaphandle kokungena. Likhombisa ukuthi ubamemile ngubani, isikhathi sokuphela, uma amanani evaliwe, umlayezo wakho, ne-PDF yamashidi, bese kuba yonke imugqa nenani layo. Ngomugqa ngamunye uthayipha inani noma athike \u003Cstrong\u003ENot included\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi angeza inothi; bangeza amanothi ephakheji lonke nemifayela engu-3 (isiphakamiso, incwadi yomsebenzi, isitifiketi). Bangalondoloza futhi bashintshe amanani kuze kufike isikhathi sokuvula, noma \u003Cstrong\u003Ebayenqabe\u003C/strong\u003E, kukhona ibhokisi lokucela ukuthi i-CadCraft ingabathumeli futhi imemo yethenda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathenda-avaliwe-nokuvulwa\"\u003EAmathenda avaliwe nokuvulwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphambi kwesikhathi sokuvula \u003Cstrong\u003Eakekho\u003C/strong\u003E obona inani, inothi noma ifayela: wena awukwazi, akukho ku-TakeoffCraft, akukho ekhasini lakho lamaphakheji wethenda. Ubona ukuthi ubamemile yini nokuthi baphendule yini. Ngesikhathi sokuvula zonke izinhlanganiso zivela ngesikhathi esisodwa. Ithenda elilondolozwe ngemva kwesikhathi sokuphela liyamukelwa lichazwe njenge \u003Cstrong\u003Engemva kwesikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E; uhlu lokulinganisa lusalibala, nokufika kwalo ngemva kwesikhathi kuyisimaka, hhayi isinqumo. Ngemva kokuvula umbhidi akakwazi ukushintsha inani. Ngaphandle kokuvala, ithenda liyaqedeka lapho lifika isikhathi sokuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-amanani\"\u003EThola amanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGet prices\u003C/span\u003E icela iwebhusayithi bese yengeza impendulo ngayinye ephakheji njengethenda, limakwe ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb\u003C/strong\u003E. I-TakeoffCraft nayo icela ngokuthula njalo lapho uvula ingxoxo uma ixhunyiwe. Ithenda umbhidi aliguqule ngalilondolozile lisethwa kabusha endaweni yalo; ithenda olihlelile wena lihlala njengoba wawushiya kuze kuthumele ngubani inguqulo entsha. Ukudonsa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa esihlehlisa ngaso \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Imigqa eshiywe iza njengomsebenzi ithenda elishiya ngaphandle, ngakho ukulinganisa kuyigcwalisa ngezindleko zakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ewebhusayithini\"\u003EEwebhusayithini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokuthi usuvumelekile ukuthumela, i-akhawunti yakho inamakhasi amabili engeziwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphakheji wethenda\u003C/strong\u003E ludweba okuthunyelwe kwakho, abaphendulile, amathenda emuva kwesikhathi nemifayela, futhi buvumela ukuthumela isikhumbuzo (ixhumanisi elisha; elidala liyeka ukusebenza), ukuvala, ukuvula kabusha noma ukukhansela iphakheji. \u003Cstrong\u003EAbakhandisi\u003C/strong\u003E bagcina irekhodi lenkampani ngayinye: oxhumana nabo, ukuhweba, izimpendulo zokufaneleka (iminyaka ebhizinisini, amandla okubopha, i-EMR, irekhodi lokuphepha, i-union noma i-open shop, izinkomba), usuku lokuphela kwelayisense nenshulansi, okumakwa uma sekudlule noma kusele izinsuku ezingama-30, kanye namathenda akhe adlule. Ngenisa nokuthumela amarekhodi njenge-CSV: umugqa owodwa ngoxhumana naye ngamunye, namakholomu ekhombisa ukuthumela; inkampani osuyinayo iyabuyekezwa, ayisoze iphindwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubani-obona-ini-nokuthi-isikhathi-esingakanani\"\u003EUbani obona ini, nokuthi isikhathi esingakanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanani, amanothi nemifayela yombhidi ayaya kuwe nakwiqembu le-CadCraft elisebenzisa ikhasi. Zigcinwa izinyanga ezingama-24 kusukela osukwini lokuphela, imifayela izinsuku ezingama-180; bese ziyasuswa. Ikheli lemeyili lombhidi ngelowo ofake wena; lisetshenziselwa kuphela ukuthumela imemo nesikhumbuzo sayo. Ikheli elilodwa lithola imemo engaba ngu-3 ngosuku kusukela kubo bonke ndawonye, futhi ungathumela kuze kufike kwangu-200 ngosuku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzengezo, izincwadi zokunikezwa, ishidi lomsebenzi elisayinwe ngombhidi ngamunye, nezikhumbuzo ezizenzakalelayo ngaphambi kokuphela kwenshulansi azikakwakhiwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Export › Bid packages and leveling… › Send for bids… ithumela iphakheji elilodwa kubantu obakhethile. Iwebhusayithi imemela ngayinye ngemeyili ngexhumanisi; bavula ikhasi, babone umsebenzi bese bathayipha inani lomugqa ngamunye. Ubona amanani esheethini lokulinganisa, ilungele ukuqhathaniswa (Amaphakheji wethenda nokulinganisa kwethenda). Ukuthumela akuvulekele wonke umuntu okwamanje. Ngesikhathi isici sisahlolwa, sisebenza kumaakhawunti avunyelwe yithimba le-CadCraft; uma eyakho engenjalo, ingxoxo iyakutshela. Ikhasi lombhidi lisebenza kuyo yonke imemo esiyithumele. Ngaphambi kokuthumela Udinga i-akhawunti ye-CadCraft enekheli eliqinisekisiwe. I-TakeoffCraft esiphequluleni icela ukuthi Xhuma: ithebhu ivuleka ku-getcadcraft.com, ucindezela Xhuma, bese leyo thebhu ithola ukungena okusebenza izinsuku ezingama-30, kuphela kumaphakheji wethenda, kuze uvale ithebhu ye-TakeoffCraft. Ungayisusa noma nini ekhasini lakho lokuphepha. Iwindi le-Studio alikwazi ukuthumela okwamanje. Nika into ngayinye inombolo ye-CSI: iphakheji ingumsebenzi wezinto zesigaba esisodwa se-CSI (Dala izinto zokubala). Linganisa amashidi aphethe amamaka ephakheji, ukuze amanani ababhidi babona abalinganiswe ngokukala. Thumela iphakheji Khetha Send for bids… ngaphansi kwephakheji. Gcwalisa isihloko, iphrojekthi nomlayezo ongakhethwa, nesikhathi sokuphela ngesikhathi sendawo yakho. Shiya Keep prices sealed ithikiwe ukuze ufihle wonke amanani kuze kufike isikhathi sokuvula (hhayi ngaphambi kwesikhathi sokuphela), noma ususe ukuthikwa ukuze ubone amanani njengoba efika. Shiya ibhokisi lamashidi lithikiwe ukuze uthumele i-PDF yamashidi aphethe amamaka ephakheji, nemaka adwetshwe kuwo. Amanani akho awasoze afakwe kulokho okuthunyelwayo: amagama ezinto, izinombolo ze-CSI, izinani, iziyunithi namagama amashidi kuphela. Thayipha abantu obamemayo, ngabanye ngomugqa, njenge Igama \u003Cname@company.com\u003E noma ikheli kuphela, noma uthike abantu ezincwadini zakho zabakhandisi. Kuya kwabangu-60 ngesikhathi, kuya kwangu-100 ngephakheji. Khetha Send invitations. Ngamunye uthola imeyili eyodwa esobala enegama lakho nekheli leimeyili yakho, isikhathi sokuphela nexhumanisi; izimpendulo ziya kuwe. Ingxoxo itshela ukuthi bangaki abathunyelwe, futhi iqamba noma yimuphi owenqatshiwe: ababemenyiwe kuleli phakheji, abacelile ukungathunyelwa imemo yethenda, ikheli elingelona elisemthethweni, noma kudlule umkhawulo wokuthumela. Okubonwa ngumbhidi Ikhasi ngexhumanisi elide eliyimfihlo, ngaphandle kokungena. Likhombisa ukuthi ubamemile ngubani, isikhathi sokuphela, uma amanani evaliwe, umlayezo wakho, ne-PDF yamashidi, bese kuba yonke imugqa nenani layo. Ngomugqa ngamunye uthayipha inani noma athike Not included, futhi angeza inothi; bangeza amanothi ephakheji lonke nemifayela engu-3 (isiphakamiso, incwadi yomsebenzi, isitifiketi). Bangalondoloza futhi bashintshe amanani kuze kufike isikhathi sokuvula, noma bayenqabe, kukhona ibhokisi lokucela ukuthi i-CadCraft ingabathumeli futhi imemo yethenda. Amathenda avaliwe nokuvulwa Ngaphambi kwesikhathi sokuvula akekho obona inani, inothi noma ifayela: wena awukwazi, akukho ku-TakeoffCraft, akukho ekhasini lakho lamaphakheji wethenda. Ubona ukuthi ubamemile yini nokuthi baphendule yini. Ngesikhathi sokuvula zonke izinhlanganiso zivela ngesikhathi esisodwa. Ithenda elilondolozwe ngemva kwesikhathi sokuphela liyamukelwa lichazwe njenge ngemva kwesikhathi; uhlu lokulinganisa lusalibala, nokufika kwalo ngemva kwesikhathi kuyisimaka, hhayi isinqumo. Ngemva kokuvula umbhidi akakwazi ukushintsha inani. Ngaphandle kokuvala, ithenda liyaqedeka lapho lifika isikhathi sokuphela. Thola amanani Get prices icela iwebhusayithi bese yengeza impendulo ngayinye ephakheji njengethenda, limakwe ngokuthi web. I-TakeoffCraft nayo icela ngokuthula njalo lapho uvula ingxoxo uma ixhunyiwe. Ithenda umbhidi aliguqule ngalilondolozile lisethwa kabusha endaweni yalo; ithenda olihlelile wena lihlala njengoba wawushiya kuze kuthumele ngubani inguqulo entsha. Ukudonsa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa esihlehlisa ngaso Ctrl+Z. Imigqa eshiywe iza njengomsebenzi ithenda elishiya ngaphandle, ngakho ukulinganisa kuyigcwalisa ngezindleko zakho. Ewebhusayithini Ngemva kokuthi usuvumelekile ukuthumela, i-akhawunti yakho inamakhasi amabili engeziwe. Amaphakheji wethenda ludweba okuthunyelwe kwakho, abaphendulile, amathenda emuva kwesikhathi nemifayela, futhi buvumela ukuthumela isikhumbuzo (ixhumanisi elisha; elidala liyeka ukusebenza), ukuvala, ukuvula kabusha noma ukukhansela iphakheji. Abakhandisi bagcina irekhodi lenkampani ngayinye: oxhumana nabo, ukuhweba, izimpendulo zokufaneleka (iminyaka ebhizinisini, amandla okubopha, i-EMR, irekhodi lokuphepha, i-union noma i-open shop, izinkomba), usuku lokuphela kwelayisense nenshulansi, okumakwa uma sekudlule noma kusele izinsuku ezingama-30, kanye namathenda akhe adlule. Ngenisa nokuthumela amarekhodi njenge-CSV: umugqa owodwa ngoxhumana naye ngamunye, namakholomu ekhombisa ukuthumela; inkampani osuyinayo iyabuyekezwa, ayisoze iphindwe. Ubani obona ini, nokuthi isikhathi esingakanani Amanani, amanothi nemifayela yombhidi ayaya kuwe nakwiqembu le-CadCraft elisebenzisa ikhasi. Zigcinwa izinyanga ezingama-24 kusukela osukwini lokuphela, imifayela izinsuku ezingama-180; bese ziyasuswa. Ikheli lemeyili lombhidi ngelowo ofake wena; lisetshenziselwa kuphela ukuthumela imemo nesikhumbuzo sayo. Ikheli elilodwa lithola imemo engaba ngu-3 ngosuku kusukela kubo bonke ndawonye, futhi ungathumela kuze kufike kwangu-200 ngosuku. Akukakwakhiwa Izengezo, izincwadi zokunikezwa, ishidi lomsebenzi elisayinwe ngombhidi ngamunye, nezikhumbuzo ezizenzakalelayo ngaphambi kokuphela kwenshulansi azikakwakhiwa. Bona Akukakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"save-and-reopen","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Londoloza futhi uvule kabusha ukubala amanani","summary":"Londoloza ukubala amanani njengefayela leprojekthi le-.takeoff.json, uyivule kabusha ngama-PDF afanayo, nokwenzakala uma i-PDF ingekho noma ishintshiwe.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwe-pdf","faka","isifakelo","londoloza","vula","vula kabusha","iprojekthi","takeoff.json","qhubeka","uhlaka olusha","i-pdf eshintshiwe","i-pdf engekho","ikopi yokugcina","ukulondoloza ngokuzenzakalelayo","buyisela","ukuwa"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza","text":"Londoloza","level":2},{"id":"gcina-ukubala-amanani-ngaphakathi-kwe-pdf","text":"Gcina ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwe-PDF","level":2},{"id":"uma-ithebhu-noma-isiphequluli-simi","text":"Uma ithebhu noma isiphequluli simi","level":2},{"id":"vula-kabusha","text":"Vula kabusha","level":2},{"id":"uma-i-pdf-ingekho","text":"Uma i-PDF ingekho","level":2},{"id":"uma-i-pdf-ishintshiwe","text":"Uma i-PDF ishintshiwe","level":2},{"id":"ifayela-elonakele-noma-elingelona-elakho","text":"Ifayela elonakele noma elingelona elakho","level":2},{"id":"umlando-wokuhlehlisa","text":"Umlando wokuhlehlisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkubala amanani kulondolozwa njengefayela elincane leprojekthi, \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Lubamba izinto zakho, izinhlanganisela, amarethi, isikali sawo wonke amashidi nazo zonke izimaki. \u003Cstrong\u003EAyibambi\u003C/strong\u003E ama-PDF; iwathola futhi ngokuqukethwe kwawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Isiphequluli sakho silanda \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Kulondolozwe (name).takeoff.json. Ivuleka phezu kwama-PDF afanayo (afanisa ngokuqukethwe kwawo).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa lelo fayela eduze kwama-PDF omsebenzi, ukuze kuhlale kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngakunye kulanda ifayela elisha. Isiphequluli sakho singalitshela ngokuthi \u003Ccode\u003E(name) (1).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E; gcina elisha kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgama livela kwi-PDF yokuqala oyivule kulokhu kubala amanani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E iyona ndlela kuphela yokugcina ukubala amanani njengefayela. Ngenkathi usebenza, i-TakeoffCraft igcina futhi ikopi yokubuyisela kulesi siphequluli (bona ngezansi), futhi ukulondoloza kwigu aikatholakali. Uma uzama ukuvala ithebhu nezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, isiphequluli siyakubuza ukuthi uyafuna yini ukushiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-ukubala-amanani-ngaphakathi-kwe-pdf\"\u003EGcina ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwe-PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E ilanda ikopi ye-PDF ngayinye evulekile, egcina igama elifana no \u003Ccode\u003EPlans (with takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E, futhi ithwele ukubala amanani konke njengesifakelo: izinto, izimaki, izikali, izindawo zokunikezela, konke okugcinwa yi-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Amakhasi awo awaguquki, ngakho abukeka futhi aphrintwe njengokuqala, futhi abafundi be-PDF abanye bababalela ukubala amanani phakathi kwezifakelo zabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula leyo PDF ku-TakeoffCraft (noma iyiphi indlela yokuvula ama-PDF) futhi izobuza \u003Cstrong\u003ELe PDF inokubala amanani ngaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the takeoff\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyithole, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJust the PDF\u003C/span\u003E ukuvula idrowing kuphela. Ikopi imele i-PDF eyenziwe kuyo, ngakho i-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E elondolozwe kwenye yazo ivula kwazo zombili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgama-PDF amaningi, ikopi ngayinye ithwele ukubala amanani konke; vula zonke ndawonye. Ukulondoloza futhi kusuka kwikopi kushintsha ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwayo, akweqi kwesibili. I-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E isasele elokugcina: iyincane, futhi yiyo eloga ukulondolozwa ngokuzenzakalelayo nohlelo lwedeskithophu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-ithebhu-noma-isiphequluli-simi\"\u003EUma ithebhu noma isiphequluli simi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImizuzwana embalwa ngemva kwenguquko ngayinye, i-TakeoffCraft igcina ikopi yokubala amanani kusitoreji salesi siphequluli, kanye nama-PDF awo uma ayi-64 MB noma ngaphansi. Akukho okulayishwa. Uma ulondoloza ukubala amanani, uqale elisha noma uvule enye iprojekthi, ikopi iyanyamalala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ithebhu iwa, isiphequluli noma likhompyutha limi, noma uphuma nezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, ngokuvula kwakho i-TakeoffCraft okulandelayo izobuza \u003Cstrong\u003EBuyisa umsebenzi wakho?\u003C/strong\u003E bese ikhombisa ukubala amanani ngegama lawo. Chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EBuyisa\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uwuthole: izinto, izimaki nezikali ziyabuya, nama-PDF avuleka futhi uma agcinwe. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Kubuyiswe (name). Akulondolozwanga efayelini okwamanje: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E iyakugcina.&quot; Uma ama-PDF ebemakhulu kakhulu ukuba agcinwe, wavule futhi; izimaki zivela emakhasini awo. Okwengeziwe: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003EBuyisa umsebenzi wakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-kabusha\"\u003EVula kabusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-TakeoffCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYehlisa ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E kanye nama-PDF awo ndawonye ekhasini. Noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E wama-PDF no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E weprojekthi, noma kusiphi isiqalo. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Kuvuliwe (name): izinto ezingu-12, izimaki ezingu-340.&quot; Ishidi ngalinye lithola isikali salo, nezimaki zivela emashidini azo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo lwama-PDF alubalulekile, futhi namagama awo amafayela noma amafolda awo akubalulekile. I-TakeoffCraft ibona ngayinye i-PDF ngesigxivizo sokuqukethwe kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula iprojekthi ngenkathi ukubala amanani okwamanje kunezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, i-TakeoffCraft iqala ibuze: \u003Cstrong\u003EKhansela\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ELahla izinguquko\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza ukubala amanani kuqala\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuvula iprojekthi kuyashintsha izinto nezimaki zamanje; ama-PDF asevulekile ayahlala evulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-i-pdf-ingekho\"\u003EUma i-PDF ingekho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula iprojekthi ngaphandle kwama-PDF ayo wonke, ibha yesimo yengeza &quot;Vula ama-PDF ayo ukuze ubone izimaki (zibhalwe ngaphansi kwamashidi).&quot; Ngaphansi kohlu lwamashidi, inothi lithi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Lokhu kubala amanani kuphinde kumboze ama-PDF angavulekile. Amanani awo ayabalwa; wavule ukuze ubone futhi uhlele izimaki zawo:&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003Ekulandelwe ngamagama amafayela nosayizi. Izimaki zawo sezisabalwa kuwo wonke amasamanisa nokuthunyelwa, ngezikali abalelwa ngazo. Vula lawo ma-PDF ukuze ubone futhi uhlele izimaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-i-pdf-ishintshiwe\"\u003EUma i-PDF ishintshiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PDF eguqulwe, noma eshintshwe nje ngohlelo lwenye, inokuqukethwe okwehlukile, ngakho ingumfayela \u003Cstrong\u003Eohlukile\u003C/strong\u003E kwi-TakeoffCraft, nakuba inegama elifanayo. Kunothi ngaphansi kohlu lwamashidi, leli fayela lisho ukuthi &quot;kukhona ifayela elinalo igama elifanayo elivuliwe, kodwa okuqukethwe kwalo kuyahluka&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimaki zihlala zibambelele enguqulweni endala. Ziyaqhubeka nokubalwa, ezindaweni zazo zakuqala nasezikalini zazo zakuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PDF eguqulwe ivula njengamashidi amasha angenasikali nezimaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uhambise ukubala amanani kulokho okuguqulwe, vula zombili i-PDF bese usebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E eshidini elisha: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003EQhathanisa ishidi eliguqulwe uhambise ukubala amanani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifayela-elonakele-noma-elingelona-elakho\"\u003EIfayela elonakele noma elingelona elakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ihlola yonke ifayela leprojekthi ngaphambi kokulisebenzisa. Imilayezo oyibonayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;(file) akuyona iprojekthi ye-TakeoffCraft (akuyona i-JSON esemthethweni).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Lolu akuyona ifayela leprojekthi le-TakeoffCraft.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Le projekthi yalondolozwa yi-TakeoffCraft entsha. Yivule khona.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Izimaki ezingu-3 zonakele zakhishwa.&quot; (okunye kuyavuleka)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umlando-wokuhlehlisa\"\u003EUmlando wokuhlehlisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmlando wokuhlehlisa uqala kabusha uma uvula iprojekthi. Ukulondoloza akuwususi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukubala amanani kulondolozwa njengefayela elincane leprojekthi, (name).takeoff.json. Lubamba izinto zakho, izinhlanganisela, amarethi, isikali sawo wonke amashidi nazo zonke izimaki. Ayibambi ama-PDF; iwathola futhi ngokuqukethwe kwawo. Londoloza Khetha Save takeoff eqenjini le-File, noma cindezela Ctrl+S. Isiphequluli sakho silanda (name).takeoff.json. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Kulondolozwe (name).takeoff.json. Ivuleka phezu kwama-PDF afanayo (afanisa ngokuqukethwe kwawo).\" Hambisa lelo fayela eduze kwama-PDF omsebenzi, ukuze kuhlale kanye. Ukulondoloza ngakunye kulanda ifayela elisha. Isiphequluli sakho singalitshela ngokuthi (name) (1).takeoff.json; gcina elisha kakhulu. Igama livela kwi-PDF yokuqala oyivule kulokhu kubala amanani. I-Save takeoff iyona ndlela kuphela yokugcina ukubala amanani njengefayela. Ngenkathi usebenza, i-TakeoffCraft igcina futhi ikopi yokubuyisela kulesi siphequluli (bona ngezansi), futhi ukulondoloza kwigu aikatholakali. Uma uzama ukuvala ithebhu nezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, isiphequluli siyakubuza ukuthi uyafuna yini ukushiya. Gcina ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwe-PDF Export › PDF with the takeoff inside ilanda ikopi ye-PDF ngayinye evulekile, egcina igama elifana no Plans (with takeoff).pdf, futhi ithwele ukubala amanani konke njengesifakelo: izinto, izimaki, izikali, izindawo zokunikezela, konke okugcinwa yi-.takeoff.json. Amakhasi awo awaguquki, ngakho abukeka futhi aphrintwe njengokuqala, futhi abafundi be-PDF abanye bababalela ukubala amanani phakathi kwezifakelo zabo. Vula leyo PDF ku-TakeoffCraft (noma iyiphi indlela yokuvula ama-PDF) futhi izobuza Le PDF inokubala amanani ngaphakathi: khetha Open the takeoff ukuze uyithole, noma Just the PDF ukuvula idrowing kuphela. Ikopi imele i-PDF eyenziwe kuyo, ngakho i-.takeoff.json elondolozwe kwenye yazo ivula kwazo zombili. Ngama-PDF amaningi, ikopi ngayinye ithwele ukubala amanani konke; vula zonke ndawonye. Ukulondoloza futhi kusuka kwikopi kushintsha ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwayo, akweqi kwesibili. I-.takeoff.json isasele elokugcina: iyincane, futhi yiyo eloga ukulondolozwa ngokuzenzakalelayo nohlelo lwedeskithophu. Uma ithebhu noma isiphequluli simi Imizuzwana embalwa ngemva kwenguquko ngayinye, i-TakeoffCraft igcina ikopi yokubala amanani kusitoreji salesi siphequluli, kanye nama-PDF awo uma ayi-64 MB noma ngaphansi. Akukho okulayishwa. Uma ulondoloza ukubala amanani, uqale elisha noma uvule enye iprojekthi, ikopi iyanyamalala. Uma ithebhu iwa, isiphequluli noma likhompyutha limi, noma uphuma nezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, ngokuvula kwakho i-TakeoffCraft okulandelayo izobuza Buyisa umsebenzi wakho? bese ikhombisa ukubala amanani ngegama lawo. Chofoza Buyisa ukuze uwuthole: izinto, izimaki nezikali ziyabuya, nama-PDF avuleka futhi uma agcinwe. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Kubuyiswe (name). Akulondolozwanga efayelini okwamanje: Save takeoff iyakugcina.\" Uma ama-PDF ebemakhulu kakhulu ukuba agcinwe, wavule futhi; izimaki zivela emakhasini awo. Okwengeziwe: Buyisa umsebenzi wakho. Vula kabusha Vula i-TakeoffCraft. Yehlisa ifayela le-.takeoff.json kanye nama-PDF awo ndawonye ekhasini. Noma khetha Open plans wama-PDF no-Open takeoff weprojekthi, noma kusiphi isiqalo. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Kuvuliwe (name): izinto ezingu-12, izimaki ezingu-340.\" Ishidi ngalinye lithola isikali salo, nezimaki zivela emashidini azo. Uhlelo lwama-PDF alubalulekile, futhi namagama awo amafayela noma amafolda awo akubalulekile. I-TakeoffCraft ibona ngayinye i-PDF ngesigxivizo sokuqukethwe kwayo. Uma uvula iprojekthi ngenkathi ukubala amanani okwamanje kunezinguquko ezingalondolozwanga, i-TakeoffCraft iqala ibuze: Khansela, Lahla izinguquko noma Londoloza ukubala amanani kuqala. Ukuvula iprojekthi kuyashintsha izinto nezimaki zamanje; ama-PDF asevulekile ayahlala evulekile. Uma i-PDF ingekho Uma uvula iprojekthi ngaphandle kwama-PDF ayo wonke, ibha yesimo yengeza \"Vula ama-PDF ayo ukuze ubone izimaki (zibhalwe ngaphansi kwamashidi).\" Ngaphansi kohlu lwamashidi, inothi lithi: \"Lokhu kubala amanani kuphinde kumboze ama-PDF angavulekile. Amanani awo ayabalwa; wavule ukuze ubone futhi uhlele izimaki zawo:\" kulandelwe ngamagama amafayela nosayizi. Izimaki zawo sezisabalwa kuwo wonke amasamanisa nokuthunyelwa, ngezikali abalelwa ngazo. Vula lawo ma-PDF ukuze ubone futhi uhlele izimaki. Uma i-PDF ishintshiwe I-PDF eguqulwe, noma eshintshwe nje ngohlelo lwenye, inokuqukethwe okwehlukile, ngakho ingumfayela ohlukile kwi-TakeoffCraft, nakuba inegama elifanayo. Kunothi ngaphansi kohlu lwamashidi, leli fayela lisho ukuthi \"kukhona ifayela elinalo igama elifanayo elivuliwe, kodwa okuqukethwe kwalo kuyahluka\". Izimaki zihlala zibambelele enguqulweni endala. Ziyaqhubeka nokubalwa, ezindaweni zazo zakuqala nasezikalini zazo zakuqala. I-PDF eguqulwe ivula njengamashidi amasha angenasikali nezimaki. Ukuze uhambise ukubala amanani kulokho okuguqulwe, vula zombili i-PDF bese usebenzisa Compare eshidini elisha: Qhathanisa ishidi eliguqulwe uhambise ukubala amanani. Ifayela elonakele noma elingelona elakho I-TakeoffCraft ihlola yonke ifayela leprojekthi ngaphambi kokulisebenzisa. Imilayezo oyibonayo: \"(file) akuyona iprojekthi ye-TakeoffCraft (akuyona i-JSON esemthethweni).\" \"Lolu akuyona ifayela leprojekthi le-TakeoffCraft.\" \"Le projekthi yalondolozwa yi-TakeoffCraft entsha. Yivule khona.\" \"Izimaki ezingu-3 zonakele zakhishwa.\" (okunye kuyavuleka) Umlando wokuhlehlisa Umlando wokuhlehlisa uqala kabusha uma uvula iprojekthi. Ukulondoloza akuwususi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"compare-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qhathanisa ishidi elibuyekeziwe uhambise ukubala amanani","summary":"Beka ishidi elidala phezu kokubuyekezwa kwalo, uzilinganise, bona okushintshile, bese uhambisa ukubala amanani ushidi elisha nezimpawu ezidinga ukuhlolwa ezimakiwe.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["ukubuyekezwa","obuyekeziwe","qhathanisa","ukubeka phezu","okudala","okusha","izinguquko","isengezo","isaziso","ukukhishwa kabusha","hambisa ukubala amanani","dlulisa","thwala","linganisa","makiwe","hlola"],"headings":[{"id":"qhathanisa","text":"Qhathanisa","level":2},{"id":"linganisa","text":"Linganisa","level":2},{"id":"thola-okushintshile","text":"Thola okushintshile","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-ukubala-amanani","text":"Hambisa ukubala amanani","level":2},{"id":"hlola-izimpawu-ezimakiwe","text":"Hlola izimpawu ezimakiwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELapho ishidi likhishwa kabusha, akudingeki ulibale futhi. Vula i-PDF endala nensha, qhathanisa amashidi amabili, bese uhambisa ukubala amanani kubo. I-TakeoffCraft imaka yonke impawu lapho umdwebo ushintshile, ngakho uzihlola lezo bese ugcina ezinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qhathanisa\"\u003EQhathanisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ama-PDF amabili: isethi endala nebuyekeziwe (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amapulani\u003C/span\u003E; kungaba kufayela elilodwa noma eminingi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa ishidi \u003Cstrong\u003Eelisha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni leshidi ngaphansi komdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ishidi elidala ohlwini. I-TakeoffCraft iphakamisa ishidi elinenombolo efanayo kwenye PDF, noma ikhasi elifanayo. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EQhathanisa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmdwebo wakudala manje uphezu komusha ngobomvu. Lapho ezivumelana khona, imigqa ebomvu ihlala phezu kwemimnyama; lapho ehlukile, ubona imigqa ebomvu yodwa (esusiwe) nemimnyama yodwa (engeziwe). Ibha esezansi yeshidi ibamba izinyathelo ezingezansi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E kuyeka ukuqhathanisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmashidi abuyekeziwe avame ukuhlelwa kancane kancane: ahanjiswe ekhasini, noma anosayizi ohlukile kancane. Uma umdwebo obomvu ungahlali phezu komnyama, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa ngamaphoyinti amabili\u003C/strong\u003E bese uchofoza kane:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiphoyinti emdwebeni wakudala (obomvu), njengesikhungo sekholomu noma ikona lesakhiwo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiphoyinti elifanayo emdwebeni omusha (omnyama),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiphoyinti lesibili emdwebeni obomvu, kude nelokuqala,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiphoyinti elifanayo emdwebeni omnyama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmdwebo obomvu uyahamba, uphendule futhi ulingane nowomnyama. Ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi umdwebo omusha mkhulu kangakanani kunowakudala (&quot;size × 1.000&quot; uma ulingana). Sondeza ukuze ukhethe amaphoyinti: lapho uchofoza eduze, ukulingana kuba kuhle kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-okushintshile\"\u003EThola okushintshile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EThola izinguquko\u003C/strong\u003E. I-TakeoffCraft iqhathanisa inki yemidwebo emibili: inki kuphela ephepheni elidala iba bomvu, inki kuphela eshidini elisha ibe bluu, futhi ibha yesimo iyabala. Imigqa ehambe ngokuncane (ukuphrinta kabusha) ayibaliwe njengezinguquko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphinde ibheke yonke impawu eshidini elidala ibale leyo ebekwe lapho umdwebo ushintshile:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumugqa noma indawo lapho umdwebo ushintshe ekugcineni kwawo noma emakhoneni awo, noma ngasemgqeni okungenani cishe ingxenye eyodwa kwesithupha ubude bawo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einani lapho okuthile kushintshe eduze kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-ukubala-amanani\"\u003EHambisa ukubala amanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa ukubala lapha\u003C/strong\u003E. Yonke impawu eshidini elidala ihamba iye kwelisha, ngokudlula ekulingeni, esinyathelweni esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ezizenzeka eduze kokushintsha ziyamakwa: zidwetshwe nge-halo ewolintshi, futhi ibha yeshidi ibonisa &quot;(n) ukuhlola&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ishidi elisha lalingenasikali, lithatha isikali seshidi elidala (silungiswe uma imidwebo kwadingeka ukuthi ilinganiswe). Uma sase linesikali esihlukile, i-TakeoffCraft iyabuza kuqala: izimpawu ezihanjisiwe zilinganiswa ngesikali seshidi elisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-izimpawu-ezimakiwe\"\u003EHlola izimpawu ezimakiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha &quot;(n) ukuhlola&quot; ebhalweni leshidi. Lisondeza ekuphawuleni elilandelayo elimakiwe lisikhethe; iphaneli yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani limakiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELungisa impawu uma umdwebo ushintshe ngaphansi kwayo (hudula amakhona ayo, engeza noma susa izimpawu, noma uyisuse futhi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EKuhlolwe\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli yayo. Ukumaka kuyasuswa, nenani ebhalweni leshidi liyehla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimpawu zilondolozwa kanye nokubala amanani, ngakho ungazihlola kamuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuqhathanisa kusebenza kuma-PDF e-vector nakuma-scan ngokufanayo, ngoba kuqhathanisa okudweziwe. I-scan egobile noma eqinisiwe ingalingana ngokuyingxenye kuphela ngamaphoyinti amabili; hlola izimpawu eziningi ngamehlo ngalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Lapho ishidi likhishwa kabusha, akudingeki ulibale futhi. Vula i-PDF endala nensha, qhathanisa amashidi amabili, bese uhambisa ukubala amanani kubo. I-TakeoffCraft imaka yonke impawu lapho umdwebo ushintshile, ngakho uzihlola lezo bese ugcina ezinye. Qhathanisa Vula ama-PDF amabili: isethi endala nebuyekeziwe (Vula amapulani; kungaba kufayela elilodwa noma eminingi). Bonisa ishidi elisha. Khetha Qhathanisa ebhalweni leshidi ngaphansi komdwebo. Khetha ishidi elidala ohlwini. I-TakeoffCraft iphakamisa ishidi elinenombolo efanayo kwenye PDF, noma ikhasi elifanayo. Khetha Qhathanisa. Umdwebo wakudala manje uphezu komusha ngobomvu. Lapho ezivumelana khona, imigqa ebomvu ihlala phezu kwemimnyama; lapho ehlukile, ubona imigqa ebomvu yodwa (esusiwe) nemimnyama yodwa (engeziwe). Ibha esezansi yeshidi ibamba izinyathelo ezingezansi; Esc noma Vala kuyeka ukuqhathanisa. Linganisa Amashidi abuyekeziwe avame ukuhlelwa kancane kancane: ahanjiswe ekhasini, noma anosayizi ohlukile kancane. Uma umdwebo obomvu ungahlali phezu komnyama, khetha Linganisa ngamaphoyinti amabili bese uchofoza kane: iphoyinti emdwebeni wakudala (obomvu), njengesikhungo sekholomu noma ikona lesakhiwo, iphoyinti elifanayo emdwebeni omusha (omnyama), iphoyinti lesibili emdwebeni obomvu, kude nelokuqala, iphoyinti elifanayo emdwebeni omnyama. Umdwebo obomvu uyahamba, uphendule futhi ulingane nowomnyama. Ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi umdwebo omusha mkhulu kangakanani kunowakudala (\"size × 1.000\" uma ulingana). Sondeza ukuze ukhethe amaphoyinti: lapho uchofoza eduze, ukulingana kuba kuhle kakhulu. Thola okushintshile Khetha Thola izinguquko. I-TakeoffCraft iqhathanisa inki yemidwebo emibili: inki kuphela ephepheni elidala iba bomvu, inki kuphela eshidini elisha ibe bluu, futhi ibha yesimo iyabala. Imigqa ehambe ngokuncane (ukuphrinta kabusha) ayibaliwe njengezinguquko. Iphinde ibheke yonke impawu eshidini elidala ibale leyo ebekwe lapho umdwebo ushintshile: umugqa noma indawo lapho umdwebo ushintshe ekugcineni kwawo noma emakhoneni awo, noma ngasemgqeni okungenani cishe ingxenye eyodwa kwesithupha ubude bawo; inani lapho okuthile kushintshe eduze kwalo. Hambisa ukubala amanani Khetha Hambisa ukubala lapha. Yonke impawu eshidini elidala ihamba iye kwelisha, ngokudlula ekulingeni, esinyathelweni esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ezizenzeka eduze kokushintsha ziyamakwa: zidwetshwe nge-halo ewolintshi, futhi ibha yeshidi ibonisa \"(n) ukuhlola\". Uma ishidi elisha lalingenasikali, lithatha isikali seshidi elidala (silungiswe uma imidwebo kwadingeka ukuthi ilinganiswe). Uma sase linesikali esihlukile, i-TakeoffCraft iyabuza kuqala: izimpawu ezihanjisiwe zilinganiswa ngesikali seshidi elisha. Hlola izimpawu ezimakiwe Khetha \"(n) ukuhlola\" ebhalweni leshidi. Lisondeza ekuphawuleni elilandelayo elimakiwe lisikhethe; iphaneli yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani limakiwe. Lungisa impawu uma umdwebo ushintshe ngaphansi kwayo (hudula amakhona ayo, engeza noma susa izimpawu, noma uyisuse futhi). Khetha Kuhlolwe ephaneli yayo. Ukumaka kuyasuswa, nenani ebhalweni leshidi liyehla. Izimpawu zilondolozwa kanye nokubala amanani, ngakho ungazihlola kamuva. Ukuqhathanisa kusebenza kuma-PDF e-vector nakuma-scan ngokufanayo, ngoba kuqhathanisa okudweziwe. I-scan egobile noma eqinisiwe ingalingana ngokuyingxenye kuphela ngamaphoyinti amabili; hlola izimpawu eziningi ngamehlo ngalokho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Sebenzisa i-TakeoffCraft nomsizi we-AI","summary":"Vumela umsizi wakho we-AI noma uhlelo lwakho lufunde izinani nesilinganiso sokubalwa, lungeze izinto nezimaki, lubale futhi lulinganise kwi-DWG noma i-DXF, futhi lukhiphe: izimvume, ukuxhuma nge-CadCraft Studio, nelogi yomsebenzi.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["ai","umsizi","ijenti","mcp","model context protocol","iskripthi","ukuzenzakalela","izinani","isilinganiso","izimvume","ukunqamula","umsebenzi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"yivule","text":"Yivule","level":2},{"id":"xhuma-umsizi-wakho","text":"Xhuma umsizi wakho","level":2},{"id":"wena-ulawula","text":"Wena ulawula","level":2},{"id":"okungacelwa-umsizi","text":"Okungacelwa umsizi","level":2},{"id":"uma-into-ingasebenzi","text":"Uma into ingasebenzi","level":2},{"id":"bona-futhi","text":"Bona futhi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma iskripthi osibhalile) asebenze ne-TakeoffCraft, nokuthi unquume kanjani okungathintwa yiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft \u003Cstrong\u003Eayinayo i-AI yayo\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ayithumeli lutho noma kuphi. Wena uletha umsizi: noma yiluphi uhlelo oluxoxa nge-Model Context Protocol (MCP). I-TakeoffCraft inikeza amathuluzi kuphela, wena ukhetha awathandayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yivule\"\u003EYivule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (igiya esitolibheni esiphezulu, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uya kwithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, thika \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise i-TakeoffCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Icishiwe kuze wenze lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okungenziwa yiwo: \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E uthikiwe ekuqaleni; thika \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela uma uwadinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi angaphandle kwezimvume ozithikile awanikezwa umsizi, futhi uma ecela enye noma kunjalo, i-TakeoffCraft iyayenqaba ibhale lokho kulogi yomsebenzi. Ukucima iswishi kuqeda wonke amaxhumanisi ngesikhathi esisodwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha izilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E nayo iyicima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhuma-umsizi-wakho\"\u003EXhuma umsizi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbasizi baxhuma nge-\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E ekhompyutheni yakho: i-Studio iqalisa iseva encane ekufinyeleleka yilo lolu khompyutha kuphela, evikelwe ithokheni eyenzelwa yona njalo lapho iqala. Ku-Studio, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXhuma umsizi\u003C/span\u003E bese ukopisha ikheli nethokheni kumsizi wakho (i-Studio ibonisa izilungiselelo ezicacile okufanele uzinamathisele). Ungalokothi wabelane ngethokheni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuvula uxhumo lomsizi: kuma-app esiphequluli iswishi ayinamthelelaize usebenzise i-CadCraft Studio ekhompyutheni yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wena-ulawula\"\u003EWena ulawula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa\u003C/strong\u003E, ibhalwe ngegama lomsizi ngale nto (isibonelo &quot;Umsizi: …&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ithatha kabusha inguquko yokugcina yomsizi yonke ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUyazi lapho kuxhunyiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Inkinobho esitolibheni esiphezulu iveza igama lomsizi lapho exhunyiwe; yichofoze ukuze ubone ayingenza, noma ukuze \u003Cstrong\u003Euyinqamule\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E ibala yonke imibizo: nini, yiliphi ithuluzi, iqedile noma inqatshiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the log\u003C/span\u003E igcina ikhophi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungacelwa-umsizi\"\u003EOkungacelwa umsizi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIthuluzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImvume\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho okwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubala okuvulekile, ama-PDF namashidi awo, isilinganiso nezimaki zeshidi ngalinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto namayunithi, amazinga nezifomula zezinhlanganisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinani ngento noma ngeshidi; izimaki emashidini angenasilinganiso ziyadwaniswa, azibalwa njengo-zero\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsilinganiso esinezindleko njengoba i-TakeoffCraft sikubala, namasamba aso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela kwe-CSV noma ye-XLSX yi-TakeoffCraft ngokwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeza izinto namayunithi, amazinga nokulahlekelwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlinganisa imigqa, izindawo nezinani eshidini. Ubude nezindawo kuphela eshidini elinesilinganiso, hhayi elingenalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_sheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_catalog\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu-DWG noma i-DXF oyivulile: amashidi ayo nezilinganiso zawo, okungabalwa (amabhulokhi, izingqimba nezinhlobo, imibhalo), nezinani ezinembile, njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E zenza (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBala kusukela kumdwebo\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbala emdwebeni futhi ibeka imaki yokubala kuyo yonke into etholakele, ngesinyathelo esisodwa; ukubala futhi kwengeza okusha kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_measure\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlinganisa into yomugqa noma yendawo kusukela emigqeni, emaarcini, ama-polyline nezigaba zokufiphaza zomdwebo uqobo, njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E yenza (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003ELinganisa kusukela kumdwebo\u003C/a\u003E); kuphela eshidini elinesilinganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindlela ezilinganisiwe, izindawo nezinani zeshidi elinesilinganiso njengemodeli yokuhlola ye-3D ye-USD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E), njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD package (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala kwi-3D check view (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EThumela ukubuka kokuhlola kwe-3D njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe, umsizi wengeza izinto nezimaki (ukubiza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa); awukwazi ukuhambisa, ukushintsha noma ukususa izimaki ezikhona ngaphambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zinani nesilinganiso zitholakala nangaphandle kokuvula i-TakeoffCraft: i-CadCraft MCP server ivula ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E kwifolda oyiqamba (\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E), futhi \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft info Job.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E iyazibonisa emugqeni womyalo. Ivula futhi i-DWG noma i-DXF njengokubala okusha emashidini ayo (ilinganiswa njengoba i-TakeoffCraft iyilinganisa), ibale futhi ilinganise kuyo ngamathuluzi afanayo e-\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_*\u003C/code\u003E, yengeze izinto futhi ilondoloze ukubala (\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_save\u003C/code\u003E); \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft count plan.dwg --block SHELF-18X48 --sheet K-101\u003C/code\u003E ibala emugqeni womyalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-into-ingasebenzi\"\u003EUma into ingasebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsizi awuboni amathuluzi e-TakeoffCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E hlola ukuthi iswishi ivuliwe kule window, nokuthi le window ivulekile ku-Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;kudinga imvume yokuthumela&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E thika \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, bese ubuza futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphutha &quot;401&quot; noma &quot;token&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E ithokheni ishintshile (i-Studio iqalile kabusha, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew token\u003C/span\u003E). Kopisha eyintsha ezilungiselelweni zomsizi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-futhi\"\u003EBona futhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EIzindlela zabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye nethuluzi eliyibizayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Indlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma iskripthi osibhalile) asebenze ne-TakeoffCraft, nokuthi unquume kanjani okungathintwa yiwo. I-TakeoffCraft ayinayo i-AI yayo futhi ayithumeli lutho noma kuphi. Wena uletha umsizi: noma yiluphi uhlelo oluxoxa nge-Model Context Protocol (MCP). I-TakeoffCraft inikeza amathuluzi kuphela, wena ukhetha awathandayo. Yivule Vula Settings (igiya esitolibheni esiphezulu, noma Ctrl+,) bese uya kwithebhu ye-TakeoffCraft. Ngaphansi kwe-Assistants, thika Vumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise i-TakeoffCraft. Icishiwe kuze wenze lokho. Khetha okungenziwa yiwo: Read uthikiwe ekuqaleni; thika Edit, Save noma Export kuphela uma uwadinga. Amathuluzi angaphandle kwezimvume ozithikile awanikezwa umsizi, futhi uma ecela enye noma kunjalo, i-TakeoffCraft iyayenqaba ibhale lokho kulogi yomsebenzi. Ukucima iswishi kuqeda wonke amaxhumanisi ngesikhathi esisodwa; Setha kabusha izilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft nayo iyicima. Xhuma umsizi wakho Abasizi baxhuma nge-CadCraft Studio ekhompyutheni yakho: i-Studio iqalisa iseva encane ekufinyeleleka yilo lolu khompyutha kuphela, evikelwe ithokheni eyenzelwa yona njalo lapho iqala. Ku-Studio, khetha Xhuma umsizi bese ukopisha ikheli nethokheni kumsizi wakho (i-Studio ibonisa izilungiselelo ezicacile okufanele uzinamathisele). Ungalokothi wabelane ngethokheni. Ithebhu yesiphequluli ayikwazi ukuvula uxhumo lomsizi: kuma-app esiphequluli iswishi ayinamthelelaize usebenzise i-CadCraft Studio ekhompyutheni yakho. Wena ulawula Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, ibhalwe ngegama lomsizi ngale nto (isibonelo \"Umsizi: …\"). Ctrl+Z ithatha kabusha inguquko yokugcina yomsizi yonke ngesikhathi esisodwa. Uyazi lapho kuxhunyiwe. Inkinobho esitolibheni esiphezulu iveza igama lomsizi lapho exhunyiwe; yichofoze ukuze ubone ayingenza, noma ukuze uyinqamule. Umsebenzi. Settings › TakeoffCraft › Assistants › Activity ibala yonke imibizo: nini, yiliphi ithuluzi, iqedile noma inqatshiwe. Save the log igcina ikhophi. Okungacelwa umsizi Ithuluzi Imvume Lokho okwenzayo app_info, sheets_list Read Ukubala okuvulekile, ama-PDF namashidi awo, isilinganiso nezimaki zeshidi ngalinye items_list Read Izinto namayunithi, amazinga nezifomula zezinhlanganisela takeoff_quantities Read Izinani ngento noma ngeshidi; izimaki emashidini angenasilinganiso ziyadwaniswa, azibalwa njengo-zero takeoff_estimate Read Isilinganiso esinezindleko njengoba i-TakeoffCraft sikubala, namasamba aso takeoff_export Export Ukuthumela kwe-CSV noma ye-XLSX yi-TakeoffCraft ngokwayo items_add Edit Yengeza izinto namayunithi, amazinga nokulahlekelwa marks_add Edit Ilinganisa imigqa, izindawo nezinani eshidini. Ubude nezindawo kuphela eshidini elinesilinganiso, hhayi elingenalo cad_sheets, cad_catalog, cad_count Read Ku-DWG noma i-DXF oyivulile: amashidi ayo nezilinganiso zawo, okungabalwa (amabhulokhi, izingqimba nezinhlobo, imibhalo), nezinani ezinembile, njengoba CAD count zenza (Bala kusukela kumdwebo) cad_count_add Edit Ibala emdwebeni futhi ibeka imaki yokubala kuyo yonke into etholakele, ngesinyathelo esisodwa; ukubala futhi kwengeza okusha kuphela cad_measure Edit Ilinganisa into yomugqa noma yendawo kusukela emigqeni, emaarcini, ama-polyline nezigaba zokufiphaza zomdwebo uqobo, njengoba Measure drawing yenza (Linganisa kusukela kumdwebo); kuphela eshidini elinesilinganiso usd_export Export Izindlela ezilinganisiwe, izindawo nezinani zeshidi elinesilinganiso njengemodeli yokuhlola ye-3D ye-USD (.usdz, .usda noma .usdc), njengoba USD package (.usdz) ibhala kwi-3D check view (Thumela ukubuka kokuhlola kwe-3D njenge-USD) Uma Edit ithikiwe, umsizi wengeza izinto nezimaki (ukubiza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa); awukwazi ukuhambisa, ukushintsha noma ukususa izimaki ezikhona ngaphambili. Lezi zinani nesilinganiso zitholakala nangaphandle kokuvula i-TakeoffCraft: i-CadCraft MCP server ivula ifayela .takeoff.json kwifolda oyiqamba (takeoff_open, takeoff_quantities, takeoff_estimate, takeoff_export), futhi cadcraft info Job.takeoff.json iyazibonisa emugqeni womyalo. Ivula futhi i-DWG noma i-DXF njengokubala okusha emashidini ayo (ilinganiswa njengoba i-TakeoffCraft iyilinganisa), ibale futhi ilinganise kuyo ngamathuluzi afanayo e-cad_*, yengeze izinto futhi ilondoloze ukubala (takeoff_save); cadcraft count plan.dwg --block SHELF-18X48 --sheet K-101 ibala emugqeni womyalo. Uma into ingasebenzi Umsizi awuboni amathuluzi e-TakeoffCraft: hlola ukuthi iswishi ivuliwe kule window, nokuthi le window ivulekile ku-Studio. \"kudinga imvume yokuthumela\": thika Export ngaphansi kwe-Assistants, bese ubuza futhi. Amaphutha \"401\" noma \"token\": ithokheni ishintshile (i-Studio iqalile kabusha, noma New token). Kopisha eyintsha ezilungiselelweni zomsizi. Bona futhi Izindlela zabasizi be-AI: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye nethuluzi eliyibizayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Sebenza kokubalwa kwemisebenzi ndawonye nge-Live TeamWork","summary":"Okushintsha ku-TakeoffCraft uma usesikhathini se-Live TeamWork esivela ku-CadCraft Studio: izinto nezimaki zawo wonke umuntu kokubalwa kunye, izinani ezifanayo kubo bonke, ukuhlehlisa kwakho, nokujoyina kusuka kusiphequluli esifanayo kwinethiwekhi.","section":"tasks","order":119,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","ndawonye","sebenzisana","isikhathi sokuhlangana","yabelana live","joyina","izinto","izimaki","izinani","isilinganiso","isikhombisi","ukubona","amagama","umbala","ukukhetha","hlehlisa","umphathi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"wonke-umuntuulinganisa-ngesikhathi-esisodwa","text":"Wonke umuntuulinganisa ngesikhathi esisodwa","level":2},{"id":"bonana","text":"Bonana","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-umsebenzi-wakho","text":"Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho","level":2},{"id":"joyina-kusuka-kusiphequluli","text":"Joyina kusuka kusiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"lapho-isikhathi-siphela","text":"Lapho isikhathi siphela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkwenzeka kokubalwa lapho abantu abaningana belinganisa umsebenzi ofanayo ngesikhathi esifanayo. I-CadCraft Studio iqalisa futhi ijoyine isikhathi se-Live TeamWork (Share live, Join); leli khasi likhuluma ngokubalwa uqobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wonke-umuntuulinganisa-ngesikhathi-esisodwa\"\u003EWonke umuntuulinganisa ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-PDF womphathi afika kubo bonke abajoyinile. Engeza izinto, linganisa imigqa, izindawo nezinani, bese usetha izilinganiso nezindleko njengoba bekwenza ngokujwayelekile. Izimaki zakho zivela masinyane; ezabanye zivela ngemva kwesikhashana ezidalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinani zifanayo kubo bonke:\u003C/strong\u003E iwindi ngalinye lisebenza izinani nesilinganiso kusukela ezimakini, ngakho awekho amanani ohlukana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbantu ababili beshintsha into noma imaki efanayo:\u003C/strong\u003E izinto ezihlukile zombili zigcinwa; into efanayo ihamba nenguquko yakamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImaki ekwinto esanda kususwa\u003C/strong\u003E iyabuyiswa, futhi ibha yesimo ichaza ngani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto nezimaki ezintsha zomuntu ngamunye zithola izinombolo zazo, ngakho abantu ababili abayikaze benze eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bonana\"\u003EBonana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke umuntu kulesi sikhathi unombala wakhe. Eshidini obheka kulo ubona isikhombisi sakhe ngasinye njengomcibisholo ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze kwawo, nebhokisi elinemigqa ngombala wakhe ozungeza izimaki abazikhethile. Abantu abesheshe elinye ishidi bahlelwa phezulu ngakwesokudla kwendawo yokubuka ngegama leshidi lawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikhombisi, amagama nokukhethwa kuphela kwesikhathi sokuhlangana: akuzange kugcinwe ngaphakathi kwefayela futhi akuzange kungene ekuhlehliseni komuntu. Ziyahamba zibhodle lapho kukhona umuntu ngamunye, ngakho zihlala zibukeka zishelela nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-umsebenzi-wakho\"\u003EUkuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlehlisa inguquko yakho yokugcina kuphela futhi ishiye eyabanye ibe njalo. Uma umuntu eshintshe into efanayo selokhu, akukho okuhlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi ubani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joyina-kusuka-kusiphequluli\"\u003EJoyina kusuka kusiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlungu lethimu elingenayo i-Studio lingaskena ikhodi ephezu kwesithombe ngefoni, ithebhulethi noma ikhompyutha ekwinethiwekhi efanayo. I-TakeoffCraft ivula kusiphequluli futhi igcwale ngokubalwa komphathi nama-PDF akhe uma umphathi sekuvumile ukuthi ungene. Isixhumanisi sesimemo singavumela umuntu ukuthi ajoyine kusuka kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi kufanele abe nesihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan se-app, abanye bonke bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi sisebenza kuphela ngenkathi isikhathi somphathi sivulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-isikhathi-siphela\"\u003ELapho isikhathi siphela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphathi kuphela ogcina ukubalwa. Abanye bonke bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: yigcine uma ufuna ukuyigcina.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Okwenzeka kokubalwa lapho abantu abaningana belinganisa umsebenzi ofanayo ngesikhathi esifanayo. I-CadCraft Studio iqalisa futhi ijoyine isikhathi se-Live TeamWork (Share live, Join); leli khasi likhuluma ngokubalwa uqobo. Wonke umuntuulinganisa ngesikhathi esisodwa Ama-PDF womphathi afika kubo bonke abajoyinile. Engeza izinto, linganisa imigqa, izindawo nezinani, bese usetha izilinganiso nezindleko njengoba bekwenza ngokujwayelekile. Izimaki zakho zivela masinyane; ezabanye zivela ngemva kwesikhashana ezidalwa. Izinani zifanayo kubo bonke: iwindi ngalinye lisebenza izinani nesilinganiso kusukela ezimakini, ngakho awekho amanani ohlukana. Abantu ababili beshintsha into noma imaki efanayo: izinto ezihlukile zombili zigcinwa; into efanayo ihamba nenguquko yakamuva. Imaki ekwinto esanda kususwa iyabuyiswa, futhi ibha yesimo ichaza ngani. Izinto nezimaki ezintsha zomuntu ngamunye zithola izinombolo zazo, ngakho abantu ababili abayikaze benze eyodwa. Bonana Wonke umuntu kulesi sikhathi unombala wakhe. Eshidini obheka kulo ubona isikhombisi sakhe ngasinye njengomcibisholo ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze kwawo, nebhokisi elinemigqa ngombala wakhe ozungeza izimaki abazikhethile. Abantu abesheshe elinye ishidi bahlelwa phezulu ngakwesokudla kwendawo yokubuka ngegama leshidi lawo. Izikhombisi, amagama nokukhethwa kuphela kwesikhathi sokuhlangana: akuzange kugcinwe ngaphakathi kwefayela futhi akuzange kungene ekuhlehliseni komuntu. Ziyahamba zibhodle lapho kukhona umuntu ngamunye, ngakho zihlala zibukeka zishelela nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane. Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho Ctrl+Z ihlehlisa inguquko yakho yokugcina kuphela futhi ishiye eyabanye ibe njalo. Uma umuntu eshintshe into efanayo selokhu, akukho okuhlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi ubani. Joyina kusuka kusiphequluli Ilungu lethimu elingenayo i-Studio lingaskena ikhodi ephezu kwesithombe ngefoni, ithebhulethi noma ikhompyutha ekwinethiwekhi efanayo. I-TakeoffCraft ivula kusiphequluli futhi igcwale ngokubalwa komphathi nama-PDF akhe uma umphathi sekuvumile ukuthi ungene. Isixhumanisi sesimemo singavumela umuntu ukuthi ajoyine kusuka kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi kufanele abe nesihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan se-app, abanye bonke bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi sisebenza kuphela ngenkathi isikhathi somphathi sivulekile. Lapho isikhathi siphela Umphathi kuphela ogcina ukubalwa. Abanye bonke bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: yigcine uma ufuna ukuyigcina.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"new-takeoff","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qala ukubala okusha","summary":"Sula konke uqale ukubala okungenalutho ngaphandle kokulayisha kabusha ikhasi, bese ugcina umsebenzi wakho kuqala.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["okusha","ukubala okusha","sula","setha kabusha","qala phansi","engenalutho","vala ama-pdf","umsebenzi olandelayo"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E ivala yonke i-PDF bese iqala ukubala okungenalutho ekhasini elifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELondoloza ukubala kwamanje uma ufuna ukukugcina: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kukhona izinguquko ezingalondoloziwe, i-TakeoffCraft ibuza \u003Cstrong\u003EUnsaved takeoff\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff first\u003C/span\u003E (ilanda iphrojekthi, bese isula), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard changes\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E. Iwindi libuyela esimweni salo esingenalutho: akukho ma-PDF, akukho zinto, akukho zimaki, akukho zikali. Ibha yesimo ithi &quot;Ukubala okusha. Vula ama-PDF ukuze uqale.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkusulwayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eyonke i-PDF evuliwe, amashidi nezithonjana zawo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizinto, izinhlanganisela, izimaki nezikali,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizoom nendawo yeshidi ngayinye,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumlando wokuhlehlisa (awukwazi ukuhlehlisa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eimodi yejika, nanoma yiluphi usesho lokubala okuzenzakalelayo noma ukubuyekeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela akho ediskini awathintwa. Ukuze uthole kabusha ukubala kwakudala, vula i-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E yakho kanye ne-PDF: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ELondoloza futhi uvule kabusha ukubala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubala okusha ngakunye kuqala ngaphandle kwezinto. Ukuze uzise izinto, zikopishe kuqala: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E (noma kopisha izimaki, ezithwele izinto zazo), bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E ekubaleni okusha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi phinda izimaki\u003C/a\u003E. Izinto osebenzisa emsebenzini wonke, zigcine ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Eumtapo wentengo\u003C/a\u003E wakho bese uzengeza kuwo, noma engeza \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Eiphakethe lomkhakha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"New ivala yonke i-PDF bese iqala ukubala okungenalutho ekhasini elifanayo. Londoloza ukubala kwamanje uma ufuna ukukugcina: Save takeoff noma Ctrl+S. Khetha New eqenjini le-File. Uma kukhona izinguquko ezingalondoloziwe, i-TakeoffCraft ibuza Unsaved takeoff: khetha Save takeoff first (ilanda iphrojekthi, bese isula), Discard changes, noma Cancel. Iwindi libuyela esimweni salo esingenalutho: akukho ma-PDF, akukho zinto, akukho zimaki, akukho zikali. Ibha yesimo ithi \"Ukubala okusha. Vula ama-PDF ukuze uqale.\" Okusulwayo: yonke i-PDF evuliwe, amashidi nezithonjana zawo, izinto, izinhlanganisela, izimaki nezikali, izoom nendawo yeshidi ngayinye, umlando wokuhlehlisa (awukwazi ukuhlehlisa i-New), imodi yejika, nanoma yiluphi usesho lokubala okuzenzakalelayo noma ukubuyekeza. Amafayela akho ediskini awathintwa. Ukuze uthole kabusha ukubala kwakudala, vula i-.takeoff.json yakho kanye ne-PDF: bona Londoloza futhi uvule kabusha ukubala. Ukubala okusha ngakunye kuqala ngaphandle kwezinto. Ukuze uzise izinto, zikopishe kuqala: Copy item ngaphansi kwe-Items (noma kopisha izimaki, ezithwele izinto zazo), bese Paste ekubaleni okusha. Bona Kopisha, namathisela futhi phinda izimaki. Izinto osebenzisa emsebenzini wonke, zigcine ku-umtapo wentengo wakho bese uzengeza kuwo, noma engeza iphakethe lomkhakha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Thumela ukubuka kwe-3D njenge-USD","summary":"Bhala izindonga, amaslabhu, amapuleti nemigqa yokubuka kokuhlola kwe-3D njengephakheji ye-USD, ngalinye nento yalo nenani lalo.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","thumela","3d","ukubuka kokuhlola","izindonga","amaslabhu","ukwenza"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKububukeko be-3D sokuhlola, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji ye-USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto ngayinye (udonga, islabhu, ipuleti, ipositi yokubala noma umugqa) iyinto eyodwa efayelini, iqanjwe ngegama lento yayo, iphethe igama lento nenani elilinganiswe ukubuka. Amaslabhu namapuleti abonakala njengalokho okusebukweni. Ifayela lisemamitheni, nokuphakama kuyi-Z ephezulu.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kububukeko be-3D sokuhlola, khetha Iphakheji ye-USD (.usdz) eduze kwe-GLB. Into ngayinye (udonga, islabhu, ipuleti, ipositi yokubala noma umugqa) iyinto eyodwa efayelini, iqanjwe ngegama lento yayo, iphethe igama lento nenani elilinganiswe ukubuka. Amaslabhu namapuleti abonakala njengalokho okusebukweni. Ifayela lisemamitheni, nokuphakama kuyi-Z ephezulu.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ukusuka kwezinye izinhlelo zokubala amanani","summary":"Indlela izinkambiso zezinhlelo zokubala amanani ezigxile kuzo nezamathuluzi okumaka i-PDF ezihlangana ngayo ne-TakeoffCraft, nemehluko edida abantu.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["ukushintsha","ukudlulisa","izimo","izingxenye","amathuluzi okulinganisa","uhlu lwezimpawu","uxhumano lwamanani","izinkambiso zokubala","umehluko","qhathanisa"],"headings":[{"id":"izinkambiso-ezihlanganiswe","text":"Izinkambiso ezihlanganiswe","level":2},{"id":"umehluko-odida-abantu","text":"Umehluko odida abantu","level":2},{"id":"akukakatholakali-okwamanje","text":"Akukakatholakali okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUma usuke wenza ukubala amanani nge-PlanSwift noma ngezamathuluzi okulinganisa e-Bluebeam Revu, iningi le-TakeoffCraft lizokuzwakala lijwayelekile: isethi yamapulani, isikali ngeshidi ngalinye, izinto ozilinganisayo, nesamba esibalwe ngamanani. Indlela izingxenye ezihlanganiswa ngayo ihluke kwezinye izindawo, nalezo zindawo zilandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma wazi i-PlanSwift noma i-On-Screen Takeoff, khetha isitayela semenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdeskithophu yokubala\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/span\u003E: ibha yemenyu enoFayela, Hlela, Ukubuka, Isikali, Ukubala amanani, Izinto, Ukumaka kanye ne-Thumela phezu komugqa wamathuluzi okubala amanani, nezilungiselelo zesikali ebhalweni leshidi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkambiso-ezihlanganiswe\"\u003EIzinkambiso ezihlanganiswe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjwayele\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-TakeoffCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula umsebenzi noma iphrojekthi egcina amapulani (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ama-PDF nefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ecaleni komunye. Iphrojekthi igcina ukubala amanani kuphela; ama-PDF asalokhu eyizifayela zakho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lokumaka olunamanothi, amafu nokugqamisa (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkumaka\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni leshidi: amanothi, amafu nokugqamisa anesimo (Ivulekile, Iphendulwe, Ivaliwe), adwetshwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkumaka\u003C/strong\u003E futhi abonakale ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF emakwe\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/markups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/markups\"\u003EAmanothi, amafu nokugqamisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ezigcinwe njengezimpawu ngaphakathi kwe-PDF (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubala amanani kuhlala ku-fayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF emakwe\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ikhophi enokubala amanani edwetshiwe, yokwabelana; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ikhophi equkethe ukubala amanani, ukuze uyivule futhi ku-TakeoffCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zokubala amanani (PlanSwift), amathuluzi okulinganisa angokwezifiso agcinwe ku-Tool Chest (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E: igama, uhlobo, umbala, iyunithi, ukuphakama noma ukujula, ukulahleka, amazinga entengo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye nezinhlanganisela ezinamafomula (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E wento: izingxenye ezinefomula elisebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003EL H A N P\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusetha isikali sephepha, noma ukulinganisa (kokubili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikali\u003C/span\u003E, ngeshidi ngalinye. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa ubukhulu obaziwayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusebenzisa isikali esisodwa kuhla lwamakhasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakatholakali: setha ishidi ngalinye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafasitela okubuka anezikali ezihlukene ebhodini elilodwa (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukakatholakali: isikali esisodwa ngeshidi ngalinye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathuluzi obude bephola-layini nendawo (Bluebeam), ukubala amanani komugqa nendawo (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubamba i-Shift emigqeni eqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibambelela ezinyathelweni ezingu-45°, umqondo ofanayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubambelela emigqeni yomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuvulwe ngokuzenzakalelayo: iziphetho, amaphakathi, izimpambano nephoyinti eliseduze emgqeni, ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyivala, njengakuzinhlelo ze-CAD.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthuluzi lokubala (kokubili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusesha ngokubona izimfanekiso (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): bopha isimfanekiso esisodwa, hlola, bese wengeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImbobo noma ukukhishwa ezindaweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) kwindawo ekhethiwe, kanye nembobo ezungezile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhishwa emigqeni eqondile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba umugqa uqonde ngqo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhipha\u003C/span\u003E) ukuze kukhishwe imbobo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003ELinganisa imigqa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingxenye zejika ku-polyline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIjika\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): chofoza iphoyinti ejikeni, bese ukuphela kwalo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwezimaka nezikholomu zamanani (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthebula le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgento\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgeshidi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgridi lokulinganisa nentengo (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthebula elifanayo: ukulahleka, impahla nomsebenzi ngeyunithi, izamba eziphelele, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsamba somsebenzi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela ku-Excel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E enamafomula aphilayo, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-Escape ukumisa ithuluzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhansela futhi ibuyele ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ngesokudla ukuqeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla kuqeda umugqa noma kuvala indawo nakhu. Ayikho imenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umehluko-odida-abantu\"\u003EUmehluko odida abantu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubala amanani akusoze kube ngaphakathi kwe-PDF yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho okwenzayo okushintsha ama-PDF akho. Londoloza ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ugcine lona eduze kwemidwebo. Ukuthumela omunye umuntu i-PDF emakwe akumthumeli ukubala amanani okuhleleka: thumela ifayela lephrojekthi namaPDF oqobo, noma i-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EI-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-PDF ahlanganiswa ngokuqukethwe, hhayi ngegama.\u003C/strong\u003E Ishidi elibuyekeziwe elilondolozwe phezu kwegama lefayela elidala liyifayela elisha ku-TakeoffCraft, elingenasikali nezimpawu. Izimpawu zakho ezindala zihlala kunguqulo endala futhi ziqhubeka zibalwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ELondoloza uphinde uvule ukubala amanani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimpawu ezingenasikali azishiywa ngaphandle, azibalwa njengo-zero.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma ishidi lingenasikali, imigqa nezindawo zalo azibalwa, nethebula lithi &quot;Akuphelele&quot;. Emaphrogramu amaningi wawuzobona u-0 kuphela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho ukuqagela usayizi wephepha.\u003C/strong\u003E Okusethiwe ngaphambili kuthatha ukuthi i-PDF iphrintwe ngosayizi ogcwele. I-PDF engosayizi wengxenye noma e-&quot;fit to page&quot; idinga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInto eyodwa, uhlobo oluyinhloko olulodwa, eminingi uma ucela.\u003C/strong\u003E Into iyumugqa, indawo noma inani, futhi uhlobo lwayo luyavaleka uma seluneziimpawu. Imo enikeza indawo nomgangatho wayo ingumbandela wendawo: umgangatho wayo uyinguqukayo \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E. Udonga olunobude nendawo luyinto yomugqa enokuphakama. Ngento enezimo eziningi, njengegumbi elinephansi, ibhezi nezimnyango, khetha ezinye izinhlobo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuthi ukale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: ngayinye ibhalwa ngemugqa wayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EInto eyodwa, izinhlobo eziningi zezimpawu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafomula asebenza ngamasamba.\u003C/strong\u003E Amafomula omhlanganisela asebenzisa amasamba ento ezindaweni zonke, hhayi umugqa ngamunye ngokwawo. I-\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (inani lemigqa noma lezindawo) ikhona ngezengezo zomugqa ngamunye, njengesitudi esengeziwe ngodonga ngalunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmgangatho uhlanganisa imbobo.\u003C/strong\u003E I-\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E yendawo yengeza imiphetho yezimbobo zayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#read-the-area\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"read-the-area\"\u003ELinganisa izindawo ezinembobo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudonsa kushelelisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukudonsa ngenkinobho yesokunxele eshidini kushelelisa, kuwo wonke amathuluzi ngaphandle kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E. Akudingeki ushintshe ube uthuluzi lokushelelisa. Ivili lisondeza; ayisikroli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhophi yokubuyisa, hhayi i-cloud.\u003C/strong\u003E I-TakeoffCraft igcina ikhophi yomsebenzi wakho kulesi siphequluli futhi iwubuyisele ngemva kokuhlehla (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\"\u003EUma ithebhu noma isiphequluli simisa\u003C/a\u003E), kodwa ukubala amanani kuwe ukulondoloza: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKonke kusesiphequluli.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho okufakwayo, namapulani awakaze alayishwe. Ngohlelo lwe-desktop, i-TakeoffCraft itholakala ku-CadCraft Studio, namanye ama-app ayisikhombisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakatholakali-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukakatholakali okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzifunda zesikali ngeshidi ngalinye azikakhiwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E ngohlu olugcwele nokufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uma usuke wenza ukubala amanani nge-PlanSwift noma ngezamathuluzi okulinganisa e-Bluebeam Revu, iningi le-TakeoffCraft lizokuzwakala lijwayelekile: isethi yamapulani, isikali ngeshidi ngalinye, izinto ozilinganisayo, nesamba esibalwe ngamanani. Indlela izingxenye ezihlanganiswa ngayo ihluke kwezinye izindawo, nalezo zindawo zilandelayo. Uma wazi i-PlanSwift noma i-On-Screen Takeoff, khetha isitayela semenyu Ideskithophu yokubala ku-Izilungiselelo › TakeoffCraft › Imenyu, okhiye nemouse: ibha yemenyu enoFayela, Hlela, Ukubuka, Isikali, Ukubala amanani, Izinto, Ukumaka kanye ne-Thumela phezu komugqa wamathuluzi okubala amanani, nezilungiselelo zesikali ebhalweni leshidi. Bona Imenyu, okhiye nemouse. Izinkambiso ezihlanganiswe Ujwayele Ku-TakeoffCraft Ukuvula umsebenzi noma iphrojekthi egcina amapulani (PlanSwift) Vula ama-PDF nefayela le-.takeoff.json ecaleni komunye. Iphrojekthi igcina ukubala amanani kuphela; ama-PDF asalokhu eyizifayela zakho. Uhlu lokumaka olunamanothi, amafu nokugqamisa (Bluebeam) Ukumaka ebhalweni leshidi: amanothi, amafu nokugqamisa anesimo (Ivulekile, Iphendulwe, Ivaliwe), adwetshwa ngaphansi kwe-Ukumaka futhi abonakale ku-I-PDF emakwe. Bona Amanothi, amafu nokugqamisa. Izilinganiso ezigcinwe njengezimpawu ngaphakathi kwe-PDF (Bluebeam) Ukubala amanani kuhlala ku-fayela le-.takeoff.json. I-PDF emakwe ibhala ikhophi enokubala amanani edwetshiwe, yokwabelana; I-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi ibhala ikhophi equkethe ukubala amanani, ukuze uyivule futhi ku-TakeoffCraft. Izinto zokubala amanani (PlanSwift), amathuluzi okulinganisa angokwezifiso agcinwe ku-Tool Chest (Bluebeam) Izinto ngaphansi kwe-Izinto: igama, uhlobo, umbala, iyunithi, ukuphakama noma ukujula, ukulahleka, amazinga entengo. Izingxenye nezinhlanganisela ezinamafomula (PlanSwift) Umhlanganisela wento: izingxenye ezinefomula elisebenzisa L H A N P. Ukusetha isikali sephepha, noma ukulinganisa (kokubili) Uhlu lwe-Okusethiwe ngaphambili noma Linganisa eqenjini le-Isikali, ngeshidi ngalinye. Hlola ilinganisa ubukhulu obaziwayo. Ukusebenzisa isikali esisodwa kuhla lwamakhasi Akukakatholakali: setha ishidi ngalinye. Amafasitela okubuka anezikali ezihlukene ebhodini elilodwa (Bluebeam) Akukakatholakali: isikali esisodwa ngeshidi ngalinye. Amathuluzi obude bephola-layini nendawo (Bluebeam), ukubala amanani komugqa nendawo (PlanSwift) Umugqa (L) kanye ne-Indawo (A). Ukubamba i-Shift emigqeni eqondile Shift ibambelela ezinyathelweni ezingu-45°, umqondo ofanayo. Ukubambelela emigqeni yomdwebo Kuvulwe ngokuzenzakalelayo: iziphetho, amaphakathi, izimpambano nephoyinti eliseduze emgqeni, ne-F3 ukuyivala, njengakuzinhlelo ze-CAD. Ithuluzi lokubala (kokubili) Bala (C). Ukusesha ngokubona izimfanekiso (Bluebeam) Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo (S): bopha isimfanekiso esisodwa, hlola, bese wengeza. Imbobo noma ukukhishwa ezindaweni Imbobo (X) kwindawo ekhethiwe, kanye nembobo ezungezile. Ukukhishwa emigqeni eqondile Dweba umugqa uqonde ngqo bese ucindezela E (Ukukhipha) ukuze kukhishwe imbobo. Bona Linganisa imigqa. Izingxenye zejika ku-polyline Ijika (R): chofoza iphoyinti ejikeni, bese ukuphela kwalo. Uhlu lwezimaka nezikholomu zamanani (Bluebeam) Ithebula le-Amanani, Ngento noma Ngeshidi. Igridi lokulinganisa nentengo (PlanSwift) Ithebula elifanayo: ukulahleka, impahla nomsebenzi ngeyunithi, izamba eziphelele, kanye ne-Isamba somsebenzi. Ukuthumela ku-Excel XLSX enamafomula aphilayo, noma CSV. I-Escape ukumisa ithuluzi Esc ikhansela futhi ibuyele ku-Khetha. Chofoza ngesokudla ukuqeda Ukuchofoza ngesokudla kuqeda umugqa noma kuvala indawo nakhu. Ayikho imenyu yokuchofoza ngesokudla. Umehluko odida abantu Ukubala amanani akusoze kube ngaphakathi kwe-PDF yakho. Akukho okwenzayo okushintsha ama-PDF akho. Londoloza ifayela le-.takeoff.json ugcine lona eduze kwemidwebo. Ukuthumela omunye umuntu i-PDF emakwe akumthumeli ukubala amanani okuhleleka: thumela ifayela lephrojekthi namaPDF oqobo, noma i-I-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi. Ama-PDF ahlanganiswa ngokuqukethwe, hhayi ngegama. Ishidi elibuyekeziwe elilondolozwe phezu kwegama lefayela elidala liyifayela elisha ku-TakeoffCraft, elingenasikali nezimpawu. Izimpawu zakho ezindala zihlala kunguqulo endala futhi ziqhubeka zibalwa. Bona Londoloza uphinde uvule ukubala amanani. Izimpawu ezingenasikali azishiywa ngaphandle, azibalwa njengo-zero. Uma ishidi lingenasikali, imigqa nezindawo zalo azibalwa, nethebula lithi \"Akuphelele\". Emaphrogramu amaningi wawuzobona u-0 kuphela. Bona Setha isikali. Akukho ukuqagela usayizi wephepha. Okusethiwe ngaphambili kuthatha ukuthi i-PDF iphrintwe ngosayizi ogcwele. I-PDF engosayizi wengxenye noma e-\"fit to page\" idinga Linganisa. Sebenzisa Hlola njalo. Into eyodwa, uhlobo oluyinhloko olulodwa, eminingi uma ucela. Into iyumugqa, indawo noma inani, futhi uhlobo lwayo luyavaleka uma seluneziimpawu. Imo enikeza indawo nomgangatho wayo ingumbandela wendawo: umgangatho wayo uyinguqukayo P. Udonga olunobude nendawo luyinto yomugqa enokuphakama. Ngento enezimo eziningi, njengegumbi elinephansi, ibhezi nezimnyango, khetha ezinye izinhlobo ngaphansi kwe-Futhi ukale: ngayinye ibhalwa ngemugqa wayo. Bona Into eyodwa, izinhlobo eziningi zezimpawu. Amafomula asebenza ngamasamba. Amafomula omhlanganisela asebenzisa amasamba ento ezindaweni zonke, hhayi umugqa ngamunye ngokwawo. I-N (inani lemigqa noma lezindawo) ikhona ngezengezo zomugqa ngamunye, njengesitudi esengeziwe ngodonga ngalunye. Umgangatho uhlanganisa imbobo. I-P yendawo yengeza imiphetho yezimbobo zayo. Bona Linganisa izindawo ezinembobo. Ukudonsa kushelelisa. Ukudonsa ngenkinobho yesokunxele eshidini kushelelisa, kuwo wonke amathuluzi ngaphandle kwe-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo. Akudingeki ushintshe ube uthuluzi lokushelelisa. Ivili lisondeza; ayisikroli. Ikhophi yokubuyisa, hhayi i-cloud. I-TakeoffCraft igcina ikhophi yomsebenzi wakho kulesi siphequluli futhi iwubuyisele ngemva kokuhlehla (Uma ithebhu noma isiphequluli simisa), kodwa ukubala amanani kuwe ukulondoloza: Ctrl+S. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje. Konke kusesiphequluli. Akukho okufakwayo, namapulani awakaze alayishwe. Ngohlelo lwe-desktop, i-TakeoffCraft itholakala ku-CadCraft Studio, namanye ama-app ayisikhombisa. Akukakatholakali okwamanje Izifunda zesikali ngeshidi ngalinye azikakhiwa. Bona Okungakakhiwa ngohlu olugcwele nokufanele wenze esikhundleni salokho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft","summary":"Bonisa amayintshi kuya ku-1/16, 1/8 noma 1/4, qala izinto ezintsha ngephesenti lokulahleka, khetha lapho isilayidi se-Auto count siqala khona, bambelela emigqeni yedrowing noma ku-45° ngaphandle kokubamba i-Shift, setha ububanzi bomnyango ogcwaliswa yi-Room fill, bese ukhetha isikhombi sekhona se-3D.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["izilungiselelo","okukhethwayo","okuzikhethela","ukunemba","amafrakshini","amayintshi","ukuzungeza","ukulahleka","ukulahleka okuzenzakalelayo","auto count","ukuvala","match","isilayidi","bambelela","45","ikona","shift","ikhyubhu lokubuka","isithonjana se-axis","ikhona","3d"],"headings":[{"id":"amayunithi-amafiti-namayintshi","text":"Amayunithi amafiti namayintshi","level":2},{"id":"ukulahleka-okuqalayo","text":"Ukulahleka okuqalayo","level":2},{"id":"auto-count-lapho-isilayidi-sokufana-siqala-khona","text":"Auto count: lapho isilayidi sokufana siqala khona","level":2},{"id":"bambelela-emigqeni-yedrowing","text":"Bambelela emigqeni yedrowing","level":2},{"id":"room-fill-ububanzi-bokuvala-obuvalwa","text":"Room fill: ububanzi bokuvala obuvalwa","level":2},{"id":"bambelela-ku-45-ngaphandle-kokubamba-i-shift","text":"Bambelela ku-45° ngaphandle kokubamba i-Shift","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-wophawu-lokubala","text":"Usayizi wophawu lokubala","level":2},{"id":"isikhombi-sekhona","text":"Isikhombi sekhona","level":2},{"id":"ithuluzi-lendlela-igebe-elikhulu-kakhulu-lokuhlanganisa","text":"Ithuluzi lendlela: igebe elikhulu kakhulu lokuhlanganisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E ngegiya ebhala lokusebenza noma ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ithebhu yokuqala, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E, ibamba izilungiselelo zalolu hlelo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E ibamba ezabelwana yiyo yonke i-CadCraft (itimu, amaphaneli, ibha yamathuluzi). Izilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft zikhona kuhlelo kuphela: ziguqulwa lapha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyazikhumbula. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffCraft settings\u003C/span\u003E ziyabuyisela ekuqaleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amayunithi-amafiti-namayintshi\"\u003EAmayunithi amafiti namayintshi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBonisa ubude kuya eduze kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003E1/16&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (okokuqala), \u003Cstrong\u003E1/8&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003E1/4&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E. Lokhu kushintsha indlela ubude obufundeka ngayo eshidini, emaphaneli, emananini nasebhalini lesimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubonisa kuzungezwa kuphela. Amanani, izindleko nokuthunyelwa kubalwa ngobude obunembile, futhi ukuthunyelwa kubonisa njalo u-1/16&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulahleka-okuqalayo\"\u003EUkulahleka okuqalayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphesenti lokulahleka ngalinye into entsha eqala ngalo: 0% (okokuqala), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% noma 20%. Usakwazi ukuthayipha ukulahleka okunye ngento ngayinye, kumhleli wento noma ngqo kuthebula lamanani. Izinto osezinazo zigcina ukulahleka kwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count-lapho-isilayidi-sokufana-siqala-khona\"\u003EAuto count: lapho isilayidi sokufana siqala khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho isilayidi se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E sihlala khona ngesikhathi ukusesha kwe-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/a\u003E kuphela, kusukela kuma-50% kuya kuma-95%; 75% kuyokuqala. Okuphansi kunikeza abafanayo abaningi ukuze ubenqabe; okuphezulu kunikeza abambalwa. Usakwazi ukuhambisa isilayidi ngesikhathi sokubuyekeza ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bambelela-emigqeni-yedrowing\"\u003EBambelela emigqeni yedrowing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIvulekile ekuqaleni. Ngesikhathi ulinganisa noma ulinganisa, indawo eseduze komugqa we-PDF iyagxumela esiphethweni sawo, eyiphakathi, kumaphuzu okuhlangana noma endaweni eseduze kuwo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E ebhalweni lesimo nazo ziyakuvula noma zikucime. Okwengeziwe: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EBambelela emigqeni yedrowing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"room-fill-ububanzi-bokuvala-obuvalwa\"\u003ERoom fill: ububanzi bokuvala obuvalwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom fill closes openings up to\u003C/span\u003E isetha ukuthi umnyango noma igebe elibanzi kangakanani okuthathwa ithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E njengelivaliwe: 3&#039;-0&quot; kuya ku-8&#039;-0&quot;, 4&#039;-0&quot; ekuqaleni. Okubanzi kunomnyango wakho omkhulu kakhulu kuvumela igumbi lidlule kelinye; okuncane kunomnyango kushiya igumbi livulekile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#fill-a-room-with-one-click\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"fill-a-room-with-one-click\"\u003EGcwalisa igumbi ngokuchofoza kanye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bambelela-ku-45-ngaphandle-kokubamba-i-shift\"\u003EBambelela ku-45° ngaphandle kokubamba i-Shift\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIcimile ekuqaleni. Uma ivuliwe, imigqa, izinkomba, ukusikwa nezikhona ezidonsiwe ziya ku-0°, 45°, 90° noma 135° kusukela esiphethweni sokugcina ngaphandle kokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuchofoza ngeyiphi ingosi. Ibha yesimo ifunda &quot;Ibambelela ku-45°; Shift ikhulula ingosi&quot;. Indawo ochofoza kuyo echibini lesiyingi nemibhoxo ayisoze ibanjwe; isiphetho sesiyingi siyabanjwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-wophawu-lokubala\"\u003EUsayizi wophawu lokubala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmachashaza okubala akhulu kangakanani: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtra small\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMedium\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala: usayizi amachashaza ayehlale enawo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge\u003C/span\u003E. Usayizi uhlala esikrinini kuzo zonke izinga lokukhulisa, futhi i-PDF emakiwe idweba ichashaza ngalinye ngosayizi ofanayo ephepheni, noma ngabe ishidi likhulu kangakanani, ngakho i-PDF ku-100% ibukeka njengesikrini. Okwengeziwe: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand#dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-hash=\"dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\"\u003EBala ngesandla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikhombi-sekhona\"\u003EIsikhombi sekhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYe-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003Eukubuka kwe-3D ukuhlola\u003C/a\u003E kuphela: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView cube\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala: ikhyubhu ekhoneni eliphezulu kwesokudla lokuchofoza, lokudonsa nokujikeza), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis icon\u003C/span\u003E (uphawu olunkulu lwe-X, Y, Z ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENone\u003C/span\u003E. Ishintsha ngokushesha futhi igcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Ishidi elilingeneyo alisoze libonise lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ithuluzi-lendlela-igebe-elikhulu-kakhulu-lokuhlanganisa\"\u003EIthuluzi lendlela: igebe elikhulu kakhulu lokuhlanganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath tool: largest gap to join\u003C/span\u003E kuyisimo sokuthi imiphetho yemigqa emibili ingaba kanye kangakanani futhi ibaleke njengendlela eyodwa, ngamaphuwenti e-PDF (0.05 kuya ku-60; 1.5 ekuqaleni). Imigqa yedrowing ivame ukuyeka ingasaphelele eduze komunye. Okukhulu kuhlanganisa kakhulu; okuncane kugcina imigqa ihlukene. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ziyayishintsha ngenkathi ukhetha, futhi lolu hlu luyalandela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EKhetha imigqa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula Settings ngegiya ebhala lokusebenza noma ngo-Ctrl+,. Ithebhu yokuqala, TakeoffCraft, ibamba izilungiselelo zalolu hlelo; General ibamba ezabelwana yiyo yonke i-CadCraft (itimu, amaphaneli, ibha yamathuluzi). Izilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft zikhona kuhlelo kuphela: ziguqulwa lapha, futhi lesi siphequluli siyazikhumbula. Reset TakeoffCraft settings ziyabuyisela ekuqaleni. Amayunithi amafiti namayintshi Bonisa ubude kuya eduze kwe-1/16\" (okokuqala), 1/8\" noma 1/4\". Lokhu kushintsha indlela ubude obufundeka ngayo eshidini, emaphaneli, emananini nasebhalini lesimo. Ukubonisa kuzungezwa kuphela. Amanani, izindleko nokuthunyelwa kubalwa ngobude obunembile, futhi ukuthunyelwa kubonisa njalo u-1/16\". Ukulahleka okuqalayo Iphesenti lokulahleka ngalinye into entsha eqala ngalo: 0% (okokuqala), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% noma 20%. Usakwazi ukuthayipha ukulahleka okunye ngento ngayinye, kumhleli wento noma ngqo kuthebula lamanani. Izinto osezinazo zigcina ukulahleka kwazo. Auto count: lapho isilayidi sokufana siqala khona Lapho isilayidi se-Match sihlala khona ngesikhathi ukusesha kwe-Auto count kuphela, kusukela kuma-50% kuya kuma-95%; 75% kuyokuqala. Okuphansi kunikeza abafanayo abaningi ukuze ubenqabe; okuphezulu kunikeza abambalwa. Usakwazi ukuhambisa isilayidi ngesikhathi sokubuyekeza ngasinye. Bambelela emigqeni yedrowing Ivulekile ekuqaleni. Ngesikhathi ulinganisa noma ulinganisa, indawo eseduze komugqa we-PDF iyagxumela esiphethweni sawo, eyiphakathi, kumaphuzu okuhlangana noma endaweni eseduze kuwo. F3 no-Snap ebhalweni lesimo nazo ziyakuvula noma zikucime. Okwengeziwe: Bambelela emigqeni yedrowing. Room fill: ububanzi bokuvala obuvalwa Room fill closes openings up to isetha ukuthi umnyango noma igebe elibanzi kangakanani okuthathwa ithuluzi le-Room njengelivaliwe: 3'-0\" kuya ku-8'-0\", 4'-0\" ekuqaleni. Okubanzi kunomnyango wakho omkhulu kakhulu kuvumela igumbi lidlule kelinye; okuncane kunomnyango kushiya igumbi livulekile. Bona Gcwalisa igumbi ngokuchofoza kanye. Bambelela ku-45° ngaphandle kokubamba i-Shift Icimile ekuqaleni. Uma ivuliwe, imigqa, izinkomba, ukusikwa nezikhona ezidonsiwe ziya ku-0°, 45°, 90° noma 135° kusukela esiphethweni sokugcina ngaphandle kokubamba Shift; bamba Shift ukuchofoza ngeyiphi ingosi. Ibha yesimo ifunda \"Ibambelela ku-45°; Shift ikhulula ingosi\". Indawo ochofoza kuyo echibini lesiyingi nemibhoxo ayisoze ibanjwe; isiphetho sesiyingi siyabanjwa. Usayizi wophawu lokubala Amachashaza okubala akhulu kangakanani: Extra small, Small, Medium (okokuqala: usayizi amachashaza ayehlale enawo) noma Large. Usayizi uhlala esikrinini kuzo zonke izinga lokukhulisa, futhi i-PDF emakiwe idweba ichashaza ngalinye ngosayizi ofanayo ephepheni, noma ngabe ishidi likhulu kangakanani, ngakho i-PDF ku-100% ibukeka njengesikrini. Okwengeziwe: Bala ngesandla. Isikhombi sekhona Ye-ukubuka kwe-3D ukuhlola kuphela: View cube (okokuqala: ikhyubhu ekhoneni eliphezulu kwesokudla lokuchofoza, lokudonsa nokujikeza), Axis icon (uphawu olunkulu lwe-X, Y, Z ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla) noma None. Ishintsha ngokushesha futhi igcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Ishidi elilingeneyo alisoze libonise lutho. Ithuluzi lendlela: igebe elikhulu kakhulu lokuhlanganisa Path tool: largest gap to join kuyisimo sokuthi imiphetho yemigqa emibili ingaba kanye kangakanani futhi ibaleke njengendlela eyodwa, ngamaphuwenti e-PDF (0.05 kuya ku-60; 1.5 ekuqaleni). Imigqa yedrowing ivame ukuyeka ingasaphelele eduze komunye. Okukhulu kuhlanganisa kakhulu; okuncane kugcina imigqa ihlukene. [ no-] ziyayishintsha ngenkathi ukhetha, futhi lolu hlu luyalandela. Bona Khetha imigqa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Imenyu, okhiye nemouse","summary":"Khetha isitayela semenyu esihambisana nendlela osuvele usebenza ngayo, nika noma yiliphi umyalo ukhiye wakho, hambisa imiyalo phakathi kwemenyu, bese usetha ukuthi ivili nezinkinobho zemouse zenzani.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["isitayela semenyu","imenyu","ibha yemenyu","ribhoni","amathebhu eribhoni","ibha yamathuluzi","izinqamuleli zekhibhodi","okhiye","lungisa","shintsha","mouse","ivili","phendula ukuskrola","inkinobho ephakathi","inkinobho yesokudla","shelelisa","export","import","ukushintsha","ejwayelekile","ideskithophu yokubala","izimo"],"headings":[{"id":"izitayela-ezintathu","text":"Izitayela ezintathu","level":2},{"id":"yenza-eyakho","text":"Yenza eyakho","level":2},{"id":"imouse","text":"Imouse","level":2},{"id":"yithathe-nawe","text":"Yithathe nawe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImiyalo ye-TakeoffCraft ifinyelelwa ngendlela efanayo noma ngabe uyifinyelela kanjani. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela semenyu\u003C/strong\u003E sinquma kuphela lapho ihlala khona esikrinini, ukuthi ibizwa ngani khona, nokuthi yiziphi izikhiye ezayisebenzisayo. Khetha esinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi sisekeli sesiphequluli siyakukhumbula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izitayela-ezintathu\"\u003EIzitayela ezintathu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStyle\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat you get\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yamathuluzi yayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, nezikhiye zezinhlamvu ezodwa zamathuluzi. Isiqalo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff desk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yemenyu (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E) phezu komugqa owodwa wamathuluzi okubala, njengendlela izinhlelo zokubala ezisekhompyutheni ezihlela ngayo amathuluzi azo. Izinto zibizwa ngokuthi izimo kulo mugqa. Okhiye abafanayo, kanye ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yesinto esisha. Izinkomba zesikali ziya ebhareni yeshidi, eduze kwesikali seshidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathebhu eribhoni aqanjwe ngomsebenzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E (linganisa, yenza umumo, isikali, kusuka emdwebeni, izimo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E (incwadi yokusebenza, ama-PDF amakwe, ithenda), nemenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E nomugqa osheshayo wokuvula, ukulondoloza, ukuhlehlisa nokuphinda. Amathuluzi osebenzisa usuku lonke ayakhulu, eziseduze zincane futhi zigxunyiwe. Okhiye abafanayo; izinkomba zesikali ziya ebhareni yeshidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZonke izitayela zintathu zigcina okhiye be-TakeoffCraft: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E khetha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umugqa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E indawo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isiyingi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igumbi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E indlela (khetha imigqa ye-PDF), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E imbobo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bala, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubala okuzenzakalelayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E linganisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hlola, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E imodi yejika, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E imodi yokukhipha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukulingana, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umbono wokuhlola we-3D, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuncamelana, kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi ebha yeshidi (amanothi, amafu, okuqaqambisiwe, Compare, 3D) alinde kuze kuvulwe i-PDF; uma akhethwa ngaphambi kwalokho, umugqa wesimo uyasho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkhiye okungowe-layout yeTakeoffCraft kodwa isitayela sakho sawunikeze umyalo ohlukile akwenzi lutho, nomugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi umyalo wawo uphi (&quot;Kuma-My keys, Count ingu-Ctrl+Alt+C&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nezimpondo zihlala zinencazelo yazo. Uma udweba umugqa noma isakhiwo, unamathisela noma ubuyekeze ukusesha okuzenzakalelayo, izinhlamvu nezinombolo zobude othayiphile zihlala nomdwebo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-eyakho\"\u003EYenza eyakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isitayela esiseduze kakhulu nalokho ofuna, bese ucofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECustomize…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys and menus\u003C/span\u003E, thola umyalo (ibhokisi lokusesha liyasiza), bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a key\u003C/span\u003E ucindezele ukhiye, noma izikhiye ezimbili ngokulandelana ukuze uthole ukhiye wezinhlamvu ezimbili. Cofa ukhiye ukuze uwususe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgebha yemenyu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhere it sits\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa umyalo kwenye imenyu, noma kwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys only\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E, setha ivili nezinkinobho ezihambisa ishidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYinike igama bese ucofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza isitayela esakhelwe ngaphambili kwenza ikhophi yakho (&quot;My Takeoff desk&quot;); eyakhelwe ngaphambili ayishintshi ngokuphelele. Ukhiye onikezwe imiyalo emibili ubonakala ebomvu futhi kufanele ulungiswe ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imouse\"\u003EImouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIvili le-mouse\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms in\u003C/span\u003E (isiqalo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms out\u003C/span\u003E, nokuthi lisheshe kangakanani. Ukuhlanganisa kwe-trackpad kusondeza njalo ngendlela eminwe yakho ehamba ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa ishidi nge-\u003C/strong\u003E: inkinobho ephakathi, inkinobho yesokudla, noma zombili. Ukudonsa kwesokunxele ephepheni elingenalutho kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokudonsa kushelelisa njalo; ukucofa ngesokudla ngaphandle kokudonsa kuqeda njalo umugqa noma isakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDonsa kumabhuyu e-3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach view&#039;s own\u003C/span\u003E igcina izinkinobho zombono wokuhlola we-3D (zesokunxele nezephakathi zizungeza, zesokudla zishelelisa). Noma misa izinkinobho eziphakathi nezesokudla zizungeze, zishelelise, zisondeze noma zingenzi lutho; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho iguqula ukuzungeza nokushelelisa. Inkinobho yesokunxele njalo izungeza futhi ikhethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yithathe-nawe\"\u003EYithathe nawe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport…\u003C/span\u003E iyengeza, kusuka kwenye ikhompyutha noma kumngane wakho. Ifayela elingeniswe lingasho imiyalo ye-TakeoffCraft kuphela: okunye kukho kuyasuswa futhi kubalwe kumugqa wesimo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete this style\u003C/span\u003E isusa eyakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi sisekeli sesiphequluli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this style in every app\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwamakhadi wezitayela yenza ukuthi zonke ii-app zivule esitayelweni sazo esifanayo (ibha yamathuluzi yazo, ibha yemenyu noma iribhoni), nezinguquko ozenzile kwi-app ngayinye. I-TakeoffCraft ayinaso isitayela esinomugqa womyalo: uma kukhethwa esinye sezinhlelo zonke, i-TakeoffCraft igcina ibha yayo yamathuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIribhoni yokubala (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E) iyiribhoni yesakhiwo se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E): bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EIsikrini se-TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlobene: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIkhibhodi nemouse\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EUkusuka kwezinye izinhlelo zokubala\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Imiyalo ye-TakeoffCraft ifinyelelwa ngendlela efanayo noma ngabe uyifinyelela kanjani. Isitayela semenyu sinquma kuphela lapho ihlala khona esikrinini, ukuthi ibizwa ngani khona, nokuthi yiziphi izikhiye ezayisebenzisayo. Khetha esinye ku-Settings (Ctrl+,) › TakeoffCraft › Menus, keys and mouse; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi sisekeli sesiphequluli siyakukhumbula. Izitayela ezintathu Style What you get TakeoffCraft Ibha yamathuluzi yayo: File, Export, Scale, Takeoff, Edit kanye View, nezikhiye zezinhlamvu ezodwa zamathuluzi. Isiqalo. Takeoff desk Ibha yemenyu (File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup, Export) phezu komugqa owodwa wamathuluzi okubala, njengendlela izinhlelo zokubala ezisekhompyutheni ezihlela ngayo amathuluzi azo. Izinto zibizwa ngokuthi izimo kulo mugqa. Okhiye abafanayo, kanye ne-N yesinto esisha. Izinkomba zesikali ziya ebhareni yeshidi, eduze kwesikali seshidi. Takeoff ribbon Amathebhu eribhoni aqanjwe ngomsebenzi: Takeoff (linganisa, yenza umumo, isikali, kusuka emdwebeni, izimo), Edit, View, Markup kanye ne-Estimate (incwadi yokusebenza, ama-PDF amakwe, ithenda), nemenyu ye-File nomugqa osheshayo wokuvula, ukulondoloza, ukuhlehlisa nokuphinda. Amathuluzi osebenzisa usuku lonke ayakhulu, eziseduze zincane futhi zigxunyiwe. Okhiye abafanayo; izinkomba zesikali ziya ebhareni yeshidi. Zonke izitayela zintathu zigcina okhiye be-TakeoffCraft: V khetha, L umugqa, A indawo, O isiyingi, B igumbi, P indlela (khetha imigqa ye-PDF), X imbobo, C bala, S ukubala okuzenzakalelayo, K linganisa, D hlola, R imodi yejika, E imodi yokukhipha, F no-W ukulingana, 3 umbono wokuhlola we-3D, F3 ukuncamelana, kanye no-Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Ctrl+A. Amathuluzi ebha yeshidi (amanothi, amafu, okuqaqambisiwe, Compare, 3D) alinde kuze kuvulwe i-PDF; uma akhethwa ngaphambi kwalokho, umugqa wesimo uyasho. Ukhiye okungowe-layout yeTakeoffCraft kodwa isitayela sakho sawunikeze umyalo ohlukile akwenzi lutho, nomugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi umyalo wawo uphi (\"Kuma-My keys, Count ingu-Ctrl+Alt+C\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space nezimpondo zihlala zinencazelo yazo. Uma udweba umugqa noma isakhiwo, unamathisela noma ubuyekeze ukusesha okuzenzakalelayo, izinhlamvu nezinombolo zobude othayiphile zihlala nomdwebo. Yenza eyakho Khetha isitayela esiseduze kakhulu nalokho ofuna, bese ucofa Customize…. Ku-Keys and menus, thola umyalo (ibhokisi lokusesha liyasiza), bese Add a key ucindezele ukhiye, noma izikhiye ezimbili ngokulandelana ukuze uthole ukhiye wezinhlamvu ezimbili. Cofa ukhiye ukuze uwususe. Ngebha yemenyu, Where it sits ihambisa umyalo kwenye imenyu, noma kwi-Keys only. Ku-Mouse, setha ivili nezinkinobho ezihambisa ishidi. Yinike igama bese ucofa Save. Ukulondoloza isitayela esakhelwe ngaphambili kwenza ikhophi yakho (\"My Takeoff desk\"); eyakhelwe ngaphambili ayishintshi ngokuphelele. Ukhiye onikezwe imiyalo emibili ubonakala ebomvu futhi kufanele ulungiswe ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze. Imouse Ivili le-mouse: Scroll up zooms in (isiqalo) noma Scroll up zooms out, nokuthi lisheshe kangakanani. Ukuhlanganisa kwe-trackpad kusondeza njalo ngendlela eminwe yakho ehamba ngayo. Hambisa ishidi nge-: inkinobho ephakathi, inkinobho yesokudla, noma zombili. Ukudonsa kwesokunxele ephepheni elingenalutho kanye no-Space nokudonsa kushelelisa njalo; ukucofa ngesokudla ngaphandle kokudonsa kuqeda njalo umugqa noma isakhiwo. Donsa kumabhuyu e-3D: Each view's own igcina izinkinobho zombono wokuhlola we-3D (zesokunxele nezephakathi zizungeza, zesokudla zishelelisa). Noma misa izinkinobho eziphakathi nezesokudla zizungeze, zishelelise, zisondeze noma zingenzi lutho; Shift nenkinobho iguqula ukuzungeza nokushelelisa. Inkinobho yesokunxele njalo izungeza futhi ikhethe. Yithathe nawe Export ilondoloza isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane le-.ccinput.json; Import… iyengeza, kusuka kwenye ikhompyutha noma kumngane wakho. Ifayela elingeniswe lingasho imiyalo ye-TakeoffCraft kuphela: okunye kukho kuyasuswa futhi kubalwe kumugqa wesimo. Delete this style isusa eyakho. Lezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi sisekeli sesiphequluli. Use this style in every app ngaphansi kwamakhadi wezitayela yenza ukuthi zonke ii-app zivule esitayelweni sazo esifanayo (ibha yamathuluzi yazo, ibha yemenyu noma iribhoni), nezinguquko ozenzile kwi-app ngayinye. I-TakeoffCraft ayinaso isitayela esinomugqa womyalo: uma kukhethwa esinye sezinhlelo zonke, i-TakeoffCraft igcina ibha yayo yamathuluzi. Iribhoni yokubala (Takeoff ribbon) iyiribhoni yesakhiwo se-Ribbon and project browser (Settings › Global › Layout): bona Isikrini se-TakeoffCraft. Okuhlobene: Ikhibhodi nemouse · Izilungiselelo ze-TakeoffCraft · Ukusuka kwezinye izinhlelo zokubala","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ikhibhodi nemouse","summary":"Zonke izinkinobho, imouse, i-trackpad kanye nezenzo zokuthinta ku-TakeoffCraft, zihlelwe, nomehluko wenkundla.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["okhiye","izinqamuleli","izinqamuleli zekhibhodi","ikhibhodi","imouse","trackpad","ukuthinta","shelelisa","sondeza","ivili","cofa ngesokudla","cofa kabili","isikhala","shift","kopisha","namathisela","sika","phinda","khetha konke"],"headings":[{"id":"amathuluzi","text":"Amathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"ngenkathi-udweba","text":"Ngenkathi udweba","level":2},{"id":"ukukhetha-nokuhlela","text":"Ukukhetha nokuhlela","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-namathisela","text":"Kopisha namathisela","level":2},{"id":"amafayela","text":"Amafayela","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-namashidi","text":"Ukubuka namashidi","level":2},{"id":"umbono-we-3d","text":"Umbono we-3D","level":2},{"id":"auto-count","text":"Auto count","level":2},{"id":"usizo","text":"Usizo","level":2},{"id":"amabhokisi-nezinkundla","text":"Amabhokisi nezinkundla","level":2},{"id":"amanothi-enkundla","text":"Amanothi enkundla","level":2},{"id":"okhiye-abagcinwe-yisiphequluli","text":"Okhiye abagcinwe yisiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kuhlala-khona-i-hambisa","text":"Lapho kuhlala khona i-Hambisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOkhiye bezinhlamvu basebenza uma ipointer isekhasini futhi ungathayipha ensimini. Uma ingxoxo ivuliwe, okhiye bayo basebenza. Izinhlamvu zisebenza ngaphandle noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathuluzi\"\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETool\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E (gcwalisa igumbi ngokucofa kanye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe noma icinyiwe (kuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E nase-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe noma icinyiwe: izigaba ezilandelayo zomugqa zidwetshwe kodwa azibalwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E ngesikhathi udweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ibhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E: thayipha ubude noma izixhumanisi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibeka iphoyinti (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#type-lengths-and-coordinates\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"type-lengths-and-coordinates\"\u003ELinganisa imigqa emide\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (khetha indawo kuqala)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E isikali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenkathi-udweba\"\u003ENgenkathi udweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey or action\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka iphoyinti (ichashazi, ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndlela: khetha yonke indlela exhunyiwe yomugqa we-PDF, noma umugqa ozungeze ukucofa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EKhetha imigqa ye-PDF\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuncamelana nemigqa yomdwebo kuyavulwa noma kuyavalwa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EUkuncamelana nemigqa yomdwebo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibanjiwe ngesikhathi ucofa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENcamelanisa isegimenti ibe ku-0°, 45°, 90° noma 135° kusuka ephointini lokugcina. Hhayi amaphoyinti ejika noma amasongo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeda umugqa, noma vala indawo noma imbobo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeda umugqa, noma vala indawo noma imbobo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa ngesokudla (ungahambisi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeda umugqa, noma vala indawo noma imbobo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa iphoyinti lokuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVala indawo noma imbobo (kusukela ephointini lesithathu).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa iphoyinti lokugcina (kuqala iphoyinti lejika elilindile).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELahla iphoyinti lejika elilindile; bese ukhansela uphawu olungaqedile; bese ubuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhetha-nokuhlela\"\u003EUkukhetha nokuhlela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey or action\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa imaki (ithuluzi lokukhetha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYikhethe futhi yenze into yayo ibe yamanje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + cofa imaki\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeze ekukhethweni, noma uyisuse.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha zonke izimaki esheetini evulekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa isibambo sekhona\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa leliphoyinti (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ncamelanisa ibe ngu-45°). Lisebenza uma imaki eyodwa ikhethiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa izimaki ezikhethiwe (uma ungadwetshi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUngakhethi lutho: sula ukukhetha nomugqa wokuhlola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda wenze.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-namathisela\"\u003EKopisha namathisela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha izimaki ezikhethiwe, nezinto zazo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESika: kopisha izimaki ezikhethiwe bese uzisusa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela: ikhophi ilandela ipointer; cofa lapho ifuna ukuya khona.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela endaweni efanayo: indawo efanayo esheetini evulekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda izimaki ezikhethiwe: ikhophi ilandela ipointer; cofa lapho ifuna ukuya khona.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUngabeki lutho: khansela ukunamathisela noma ukuphinda okusepointer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlamvu zodwa zisathatha amathuluzi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E); kuphela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nazo ikopisha futhi inamathisele. Ensimini yombhalo lezi zikhiye zikopisha futhi zinamathisele okhokho njengoba kujwayelekile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi phinda izimaki\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa imaki ekhethiwe uma ungadwetshi. Uma lokho kwenzeka ngephutha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyibuyisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zombili zisebenza noma ngabe uthayipha ensimini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-namashidi\"\u003EUkubuka namashidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey or action\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngaphakathi nangaphandle ngapointer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa (inkinobho yesokunxele, ephakathi noma yesokudla)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, ukudonsa kwesokunxele kudweba ibhokisi lokusesha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibanjiwe + donsa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa, kunoma yiliphi ithuluzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngaphakathi emaphakathi kombono.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngaphandle emaphakathi kombono.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi elilandelayo noma elidlule ohlwini lwamashidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda phakathi kwemodi yesikrini esigcwele (Control kuyo yonke imikhakha, nakuMac).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula noma vala lolu siza, iphaneli ecaleni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono wokuhlola we-3D wesheet, uvuliwe noma uvaliwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umbono-we-3d\"\u003EUmbono we-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey or action\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + donsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngapointer. Ku-trackpad, ukushayela ngeminwe emibili kuzungeza, nokuhlanganisa kusondeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha imaki ngaphansi kwepointer (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + cofa iyengeza noma iyasusa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza kukho konke okungaphakathi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuyela eshidini elilinganayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EHlola ukubala amanani nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey or action\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ibhokisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBhokisa uphawu ofuna ukulusesha (kuqala ukusesha).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECofa ibhokisi elifanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiyeqa, noma uliphindisele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhansela ukusesha okusebenzayo, noma lahla ukubuyekeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usizo\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula noma vala iphaneli yosizo (futhi inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni yohlelo). Isebenza kuwo wonke amathuluzi, nangesikhathi uthayipha ensimini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVala iphaneli yosizo. Ensimini yokusesha yayo, i-Esc yokuqala isula ukusesha. Uma iphaneli ivuliwe, i-Esc ecindezelwe ngemva kokucofa ishidi ivala iphaneli kuqala; cindezela futhi ukuze ukhansele ku-TakeoffCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ulawula ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela fn ne-F1, noma vula &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot; ku-System Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Keyboard.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amabhokisi-nezinkundla\"\u003EAmabhokisi nezinkundla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKey\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnsimini: faka inani. Kubhokisi lokulinganisa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVala ingxoxo (njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E); vala ifomu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHamba ensimini elandelayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi-enkundla\"\u003EAmanothi enkundla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingukhiye we-Command: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Isikrini esigcwele siyinto eyehlukile: Control+Shift+F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkucofa ngesokudla kuyi-two-finger click ku-trackpad, uma i-secondary click ivuliwe ku-System Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Trackpad. I-TakeoffCraft ifunda inkinobho yesibili kuphela; i-Control-click ingathathwa njengokucofa okuvamile futhi yengeze iphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ishidi (akulishayeli). Ukushelelisa, cindezela futhi udonse, noma bamba Space udonse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPage Up ne-Page Down ziyi-fn nezinkwa eziphezulu nezingaphansi kuma-keyboard angenazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBackspace yisikhiye esibhalwe delete.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-Ctrl: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-touchpad yelaptop, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza ishidi. Ukushelelisa, cindezela futhi udonse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-Ctrl. Amanye ama-desktop anezinqamuleli zawo ze-Ctrl+Alt noma Super; i-TakeoffCraft ayisebenzisi nalinye lazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-touchpad, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza ishidi. Ukushelelisa, cindezela futhi udonse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ifunda ukuthinta njengephoyinti elilodwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthinta kubeka iphoyinti, kukhetha imaki noma kwengeza ichashazi lokubala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkudonsa ngomunwe owodwa kushelelisa ishidi (ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E kudweba ibhokisi lokusesha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlanganisa ukusondeza akusasekelwa okwamanje. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ekhibhodini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvala indawo, thinta iphoyinti layo lokuqala. Ukuqeda umugqa, thinta kabili lapho isiphequluli sakho sishintsha ukuthinta kabili sibe yi-double-click, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ekhibhodini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho ukufunda kobude okuphilayo kuze kuthintwe, ngoba akukho hover.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhibhodi nemouse noma i-trackpad yindlela engcono yokubala namuhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye-abagcinwe-yisiphequluli\"\u003EOkhiye abagcinwe yisiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbasebenzisi bezinqamuleli ezithile, ngakho ikhasi alikwazi ukuzisebenzisa: ukuvala ithebhu (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ithebhu noma iwindi elisha (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), nokusondeza kwesiphequluli (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Yingakho i-TakeoffCraft isondeza ishidi nge-wheel nokhiye abayodwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Uma ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngephutha, ikhasi lonke liyakhula; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyilungisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EOkhiye, amamouse namatrackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kuhlala-khona-i-hambisa\"\u003ELapho kuhlala khona i-Hambisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAyikho imiyalo ethi Hambisa: khetha uphawu lokubala udonse, noma khetha indawo noma umugqa udonse izibambo zamakhona awo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okhiye bezinhlamvu basebenza uma ipointer isekhasini futhi ungathayipha ensimini. Uma ingxoxo ivuliwe, okhiye bayo basebenza. Izinhlamvu zisebenza ngaphandle noma nge-Shift. Amathuluzi Key Tool V Select L Linear A Area O Circle B Room (gcwalisa igumbi ngokucofa kanye) R Arc ivuliwe noma icinyiwe (kuthi Linear, Area nase-Cut-out) E Deduct ivuliwe noma icinyiwe: izigaba ezilandelayo zomugqa zidwetshwe kodwa azibalwa Inombolo, @ noma # ngesikhathi udweba Vula ibhokisi le-Type: thayipha ubude noma izixhumanisi, Enter ibeka iphoyinti (Linganisa imigqa emide) X Cut-out (khetha indawo kuqala) C Count S Auto count K Calibrate D Check isikali Ngenkathi udweba Key or action What it does Cofa Beka iphoyinti (ichashazi, ngo-Count). P Indlela: khetha yonke indlela exhunyiwe yomugqa we-PDF, noma umugqa ozungeze ukucofa (Khetha imigqa ye-PDF). F3 Ukuncamelana nemigqa yomdwebo kuyavulwa noma kuyavalwa (Ukuncamelana nemigqa yomdwebo). Shift ibanjiwe ngesikhathi ucofa Ncamelanisa isegimenti ibe ku-0°, 45°, 90° noma 135° kusuka ephointini lokugcina. Hhayi amaphoyinti ejika noma amasongo. Cofa kabili Qeda umugqa, noma vala indawo noma imbobo. Enter Qeda umugqa, noma vala indawo noma imbobo. Cofa ngesokudla (ungahambisi) Qeda umugqa, noma vala indawo noma imbobo. Cofa iphoyinti lokuqala Vala indawo noma imbobo (kusukela ephointini lesithathu). Backspace noma Delete Susa iphoyinti lokugcina (kuqala iphoyinti lejika elilindile). Esc Lahla iphoyinti lejika elilindile; bese ukhansela uphawu olungaqedile; bese ubuyela ku-Select. Ukukhetha nokuhlela Key or action What it does Cofa imaki (ithuluzi lokukhetha) Yikhethe futhi yenze into yayo ibe yamanje. Shift + cofa imaki Yengeze ekukhethweni, noma uyisuse. Ctrl+A Khetha zonke izimaki esheetini evulekile. Donsa isibambo sekhona Hambisa leliphoyinti (Shift ncamelanisa ibe ngu-45°). Lisebenza uma imaki eyodwa ikhethiwe. Delete noma Backspace Susa izimaki ezikhethiwe (uma ungadwetshi). Esc Ungakhethi lutho: sula ukukhetha nomugqa wokuhlola. Ctrl+Z Undo. Ctrl+Y noma Ctrl+Shift+Z Phinda wenze. Kopisha namathisela Key What it does Ctrl+C Kopisha izimaki ezikhethiwe, nezinto zazo. Ctrl+X Sika: kopisha izimaki ezikhethiwe bese uzisusa. Ctrl+V Namathisela: ikhophi ilandela ipointer; cofa lapho ifuna ukuya khona. Ctrl+Shift+V Namathisela endaweni efanayo: indawo efanayo esheetini evulekile. Ctrl+D Phinda izimaki ezikhethiwe: ikhophi ilandela ipointer; cofa lapho ifuna ukuya khona. Esc Ungabeki lutho: khansela ukunamathisela noma ukuphinda okusepointer. Izinhlamvu zodwa zisathatha amathuluzi (C ingu-Count, D ingu-Check, X ingu-Cut-out, V ingu-Select, A ingu-Area); kuphela Ctrl nazo ikopisha futhi inamathisele. Ensimini yombhalo lezi zikhiye zikopisha futhi zinamathisele okhokho njengoba kujwayelekile. Bona Kopisha, namathisela futhi phinda izimaki. Backspace isusa imaki ekhethiwe uma ungadwetshi. Uma lokho kwenzeka ngephutha, Ctrl+Z iyibuyisela. Amafayela Key What it does Ctrl+O Open plans Ctrl+S Save takeoff Lezi zombili zisebenza noma ngabe uthayipha ensimini. Ukubuka namashidi Key or action What it does Mouse wheel Sondeza ngaphakathi nangaphandle ngapointer. Donsa (inkinobho yesokunxele, ephakathi noma yesokudla) Shelelisa. Ku-Auto count, ukudonsa kwesokunxele kudweba ibhokisi lokusesha. Space ibanjiwe + donsa Shelelisa, kunoma yiliphi ithuluzi. F Fit page W Fit width + noma = Sondeza ngaphakathi emaphakathi kombono. − Sondeza ngaphandle emaphakathi kombono. Page Down / Page Up Ishidi elilandelayo noma elidlule ohlwini lwamashidi. Ctrl+Shift+F Phinda phakathi kwemodi yesikrini esigcwele (Control kuyo yonke imikhakha, nakuMac). F1 Vula noma vala lolu siza, iphaneli ecaleni. 3 Umbono wokuhlola we-3D wesheet, uvuliwe noma uvaliwe. Umbono we-3D Key or action What it does Donsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi Zungeza. Shift + donsa, noma donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla Shelelisa. Mouse wheel Sondeza ngapointer. Ku-trackpad, ukushayela ngeminwe emibili kuzungeza, nokuhlanganisa kusondeza. Cofa Khetha imaki ngaphansi kwepointer (Shift + cofa iyengeza noma iyasusa). F noma W Sondeza kukho konke okungaphakathi. 3 Buyela eshidini elilinganayo. Bona Hlola ukubala amanani nge-3D. Auto count Key or action What it does Donsa ibhokisi Bhokisa uphawu ofuna ukulusesha (kuqala ukusesha). Cofa ibhokisi elifanayo Liyeqa, noma uliphindisele. Esc Khansela ukusesha okusebenzayo, noma lahla ukubuyekeza. Usizo Key What it does F1 Vula noma vala iphaneli yosizo (futhi inkinobho ye-Help ebhareni yohlelo). Isebenza kuwo wonke amathuluzi, nangesikhathi uthayipha ensimini. Esc Vala iphaneli yosizo. Ensimini yokusesha yayo, i-Esc yokuqala isula ukusesha. Uma iphaneli ivuliwe, i-Esc ecindezelwe ngemva kokucofa ishidi ivala iphaneli kuqala; cindezela futhi ukuze ukhansele ku-TakeoffCraft. Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ulawula ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela fn ne-F1, noma vula \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\" ku-System Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Keyboard. Amabhokisi nezinkundla Key What it does Enter Ensimini: faka inani. Kubhokisi lokulinganisa: Set the scale. Esc Vala ingxoxo (njenge-Cancel); vala ifomu le-New item. Tab Hamba ensimini elandelayo. Amanothi enkundla Ctrl ingukhiye we-Command: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Isikrini esigcwele siyinto eyehlukile: Control+Shift+F. Ukucofa ngesokudla kuyi-two-finger click ku-trackpad, uma i-secondary click ivuliwe ku-System Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Trackpad. I-TakeoffCraft ifunda inkinobho yesibili kuphela; i-Control-click ingathathwa njengokucofa okuvamile futhi yengeze iphoyinti. Ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ishidi (akulishayeli). Ukushelelisa, cindezela futhi udonse, noma bamba Space udonse. Page Up ne-Page Down ziyi-fn nezinkwa eziphezulu nezingaphansi kuma-keyboard angenazo. Backspace yisikhiye esibhalwe delete. Ctrl ingu-Ctrl: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Ku-touchpad yelaptop, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza ishidi. Ukushelelisa, cindezela futhi udonse. Ctrl ingu-Ctrl. Amanye ama-desktop anezinqamuleli zawo ze-Ctrl+Alt noma Super; i-TakeoffCraft ayisebenzisi nalinye lazo. Ku-touchpad, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza ishidi. Ukushelelisa, cindezela futhi udonse. I-TakeoffCraft ifunda ukuthinta njengephoyinti elilodwa: Ukuthinta kubeka iphoyinti, kukhetha imaki noma kwengeza ichashazi lokubala. Ukudonsa ngomunwe owodwa kushelelisa ishidi (ku-Auto count kudweba ibhokisi lokusesha). Ukuhlanganisa ukusondeza akusasekelwa okwamanje. Sebenzisa Fit page ne-Fit width, noma + ne-− ekhibhodini. Ukuvala indawo, thinta iphoyinti layo lokuqala. Ukuqeda umugqa, thinta kabili lapho isiphequluli sakho sishintsha ukuthinta kabili sibe yi-double-click, noma cindezela Enter ekhibhodini. Akukho ukufunda kobude okuphilayo kuze kuthintwe, ngoba akukho hover. Ikhibhodi nemouse noma i-trackpad yindlela engcono yokubala namuhla. Okhiye abagcinwe yisiphequluli Abasebenzisi bezinqamuleli ezithile, ngakho ikhasi alikwazi ukuzisebenzisa: ukuvala ithebhu (Ctrl+W), ithebhu noma iwindi elisha (Ctrl+T, Ctrl+N), nokusondeza kwesiphequluli (Ctrl++, Ctrl+−). Yingakho i-TakeoffCraft isondeza ishidi nge-wheel nokhiye abayodwa + no-−. Uma ucindezela Ctrl++ ngephutha, ikhasi lonke liyakhula; Ctrl+0 iyilungisa. Bona Okhiye, amamouse namatrackpad. Lapho kuhlala khona i-Hambisa Ayikho imiyalo ethi Hambisa: khetha uphawu lokubala udonse, noma khetha indawo noma umugqa udonse izibambo zamakhona awo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"entry-formats","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ukufaka ubude, irethi nephesenti","summary":"Okungafakwa ngobude, ukuphakama, amarethi emali nephesenti lodoti, nezibonelo nemilayezo yokufaka okungafundeki yi-TakeoffCraft.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["ukufaka","ifomethi","amafidi namainchi","izingxenye","amafidi ane-decimal","metric","amamitha","amamilimitha","irethi","imali","amadola","iphesenti","udoti","ukubhala"],"headings":[{"id":"ubude","text":"Ubude","level":2},{"id":"ukubala","text":"Ukubala","level":3},{"id":"indlela-okuboniswa-ngayo-ubude","text":"Indlela okuboniswa ngayo ubude","level":2},{"id":"amarethi-impahla-nomsebenzi-ngeyunithi-ngayinye","text":"Amarethi (impahla nomsebenzi ngeyunithi ngayinye)","level":2},{"id":"iphesenti-lodoti","text":"Iphesenti lodoti","level":2},{"id":"amagama-namayunithi","text":"Amagama namayunithi","level":2},{"id":"izifomula","text":"Izifomula","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ubude\"\u003EUbude\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKusetshenziselwa \u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga langempela\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E, nakwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula\u003C/span\u003E kumhleli wento.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUthayipha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi angu-24\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi angu-24 nama-inchi angu-6½\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi angu-12 nama-inchi angu-6½ (isikhala esikhundleni sedashi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi angu-12 nama-inchi angu-6½ (amadashi phakathi kwezingxenye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi angu-24\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamainchi angu-30\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamainchi angu-6½\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einchi engu-¾\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi angu-24 nama-inchi angu-6 (futhi \u003Ccode\u003Efoot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einches\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 ngeyunithi ezenzakalelayo (bheka ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi angu-24.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha angu-7.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E750 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamasentimitha angu-750\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamilimitha angu-7,500\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInani elingenalo uphawu lingamafidi ekulinganiseni nasemaitemini e-LF, SF noma SY, futhi lingamamitha kumaitemu e-m noma e-m².\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpawu zokhuluma ezigobile nezimpawu zokuphrayima ezivela kuma-word processor (′ ″ ’ ”) zisebenza njengo \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Ama-apostrophe amabili \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;&#039;\u003C/code\u003E abalwa njengo \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhoma ayanganakwa: \u003Ccode\u003E1,200 mm\u003C/code\u003E ingu-1200 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingxenye zidinga izinombolo ezigcwele ngaphambili nangemuva: \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E iyasebenza, \u003Ccode\u003E6.5 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ayisebenzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbude be-zero nobungezansi buyenqatshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImilayezo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Faka ibanga, njengo-24&#039;-0&quot; noma 7.5 m.&quot; (insimu ayinalutho)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Faka ibanga elikhulu kuno-zero.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Sebenzisa amafidi namainchi (24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;), amafidi ane-decimal, m, cm noma mm.&quot; (iyunithi engaziwa)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Leli banga alifundeki. Zama 24&#039;-6 1/2&quot; noma 24.5.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze usule ukuphakama noma ukujula kwento, khipha insimu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukubala\"\u003EUkubala\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInsimu yobude ngayinye, nebhokisi lokuthayipha ngesikhathi udweba, nakho kuthatha ukubala nge \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E namabhulaketi: \u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E (4.4375 ngeyunithi ezenzakalelayo), \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E (amafidi angu-8), \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdashi elibhalwe ebudeni liyingxenye yalo: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ingu-24 amafidi nama-inchi angu-6 futhi \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2\u003C/code\u003E ingu-6½. Beka izikhala ezungeze idashi ukuze ukhiphe: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039; - 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ingu-23&#039;-6&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInani elingenalo uphawu liphindaphinda noma lihlukanise ubude njengenani; uma lengezwa kubude, liba ngeyunithi ezenzakalelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E nazo ziyasebenza. Ukubala okungafundeki kuyenqatshwa kanye nendawo lapho kwaphazamisa khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-okuboniswa-ngayo-ubude\"\u003EIndlela okuboniswa ngayo ubude\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbude buboniswa njengamafidi, amainchi nezingxenye zesi-16: \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-0 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Amanani azungezwa kwesiqingatha esiseduze kakhulu ukuze abonakale; amanani angokoqobo awazungezwa. Amanani e-decimal aboniswa ngamadesimali amabili namakhomba wamawaka, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E1,234.50 LF\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amarethi-impahla-nomsebenzi-ngeyunithi-ngayinye\"\u003EAmarethi (impahla nomsebenzi ngeyunithi ngayinye)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUthayipha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$12.50\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$1,250.00\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0.385\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0.385 (kuya kumadesimali amane; okwengeziwe kuyazungezwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(empty)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmlayezo: &quot;Faka inani njengo-12.50.&quot; noma &quot;Lelo nani likhulu kakhulu.&quot; Amarethi angaphansi kuka-zero awamukelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanani aqoqwe (impahla, umsebenzi, amasamba) abalwa kuya kusenti. Ubuningi nodoti × irethi, kuzungezwe kusuka ku-zero (isiqingatha siyanyuselwa), ngendlela efanayo nakwe-\u003Ccode\u003EROUND(x, 2)\u003C/code\u003E yesipredishithi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iphesenti-lodoti\"\u003EIphesenti lodoti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUthayipha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5%\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(empty)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuya kumadesimali amabili, kusuka ku-0% kuya ku-1000%. Imilayezo: &quot;Faka iphesenti njengo-10 noma 7.5.&quot; noma &quot;Udoti ophezulu kuka-1000% awuvunyelwe.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amagama-namayunithi\"\u003EAmagama namayunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmagama amaitemu namakhomponenti: kuya kuzinhlamvu ezingu-200.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/span\u003E yekhomponenti: noma yimuphi umbhalo kuya kuzinhlamvu ezingu-20, njengo \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECY\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egal\u003C/code\u003E. Iyilebula nje kuphela; i-TakeoffCraft ayiyiguquli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izifomula\"\u003EIzifomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzifomula zokuhlanganiswa zinemithetho yazo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EUlimi lwesifomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ubude Kusetshenziselwa Ibanga langempela ku-Linganisa, nakwe-Ukuphakama ne-Ukujula kumhleli wento. Uthayipha Kusho 24'-0\" amafidi angu-24 24'-6 1/2\" amafidi angu-24 nama-inchi angu-6½ 12' 6 1/2\" amafidi angu-12 nama-inchi angu-6½ (isikhala esikhundleni sedashi) 12'-6-1/2\" amafidi angu-12 nama-inchi angu-6½ (amadashi phakathi kwezingxenye) 24' amafidi angu-24 30\" amainchi angu-30 6 1/2\" amainchi angu-6½ 3/4\" inchi engu-¾ 24 ft 6 in amafidi angu-24 nama-inchi angu-6 (futhi foot, feet, inch, inches) 24.5 24.5 ngeyunithi ezenzakalelayo (bheka ngezansi) 24.5' amafidi angu-24.5 7.5 m amamitha angu-7.5 750 cm amasentimitha angu-750 7500 mm amamilimitha angu-7,500 Inani elingenalo uphawu lingamafidi ekulinganiseni nasemaitemini e-LF, SF noma SY, futhi lingamamitha kumaitemu e-m noma e-m². Izimpawu zokhuluma ezigobile nezimpawu zokuphrayima ezivela kuma-word processor (′ ″ ’ ”) zisebenza njengo ' no \". Ama-apostrophe amabili '' abalwa njengo \". Amakhoma ayanganakwa: 1,200 mm ingu-1200 mm. Izingxenye zidinga izinombolo ezigcwele ngaphambili nangemuva: 6 1/2\" iyasebenza, 6.5 1/2\" ayisebenzi. Ubude be-zero nobungezansi buyenqatshwa. Imilayezo: \"Faka ibanga, njengo-24'-0\" noma 7.5 m.\" (insimu ayinalutho) \"Faka ibanga elikhulu kuno-zero.\" \"Sebenzisa amafidi namainchi (24'-6 1/2\"), amafidi ane-decimal, m, cm noma mm.\" (iyunithi engaziwa) \"Leli banga alifundeki. Zama 24'-6 1/2\" noma 24.5.\" Ukuze usule ukuphakama noma ukujula kwento, khipha insimu. Ukubala Insimu yobude ngayinye, nebhokisi lokuthayipha ngesikhathi udweba, nakho kuthatha ukubala nge +, -, *, / namabhulaketi: 4+7/16 (4.4375 ngeyunithi ezenzakalelayo), 12'6\" + 3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 (amafidi angu-8), 2*450mm. Idashi elibhalwe ebudeni liyingxenye yalo: 24'-6\" ingu-24 amafidi nama-inchi angu-6 futhi 6-1/2 ingu-6½. Beka izikhala ezungeze idashi ukuze ukhiphe: 24' - 6\" ingu-23'-6\". Inani elingenalo uphawu liphindaphinda noma lihlukanise ubude njengenani; uma lengezwa kubude, liba ngeyunithi ezenzakalelayo. abs, round, ceil no floor nazo ziyasebenza. Ukubala okungafundeki kuyenqatshwa kanye nendawo lapho kwaphazamisa khona. Indlela okuboniswa ngayo ubude Ubude buboniswa njengamafidi, amainchi nezingxenye zesi-16: 12'-6 1/2\", 0'-0 3/4\". Amanani azungezwa kwesiqingatha esiseduze kakhulu ukuze abonakale; amanani angokoqobo awazungezwa. Amanani e-decimal aboniswa ngamadesimali amabili namakhomba wamawaka, njengo 1,234.50 LF. Amarethi (impahla nomsebenzi ngeyunithi ngayinye) Uthayipha Kusho 12.5 $12.50 $12.50 $12.50 1,250 $1,250.00 0.385 $0.385 (kuya kumadesimali amane; okwengeziwe kuyazungezwa) (empty) $0 Umlayezo: \"Faka inani njengo-12.50.\" noma \"Lelo nani likhulu kakhulu.\" Amarethi angaphansi kuka-zero awamukelwa. Amanani aqoqwe (impahla, umsebenzi, amasamba) abalwa kuya kusenti. Ubuningi nodoti × irethi, kuzungezwe kusuka ku-zero (isiqingatha siyanyuselwa), ngendlela efanayo nakwe-ROUND(x, 2) yesipredishithi. Iphesenti lodoti Uthayipha Kusho 10 10% 7.5% 7.5% (empty) 0% Kuya kumadesimali amabili, kusuka ku-0% kuya ku-1000%. Imilayezo: \"Faka iphesenti njengo-10 noma 7.5.\" noma \"Udoti ophezulu kuka-1000% awuvunyelwe.\" Amagama namayunithi Amagama amaitemu namakhomponenti: kuya kuzinhlamvu ezingu-200. Iyunithi yekhomponenti: noma yimuphi umbhalo kuya kuzinhlamvu ezingu-20, njengo EA, sheets, CY, gal. Iyilebula nje kuphela; i-TakeoffCraft ayiyiguquli. Izifomula Izifomula zokuhlanganiswa zinemithetho yazo: bheka Ulimi lwesifomula.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"scale-presets","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Okusethiwe ngaphambili kwesikali","summary":"Yonke into esethiwe ngaphambili ohlwini lwe-Preset - okwezakhiwo, okwezinjiniyeli nokwemethrikhi - nokuthi ngayinye ithatha ukuthini nge-PDF.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["isikali","okusethiwe ngaphambili","isikali sokwakha","isikali sezinjiniyeli","isikali semethrikhi","isilinganiso","1/4 inch","1/8 inch","1:100","ubukhulu obugcwele"],"headings":[{"id":"ezokwakha","text":"Ezokwakha","level":2},{"id":"ezinjiniyeli","text":"Ezinjiniyeli","level":2},{"id":"imethrikhi","text":"Imethrikhi","level":2},{"id":"izikali-ezilinganisiwe","text":"Izikali ezilinganisiwe","level":2},{"id":"ama-pdf-angavamile","text":"Ama-PDF angavamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E linezikali ezingu-32 ezinamaqembu amathathu. Okusethiwe ngaphambili kusetha isikali seshidi elivulekile ngokunembile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke into esethiwe ngaphambili ithatha ukuthi ikhasi le-PDF yisayizi yephepha yangempela yedrowing: iyinshi eyodwa ekhasini le-PDF iyinshi eyodwa yephepha (amakhasi e-PDF alinganiswa ngamaphuwenti angu-72 ngeyinshi). Uma i-PDF ishintshiwe usayizi, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E emva kokusetha noma yisiphi isikali. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezokwakha\"\u003EEzokwakha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInshi eyodwa yephepha ingu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/32&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezinjiniyeli\"\u003EEzinjiniyeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInshi eyodwa yephepha ingu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 30&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 40&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E40 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 50&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E50 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 60&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E60 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 100&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imethrikhi\"\u003EImethrikhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1:1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:20\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:75\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:150\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:250\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:500\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsilinganiso semethrikhi kusho ukuthi iyunithi eyodwa ephepheni ingamayunithi amaningi angempela: ngo-\u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, i-10 mm ekhasini ingu-1 m.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izikali-ezilinganisiwe\"\u003EIzikali ezilinganisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikali esilinganisiwe sivela njenge &quot;Calibrated 1&quot; = 4.002&#039; on 24&#039;-6&quot;&quot; embhalweni ongaphansi kweshidi: amafiti angempela ngenshi eyodwa yephepha, nobude obuthayiphile. Uma sisezinhlamvu ezingu-0.5% kokusethiwe ngaphambili, ibha yengeza &quot;(matches 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;)&quot; futhi uhlu lwamashidi lubonisa igama lokusethiwe ngaphambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-pdf-angavamile\"\u003EAma-PDF angavamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanye ama-PDF amemezela iyunithi yekhasi elikhulu (i-&quot;user unit&quot;); i-TakeoffCraft iyayicabangela kokusethiwe ngaphambili nakwesikali esibonisiwe. Amakhasi ajikijelwe ku-PDF alinganiswa ngendlela efanayo nangawamakhasi aqondile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uhlu Preset eqenjini le-Scale linezikali ezingu-32 ezinamaqembu amathathu. Okusethiwe ngaphambili kusetha isikali seshidi elivulekile ngokunembile. Yonke into esethiwe ngaphambili ithatha ukuthi ikhasi le-PDF yisayizi yephepha yangempela yedrowing: iyinshi eyodwa ekhasini le-PDF iyinshi eyodwa yephepha (amakhasi e-PDF alinganiswa ngamaphuwenti angu-72 ngeyinshi). Uma i-PDF ishintshiwe usayizi, sebenzisa Calibrate. Sebenzisa Check emva kokusetha noma yisiphi isikali. Bona Setha isikali. Ezokwakha Okusethiwe ngaphambili Inshi eyodwa yephepha ingu 1/16\" = 1'-0\" 16 ft 3/32\" = 1'-0\" 10 ft 8 in 1/8\" = 1'-0\" 8 ft 3/16\" = 1'-0\" 5 ft 4 in 1/4\" = 1'-0\" 4 ft 3/8\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 8 in 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 3/4\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 4 in 1\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 8 in 3\" = 1'-0\" 4 in Ezinjiniyeli Okusethiwe ngaphambili Inshi eyodwa yephepha ingu 1\" = 10' 10 ft 1\" = 20' 20 ft 1\" = 30' 30 ft 1\" = 40' 40 ft 1\" = 50' 50 ft 1\" = 60' 60 ft 1\" = 100' 100 ft Imethrikhi 1:1, 1:2, 1:5, 1:10, 1:20, 1:25, 1:50, 1:75, 1:100, 1:150, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000. Isilinganiso semethrikhi kusho ukuthi iyunithi eyodwa ephepheni ingamayunithi amaningi angempela: ngo-1:100, i-10 mm ekhasini ingu-1 m. Izikali ezilinganisiwe Isikali esilinganisiwe sivela njenge \"Calibrated 1\" = 4.002' on 24'-6\"\" embhalweni ongaphansi kweshidi: amafiti angempela ngenshi eyodwa yephepha, nobude obuthayiphile. Uma sisezinhlamvu ezingu-0.5% kokusethiwe ngaphambili, ibha yengeza \"(matches 1/4\" = 1'-0\")\" futhi uhlu lwamashidi lubonisa igama lokusethiwe ngaphambili. Ama-PDF angavamile Amanye ama-PDF amemezela iyunithi yekhasi elikhulu (i-\"user unit\"); i-TakeoffCraft iyayicabangela kokusethiwe ngaphambili nakwesikali esibonisiwe. Amakhasi ajikijelwe ku-PDF alinganiswa ngendlela efanayo nangawamakhasi aqondile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"formulas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ulimi lwesifomula","summary":"Imithetho yezifomula zamanani zokuhlanganiswa: okuguquguqukayo, abasebenzi, imisebenzi, ukuzungeza nemilayezo yamaphutha ngayinye.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["ifomula","isakhiwo","incazelo","imisebenzi","ceil","floor","round","min","max","abs","okuguquguqukayo","abasebenzi","ukubala"],"headings":[{"id":"okuguquguqukayo","text":"Okuguquguqukayo","level":2},{"id":"abasebenzi","text":"Abasebenzi","level":2},{"id":"imisebenzi","text":"Imisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha","text":"Amaphutha","level":2},{"id":"ephephile-ngokwakhiwa","text":"Ephephile ngokwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzingxenye zokuhlanganiswa zithola inani lazo kusuka ku-ifomula. Ifomula yisisho sezibalo esincane esisebenza ngamanani aseshweni elilinganisiwe lento. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EUkuhlanganiswa nezifomula\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole izibonelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuguquguqukayo\"\u003EOkuguquguqukayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo lwento\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuguquguqukayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude bonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphakama kwento\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo yodonga, L × H, ngaphandle kwezimbobo zemigqa enazo (ukubala okuvela ku-BimCraft). Uma lokho kubala kubiza indlela yokulinganisa, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E ilinganiswa yiyo: izimbobo ezingakhulu kunosayizi omncane wale ndlela ziyahlala, futhi lokho indlela ekukhishayo lapho odonga behlangana kuyasuswa. Inothi ngaphansi kwento libiza indlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lemigqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo esele yonke (imiphetho ngaphandle kwezikhishiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmjikelo wonke, kuhlanganise nemiphetho yezikhishiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujula noma ukuqina kwento\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lezindawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkuguquguqukayo kusezinyunithini zento: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlamvu oluncane nolukhulu kuyefana: \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E ingu \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkuguquguqukayo kohlobo lwento yayo kuphela kuyasebenza. \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E kwento yomugqa inikeza \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;P&quot; ayisilinganiso esitholakala lapha. Sebenzisa L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuphakama noma ukujula okungenalutho kungu-0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"abasebenzi\"\u003EAbasebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBhala\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E−\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha, noma inani elingaphansi kuka-zero\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E×\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhindaphinda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E÷\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E( )\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphindaphinda nokuhlukanisa kwenziwa ngaphambi kokungeza nokukhipha: \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2 + 4\u003C/code\u003E ingu (L × 2) + 4. Sebenzisa amabhulaketi uma ungaqiniseki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinombolo zingaba namadesimali (\u003Ccode\u003E1.333\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.5\u003C/code\u003E) nezinkomba (\u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E = 1000). Izikhala ziyanganakwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imisebenzi\"\u003EImisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmphumela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsibonelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza uye enombolweni ephelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 68\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza ehla kunombolo ephelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 67\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza kunombolo ephelele eseduze, amasiqingatha akhishwa kude no-zero\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(2.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x, d)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza kumadesimali d (0 kuya ku-10)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(3.14159, 2)\u003C/code\u003E = 3.14\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani elincane kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(N, 10)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani elikhulu kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani ngaphandle kophawu lwalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(-3)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E ziyanganaka umsindo omncane wokuzungeza wekhompyutha, ngakho inani okufanele libe ngu-1 alikaze lizungezwe libe ngu-2.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha\"\u003EAmaphutha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfomula engafundeki noma engabalwa ibonisa iphutha layo ngaphansi kwensimu, futhi ingxenye ayifakwa emasamba aphelele (ikhanda elithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E lithi &quot;Akuphelele&quot;). Imilayezo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaka ifomula, njenge-L noma ceil(L / 1.333) + 1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula ayinalutho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; ayisilinganiso esitholakala lapha. Sebenzisa …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa enye yezinguquguquko ezidweshiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; ayisisebenzi lapha. Sebenzisa ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa esinye salezo zimisebenzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;#&quot; ayivunyelwe kuma-ifomula.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa lolo hlamvu (amayunithi, \u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E akuvunyelwe).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKukhona &quot;)&quot; eyeqile. / Kukhona &quot;)&quot; ngaphandle kwe-&quot;(&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa amabhulaketi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKukhona inani eliphuthile ngaphambi kwe-&quot;)&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufana ne \u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, )\u003C/code\u003E: faka inani.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula iphela kusenesikhathi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufana ne \u003Ccode\u003EL *\u003C/code\u003E: yiqedele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkungalindelekile &quot;…&quot;. Ingabe umsebenzi uyeqile?\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanani amabili eceleni, njenge \u003Ccode\u003E2L\u003C/code\u003E: bhala \u003Ccode\u003E2 * L\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eceil() ithatha inani elingu-1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENikeza umsebenzi inani elifanele lamanani.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eround(x, digits) idinga izinombolo ezigcwele ezisuka ku-0 kuya ku-10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa inombolo ephelele yamadesimali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula ihlukanisa ngo-zero.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokuvamile H ingu-0: setha ukuphakama noma ukujula kwento.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula ayinikezi inombolo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmphumela mkhulu kakhulu ukuze ube yinombolo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeyo fomula inde kakhulu (izinhlamvu ezingu-500 kuphela).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYifushanise.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ephephile-ngokwakhiwa\"\u003EEphephile ngokwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfomula ingenza izibalo kuphela ngokuguquguquka nemisebenzi engenhla. Ayikwazi ukusebenzisa ikhodi noma ukufunda okunye, ngakho ifomula ephrojekthini othumelwe yona ayinabungozi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izingxenye zokuhlanganiswa zithola inani lazo kusuka ku-ifomula. Ifomula yisisho sezibalo esincane esisebenza ngamanani aseshweni elilinganisiwe lento. Bheka Ukuhlanganiswa nezifomula ukuze uthole izibonelo. Okuguquguqukayo Uhlobo lwento Okuguquguqukayo Incazelo Okomugqa L Ubude bonke Okomugqa H Ukuphakama kwento Okomugqa A Indawo yodonga, L × H, ngaphandle kwezimbobo zemigqa enazo (ukubala okuvela ku-BimCraft). Uma lokho kubala kubiza indlela yokulinganisa, A ilinganiswa yiyo: izimbobo ezingakhulu kunosayizi omncane wale ndlela ziyahlala, futhi lokho indlela ekukhishayo lapho odonga behlangana kuyasuswa. Inothi ngaphansi kwento libiza indlela Okomugqa N Inani lemigqa Indawo A Indawo esele yonke (imiphetho ngaphandle kwezikhishiwe) Indawo P Umjikelo wonke, kuhlanganise nemiphetho yezikhishiwe Indawo H Ukujula noma ukuqina kwento Indawo N Inani lezindawo Ukubala N Inani Okuguquguqukayo kusezinyunithini zento: bheka Iyunithi. Uhlamvu oluncane nolukhulu kuyefana: l ingu L. Okuguquguqukayo kohlobo lwento yayo kuphela kuyasebenza. P kwento yomugqa inikeza \"P\" ayisilinganiso esitholakala lapha. Sebenzisa L, H, A, N. Ukuphakama noma ukujula okungenalutho kungu-0. Abasebenzi Bhala Incazelo + Engeza - noma − Khipha, noma inani elingaphansi kuka-zero * noma × Phindaphinda / noma ÷ Hlukanisa ( ) Hlanganisa Ukuphindaphinda nokuhlukanisa kwenziwa ngaphambi kokungeza nokukhipha: L * 2 + 4 ingu (L × 2) + 4. Sebenzisa amabhulaketi uma ungaqiniseki. Izinombolo zingaba namadesimali (1.333, .5) nezinkomba (1e3 = 1000). Izikhala ziyanganakwa. Imisebenzi Umsebenzi Umphumela Isibonelo ceil(x) Zungeza uye enombolweni ephelele ceil(67.5) = 68 floor(x) Zungeza ehla kunombolo ephelele floor(67.5) = 67 round(x) Zungeza kunombolo ephelele eseduze, amasiqingatha akhishwa kude no-zero round(2.5) = 3 round(x, d) Zungeza kumadesimali d (0 kuya ku-10) round(3.14159, 2) = 3.14 min(a, b, …) Inani elincane kakhulu min(N, 10) max(a, b, …) Inani elikhulu kakhulu max(1, ceil(N / 12)) abs(x) Inani ngaphandle kophawu lwalo abs(-3) = 3 ceil no floor ziyanganaka umsindo omncane wokuzungeza wekhompyutha, ngakho inani okufanele libe ngu-1 alikaze lizungezwe libe ngu-2. Amaphutha Ifomula engafundeki noma engabalwa ibonisa iphutha layo ngaphansi kwensimu, futhi ingxenye ayifakwa emasamba aphelele (ikhanda elithi Amanani lithi \"Akuphelele\"). Imilayezo: Umlayezo Ukulungisa Faka ifomula, njenge-L noma ceil(L / 1.333) + 1. Ifomula ayinalutho. \"X\" ayisilinganiso esitholakala lapha. Sebenzisa … Sebenzisa enye yezinguquguquko ezidweshiwe. \"X\" ayisisebenzi lapha. Sebenzisa ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs. Sebenzisa esinye salezo zimisebenzi. \"#\" ayivunyelwe kuma-ifomula. Susa lolo hlamvu (amayunithi, %, $ no = akuvunyelwe). Kukhona \")\" eyeqile. / Kukhona \")\" ngaphandle kwe-\"(\". Linganisa amabhulaketi. Kukhona inani eliphuthile ngaphambi kwe-\")\". Okufana ne max(1, ): faka inani. Ifomula iphela kusenesikhathi. Okufana ne L *: yiqedele. Okungalindelekile \"…\". Ingabe umsebenzi uyeqile? Amanani amabili eceleni, njenge 2L: bhala 2 * L. ceil() ithatha inani elingu-1. Nikeza umsebenzi inani elifanele lamanani. round(x, digits) idinga izinombolo ezigcwele ezisuka ku-0 kuya ku-10. Sebenzisa inombolo ephelele yamadesimali. Ifomula ihlukanisa ngo-zero. Ngokuvamile H ingu-0: setha ukuphakama noma ukujula kwento. Ifomula ayinikezi inombolo. Umphumela mkhulu kakhulu ukuze ube yinombolo. Leyo fomula inde kakhulu (izinhlamvu ezingu-500 kuphela). Yifushanise. Ephephile ngokwakhiwa Ifomula ingenza izibalo kuphela ngokuguquguquka nemisebenzi engenhla. Ayikwazi ukusebenzisa ikhodi noma ukufunda okunye, ngakho ifomula ephrojekthini othumelwe yona ayinabungozi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"units","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amayunithi","summary":"Amayunithi into engabika ngawo, amayunithi ezinguquko zezifomula, nokuxutshwa kwe-imperial nemetric.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["amayunithi","lf","sf","sy","sq","amayadi aswele","amaskwele ophahla","amacre","amamitha","amamitha aswele","ea","ngamunye","metric","imperial","ukuguqula","iyunithi ejwayelekile"],"headings":[{"id":"amayunithi-wento","text":"Amayunithi wento","level":2},{"id":"amayunithi-ezinguquko-zezifomula","text":"Amayunithi ezinguquko zezifomula","level":2},{"id":"lapho-amayunithi-emisiwe","text":"Lapho amayunithi emisiwe","level":2},{"id":"izikali-namayunithi-ahlukene","text":"Izikali namayunithi ahlukene","level":2},{"id":"ukunemba","text":"Ukunemba","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"amayunithi-wento\"\u003EAmayunithi wento\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo lwento\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIgama\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi emugqa (ajwayelekile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi aswele (ajwayelekile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamayadi aswele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamaskwele ophahla (amafidi aswele angu-100)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamacre\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha aswele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamahektha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Engamunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/span\u003E kwi-item editor noma nini, nakuba ukulinganisa sekwenziwe; inani liguqulwa masinyane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIyunithi\u003C/span\u003E lubonisa amayunithi avuliwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E, kanye nayo iyunithi yento ngokwayo njalo. Into entsha iqala ngeyunithi yobude noma yendawo ekhonjiswe ngesiqu lapho, uma kuyiyunithi yale nto; kungenjalo ngo-LF noma SF. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EAmayunithi, izinani ezithayiphiwe nohlu lwamayunithi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amayunithi-ezinguquko-zezifomula\"\u003EAmayunithi ezinguquko zezifomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIyunithi yento\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EL, P, H\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EA\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi aswele (indawo yodonga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha aswele (indawo yodonga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi aswele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamayadi aswele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamaskwele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamafidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamacre\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha aswele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamamitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamahektha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgezinto ze-SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E isezikwele-yadi kuyilapho \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E kuhlala emafidini. Ivolumu evela kento ye-SY ingu \u003Ccode\u003EA * 9 * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E amayadi ayisikwele; ukusebenzisa i-SF kumaslabhu kulula kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-amayunithi-emisiwe\"\u003ELapho amayunithi emisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinkombandlela zihlala zisebenzisa amafidi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumbhalo ophilayo ku-status bar lapho udweba (amafidi-namainshi, SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImaki ekhethiwe\u003C/strong\u003E (amafidi-namainshi, LF no-SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumphumela wokuhlola (amafidi-namainshi, namamitha),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eubude bezingxenye nemiphetho ku-Marks worksheet yespredishithi (amafidi-namainshi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinani zento, ithebula le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E, izifomula kanye ne-Estimate worksheet zisebenzisa iyunithi yento ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izikali-namayunithi-ahlukene\"\u003EIzikali namayunithi ahlukene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikali seshidi sisho ukuthi umdwebo mkhulu kangakanani; iyunithi yento isho ukuthi kufanele ibikwe kanjani. Umdwebo wemetric ku-\u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E ungalinganiswa nge-LF, futhi umdwebo we-imperial ungalinganiswa ngo-m². Ukulinganisa kwamukela noma iyiphi iyunithi: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukunemba\"\u003EUkunemba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa ngokunembile kumaphoyinti oyichofozayo, kufaka phakathi ubude bama-arc bangempela nezindawo, futhi ayijikeleziseli izinani. Ukubonisa kujikeleza ubude ku-1/16 yeyinshi nezinombolo ezinamachashazi ku-amabili. Imali ijikelezwa kuphela ezinanini ezinwetshiwe, kuya esentini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amayunithi wento Uhlobo lwento Iyunithi Igama Umugqa LF amafidi emugqa (ajwayelekile) Umugqa m amamitha Indawo SF amafidi aswele (ajwayelekile) Indawo SY amayadi aswele Indawo SQ amaskwele ophahla (amafidi aswele angu-100) Indawo ac amacre Indawo m² amamitha aswele Indawo ha amahektha Bala EA ngamunye Shintsha ngo-Iyunithi kwi-item editor noma nini, nakuba ukulinganisa sekwenziwe; inani liguqulwa masinyane. Uhlu lwe-Iyunithi lubonisa amayunithi avuliwe ku-Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Amayunithi, kanye nayo iyunithi yento ngokwayo njalo. Into entsha iqala ngeyunithi yobude noma yendawo ekhonjiswe ngesiqu lapho, uma kuyiyunithi yale nto; kungenjalo ngo-LF noma SF. Bheka Amayunithi, izinani ezithayiphiwe nohlu lwamayunithi. Amayunithi ezinguquko zezifomula Iyunithi yento L, P, H A LF amafidi amafidi aswele (indawo yodonga) m amamitha amamitha aswele (indawo yodonga) SF amafidi amafidi aswele SY amafidi amayadi aswele SQ amafidi amaskwele ac amafidi amacre m² amamitha amamitha aswele ha amamitha amahektha Ngezinto ze-SY, A isezikwele-yadi kuyilapho P no H kuhlala emafidini. Ivolumu evela kento ye-SY ingu A * 9 * H / 27 amayadi ayisikwele; ukusebenzisa i-SF kumaslabhu kulula kakhulu. Lapho amayunithi emisiwe Ezinye izinkombandlela zihlala zisebenzisa amafidi: umbhalo ophilayo ku-status bar lapho udweba (amafidi-namainshi, SF), Imaki ekhethiwe (amafidi-namainshi, LF no-SF), umphumela wokuhlola (amafidi-namainshi, namamitha), ubude bezingxenye nemiphetho ku-Marks worksheet yespredishithi (amafidi-namainshi). Izinani zento, ithebula le-Amanani, izifomula kanye ne-Estimate worksheet zisebenzisa iyunithi yento ngayo. Izikali namayunithi ahlukene Isikali seshidi sisho ukuthi umdwebo mkhulu kangakanani; iyunithi yento isho ukuthi kufanele ibikwe kanjani. Umdwebo wemetric ku-1:100 ungalinganiswa nge-LF, futhi umdwebo we-imperial ungalinganiswa ngo-m². Ukulinganisa kwamukela noma iyiphi iyunithi: 24'-6\", 7.5 m, 7500 mm. Ukunemba I-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa ngokunembile kumaphoyinti oyichofozayo, kufaka phakathi ubude bama-arc bangempela nezindawo, futhi ayijikeleziseli izinani. Ukubonisa kujikeleza ubude ku-1/16 yeyinshi nezinombolo ezinamachashazi ku-amabili. Imali ijikelezwa kuphela ezinanini ezinwetshiwe, kuya esentini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"export-columns","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Amakholomu okuthumela","summary":"Yonke ishidi lomsebenzi namakholomu e-XLSX export ne-CSV, nezifomula ishidi le-Estimate eziyibambile.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["thumela","amakholomu","xlsx","csv","ishidi lomsebenzi","ishidi lesilinganiso","ngeshidi","imaki","izikali","izifomula","izinkambu"],"headings":[{"id":"estimate-ishidi-le-xlsx-ne-csv","text":"Estimate (ishidi le-XLSX ne-CSV)","level":2},{"id":"by-sheet-i-xlsx-kuphela","text":"By sheet (i-XLSX kuphela)","level":2},{"id":"marks-i-xlsx-kuphela","text":"Marks (i-XLSX kuphela)","level":2},{"id":"by-bid-area-i-xlsx-kuphela-uma-ukubala-kunezindawo-zethenda","text":"By bid area (i-XLSX kuphela, uma ukubala kunezindawo zethenda)","level":2},{"id":"scales-i-xlsx-kuphela","text":"Scales (i-XLSX kuphela)","level":2},{"id":"amagama-amafayela","text":"Amagama amafayela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"estimate-ishidi-le-xlsx-ne-csv\"\u003EEstimate (ishidi le-XLSX ne-CSV)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa owodwa ngento ngayinye, ulandelwe ngomugqa ngamunye wekhomponenti yokuhlanganiswa kwayo (ingenile). Bese kuba umugqa ongenalutho nesamba sephrojekthi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkholomu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuqukethwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-XLSX\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA Item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lento (elimnyama) noma igama lekhomponenti (elingenile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB Type\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkomugqa, Indawo, Ukubala noma Ingxenye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC Unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, noma iyunithi yekhomponenti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ED Quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsamba esilinganisiwe, noma umphumela wesifomula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE Waste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdoti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphesenti (0.10 = 10%)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EF Qty with waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani × (1 + udoti)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula \u003Ccode\u003ED*(1+E)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG Material per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIrethi yempahla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIrethi lomsebenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI Material\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImpahla eqoqiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*G,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJ Labor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmsebenzi oqoqiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*H,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EK Total\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImpahla + umsebenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula \u003Ccode\u003EI+J\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EL Notes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula esetshenziswe, iphutha lesifomula, amaemaki emashidini angenasikali, indawo yodonga, umjikelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wesamba sephrojekthi: \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E yamakholomu I, J no K kuzo zonke izimugqa ezingenhla, kanye ne-&quot;Incomplete: see the notes above&quot; ku-Notes uma kukhona okushiyiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa onephutha lesifomula awunanani noma amasamba; inothi yawo inikeza iphutha. Umugqa wenhloko umisiwe endaweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CSV, amakholomu afanayo anamanani avamile, i-Waste % iyinombolo yamaphesenti (10 uma kungu-10%), futhi imali ingamadola anezinsimbo ezimbili zamadesimali. Umbhalo ongathathwa yi-spreadsheet njengefomula (uqala nge \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) uthola \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E phambili ukuze uhlale umbhalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-sheet-i-xlsx-kuphela\"\u003EBy sheet (i-XLSX kuphela)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkholomu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuqukethwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama leshidi (negama le-PDF uma lingavulekile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lento\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lalento kuleshidi, ngeyunithi yalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yento\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lemaki\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marks-i-xlsx-kuphela\"\u003EMarks (i-XLSX kuphela)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa owodwa ngemaki ngayinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkholomu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuqukethwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama leshidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lento\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkomugqa, Indawo noma Ukubala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbude, indawo esele, noma 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF noma m; SF, SY noma m²; EA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDetail\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkomugqa: ubude bezingxenye, ezikhishiwe zimakwe ngokuthi &quot;(deduct)&quot;, kanye ne-&quot;deducts (length) of (length) drawn&quot;. Indawo: izindawo ezigcwele nezikhishiwe uma kukhona izikhishwa, kanye nomjikelo. &quot;Sheet has no scale&quot; kumaemaki angenasikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBid area\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela uma ukubala kunezindawo zethenda: indawo yemaki, noma &quot;No bid area&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-bid-area-i-xlsx-kuphela-uma-ukubala-kunezindawo-zethenda\"\u003EBy bid area (i-XLSX kuphela, uma ukubala kunezindawo zethenda)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkholomu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKuyini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBid area\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lendawo, noma &quot;No bid area&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto, noma ikhomponenti engenile ngaphansi kwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yento noma yekhomponenti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlinganiswe kuleyo ndawo (amakhomponenti: ifomula ezamba zendawo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQty with waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani × (1 + udoti)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Labor, Total\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIqoqwe kuya kusenti, njengakwi-Estimate\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENotes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula, amaphutha namaemaki angenasikali, njengakwi-Estimate\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ngayinye iphela ngomugqa we-&quot;(name) subtotal&quot; ohlala izindleko zawo zifaka \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E phezu kwemigqa yawo; umugqa wokugcina, \u003Cstrong\u003EAll bid areas\u003C/strong\u003E, wengeza izamba ezingaphansi. Ishidi lo-\u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E bese linekholomu yesikhombisa, \u003Cstrong\u003EBid area\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scales-i-xlsx-kuphela\"\u003EScales (i-XLSX kuphela)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa owodwa ngeshidi elinesikali noma amaemaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkholomu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuqukethwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama leshidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lesethingi, noma isikali esilinganisiwe, noma &quot;No scale&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Preset&quot;, noma &quot;Calibrated on (the distance you typed)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeet per PDF unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsilinganiso esinembile i-TakeoffCraft esisetshenzisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amagama-amafayela\"\u003EAmagama amafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E ne \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E, lapho igama livela ku-PDF yokuqala evulwe ekubaleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-CSV iyi-UTF-8 nobuhlobo bokuqala bebhayithi kanye nemigqa yeWindows, efundwa ama-spreadsheet kuzo zonke izinhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Estimate (ishidi le-XLSX ne-CSV) Umugqa owodwa ngento ngayinye, ulandelwe ngomugqa ngamunye wekhomponenti yokuhlanganiswa kwayo (ingenile). Bese kuba umugqa ongenalutho nesamba sephrojekthi. Ikholomu Okuqukethwe Ku-XLSX A Item Igama lento (elimnyama) noma igama lekhomponenti (elingenile) Umbhalo B Type Okomugqa, Indawo, Ukubala noma Ingxenye Umbhalo C Unit LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, noma iyunithi yekhomponenti Umbhalo D Quantity Isamba esilinganisiwe, noma umphumela wesifomula Inombolo E Waste % Udoti Iphesenti (0.10 = 10%) F Qty with waste Inani × (1 + udoti) Ifomula D*(1+E) G Material per unit Irethi yempahla Inombolo H Labor per unit Irethi lomsebenzi Inombolo I Material Impahla eqoqiwe Ifomula ROUND(F*G,2) J Labor Umsebenzi oqoqiwe Ifomula ROUND(F*H,2) K Total Impahla + umsebenzi Ifomula I+J L Notes Ifomula esetshenziswe, iphutha lesifomula, amaemaki emashidini angenasikali, indawo yodonga, umjikelo Umbhalo Umugqa wesamba sephrojekthi: SUM yamakholomu I, J no K kuzo zonke izimugqa ezingenhla, kanye ne-\"Incomplete: see the notes above\" ku-Notes uma kukhona okushiyiwe. Umugqa onephutha lesifomula awunanani noma amasamba; inothi yawo inikeza iphutha. Umugqa wenhloko umisiwe endaweni. Ku-CSV, amakholomu afanayo anamanani avamile, i-Waste % iyinombolo yamaphesenti (10 uma kungu-10%), futhi imali ingamadola anezinsimbo ezimbili zamadesimali. Umbhalo ongathathwa yi-spreadsheet njengefomula (uqala nge =, +, - noma @) uthola ' phambili ukuze uhlale umbhalo. By sheet (i-XLSX kuphela) Ikholomu Okuqukethwe Sheet Igama leshidi (negama le-PDF uma lingavulekile) Item Igama lento Quantity Inani lalento kuleshidi, ngeyunithi yalo Unit Iyunithi yento Marks Inani lemaki Marks (i-XLSX kuphela) Umugqa owodwa ngemaki ngayinye. Ikholomu Okuqukethwe Sheet Igama leshidi Item Igama lento Type Okomugqa, Indawo noma Ukubala Quantity Ubude, indawo esele, noma 1 Unit LF noma m; SF, SY noma m²; EA Detail Okomugqa: ubude bezingxenye, ezikhishiwe zimakwe ngokuthi \"(deduct)\", kanye ne-\"deducts (length) of (length) drawn\". Indawo: izindawo ezigcwele nezikhishiwe uma kukhona izikhishwa, kanye nomjikelo. \"Sheet has no scale\" kumaemaki angenasikali. Bid area Kuphela uma ukubala kunezindawo zethenda: indawo yemaki, noma \"No bid area\" By bid area (i-XLSX kuphela, uma ukubala kunezindawo zethenda) Ikholomu Kuyini Bid area Igama lendawo, noma \"No bid area\" Item Into, noma ikhomponenti engenile ngaphansi kwayo Unit Iyunithi yento noma yekhomponenti Quantity Ilinganiswe kuleyo ndawo (amakhomponenti: ifomula ezamba zendawo) Qty with waste Inani × (1 + udoti) Material, Labor, Total Iqoqwe kuya kusenti, njengakwi-Estimate Notes Ifomula, amaphutha namaemaki angenasikali, njengakwi-Estimate Ingxenye ngayinye iphela ngomugqa we-\"(name) subtotal\" ohlala izindleko zawo zifaka SUM phezu kwemigqa yawo; umugqa wokugcina, All bid areas, wengeza izamba ezingaphansi. Ishidi lo-Marks bese linekholomu yesikhombisa, Bid area. Scales (i-XLSX kuphela) Umugqa owodwa ngeshidi elinesikali noma amaemaki. Ikholomu Okuqukethwe Sheet Igama leshidi Scale Igama lesethingi, noma isikali esilinganisiwe, noma \"No scale\" How \"Preset\", noma \"Calibrated on (the distance you typed)\" Feet per PDF unit Isilinganiso esinembile i-TakeoffCraft esisetshenzisa Amagama amafayela (name).xlsx ne (name).csv, lapho igama livela ku-PDF yokuqala evulwe ekubaleni. I-CSV iyi-UTF-8 nobuhlobo bokuqala bebhayithi kanye nemigqa yeWindows, efundwa ama-spreadsheet kuzo zonke izinhlelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ukuxazulula izinkinga","summary":"Izimpawu, izimbangela nezixazululo zemilayezo nezimangaliso ongahlangabezana nazo ku-TakeoffCraft, ezicashunwe njengoba i-app iziveza.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["izinkinga","amaphutha","akusebenzi","xazulula","usizo","kwenqatshiwe","ayikwazi ukulinganisa","akukho sikali","amamaki akhe","ukuthumela kuhlulekile","ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","thinta"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuvula-amafayela","text":"Ukuvula amafayela","level":2},{"id":"ukulinganisa","text":"Ukulinganisa","level":2},{"id":"isikali","text":"Isikali","level":2},{"id":"ubuningi-nezifomula","text":"Ubuningi nezifomula","level":2},{"id":"ukubala-okuzenzakalelayo","text":"Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-nokuthumela","text":"Ukulondoloza nokuthumela","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-nemouse","text":"Izinkinobho nemouse","level":2},{"id":"izikrini-zokuthinta","text":"Izikrini zokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"ukusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"usaphazamekile","text":"Usaphazamekile?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ichaza izenqaba eziningi ebhalweni lesimo phansi kwewindi. Thola umlayezo ongaphansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvula-amafayela\"\u003EUkuvula amafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo noma isimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe PDF reader could not load. Reload the page to try again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmfundi we-PDF wehlulekile ukulayisha, ngokuvamile ngoba ungaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi i-app ayizange igcinwe ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXhuma futhi uvuselele ikhasi. Bese khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ulinde \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-PDF idinga iphasiwedi ukuze ivuleke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECela ikopi engavikelwe, noma susa iphasiwedi ohlelweni lwe-PDF oluthembekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) could not be read as a PDF (…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lonakele noma akulona i-PDF ngempela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELidonsele futhi, noma ligcine kabusha kuhlelo olwalenza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) is already open.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELe-PDF efanayo (okuqukethwe okufanayo) ivulekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkudingeki lutho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft opens PDFs and .takeoff.json projects. Skipped: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinye izinhlobo zamafayela ziphonswe ngaphandle.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuqula imidwebo ibe yi-PDF kuqala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENothing happens when I drop files\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela ashiywe ngaphandle kwewindi lesiphequluli, noma isiphequluli sivule i-PDF ethebhu entsha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShiya phezu kwekhasi le-TakeoffCraft ngokwalo; ifreyimu ethi &quot;Drop PDFs or a .takeoff.json&quot; ibonisa ukuthi izosebenza nini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a big set takes a while\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke i-PDF ifundwa ngokugcwele ukuze ibe nesandiso sayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinda umlayezo &quot;Opening (name)…&quot; uphele. Izithombe ziyagcwala uma useskrola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulinganisa\"\u003EUkulinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo noma isimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen a PDF first.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi alivulekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula i-PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis sheet has no scale yet, so it can&#039;t be measured. Pick a preset scale or calibrate first (counts work without one).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathuluzi womugqa, indawo, isiyingi nembobo adinga isikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMake a linear item first (name it under Items), then click on the sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho nto yalolo hlobo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcwalisa ifomu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInto entsha\u003C/span\u003E elivulekile, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPick an item to take off first (Items panel).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto yamanje isusiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza into ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA run needs at least two points.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUqedile ngemva kokuchofoza kanye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza okungenani amaphoyinti amabili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn area needs at least three points.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhona amancane kakhulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza okungenani amakhona amathathu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe outline crosses itself, so its area would be wrong. Draw it again without crossing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsimo esinesibalo se-8 (figure-eight).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba njengendawo ezimbili, noma hambisa umphetho ngokulandelana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThose points enclose no area.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnke amaphoyinti ekugxileni komugqa munye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza amakhona avala indawo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESelect an area mark first (Select tool), then choose Cut-out and draw the hole inside it.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImbobo\u003C/span\u003E idinga indawo ekhethiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza indawo, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA cut-out has to sit fully inside the area.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImbobo iwela noma iphuma kumphetho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba imbobo ngaphakathi endaweni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut-outs cannot overlap each other.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimbobo ezimbili ziyahlanganiswa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba imbobo eyodwa ezungeze zombili, noma uzigcine zihlukene.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E… The point was put back.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhona edonsiwe ingenza umphetho uzicwebe noma iphushe imbobo ngaphandle.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa uye endaweni egcina isimo sisemthethweni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClick a point on the circle&#039;s edge, away from its center.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza kwesibili kusondele kakhulu esikhungweni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kude ngaphandle.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClicks pan the sheet instead of adding points\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInkomba ihambe ngaphezu kwamaphikseli ambalwa ngenkathi inkinobho icindezelwe; lokho kubalwa njengokudonsa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ungahambisi, ikakhulu ku-trackpad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift does not snap\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbeka iphoyinti ku-arc, noma udweba isiyingi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubambelela kwe-45° kusebenza emigqeni eqondile kuphela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoints jump onto a nearby line\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBambelela\u003C/span\u003E emigqeni yomdwebo ivulekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ukuze uchofoze phakathi kwemigqa, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuvala \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBambelela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENo snap marker appears\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBambelela\u003C/span\u003E ivaliwe, ishidi liyiskena, noma ithuluzi alibambelelisi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E, ukunamathisela).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; kumashidi eskeniwe akukho migqa yokubambelela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe length is wrong\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikali asilungile (ngokuvamile i-PDF esayizwe kabusha ngepreset).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E kwisilinganiso esaziwayo, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikali\"\u003EIsikali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo noma isimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPick two points further apart.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti okulinganisa aseduze kakhulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa esilinganisweni eside kakhulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA message in the calibrate dialog, like &quot;That distance could not be read&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbanga lisesimweni i-TakeoffCraft engayifunda ngayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUkungeniswa kobude, izinga nephesenti\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis sheet has no scale yet, so there is nothing to check. Calibrate it, or pick a preset.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E kwishidi elingenasikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetha isikali kuqala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusethiwe ngaphambili\u003C/span\u003E list is grayed out\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho shidi elivuliwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula i-PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubuningi-nezifomula\"\u003EUbuningi nezifomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo noma isimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIncomplete: … (not in the totals)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphutha lesifomula, noma izimaki emashidini angenasikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities#the-incomplete-warning\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-hash=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EFunda izibalo nesilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+(n) unscaled next to an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinye zezimaki zayo zisemashidini angenasikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENika lawo mashidi isikali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula error: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomula ayikwazi ukubalwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas#errors\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-hash=\"errors\"\u003EUlimi lwezifomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis item has marks, so its type cannot change.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlobo luyakhiywa uma sekukhona izimaki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza into entsha yolunye uhlobo bese udweba kabusha izimaki ngayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn item needs a name.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsimu yegama ihlanzwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThayipha igama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType an amount like 12.50. / Type a percentage like 10 or 7.5.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinga noma ukulahleka akufundeki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUkungeniswa kobude, izinga nephesenti\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA total looks doubled\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto inamazinga nezingxenye zayo ezithwala intengo efanayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetha amazinga ento ibe ngu-0 uma izingxenye zayo zithwala intengo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis item&#039;s marks are on PDFs that are not open.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUcofoze into okuyizimaki zayo zonke kuma-PDF ongawavulile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula la ma-PDF; amagama awo alandelwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubala-okuzenzakalelayo\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo noma isimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThat box is too small. Draw it around the whole symbol.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi lincane kakhulu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngaphakathi bese uzungeza uphawu lonke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThat box is almost empty. Draw it around a symbol.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi linephepha kuphela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza uphawu uqobo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENo matches. Lower the match slider, or box the symbol more tightly.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho okuthe xaxa ngokwanele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza uphawu ngokuqinile, noma wehlisele phansi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkufana\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToo many matches, including wrong symbols\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimpawu ezifanayo zithola amaphuzu aseduze nelangempela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhakamisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkufana\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza amabhokisi angalungile ukuwenqaba.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatches missing on other sheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELawo mashidi adweba uphawu ngobukhulu obuhlukile, noma ngengeli engayisinyathelo se-90°.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESesha lawo mashidi ngebhokisi edwetshwe khona, noma bala ngesandla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) sheets were too large to search at this symbol size.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshidi lingaba likhulu kakhulu ngobukhulu bokusebenza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza uphawu olukhulu, noma bala lelo shidi ngesandla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe search failed: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusesha ngemuva kumisiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZama futhi; layisha kabusha ikhasi uma kuphindeka (londoloza kuqala). Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, isebenza kuphela uma i-app bar isho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDragging draws a box instead of panning\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYiyo indlela i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/span\u003E esebenza ngayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E udonse, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-nokuthumela\"\u003EUkulondoloza nokuthumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmlayezo noma isimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENothing to export yet: make an item and take it off.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho zinto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYenza into kuqala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENo marks on the open PDFs yet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF emakwe\u003C/span\u003E ayinalutho okudwetshwa kuma-PDF avuliwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ama-PDF anezimaki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis PDF is password-protected or encrypted, so a marked copy cannot be written. …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-PDF ibethelwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E esikhundleni, noma sebenzisa ikopi engabethelwe ye-PDF (lapho-ke idinga umbalo wayo, ngoba iyifayela elihlukile).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe marked PDF could not be written: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgokuvamile: ungaphandle kwe-inthanethi, futhi i-app ayizange igcinwe ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ngakho umbhali we-PDF akekho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXhuma ku-inthanethi bese ukhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF emakwe\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuze uyigweme, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E bese ulinda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnly one marked PDF downloaded\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphequluli sivimbe ukulanda okuningi ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVumela ukulanda okuningi kulo webhusayithi, bese uthumela futhi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(file) is not a TakeoffCraft project (it is not valid JSON). / This is not a TakeoffCraft project file.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela elingalungile, noma elonakele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis project was saved by a newer TakeoffCraft. Open it there.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela livela esakhiweni esisha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula kuso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) marks were damaged and left out.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye yefayela yonakele noma yahlelwa ngesandla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkunye kuvulekile. Dweba kabusha izimaki ezingekho, noma vula ikopi endala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarks missing after reopening\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-PDF awavulekile, noma enye yawo yashintsha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ELondoloza futhi uvule umbalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe browser asks &quot;Leave site?&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKukhona izinguquko ezingalondolozwanga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlala, bese ulondoloza nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-nemouse\"\u003EIzinkinobho nemouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELetter keys do nothing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhesa lisensimini (usesho, item editor, ithebula).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza esigcawini, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uphume ensimini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe wheel zooms instead of scrolling\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsondo lisondeza ishidi njalo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ukuze uhambise.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe whole page got bigger or smaller\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkusondeza kwesiphequluli (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Sondeza ishidi ngesondo noma ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngokwawo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA mark disappeared when I pressed Backspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace isusa isimaki esikhethiwe uma ungadwebi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyabuyisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click does not finish on a Mac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla (Control-click) kufika njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili nge-secondary click evuliwe, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izikrini-zokuthinta\"\u003EIzikrini zokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikrinini sokuthinta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThinta\u003C/strong\u003E ibeka iphoyinti (noma ikhetha isimaki nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E). Umunwe owodwa udonsa ukuhambisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzigqoko ezimbili\u003C/strong\u003E zi-pinch ukusondeza ngasendaweni phakathi kwazo, futhi zihambise uma zihamba ndawonye. Ukubeka umunwe wesibili kuqeda lokho okwaqalwa yiwo wokuqala, ngakho i-pinch ayishiyi iphoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQeda\u003C/strong\u003E umugqa noma umphetho ngokucindezela isikhathi eside (indlela yokuchofoza ngakwesokudla), ngokuthinta kabili, noma nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQeda\u003C/span\u003E kwibha esezansi kwishidi. Leyo bha inezinkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmuva\u003C/span\u003E (ibuyisa iphoyinti lokugcina) no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E. Izindawo zivala futhi ngokuthinta iphoyinti lokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIminwe inezinhloso ezinkulu: amaphoyinti abambelela, avale futhi akhethe kude kakhulu, nezibambi zamakhona zikhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthayipha ubude kudinga ikhibhodi; ikhibhodi esikrinini isebenza uma ibhokisi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThayipha\u003C/span\u003E ligxilile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEthabhulethini, ikhibhodi nemouse noma i-trackpad kwenza umbalo ube lula kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho noma isimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImbangela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkulungisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukwazanga ukulondoloza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanye amafayela e-app awazange alandwe ngenkathi ilondolozelwa ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlola uxhumo bese ukhetha inkinobho futhi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAyikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmawindi angasese namanye amakhompyutha alawulwayo avimbela amakhophi angaphandle kwe-inthanethi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa iwindi elijwayelekile, noma esinye isiphequluli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Saving…&quot; never starts\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUngaphandle kwe-inthanethi; ukulondoloza kudinga uxhumo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza uku-inthanethi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe app is old after an update\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi isuka ngolunye usuku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu-inthanethi, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYou want the space back\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi icishe ibe ngu-6 MB.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa ikopi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usaphazamekile\"\u003EUsaphazamekile?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayisha kabusha ikhasi uma i-app ingasasebenzi. Umbalo wakho uyalahleka lapho ulayisha kabusha, uma ungawulondolozanga, ngakho londoloza kuqala nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uma kungenzeka. Ngemibuzo yesiphequluli bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EIzisphequluli namakhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-TakeoffCraft ichaza izenqaba eziningi ebhalweni lesimo phansi kwewindi. Thola umlayezo ongaphansi. Ukuvula amafayela Umlayezo noma isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa The PDF reader could not load. Reload the page to try again. Umfundi we-PDF wehlulekile ukulayisha, ngokuvamile ngoba ungaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi i-app ayizange igcinwe ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Xhuma futhi uvuselele ikhasi. Bese khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ulinde Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi; bheka Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. (name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy. I-PDF idinga iphasiwedi ukuze ivuleke. Cela ikopi engavikelwe, noma susa iphasiwedi ohlelweni lwe-PDF oluthembekile. (name) could not be read as a PDF (…) Ifayela lonakele noma akulona i-PDF ngempela. Lidonsele futhi, noma ligcine kabusha kuhlelo olwalenza. (name) is already open. Le-PDF efanayo (okuqukethwe okufanayo) ivulekile. Akudingeki lutho. TakeoffCraft opens PDFs and .takeoff.json projects. Skipped: … Ezinye izinhlobo zamafayela ziphonswe ngaphandle. Guqula imidwebo ibe yi-PDF kuqala. Nothing happens when I drop files Amafayela ashiywe ngaphandle kwewindi lesiphequluli, noma isiphequluli sivule i-PDF ethebhu entsha. Shiya phezu kwekhasi le-TakeoffCraft ngokwalo; ifreyimu ethi \"Drop PDFs or a .takeoff.json\" ibonisa ukuthi izosebenza nini. Opening a big set takes a while Yonke i-PDF ifundwa ngokugcwele ukuze ibe nesandiso sayo. Linda umlayezo \"Opening (name)…\" uphele. Izithombe ziyagcwala uma useskrola. Ukulinganisa Umlayezo noma isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa Open a PDF first. Ishidi alivulekile. Vula i-PDF. This sheet has no scale yet, so it can't be measured. Pick a preset scale or calibrate first (counts work without one). Amathuluzi womugqa, indawo, isiyingi nembobo adinga isikali. Setha isikali. Make a linear item first (name it under Items), then click on the sheet. Akukho nto yalolo hlobo. Gcwalisa ifomu Into entsha elivulekile, bese ukhetha Engeza. Pick an item to take off first (Items panel). Into yamanje isusiwe. Chofoza into ngaphansi kwe-Izinto. A run needs at least two points. Uqedile ngemva kokuchofoza kanye. Chofoza okungenani amaphoyinti amabili. An area needs at least three points. Amakhona amancane kakhulu. Chofoza okungenani amakhona amathathu. The outline crosses itself, so its area would be wrong. Draw it again without crossing. Isimo esinesibalo se-8 (figure-eight). Dweba njengendawo ezimbili, noma hambisa umphetho ngokulandelana. Those points enclose no area. Onke amaphoyinti ekugxileni komugqa munye. Chofoza amakhona avala indawo. Select an area mark first (Select tool), then choose Cut-out and draw the hole inside it. Imbobo idinga indawo ekhethiwe. Cindezela V, chofoza indawo, bese X. A cut-out has to sit fully inside the area. Imbobo iwela noma iphuma kumphetho. Dweba imbobo ngaphakathi endaweni. Cut-outs cannot overlap each other. Izimbobo ezimbili ziyahlanganiswa. Dweba imbobo eyodwa ezungeze zombili, noma uzigcine zihlukene. … The point was put back. Ikhona edonsiwe ingenza umphetho uzicwebe noma iphushe imbobo ngaphandle. Donsa uye endaweni egcina isimo sisemthethweni. Click a point on the circle's edge, away from its center. Ukuchofoza kwesibili kusondele kakhulu esikhungweni. Chofoza kude ngaphandle. Clicks pan the sheet instead of adding points Inkomba ihambe ngaphezu kwamaphikseli ambalwa ngenkathi inkinobho icindezelwe; lokho kubalwa njengokudonsa. Chofoza ungahambisi, ikakhulu ku-trackpad. Shift does not snap Ubeka iphoyinti ku-arc, noma udweba isiyingi. Ukubambelela kwe-45° kusebenza emigqeni eqondile kuphela. Points jump onto a nearby line Bambelela emigqeni yomdwebo ivulekile. Sondeza ukuze uchofoze phakathi kwemigqa, noma cindezela F3 ukuvala Bambelela. No snap marker appears Bambelela ivaliwe, ishidi liyiskena, noma ithuluzi alibambelelisi (Bala, Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo, ukunamathisela). Cindezela F3; kumashidi eskeniwe akukho migqa yokubambelela. The length is wrong Isikali asilungile (ngokuvamile i-PDF esayizwe kabusha ngepreset). Sebenzisa Hlola kwisilinganiso esaziwayo, bese Linganisa. Isikali Umlayezo noma isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa Pick two points further apart. Amaphoyinti okulinganisa aseduze kakhulu. Linganisa esilinganisweni eside kakhulu. A message in the calibrate dialog, like \"That distance could not be read\" Ibanga lisesimweni i-TakeoffCraft engayifunda ngayo. Bheka Ukungeniswa kobude, izinga nephesenti. This sheet has no scale yet, so there is nothing to check. Calibrate it, or pick a preset. Hlola kwishidi elingenasikali. Setha isikali kuqala. The Okusethiwe ngaphambili list is grayed out Akukho shidi elivuliwe. Vula i-PDF. Ubuningi nezifomula Umlayezo noma isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa Incomplete: … (not in the totals) Iphutha lesifomula, noma izimaki emashidini angenasikali. Bheka Funda izibalo nesilinganiso. +(n) unscaled next to an item Ezinye zezimaki zayo zisemashidini angenasikali. Nika lawo mashidi isikali. Formula error: … Ifomula ayikwazi ukubalwa. Bheka Ulimi lwezifomula. This item has marks, so its type cannot change. Uhlobo luyakhiywa uma sekukhona izimaki. Yenza into entsha yolunye uhlobo bese udweba kabusha izimaki ngayo. An item needs a name. Insimu yegama ihlanzwe. Thayipha igama. Type an amount like 12.50. / Type a percentage like 10 or 7.5. Izinga noma ukulahleka akufundeki. Bheka Ukungeniswa kobude, izinga nephesenti. A total looks doubled Into inamazinga nezingxenye zayo ezithwala intengo efanayo. Setha amazinga ento ibe ngu-0 uma izingxenye zayo zithwala intengo. This item's marks are on PDFs that are not open. Ucofoze into okuyizimaki zayo zonke kuma-PDF ongawavulile. Vula la ma-PDF; amagama awo alandelwa ngaphansi kwe-Amashidi. Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo Umlayezo noma isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa That box is too small. Draw it around the whole symbol. Ibhokisi lincane kakhulu. Sondeza ngaphakathi bese uzungeza uphawu lonke. That box is almost empty. Draw it around a symbol. Ibhokisi linephepha kuphela. Zungeza uphawu uqobo. No matches. Lower the match slider, or box the symbol more tightly. Akukho okuthe xaxa ngokwanele. Zungeza uphawu ngokuqinile, noma wehlisele phansi Ukufana. Too many matches, including wrong symbols Izimpawu ezifanayo zithola amaphuzu aseduze nelangempela. Phakamisa Ukufana bese uchofoza amabhokisi angalungile ukuwenqaba. Matches missing on other sheets Lawo mashidi adweba uphawu ngobukhulu obuhlukile, noma ngengeli engayisinyathelo se-90°. Sesha lawo mashidi ngebhokisi edwetshwe khona, noma bala ngesandla. (n) sheets were too large to search at this symbol size. Ishidi lingaba likhulu kakhulu ngobukhulu bokusebenza. Zungeza uphawu olukhulu, noma bala lelo shidi ngesandla. The search failed: … Ukusesha ngemuva kumisiwe. Zama futhi; layisha kabusha ikhasi uma kuphindeka (londoloza kuqala). Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, isebenza kuphela uma i-app bar isho Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Dragging draws a box instead of panning Yiyo indlela i-Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo esebenza ngayo. Bamba Space udonse, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi. Ukulondoloza nokuthumela Umlayezo noma isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa Nothing to export yet: make an item and take it off. Akukho zinto. Yenza into kuqala. No marks on the open PDFs yet. I-PDF emakwe ayinalutho okudwetshwa kuma-PDF avuliwe. Vula ama-PDF anezimaki. This PDF is password-protected or encrypted, so a marked copy cannot be written. … I-PDF ibethelwe. Thumela XLSX esikhundleni, noma sebenzisa ikopi engabethelwe ye-PDF (lapho-ke idinga umbalo wayo, ngoba iyifayela elihlukile). The marked PDF could not be written: … Ngokuvamile: ungaphandle kwe-inthanethi, futhi i-app ayizange igcinwe ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ngakho umbhali we-PDF akekho. Xhuma ku-inthanethi bese ukhetha futhi I-PDF emakwe. Ukuze uyigweme, khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi bese ulinda Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Only one marked PDF downloaded Isiphequluli sivimbe ukulanda okuningi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Vumela ukulanda okuningi kulo webhusayithi, bese uthumela futhi. (file) is not a TakeoffCraft project (it is not valid JSON). / This is not a TakeoffCraft project file. Ifayela elingalungile, noma elonakele. Khetha ifayela .takeoff.json. This project was saved by a newer TakeoffCraft. Open it there. Ifayela livela esakhiweni esisha. Vula kuso. (n) marks were damaged and left out. Ingxenye yefayela yonakele noma yahlelwa ngesandla. Okunye kuvulekile. Dweba kabusha izimaki ezingekho, noma vula ikopi endala. Marks missing after reopening Ama-PDF awavulekile, noma enye yawo yashintsha. Bheka Londoloza futhi uvule umbalo. The browser asks \"Leave site?\" Kukhona izinguquko ezingalondolozwanga. Hlala, bese ulondoloza nge-Ctrl+S. Izinkinobho nemouse Isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa Letter keys do nothing Ikhesa lisensimini (usesho, item editor, ithebula). Chofoza esigcawini, noma cindezela Tab uphume ensimini. The wheel zooms instead of scrolling Isondo lisondeza ishidi njalo. Donsa ukuze uhambise. The whole page got bigger or smaller Ukusondeza kwesiphequluli (Ctrl++ noma Ctrl+−). Cindezela Ctrl+0. Sondeza ishidi ngesondo noma ngo-+ no-− ngokwawo. A mark disappeared when I pressed Backspace Backspace isusa isimaki esikhethiwe uma ungadwebi. Ctrl+Z iyabuyisa. Right-click does not finish on a Mac Ukuchofoza ngesokudla (Control-click) kufika njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile. Sebenzisa ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili nge-secondary click evuliwe, noma cindezela Enter. Izikrini zokuthinta Esikrinini sokuthinta: Thinta ibeka iphoyinti (noma ikhetha isimaki nge-Khetha). Umunwe owodwa udonsa ukuhambisa. Izigqoko ezimbili zi-pinch ukusondeza ngasendaweni phakathi kwazo, futhi zihambise uma zihamba ndawonye. Ukubeka umunwe wesibili kuqeda lokho okwaqalwa yiwo wokuqala, ngakho i-pinch ayishiyi iphoyinti. Qeda umugqa noma umphetho ngokucindezela isikhathi eside (indlela yokuchofoza ngakwesokudla), ngokuthinta kabili, noma nge-Qeda kwibha esezansi kwishidi. Leyo bha inezinkinobho Emuva (ibuyisa iphoyinti lokugcina) no-Khansela. Izindawo zivala futhi ngokuthinta iphoyinti lokuqala. Iminwe inezinhloso ezinkulu: amaphoyinti abambelela, avale futhi akhethe kude kakhulu, nezibambi zamakhona zikhulu. Ukuthayipha ubude kudinga ikhibhodi; ikhibhodi esikrinini isebenza uma ibhokisi Thayipha ligxilile. Ethabhulethini, ikhibhodi nemouse noma i-trackpad kwenza umbalo ube lula kakhulu. Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Inkinobho noma isimo Imbangela Ukulungisa Akukwazanga ukulondoloza Amanye amafayela e-app awazange alandwe ngenkathi ilondolozelwa ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Hlola uxhumo bese ukhetha inkinobho futhi. Ayikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi Amawindi angasese namanye amakhompyutha alawulwayo avimbela amakhophi angaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Sebenzisa iwindi elijwayelekile, noma esinye isiphequluli. \"Saving…\" never starts Ungaphandle kwe-inthanethi; ukulondoloza kudinga uxhumo. Londoloza uku-inthanethi. The app is old after an update Ikhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi isuka ngolunye usuku. Ku-inthanethi, khetha Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, bese Londoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu). You want the space back Ikhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi icishe ibe ngu-6 MB. Khetha Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, bese Susa ikopi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Bheka Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Usaphazamekile? Layisha kabusha ikhasi uma i-app ingasasebenzi. Umbalo wakho uyalahleka lapho ulayisha kabusha, uma ungawulondolozanga, ngakho londoloza kuqala nge-Ctrl+S uma kungenzeka. Ngemibuzo yesiphequluli bheka Izisphequluli namakhompyutha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Okungakakhiwa okwamanje","summary":"Izici zokubala ezingekho kule bhilidi, nokwenzani namuhla esikhundleni sazo.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["imikhawulo","akukho","akukakhiwa","okuhleliwe","isikhathi esizayo","isixazululo","ngomugqa","ifu","ideskithophu"],"headings":[{"id":"ukukala","text":"Ukukala","level":2},{"id":"izinto-nentengo","text":"Izinto nentengo","level":2},{"id":"imidwebo-dwg-ne-dxf","text":"Imidwebo (DWG ne-DXF)","level":2},{"id":"ukubala-okuzenzakalelayo","text":"Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-nokwabelana","text":"Amafayela nokwabelana","level":2},{"id":"isikrini-nokufaka","text":"Isikrini nokufaka","level":2},{"id":"umbono-we-3d","text":"Umbono we-3D","level":2},{"id":"ukuncintisana-kwamathenda","text":"Ukuncintisana kwamathenda","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli","text":"Amaphaneli","level":2},{"id":"amashidi-ezibalo","text":"Amashidi ezibalo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft isathuthukiswa. Lolu luhlu lubonisa okungenziwa yile bhilidi yamanje, nokuthi umsebenzi ungenziwa kanjani namuhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukala\"\u003EUkukala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkufaka iphoyinti phakathi komugqa noma umbandela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa uphawu bese uludweba futhi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha ngebhokisi (iwindi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + ukuchofoza ngayinye yamamaki, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuwo wonke amamaki eshidi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi phinda amamaki\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujikeleza, ukubuyisela phansi noma ukushintsha isikali sekhophi enamathisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela eshidini ngesikali nangokuqondiswa okufanayo; dweba okunye ngesandla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkufunda isikali eshidini elisiwe noma kubha yesikali esiyisithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha isethi ekhona, noma linganisa ngobude bebha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikali esingaphezu kwesisodwa eshidini (izindawo zemininingwane, amapulani akhulisiwe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa ingxenye ngesikali seshidi, bese ubala imininingwane eshidini layo elikhulisiwe uma isethi inalo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-nentengo\"\u003EIzinto nentengo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzifomula zenhlanganisela ezisebenzisa ezinye izinhlobo zamamakiento (izimnyango zegumbi kwizifomula zesitezi salo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzifomula zisebenzisa izipheluzi zohlobo oluyinhloko; nika ezinye izinhlobo intengo emigqeni yazo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzifomula zenhlanganisela ezibalwa umugqa ngomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzifomula zisebenzisa izipheluzi zento; sebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E ngezengeziwe zomugqa ngamunye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzifomula ezisebenzisa amanani enye into\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda ukulinganisa kuleyo nto, noma uyibale kusiphephelo se-spreadsheet esithunyelwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaqembu ezingxenyeni zenhlanganisela, noma usuku lokusebenza olungelona amahora angu-8\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENikeza iqembu into; funda izinsuku zeqembu kusuku olunobude obehlukile njengamahora eqembu ÷ usuku lwakho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkumaka okungelona amanothi, amafu nokukhanyisa (imicibisho, izilinganiso, izitembu), noma izimpendulo kunothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYibhale kumbhalo wenothi; shintsha isimo sawo njengoba kuxazululwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmtapo wezintengo oqhelelene yiqembu, noma ogcinwe ne-akhawunti yakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmtapo ugcinwa kule bhrawuza: uwuthumele njenge-CSV bese uwungenisa kenye ikhompyutha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphakhi wokuhweba ahlolwe ngabalinganisi besikhathi esigcwele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke iphakhi iyisiqalo: hlola izimo zayo ngomsebenzi wakho nangemikhiqizo yakho ngaphambi kokubala intengo ngayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EAmaphakhi wokuhweba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzintengo emaphakhini wokuhweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphakhi anikeza izinhlanganisela kuphela: setha amazinga akho, noma ungenise uhlu lwakho lwentengo njenge-CSV.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuqamba kabusha ukubala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lithathwa kuPDF yokuqala; qamba kabusha amafayela alayishiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuqamba amashidi ngesandla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmashidi aqanjwa ngamalebula amakhasi e-PDF; sesha ngegama lefayela nekhasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imidwebo-dwg-ne-dxf\"\u003EImidwebo (DWG ne-DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathebula wesitayela sokuprinta, izabelo zepeni namafayela e-CTB emashidini omdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo udwetshwa mnyama, noma ngemibala yawo emnyama ukuze ufaneleke iphepha; ubukhulu bemigqa buvela kumdwebo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula i-DXF yebinary, noma i-DWG edlula i-AutoCAD 2000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYigcine njenge-DXF ye-ASCII noma njenge-DWG entsha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthola umdwebo oxhunyiwe (xref) ngesikhwama esiwuphethe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula nofayela lomdwebo oxhunyiwe, kanye nomdwebo owubambe: utholakala ngegama lefayela phakathi kwamafayela avulekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa imigqa ye-3D, ama-mesh, izinto eziqinile nezindawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZibale ngengqimba nangohlobo, noma linganisa ukubukwa kwepulani ngamathuluzi i-Linear ne-Area.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo ku-PDF emakiwe ovela komdwebo ngezinhlelo zokubhala ezingeziso zaseLatin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlamvu ezingenagilifu ku-Helvetica zikhishwa njenge-&quot;?&quot; ku-PDF emakiwe; umdwebo esikrinini awuthintekile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudluliselwa komdwebo kolunye uhlelo kusuka ebha yeshidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula leli fayela kulolo hlelo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo oqukethe ukubala ngaphakathi kwawo, njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi\u003C/span\u003E kwenza ama-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ukubala amanani\u003C/span\u003E: i-\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ivuleka kabusha kumdwebo ofanayo, ithole ngokuqukethwe kwawo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzingaphansi ze-PDF, izithombe nezinto ze-OLE ezibekwe emdwebeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzithombe zibonakala njengohlaka kuphela. Vula i-PDF yengaphansi njengeshidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubala-okuzenzakalelayo\"\u003EUkubala okuzenzakalelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthola izimpawu eshidini elingenasikali esidwetshwe ngosayizi ohlukile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENika ishidi isikali salo, noma lisese ngebhokisi odwetshwe lapho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthola izimpawu ezibonakala njengesibuko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZibale ngesandla, noma sesha futhi ngebhokisi elizungeze eyodwa ebonakala njengesibuko.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-nokwabelana\"\u003EAmafayela nokwabelana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-PDF eyodwa ebonisa amamaki futhi iqukethe ukubala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF emakwe\u003C/span\u003E ukuze abantu babone amamaki; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi\u003C/span\u003E ukuvula kabusha ku-TakeoffCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-CSV yamanani ngeshidi noma yamamaki\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E: amashidi awo asebenzayo i-By sheet ne-Marks anawo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugcina efwini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukatholakali okwamanje. Gcina amafayela ephrojekthi kukhompyutha yakho futhi uwenze ikhophi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo oluhlukile lwedeskithophu lwe-TakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKusukela ku-0.5 uhlelo lwedeskithophu luyi-CadCraft Studio, nazo zonke izinhlelo ezingu-8 kufakelo olulodwa. I-TakeoffCraft iphinde isebenze kubhrawuza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikrini-nokufaka\"\u003EIsikrini nokufaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImenyu yokuchofoza ngokwesokudla (noma ukucindezela isikhathi eside)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa ithuluzi, amaphaneli nezinkinobho. Ukucindezela isikhathi eside kuqeda umugqa noma umbandela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujikeleza umbono\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhasi ajikelezwe kwi-PDF avele eqondile sekuvele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umbono-we-3d\"\u003EUmbono we-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudweba noma ukuhlela amamaki nge-3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuyela eshidini (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ukuze udwebe; ukukhetha nokusula kusebenza nge-3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa izitezi ezibekwe ngaphezulu kwezinye ezidwetshwe ngezindawo ezihlukile emakhasini azo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka izitezi ezidwetshwe ngokufanayo; hlola ezinye ishidi linye ngesikhathi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubala izinsika ezinosayizi ofanayo nento ebalwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZonke izinsika eshidini zifana ngosayizi; zibonisa lapho kukhona ukubala, hhayi ukuthi yini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuncintisana-kwamathenda\"\u003EUkuncintisana kwamathenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzengezo ephaketheni elalisevele lathunyelwa, izincwadi zokunikezwa, ishidi lomsebenzi elisayinwa ngumuntu ngamunye ofaka ithenda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela iphakethe elisha, bese ubhala ukunikezwa ngokwakho. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\"\u003EThumela iphakethe lamathenda\u003C/a\u003E ichaza okwakhiwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela izimemo zamathenda kunoma iyiphi i-akhawunti: ngenkathi ihlolwa, imeyili yabafaki bamathenda abangaphandle icishiwe ngaphandle kwama-akhawunti avunyelwe yithimba le-CadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsebenzi we-CSV\u003C/span\u003E, uyithumele ngemeyili ngokwakho bese ufaka amathenda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthumela iphakethe lamathenda kusuka kuwindi le-Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumela kusuka ku-TakeoffCraft kubhrawuza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuyekeza intengo yendawo yethenda yesinye isinqumo ngethenda ekhethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindawo zamathenda nezingxenye zazo zisebenzisa izintengo zakho; lungisa esinye isinqumo ngesandla.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhumbuzo ezizenzakalelayo ngaphambi kokuphela kwesikhathi sokuqinisekiswa kwabasebenzi abangaphansi noma kwelayisense yabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsuku luphawulwa ekhasini Labasebenzi Abangaphansi uma sudlulile noma seluseduze, ezinsukwini ezingu-30; hlola lapho umemezela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli\"\u003EAmaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkukakhiwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhambisa itafula le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuphela amaphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E ayahamba. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amashidi-ezibalo\"\u003EAmashidi ezibalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIncwadi ye-XLSX ihlolwe ku-LibreOffice Calc, eyabala kabusha zonke izinhlobo zobuningi ngesenti efanayo ne-TakeoffCraft. Ayikavulwa ku-Excel. Uma uhlelo lwamashidi lukhombisa okungalindelekile, uhlu lwe-CSV lugcina isilinganiso esifanayo njengamanani avamile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft isathuthukiswa. Lolu luhlu lubonisa okungenziwa yile bhilidi yamanje, nokuthi umsebenzi ungenziwa kanjani namuhla. Ukukala Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Ukufaka iphoyinti phakathi komugqa noma umbandela Susa uphawu bese uludweba futhi. Ukukhetha ngebhokisi (iwindi) Shift + ukuchofoza ngayinye yamamaki, noma Ctrl+A kuwo wonke amamaki eshidi. Bona Kopisha, namathisela futhi phinda amamaki. Ukujikeleza, ukubuyisela phansi noma ukushintsha isikali sekhophi enamathisiwe Namathisela eshidini ngesikali nangokuqondiswa okufanayo; dweba okunye ngesandla. Ukufunda isikali eshidini elisiwe noma kubha yesikali esiyisithombe Khetha isethi ekhona, noma linganisa ngobude bebha. Isikali esingaphezu kwesisodwa eshidini (izindawo zemininingwane, amapulani akhulisiwe) Linganisa ingxenye ngesikali seshidi, bese ubala imininingwane eshidini layo elikhulisiwe uma isethi inalo. Izinto nentengo Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Izifomula zenhlanganisela ezisebenzisa ezinye izinhlobo zamamakiento (izimnyango zegumbi kwizifomula zesitezi salo) Izifomula zisebenzisa izipheluzi zohlobo oluyinhloko; nika ezinye izinhlobo intengo emigqeni yazo. Izifomula zenhlanganisela ezibalwa umugqa ngomugqa Izifomula zisebenzisa izipheluzi zento; sebenzisa N ngezengeziwe zomugqa ngamunye. Izifomula ezisebenzisa amanani enye into Phinda ukulinganisa kuleyo nto, noma uyibale kusiphephelo se-spreadsheet esithunyelwe. Amaqembu ezingxenyeni zenhlanganisela, noma usuku lokusebenza olungelona amahora angu-8 Nikeza iqembu into; funda izinsuku zeqembu kusuku olunobude obehlukile njengamahora eqembu ÷ usuku lwakho. Ukumaka okungelona amanothi, amafu nokukhanyisa (imicibisho, izilinganiso, izitembu), noma izimpendulo kunothi Yibhale kumbhalo wenothi; shintsha isimo sawo njengoba kuxazululwa. Umtapo wezintengo oqhelelene yiqembu, noma ogcinwe ne-akhawunti yakho Umtapo ugcinwa kule bhrawuza: uwuthumele njenge-CSV bese uwungenisa kenye ikhompyutha. Amaphakhi wokuhweba ahlolwe ngabalinganisi besikhathi esigcwele Yonke iphakhi iyisiqalo: hlola izimo zayo ngomsebenzi wakho nangemikhiqizo yakho ngaphambi kokubala intengo ngayo. Bona Amaphakhi wokuhweba. Izintengo emaphakhini wokuhweba Amaphakhi anikeza izinhlanganisela kuphela: setha amazinga akho, noma ungenise uhlu lwakho lwentengo njenge-CSV. Ukuqamba kabusha ukubala Igama lithathwa kuPDF yokuqala; qamba kabusha amafayela alayishiwe. Ukuqamba amashidi ngesandla Amashidi aqanjwa ngamalebula amakhasi e-PDF; sesha ngegama lefayela nekhasi. Imidwebo (DWG ne-DXF) Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Amathebula wesitayela sokuprinta, izabelo zepeni namafayela e-CTB emashidini omdwebo Umdwebo udwetshwa mnyama, noma ngemibala yawo emnyama ukuze ufaneleke iphepha; ubukhulu bemigqa buvela kumdwebo. Ukuvula i-DXF yebinary, noma i-DWG edlula i-AutoCAD 2000 Yigcine njenge-DXF ye-ASCII noma njenge-DWG entsha. Ukuthola umdwebo oxhunyiwe (xref) ngesikhwama esiwuphethe Vula nofayela lomdwebo oxhunyiwe, kanye nomdwebo owubambe: utholakala ngegama lefayela phakathi kwamafayela avulekile. Ukulinganisa imigqa ye-3D, ama-mesh, izinto eziqinile nezindawo Zibale ngengqimba nangohlobo, noma linganisa ukubukwa kwepulani ngamathuluzi i-Linear ne-Area. Umbhalo ku-PDF emakiwe ovela komdwebo ngezinhlelo zokubhala ezingeziso zaseLatin Izinhlamvu ezingenagilifu ku-Helvetica zikhishwa njenge-\"?\" ku-PDF emakiwe; umdwebo esikrinini awuthintekile. Ukudluliselwa komdwebo kolunye uhlelo kusuka ebha yeshidi Vula leli fayela kulolo hlelo. Umdwebo oqukethe ukubala ngaphakathi kwawo, njengoba I-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi kwenza ama-PDF Londoloza ukubala amanani: i-.takeoff.json ivuleka kabusha kumdwebo ofanayo, ithole ngokuqukethwe kwawo. Izingaphansi ze-PDF, izithombe nezinto ze-OLE ezibekwe emdwebeni Izithombe zibonakala njengohlaka kuphela. Vula i-PDF yengaphansi njengeshidi. Ukubala okuzenzakalelayo Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Ukuthola izimpawu eshidini elingenasikali esidwetshwe ngosayizi ohlukile Nika ishidi isikali salo, noma lisese ngebhokisi odwetshwe lapho. Ukuthola izimpawu ezibonakala njengesibuko Zibale ngesandla, noma sesha futhi ngebhokisi elizungeze eyodwa ebonakala njengesibuko. Amafayela nokwabelana Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla I-PDF eyodwa ebonisa amamaki futhi iqukethe ukubala I-PDF emakwe ukuze abantu babone amamaki; I-PDF enomsebenzi ongaphakathi ukuvula kabusha ku-TakeoffCraft. I-CSV yamanani ngeshidi noma yamamaki Sebenzisa XLSX: amashidi awo asebenzayo i-By sheet ne-Marks anawo. Ukugcina efwini Akukatholakali okwamanje. Gcina amafayela ephrojekthi kukhompyutha yakho futhi uwenze ikhophi. Uhlelo oluhlukile lwedeskithophu lwe-TakeoffCraft Kusukela ku-0.5 uhlelo lwedeskithophu luyi-CadCraft Studio, nazo zonke izinhlelo ezingu-8 kufakelo olulodwa. I-TakeoffCraft iphinde isebenze kubhrawuza. Isikrini nokufaka Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Imenyu yokuchofoza ngokwesokudla (noma ukucindezela isikhathi eside) Sebenzisa ithuluzi, amaphaneli nezinkinobho. Ukucindezela isikhathi eside kuqeda umugqa noma umbandela. Ukujikeleza umbono Amakhasi ajikelezwe kwi-PDF avele eqondile sekuvele. Umbono we-3D Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Ukudweba noma ukuhlela amamaki nge-3D Buyela eshidini (3) ukuze udwebe; ukukhetha nokusula kusebenza nge-3D. Ukulinganisa izitezi ezibekwe ngaphezulu kwezinye ezidwetshwe ngezindawo ezihlukile emakhasini azo Beka izitezi ezidwetshwe ngokufanayo; hlola ezinye ishidi linye ngesikhathi. Ukubala izinsika ezinosayizi ofanayo nento ebalwayo Zonke izinsika eshidini zifana ngosayizi; zibonisa lapho kukhona ukubala, hhayi ukuthi yini. Ukuncintisana kwamathenda Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Izengezo ephaketheni elalisevele lathunyelwa, izincwadi zokunikezwa, ishidi lomsebenzi elisayinwa ngumuntu ngamunye ofaka ithenda Thumela iphakethe elisha, bese ubhala ukunikezwa ngokwakho. Thumela iphakethe lamathenda ichaza okwakhiwe. Ukuthumela izimemo zamathenda kunoma iyiphi i-akhawunti: ngenkathi ihlolwa, imeyili yabafaki bamathenda abangaphandle icishiwe ngaphandle kwama-akhawunti avunyelwe yithimba le-CadCraft Landela Umsebenzi we-CSV, uyithumele ngemeyili ngokwakho bese ufaka amathenda. Ukuthumela iphakethe lamathenda kusuka kuwindi le-Studio Thumela kusuka ku-TakeoffCraft kubhrawuza. Ukubuyekeza intengo yendawo yethenda yesinye isinqumo ngethenda ekhethiwe Izindawo zamathenda nezingxenye zazo zisebenzisa izintengo zakho; lungisa esinye isinqumo ngesandla. Izikhumbuzo ezizenzakalelayo ngaphambi kokuphela kwesikhathi sokuqinisekiswa kwabasebenzi abangaphansi noma kwelayisense yabo Usuku luphawulwa ekhasini Labasebenzi Abangaphansi uma sudlulile noma seluseduze, ezinsukwini ezingu-30; hlola lapho umemezela. Amaphaneli Akukakhiwa Esikhundleni, namuhla Ukuhambisa itafula le-Amanani Kuphela amaphaneli Amashidi no-Izinto ayahamba. Bona Hlela amaphaneli. Amashidi ezibalo Incwadi ye-XLSX ihlolwe ku-LibreOffice Calc, eyabala kabusha zonke izinhlobo zobuningi ngesenti efanayo ne-TakeoffCraft. Ayikavulwa ku-Excel. Uma uhlelo lwamashidi lukhombisa okungalindelekile, uhlu lwe-CSV lugcina isilinganiso esifanayo njengamanani avamile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenzisa lolu sizo","summary":"Vula usizo, lusesha, bese ubona izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["usizo","f1","sesha","amathuto","incwadi"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-usizo","text":"Vula usizo","level":2},{"id":"thola-isihloko","text":"Thola isihloko","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho","text":"Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi","text":"Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-usizo\"\u003EVula usizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nokhiye \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EOkhiye ku-Mac\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-isihloko\"\u003EThola isihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela lapho wawukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EIzinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo &quot;Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/span\u003E kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi\"\u003ELolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo. Vula usizo Cindezela F1, noma khetha Usizo ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo. Cindezela Esc noma khetha Vala ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo. Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela F1 kanye nokhiye fn (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho Usizo. Bona Okhiye ku-Mac. Thola isihloko Bhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele. Izihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga. Izixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. Back ibuyisela lapho wawukhona. Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho Ezinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo \"Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi\". Khetha Shintsha kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini. Khetha Bonisa konke ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo. Izinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: Ctrl+S ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux. Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi Iwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, Vula kuwebhusayithi ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Izisebenzi nekhompyutha","summary":"Izisebenzi izinhlelo ezisebenza kuzo, okwehlukile phakathi kwazo, nokuthi ikhompyutha yakho idinga ini.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","isiphequluli","mac","windows","linux","ipad","ithebulethi","webgl","izidingo","inkumbulo"],"headings":[{"id":"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa","text":"Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa","level":2},{"id":"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi","text":"Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-ne-linux","text":"Mac, Windows ne-Linux","level":2},{"id":"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta","text":"Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu","text":"Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho","text":"Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho aya khona\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa\"\u003EIsiphequluli esingasetshenziswa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsiphequluli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi\"\u003EOkwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ifolda.\u003C/strong\u003E Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulondoloza.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha &quot;File download location&quot; ibe &quot;Ask for each download&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-ne-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows ne-Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EOkhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta\"\u003EAmathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu\"\u003EIsiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu \u003Cem\u003Eeqala\u003C/em\u003E, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EOkudingwa ikhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIchip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona Lapho amafayela akho aya khona). Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa Sebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi: Isiphequluli Injini Amanothi Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Eyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela. Firefox Gecko Iyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese. Safari WebKit Iyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa. Zombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho. Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi Ukuvula ifolda. Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu. Ukulondoloza. Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini. Ku-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha \"Always ask you where to save files\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha \"File download location\" ibe \"Ask for each download\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Mac, Windows ne-Linux Izinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad. Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta Ezinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo. Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu Sizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi. Inguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) I-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho. Lena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu eqala, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici. Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho Lezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe: I-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe). Ichip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho. Isikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela. Amafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad","summary":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo, okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac, ukuchofoza ngesokudla nokuhambisa ngaphandle kwe-mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["ikhibhodi","inqamulelo","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","okhiye bomsebenzi","trackpad","chofoza ngesokudla","inkinobho ephakathi","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac","text":"Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac","level":2},{"id":"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo","text":"Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad","text":"Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad","level":2},{"id":"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo","text":"Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkubhalwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Mac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Windows ne-Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInkinobho ye-Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. &quot;Bese&quot; kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac\"\u003EOkhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebamba \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Evula \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uvula &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo\"\u003EIzinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Mac kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad\"\u003EIzinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula &quot;Secondary click&quot; ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo\"\u003EUkubhala ebhokisini lombhalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala &quot;L&quot; kubhala u-L. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo Usizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo. Ukubhalwa Ku-Mac Ku-Windows ne-Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) kanye S Ctrl kanye S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F Ctrl, Shift kanye F Alt+← Option (⌥) kanye ← Alt kanye ← Backspace Inkinobho ye-Delete Backspace Delete fn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili) Delete Enter Return Enter Uphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. \"Bese\" kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo. Izinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho Ctrl+Z isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (Ctrl+Shift+F), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona. Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12: bamba fn (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma vula System Settings, bese Keyboard, bese Keyboard Shortcuts, bese Function Keys, bese uvula \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Ezinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho. Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo Ikhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T kanye Ctrl+W njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho. Ctrl+Q ku-Mac kanye Alt+F4 ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza. Isikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (Control-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini / F11) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-Ctrl+Shift+F, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo. Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad Izinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu: Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula \"Secondary click\" ku-System Settings, bese Trackpad, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba Ctrl ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela. Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo Lapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala \"L\" kubhala u-L. Cindezela Esc noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Thola ithuluzi noma isilungiselelo","summary":"Cindezela Ctrl+K bese uthayipha izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ukuze usebenzise noma yiliphi ithuluzi, ushintshe noma yisiphi isilungiselelo noma uvule isihloko sosizo.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["thola","sesha","ipaleti yomyalo","vula ngokushesha","sebenzisa umyalo","ctrl k","cmd k","ithuluzi","isilungiselelo","inqamulelo"],"headings":[{"id":"thola-bese-usebenzisa","text":"Thola bese usebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-bese-usebenzisa\"\u003EThola bese usebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala ibhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi. Thola bese usebenzisa Cindezela Ctrl+K, noma khetha Thola ebhareni ephezulu. Bhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu. Cindezela Enter ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. Esc ivala ibhokisi. Ithuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula Izilungiselelo kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo. Okufanele wazi Okusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye. Amathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama. Amathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela amaphaneli bese usebenzisa isikrini sesibili","summary":"Faka amaphaneli ohlangothini lwesobunxele, lwesokudla noma ngaphansi, uwabeke phezu kwawanye, uwahlanganise njengamathebhu, uwabambe noma uwafihle, uwantante phezu komdwebo, wenze isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu, khetha imigqa yethuluzi osebenzisa, noma uwahambise ewindini lawo esikrinini esinye.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["amaphaneli","faka","ntanta","hambisa iphaneli","donsa","isakhiwo","amathebhu","eqenjini lethebhu","beka phezulu","bopha","fihla ngokuzenzakalela","fihla iphaneli","vala iphaneli","okuhlangene","ubukhulu besakhiwo","okuhlangene kakhulu","imigqa yebha yamathuluzi","phindisela","umugqa owodwa","imigqa emi-2","imigqa yethuluzi","isikrini sesibili","izikrini ezimbili","isikrini esingaphezulu","iwindi","i-pop-up","setha kabusha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini","text":"Hambisa iphaneli ewindini","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu","text":"Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu","level":2},{"id":"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele","text":"Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele","level":2},{"id":"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu","text":"Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa","text":"Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa ikhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili","text":"Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili","level":2},{"id":"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli","text":"Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli","level":2},{"id":"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo","text":"Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-ingxoxo","text":"Hambisa ingxoxo","level":2},{"id":"buyisela-amaphaneli","text":"Buyisela amaphaneli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini\"\u003EHambisa iphaneli ewindini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu\"\u003EHlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ashintsha amathebhu, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E aya kowokuqala nowokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma eqenjini lethebhu\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu yalo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele\"\u003EBopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe \u003Cstrong\u003Elifihla ngokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha isikhonkwane\u003C/span\u003E, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yokuvala, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu\"\u003EYenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbukhulu besakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezimbili. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkulula\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhlangene\u003C/span\u003E unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa\"\u003EKhetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa yebha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezintathu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhindisela emugqeni olandelayo\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa owodwa\u003C/span\u003E ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa ikhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngaphansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENtanta phezu komdwebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBopha emphethweni\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E elinye iphaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E nakwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala imenyu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E. Ungakhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibeke esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli\"\u003EAmawindi amaningi amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2\u003C/span\u003E (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula okulandelayo\u003C/span\u003E kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo\"\u003ENgendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwingxenye bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-ingxoxo\"\u003EHambisa ingxoxo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta ku-PDF\u003C/span\u003E ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ngewindi layo\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyisela-amaphaneli\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina lapha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala. Iphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-⋯, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-⋯ kuphela. Hambisa iphaneli ewindini Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu. Lapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta. Amaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele. Iphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo. Donsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-⋯. Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu Amaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, ← no-→ ashintsha amathebhu, futhi Home no-End aya kowokuqala nowokugcina. Ukuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha Phuma eqenjini lethebhu kumenyu yalo ye-⋯, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa. Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele Isikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe lifihla ngokuzenzakalela: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela Esc) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha Khipha isikhonkwane, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele. Inkinobho yokuvala, noma Fihla lo phaneli emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela Enter. Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ubukhulu besakhiwo unezinketho ezimbili. Okulula yisimo esizenzakalelayo. Okuhlangene unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. Setha kabusha isakhiwo ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile. Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Imigqa yebha yamathuluzi unezinketho ezintathu. Phindisela emugqeni olandelayo yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. Imigqa emi-2 igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, Umugqa owodwa ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma Tab ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-Imigqa emi-2, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo › CadCraft. Sebenzisa ikhibhodi Inkinobho ye-⋯ yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: Faka ngakwesobunxele, Faka ngakwesokudla, Faka ngaphansi, Ntanta phezu komdwebo, Bopha emphethweni, Fihla lo phaneli, Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne elinye iphaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha nakwe-Yibuyisele. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela Enter, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela Enter futhi. Esc ivala imenyu. Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili Khetha ⋯ kwiphaneli, bese Hambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha. Ungakhetha futhi Hambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha ku-Izilungiselelo. Iwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa. Qhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu. Izinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu. I-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha Yibeke esikrinini sami sesibili kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo. Donsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli Iphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye. Kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi Hambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2 (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi \"panels 2\". Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona. Iwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa. Ngemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha Vula okulandelayo kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye. Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo Iribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-⋯ kwingxenye bese ukhetha Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha; Yibuyisele (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa. Hambisa ingxoxo Yonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi. Ukusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela Alt+Shift+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza Ctrl ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa. Efonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa. Ku-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-Phrinta ku-PDF ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, Vula ngewindi layo. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo. Buyisela amaphaneli Khetha Buyisela amaphaneli kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona. Ukuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha Vula ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma Gcina lapha. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Setha kabusha isakhiwo ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo. Uma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi. Isakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube seribhoni yamathebhu phezu komdwebo, ne-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngakwesobunxele kanye nethebhu ngayinye yokubuka evuliwe, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sasendulo noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","iribhoni","amathebhu eribhoni","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","isiphequluli","amaphalethi","iphaneli le-properties","amathebhu okubuka","ibha yesimo","ukufinyelela ngokushesha","goqa iribhoni","iwindi leribhoni","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo","efakiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo","text":"Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yesihloko:\u003C/strong\u003E igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha\u003C/span\u003E (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni:\u003C/strong\u003E amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yezinketho:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaneli lesobunxele:\u003C/strong\u003E i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yokubuka nebha yesimo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo &quot;Vula ifayela kuqala&quot;, noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina iribhoni ivulekile\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yesihloko: igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, Okwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, Usizo kanye Izilungiselelo. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo. Iribhoni: amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. Ifayela ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala. Ibha yezinketho: ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe. Iphaneli lesobunxele: i-Properties phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile. Ibha yokubuka nebha yesimo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo \"Vula ifayela kuqala\", noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi Uma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, ← no-→ bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-Home no-End bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo Chofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-Hambisa iribhoni ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-Goqa iribhoni ne-Gcina iribhoni ivulekile. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula. Hambisa iribhoni › Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele iribhoni, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube yikholomu yamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele ezindaweni zakho, ibhokisi lolwazi phezu kwesikrini elilandela ithuluzi elisebenzayo noma okukhethiwe kuwe, inavigeyitha ngakwesokudla, ithebhu ngayinye yokubuka, izinketho ezisheshayo nephaleti lokuhlela, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sakudala noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ikholomu yamathuluzi","ibhokisi lolwazi","ibha yolwazi","inavigeyitha","ishadi lephrojekthi","ibha esheshayo","izinketho ezisheshayo","iphaleti lokuhlela","iphaleti lepeti","amathuluzi ami","amathuluzi angikhethile","amathebhu okubuka","iwindi lebhokisi lamathuluzi","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo","text":"Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lolwazi:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi &quot;Akukhethiwe lutho&quot;. Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi ami:\u003C/strong\u003E iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kumathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInavigeyitha:\u003C/strong\u003E iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha esheshayo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaleti lokuhlela:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo\"\u003ENika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yamathuluzi: ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo. Ibhokisi lolwazi: ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese Ctrl+Z kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi \"Akukhethiwe lutho\". Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe. Ibhokisi lamathuluzi: ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya. Amathuluzi ami: iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha Engeza kumathuluzi ami; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli. Inavigeyitha: iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-Properties nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo. Ibha esheshayo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi. Iphaleti lokuhlela: chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-Properties. Esc, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo Inkinobho ye-Hambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho bese ulondoloza amasethi akho","summary":"Khetha iphaneli elibonisa isiphequluli sephrojekthi, i-Properties noma okuqukethwe yiphaneli ngalinye, lapho ibhokisi lamathuluzi lihlala khona nokuthi amabha aqukethe ini, ulondoloze njengesakhiwo sakho, futhi ugcine wonke amasethi ngegama ukuze ushintshe phakathi kwawo.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","hlela","yenza ngokwakho","isakhiwo sami","isakhiwo sakho","amaphaneli","abahleli","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","properties","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ibha esheshayo","ibhokisi lolwazi","indawo yokusebenza","isethi","iphrofayili","londoloza isethi","shintsha isethi","thumela isethi","ngenisa isethi","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho","text":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza","text":"Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENgaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho\"\u003EHlela isakhiwo sakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ukulungiswa kwakho…\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza igama, bese ukhetha:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhezu komdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgasohlangothini lomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka:\u003C/strong\u003E usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza:\u003C/strong\u003E bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yami\u003C/span\u003E. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintshela kuyo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYabelana:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa isethi…\u003C/span\u003E yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E kanye no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ngaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Hlela isakhiwo sakho Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,), khetha Jikelele, bese Isakhiwo. Khetha Hlela ukulungiswa kwakho…. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje. Nikeza igama, bese ukhetha: Phezu komdwebo: ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo. Ngasohlangothini lomdwebo: ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-Amathuluzi ami; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma Properties, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo. Indawo yomdwebo: amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo. Ukubukeka: usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu. Khetha Sebenzisa lolu lungiselelo. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa. Kunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-Kusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini; Thumela lolu lungiselelo silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi Hlela amaphaneli. Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza Indawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-Amathuluzi ami. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo. Londoloza: bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha Londoloza isethi yami. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi. Shintsha: khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha Shintshela kuyo. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha. Yabelana: Thumela ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-.ccenv.json; Ngenisa isethi… yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye. Susa: khetha isethi bese ukhetha Susa. Ungagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili. Ukuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi, isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi kanye no-isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","summary":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, okusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, nokudinga okuxhumeka.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","ayikho i-inthanethi","indiza","ukuvakasha endaweni","ikhashe","service worker","faka","landa","ukuxhumeka"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okudinga-ukuxhumeka","text":"Okudinga ukuxhumeka","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003ELondoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda &quot;Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi&quot;. Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EOkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudinga-ukuxhumeka\"\u003EOkudinga ukuxhumeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala. Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Vula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi. Khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ebhareni ephezulu. Linda \"Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\". Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala. Yenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo. Usuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi. Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Ukuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola. Ukulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho. Lolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha. Okudinga ukuxhumeka Ukuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe. Izixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-Vula kuwebhusayithi nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi. Ukulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje. Okufanele wazi Ikhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa. Amawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza. I-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo. I-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Lapho amafayela akho aya khona","summary":"Amafayela ahlala kukhompyutha yakho, indlela ukulondoloza ngayo, nokuthi isiphequluli sikhumbula ini.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["ubumfihlo","ukulayisha phezulu","ifu","londoloza","landa","isitoreji","endaweni","ukuphepha","imfihlo"],"headings":[{"id":"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo","text":"Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli","text":"Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-ngefu","text":"Ukulondoloza ngefu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EAmafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. \u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela alilayishwa phezulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela ukulondoloza ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha \u003Cstrong\u003E(ngokulanda)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EIzisebenzi nekhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo &quot;(edited)&quot; noma &quot;(marked up)&quot;, ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli\"\u003EOkukhunjulwa yisiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-ngefu\"\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho Uma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. Ifayela alilayishwa phezulu. Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo Ikhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha (ngokulanda): Ukulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona Izisebenzi nekhompyutha). Izinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo \"(edited)\" noma \"(marked up)\", ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga. Uma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"). Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli Ezinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo. Ukulondoloza ngefu Ukulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"zu","chain":["zu","en"]};
